nd Why Is the Industry Embracing It?",summary:"This article traces chaos engineering from Netflix's Chaos Monkey to modern reliability practices, showing how controlled failure injection helps teams validate resilience before real incidents happen. You will learn its core value, a concrete Netflix case study, and a practical four-step execution framework."},{title:"什么是混沌工程 (Chaos Engineering)? 为什么业界都在用?",date:"2026-04-26",lastmod:"2026-04-26",toc:"devops",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it",subtoc:"basic",order:53,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是混沌工程 (Chaos Engineering)? 为什么业界都在用?",summary:"本文从 Netflix 的混沌猴谈起，说明混沌工程如何通过可控的故障注入，提前验证系统韧性与团队应变流程。你会看到混沌工程的核心价值、真实案例，以及落地执行的四个步骤。"},{title:"什麼是混沌工程 (Chaos Engineering)? 為什麼業界都在用?",date:"2026-04-26",lastmod:"2026-04-26",toc:"devops",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it",subtoc:"basic",order:53,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是混沌工程 (Chaos Engineering)? 為什麼業界都在用?",summary:"本文從 Netflix 的混沌猴談起，說明混沌工程如何透過可控的故障注入，提前驗證系統韌性與團隊應變流程。你會看到混沌工程的核心價值、真實案例，以及落地執行的四個步驟。"},{title:"Use Agent Skills to Scale Staff-Engineer Thinking Across Your Team",date:"2026-04-19",lastmod:"2026-04-19",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset",subtoc:"ai-application",order:33,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Use Agent Skills to Scale Staff-Engineer Thinking Across Your Team",summary:"After joining Cursor, former Meta staff engineer Lauren Tan shared a set of agent skills that encode how she explores unfamiliar codebases and technologies. The key idea is to turn senior-level reasoning into a repeatable workflow the whole team can use with AI agents. That gives teams a more consistent way to break down problems, evaluate abstractions, and manage complexity."},{title:"通过代理技能 (agent skills)，让团队人人具备主任工程师思维",date:"2026-04-19",lastmod:"2026-04-19",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset",subtoc:"ai-application",order:33,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=通过代理技能 (agent skills)，让团队人人具备主任工程师思维",summary:"前 Meta 主任工程师 Lauren Tan 把自己理解新代码库与陌生技术的思考流程，整理成一组可复用的代理技能。这种做法的价值在于，把资深工程师的问题探索框架，沉淀成团队可共享的方法。通过这些技能，团队成员在使用 AI 代理时，能更稳定地对齐问题拆解、抽象判断与复杂度管理。"},{title:"透過代理技能 (agent skills)，讓團隊人人有主任工程師思維",date:"2026-04-19",lastmod:"2026-04-19",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset",subtoc:"ai-application",order:33,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=透過代理技能 (agent skills)，讓團隊人人有主任工程師思維",summary:"前 Meta 主任工程師 Lauren Tan 把理解新程式碼庫與技術的思考流程，整理成一組可重複使用的代理技能。這種做法的價值在於，把資深工程師面對問題時的探索框架，轉成團隊可以共享的工作方法。透過這些技能，團隊成員在使用 AI 代理時，能更穩定地對齊問題拆解、抽象判斷與複雜度管理。"},{title:"從 pretext 看 AI 如何帶給前端開發新典範",date:"2026-04-15",lastmod:"2026-04-15",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm",subtoc:"ai-with-engineer",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=從 pretext 看 AI 如何帶給前端開發新典範",summary:"pretext 透過避免呼叫 DOM API 與 reflow，讓多行文字動態排版能兼顧流暢度與效能。本文解析其技術突破、為何過去難以做到，以及作者如何用 AI 建立測試迴圈處理大量極端案例，讓前端開發出現新典範。"},{title:"DDIA Ch3 Reading Guide — Data Models and Query Languages",date:"2026-04-14",lastmod:"2026-04-14",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"ddia-ch3-data-model-query-language",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/ddia-ch3-data-model-query-language.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/ddia-ch3-data-model-query-language",subtoc:"intro",order:13,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DDIA Ch3 Reading Guide — Data Models and Query Languages",summary:"This reading guide to Chapter 3 of Designing Data-Intensive Applications focuses on the core tradeoffs behind data models and query languages. It compares relational and document models through normalization, schema flexibility, and data locality, then explains how to choose based on read/write patterns and real application needs."},{title:"DDIA 导读 CH3 — 数据模型与查询语言",date:"2026-04-14",lastmod:"2026-04-14",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"ddia-ch3-data-model-query-language",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/ddia-ch3-data-model-query-language.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/ddia-ch3-data-model-query-language",subtoc:"intro",order:13,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DDIA 导读 CH3 — 数据模型与查询语言",summary:"本文导读《Designing Data-Intensive Applications》第三章，聚焦数据模型与查询语言的核心取舍。文章比较关系型与文档型模型在规范化、弹性与数据局部性上的差异，并说明如何根据读写模式与数据结构选择更合适的数据库。"},{title:"DDIA 導讀 CH3 —  資料模型與查詢語言",date:"2026-04-14",lastmod:"2026-04-14",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"ddia-ch3-data-model-query-language",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/ddia-ch3-data-model-query-language.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/ddia-ch3-data-model-query-language",subtoc:"intro",order:13,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DDIA 導讀 CH3 —  資料模型與查詢語言",summary:"本文導讀《Designing Data-Intensive Applications》第三章，聚焦資料模型與查詢語言的核心取捨。文章比較關係型與文件型模型在正規化、彈性與資料區域性上的差異，並說明如何依據讀寫型態與資料結構選擇更合適的資料庫。"},{title:"DDIA Ch2 Reading Guide — Non-functional Requirements",date:"2026-04-13",lastmod:"2026-04-13",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"ddia-ch2-non-functional-requirements",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/ddia-ch2-non-functional-requirements.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/ddia-ch2-non-functional-requirements",subtoc:"intro",order:12,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DDIA Ch2 Reading Guide — Non-functional Requirements",summary:"This reading guide to Chapter 2 of Designing Data-Intensive Applications focuses on four core non-functional requirements in software systems: performance, reliability, scalability, and maintainability. It breaks down latency into measurable stages, explains why median and percentile metrics are more actionable than averages, and shows how resilient design handles hardware, software, and human failures."},{title:"DDIA 导读 CH2 — 非功能需求 (Non-functional Requirements)",date:"2026-04-13",lastmod:"2026-04-13",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"ddia-ch2-non-functional-requirements",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/ddia-ch2-non-functional-requirements.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/ddia-ch2-non-functional-requirements",subtoc:"intro",order:12,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DDIA 导读 CH2 — 非功能需求 (Non-functional Requirements)",summary:"本文导读《Designing Data-Intensive Applications》第二章，聚焦软件系统中的四项关键非功能需求：性能、可靠性、可扩展性与可维护性。文章先拆解延迟的构成与指标选择，再说明可靠性如何通过韧性设计应对硬件、软件与人为错误。"},{title:"DDIA 導讀 CH2 — 非功能需求 (Non-functional Requirements)",date:"2026-04-13",lastmod:"2026-04-13",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"ddia-ch2-non-functional-requirements",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/ddia-ch2-non-functional-requirements.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/ddia-ch2-non-functional-requirements",subtoc:"intro",order:12,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DDIA 導讀 CH2 — 非功能需求 (Non-functional Requirements)",summary:"本文導讀《Designing Data-Intensive Applications》第二章，聚焦軟體系統中的四項關鍵非功能需求：效能、可靠性、可擴展性與可維護性。文中先拆解延遲度的組成與指標選擇，再說明可靠性如何透過韌性設計應對硬體、軟體與人為錯誤。"},{title:"How to Effectively Handle Ambiguous Work Tasks?",date:"2026-04-08",lastmod:"2026-04-08",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks.md",fullPath:"/en/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",subtoc:"effective",order:47,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Effectively Handle Ambiguous Work Tasks?",summary:"In software engineering, many tasks are not clearly defined at the start. Using an “introduce AI to the team” scenario, this article contrasts two common reactions to ambiguity and explains why proactively clarifying goals, forming hypotheses, and aligning with stakeholders matters. It also shows why navigating ambiguity is a core skill for engineers aiming to grow into senior roles."},{title:"如何有效面对模糊的工作任务?",date:"2026-04-08",lastmod:"2026-04-08",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",subtoc:"effective",order:47,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效面对模糊的工作任务?",summary:"在软件工程工作中，很多任务一开始都不会被清晰定义。本文通过“导入 AI”案例，对比面对模糊时的两种行为，说明主动澄清目标、提出假设并持续对齐的重要性。也进一步解释了为什么 navigating ambiguity 是迈向资深工程师不可或缺的核心能力。"},{title:"如何有效面對模糊的工作任務?",date:"2026-04-08",lastmod:"2026-04-08",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",subtoc:"effective",order:47,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效面對模糊的工作任務?",summary:"在軟體工程工作中，許多任務一開始都不會被清楚定義。本文用「導入 AI」案例，對比面對模糊時的兩種行為，說明主動釐清目標、提出假設並持續對齊的重要性。也進一步解釋為何 navigating ambiguity 是邁向資深工程師不可或缺的核心能力。"},{title:"How Should Software Engineers Conduct Incident Reviews?",date:"2024-09-26",lastmod:"2026-04-03",toc:"devops",lang:"en",fileName:"incident-review",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/incident-review.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/incident-review",subtoc:"basic",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How Should Software Engineers Conduct Incident Reviews?",summary:"Learn why incident reviews matter and how to run them without blame. This article explains the core purpose of postmortems and shares industry examples of building safer systems through learning."},{title:"软件工程师该如何做好事故检讨?",date:"2024-09-26",lastmod:"2026-04-03",toc:"devops",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"incident-review",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/incident-review.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/incident-review",subtoc:"basic",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title= 软件工程师该如何做好事故检讨?",summary:"了解软件事故检讨的重要性，并学习如何通过不指责人的方式进行检讨，确保未来不再发生同样的问题。本文深入探讨事故检讨的本质，并分享业界实例，适合软件工程师和团队成员参考。"},{title:"軟體工程師該如何做好事故檢討?",date:"2024-09-26",lastmod:"2026-04-03",toc:"devops",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"incident-review",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/incident-review.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/incident-review",subtoc:"basic",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title= 軟體工程師該如何做好事故檢討?",summary:"了解軟體事故檢討的重要性，並學習如何透過不指責人的方式進行檢討，確保未來不再發生同樣的問題。本文深入探討事故檢討的本質，並分享業界實例，適合軟體工程師和團隊成員參考。"},{title:"How Pretext Shows a New AI-Powered Paradigm for Frontend Development",date:"2026-03-30",lastmod:"2026-03-30",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm",subtoc:"ai-with-engineer",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How Pretext Shows a New AI-Powered Paradigm for Frontend Development",summary:"Pretext enables dynamic multi-line text layout without relying on DOM measurements and expensive reflow, delivering much smoother UI behavior. This article breaks down its core technical breakthrough, why the problem was historically hard, and how AI-driven test loops made large-scale edge-case handling practical."},{title:"从 pretext 看 AI 如何带给前端开发新典范",date:"2026-03-30",lastmod:"2026-03-30",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm",subtoc:"ai-with-engineer",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=从 pretext 看 AI 如何带给前端开发新典范",summary:"pretext 通过避免调用 DOM API 与 reflow，让多行文字动态排版同时兼顾流畅度和性能。本文解析它的技术突破、过去为何难以实现，以及作者如何借助 AI 测试循环处理大量极端案例，推动前端开发进入新典范。"},{title:"How to Take Better Technical Notes",date:"2026-03-25",lastmod:"2026-03-25",toc:"swe-read",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-write-good-technical-notes",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/how-to-write-good-technical-notes.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/how-to-write-good-technical-notes",subtoc:"senior",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Take Better Technical Notes",summary:"This article explains why technical notes should be more than storage and retrieval for software engineers. It argues that effective note-taking is a thinking process, then shows how to apply the Cornell Method in practice by writing questions first, updating understanding as you learn, and summarizing your own insights."},{title:"如何做好技术笔记?",date:"2026-03-25",lastmod:"2026-03-25",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-write-good-technical-notes",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/how-to-write-good-technical-notes.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/how-to-write-good-technical-notes",subtoc:"senior",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何做好技术笔记?",summary:"本文总结了软件工程师做技术笔记的核心原则：笔记不应只是信息抄写与存储，而应通过提问、重述与总结来加深理解。文章结合 Sam Altman 和 Werner Vogels 的观点，并介绍了康奈尔笔记法在技术学习中的具体实践方式。"},{title:"如何做好技術筆記?",date:"2026-03-25",lastmod:"2026-03-25",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-write-good-technical-notes",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/how-to-write-good-technical-notes.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/how-to-write-good-technical-notes",subtoc:"senior",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何做好技術筆記?",summary:"本文整理軟體工程師做技術筆記的核心原則：筆記不該只是抄寫與儲存，而要透過提問、重述與總結深化理解。文章結合 Sam Altman 與 Werner Vogels 的觀點，並示範如何用康乃爾筆記法把輸入轉成自己的洞見。"},{title:"How Does Netflix's System Support Millions of Simultaneous Live Viewers?",date:"2026-03-01",lastmod:"2026-03-01",toc:"system-design",lang:"en",fileName:"netflix-streaming-architecture",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/netflix-streaming-architecture.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/netflix-streaming-architecture",subtoc:"backend",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How Does Netflix's System Support Millions of Simultaneous Live Viewers?",summary:"This article explores how Netflix architectures its live streaming system to support tens of millions of concurrent viewers. It covers the technical challenges unique to live streaming compared to on-demand services, the three-part system design including content acquisition, real-time processing and global distribution, and how Netflix ensures reliability through redundancy and reduces latency using HTTP with 2-second segment durations."},{title:"Netflix 的系统如何支撑千万人同时观看直播?",date:"2026-03-01",lastmod:"2026-03-01",toc:"system-design",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"netflix-streaming-architecture",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/netflix-streaming-architecture.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/netflix-streaming-architecture",subtoc:"backend",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Netflix 的系统如何支撑千万人同时观看直播?",summary:"本篇探讨 Netflix 如何架构直播系统以支撑数千万人同时观看。文章介绍了直播相比随选流媒体的技术挑战、整体架构设计包含内容获取、实时处理与全球分发、以及如何通过冗余设计确保可用性与使用 HTTP 搭配 2 秒片段切割来降低延迟。"},{title:"Netflix 的系統如何支撐千萬人同時觀看直播?",date:"2026-03-01",lastmod:"2026-03-01",toc:"system-design",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"netflix-streaming-architecture",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/netflix-streaming-architecture.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/netflix-streaming-architecture",subtoc:"backend",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Netflix%20%E7%9A%84%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%94%AF%E6%92%90%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8C%E6%99%82%E8%A7%80%E7%9C%8B%E7%9B%B4%E6%92%AD%3F",summary:"本篇探討 Netflix 如何架構直播系統以支撐數千萬人同時觀看。文章介紹了直播相比隨選串流的技術挑戰、整體架構設計包含內容獲取、實時處理與全球分發、以及如何透過冗餘設計確保可用性與使用 HTTP 搭配 2 秒片段切割來降低延遲。"},{title:"What is the CAP Theorem?",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2026-02-23",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"cap-theorem",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/cap-theorem.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/cap-theorem",subtoc:"basic",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is the CAP Theorem?",summary:"The CAP theorem identifies three critical properties of distributed systems: Consistency, Availability, and Partition Tolerance. A system can only guarantee two of these three simultaneously. Using ATM systems as an example, this article explores the trade-offs inherent in CAP and demonstrates how to apply this theory for better architectural decisions."},{title:"什么是 CAP 理论？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2026-02-23",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"cap-theorem",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/cap-theorem.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/cap-theorem",subtoc:"basic",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 CAP 理论？",summary:"CAP 理论指出分布式系统中的三个重要特性．一致性、可用性、分区容错性，只能同时保证其中两个。本文通过 ATM 系统的例子说明 CAP 的权衡，并探讨如何在实际设计中应用这个理论来做出更好的架构决策。"},{title:"什麼是 CAP 理論？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2026-02-23",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"cap-theorem",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/cap-theorem.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/cap-theorem",subtoc:"basic",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 CAP 理論？",summary:"CAP 理論指出分散式系統中的三個重要特性．一致性、可用性、分區容錯性，只能同時保證其中兩個。本文透過 ATM 系統的例子說明 CAP 的權衡，並探討如何在實際設計中應用這個理論來做出更好的架構決策。"},{title:"What's the difference between Concurrency and Parallelism?",date:"2026-02-21",lastmod:"2026-02-21",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"concurrency-vs-parallelism",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism",subtoc:"basic",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What's the difference between Concurrency and Parallelism?",summary:"Concurrency and parallelism are often confused but represent fundamentally different approaches. Concurrency manages multiple tasks by switching between them on a single processing unit to reduce idle time, making it ideal for I/O-bound work. Parallelism executes multiple tasks simultaneously using multiple processing units, suited for speeding up CPU-bound work. Understanding this distinction is crucial for system design and technical interviews."},{title:"并行 (Concurrency) 与并发 (Parallelism) 有什么不同?",date:"2026-02-21",lastmod:"2026-02-21",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"concurrency-vs-parallelism",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism",subtoc:"basic",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=并行 (Concurrency) 与并发 (Parallelism) 有什么不同?",summary:"并行 (Concurrency) 和并发 (Parallelism) 经常被混淆，但两者有本质区别。并行是在单一运算资源下快速切换管理多个任务以减少闲置，适合处理 I/O 受限的工作；并发则是通过多个运算单元同时执行多个任务，适合加速 CPU 受限的工作。理解两者的差异对系统设计与面试回答至关重要。"},{title:"並行 (Concurrency) 與平行 (Parallelism) 有什麼不同?",date:"2026-02-21",lastmod:"2026-02-21",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"concurrency-vs-parallelism",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism",subtoc:"basic",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=%E4%B8%A6%E8%A1%8C%20%28Concurrency%29%20%E8%88%87%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%8C%20%28Parallelism%29%20%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%3F",summary:"並行 (Concurrency) 和平行 (Parallelism) 經常被混淆，但兩者有本質區別。並行是在單一運算資源下快速切換管理多個任務以減少閒置，適合處理 I/O 受限的工作；平行則是透過多個運算單元同時執行多個任務，適合加速 CPU 受限的工作。理解兩者的差異對系統設計與面試回答至關重要。"},{title:"How to Become a More Influential Engineer?",date:"2026-02-18",lastmod:"2026-02-18",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-become-influential-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer",subtoc:"tips",order:36,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Become a More Influential Engineer?",summary:"Many engineers worry their work lacks impact, but the same problem can be solved in different ways with varying levels of influence. This article explores how to become more impactful, starting with building reliability."},{title:"如何成为更有影响力的工程师?",date:"2026-02-18",lastmod:"2026-02-18",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-become-influential-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer",subtoc:"tips",order:36,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何成为更有影响力的工程师?",summary:"许多工程师担心自己做的工作没有影响力，但其实同样的问题可以有不同层次的解决方法。本文探讨如何从提升可靠性开始，逐步迈向更有影响力的工程师。"},{title:"如何成為更有影響力的工程師?",date:"2026-02-18",lastmod:"2026-02-18",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-become-influential-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer",subtoc:"tips",order:36,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何成為更有影響力的工程師?",summary:"許多工程師擔心自己做的工作沒有影響力，但其實同樣的問題可以有不同層次的解決方法。本文探討如何從提升可靠性開始，逐步邁向更有影響力的工程師。"},{title:"What is FDE? Why Does the Software Industry Need FDE?",date:"2026-02-14",lastmod:"2026-02-14",toc:"ai-resources",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-fde",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/what-is-fde.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/what-is-fde",subtoc:"ai-insight",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What%20is%20FDE%3F%20Why%20Does%20the%20Software%20Industry%20Need%20FDE%3F",summary:"FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer) is a specialized software engineering role focused on bringing research and development to customers on-site and providing customized implementation. The software industry needs FDEs because many enterprise customers have highly customized requirements that demand engineers who understand not just the technology, but also the customer's pain points and business needs."},{title:"FDE 是什么？为什么软件业界需要 FDE?",date:"2026-02-14",lastmod:"2026-02-14",toc:"ai-resources",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-fde",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/what-is-fde.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/what-is-fde",subtoc:"ai-insight",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=FDE%20%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%3F%20%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%9A%E7%95%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%20FDE%3F",summary:"FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer) 是软件工程师的细化职位，专门负责将研发成果带到客户现场，进行客制化调整与实施。软件业界需要 FDE 是因为许多企业客户有高度客制化需求，需要工程师不仅懂技术，还要能理解客户痛点并提出解决方案。"},{title:"FDE 是什麼? 為什麼軟體業界需要 FDE?",date:"2026-02-14",lastmod:"2026-02-14",toc:"ai-resources",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-fde",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/what-is-fde.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/what-is-fde",subtoc:"ai-insight",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=FDE%20%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%3F%20%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E8%BB%9F%E9%AB%94%E6%A5%AD%E7%95%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%20FDE%3F",summary:"FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer) 是軟體工程師的細化職位，專門負責將研發成果帶到客戶現場，進行客製化調整與實施。軟體業界需要 FDE 是因為許多企業客戶有高度客製化需求，需要工程師不僅懂技術，還要能理解客戶痛點並提出解決方案。"},{title:"DDIA Ch1 Reading Guide — Tradeoffs in Data-Intensive System Design",date:"2026-02-10",lastmod:"2026-02-10",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"ddia-ch1-data-intensive-system-design-tradeoffs",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/ddia-ch1-data-intensive-system-design-tradeoffs.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/ddia-ch1-data-intensive-system-design-tradeoffs",subtoc:"intro",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DDIA Ch1 Reading Guide — Tradeoffs in Data-Intensive System Design",summary:"Chapter 1 of Designing Data-Intensive Applications explores fundamental design tradeoffs in data-intensive systems: distinguishing between transactional (OLTP) and analytical (OLAP) systems, and comparing data warehouses with data lakes to understand design decisions across different use cases."},{title:"DDIA 导读 CH1 — 数据密集型系统设计的取舍",date:"2026-02-10",lastmod:"2026-02-10",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"ddia-ch1-data-intensive-system-design-tradeoffs",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/ddia-ch1-data-intensive-system-design-tradeoffs.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/ddia-ch1-data-intensive-system-design-tradeoffs",subtoc:"intro",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DDIA 导读 CH1 — 数据密集型系统设计的取舍",summary:"《Designing Data-Intensive Applications》第一章探讨数据密集型系统设计的核心取舍：如何区分事务型(OLTP)与分析型(OLAP)系统，并通过数据仓库与数据湖的比较，理解在不同使用场景下的设计权衡。"},{title:"DDIA 導讀 CH1 — 資料密集型系統設計的取捨",date:"2026-02-10",lastmod:"2026-02-10",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"ddia-ch1-data-intensive-system-design-tradeoffs",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/ddia-ch1-data-intensive-system-design-tradeoffs.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/ddia-ch1-data-intensive-system-design-tradeoffs",subtoc:"intro",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DDIA%20%E5%B0%8E%E8%AE%80%20CH1%20%E2%80%94%20%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E5%AF%86%E9%9B%86%E5%9E%8B%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E8%A8%AD%E8%A8%88%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%96%E6%8D%A8",summary:"《Designing Data-Intensive Applications》第一章探討資料密集型系統設計的核心取捨：如何區分事務型(OLTP)與分析型(OLAP)系統，並透過資料倉儲與資料湖的比較，理解在不同使用場景下的設計權衡。"},{title:"How OpenAI Scaled PostgreSQL to Power 800 Million ChatGPT Users",date:"2026-02-07",lastmod:"2026-02-07",toc:"fullstack-case",lang:"en",fileName:"openai-postgresql-scale",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/openai-postgresql-scale.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/openai-postgresql-scale",subtoc:"backend",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How OpenAI Scaled PostgreSQL to Power 800 Million ChatGPT Users",summary:"Discover how OpenAI scaled PostgreSQL to support over 800 million ChatGPT users through strategies like sharding, query optimization, hot standby replication, and workload isolation. Learn the key technical approaches OpenAI's engineering team adopted to handle explosive traffic growth."},{title:"OpenAI 如何将 PostgreSQL 扩展到支撑 8 亿名用户",date:"2026-02-07",lastmod:"2026-02-07",toc:"fullstack-case",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"openai-postgresql-scale",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/openai-postgresql-scale.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/openai-postgresql-scale",subtoc:"backend",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=OpenAI 如何将 PostgreSQL 扩展到支撑 8 亿名用户",summary:"OpenAI 如何通过分片、查询优化、热备份和负载隔离等策略，将 PostgreSQL 扩展到支撑超过 8 亿 ChatGPT 用户。本文探讨 ChatGPT 背后的数据库架构，以及 OpenAI 团队应对流量大幅增长时采取的关键技术方案。"},{title:"OpenAI 如何將 PostgreSQL 擴展到支撐 8 億名使用者",date:"2026-02-07",lastmod:"2026-02-07",toc:"fullstack-case",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"openai-postgresql-scale",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/openai-postgresql-scale.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/openai-postgresql-scale",subtoc:"backend",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=OpenAI 如何將 PostgreSQL 擴展到支撐 8 億名使用者",summary:"OpenAI 如何通過分片、查詢最佳化、熱備份和負載隔離等策略，將 PostgreSQL 擴展到支撐超過 8 億 ChatGPT 使用者。本文探討 ChatGPT 背後的資料庫架構，以及 OpenAI 團隊應對流量大幅增長時採取的關鍵技術方案。"},{title:"What is AI Evaluation (Evals)?",date:"2026-02-03",lastmod:"2026-02-03",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"ai-evals",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/ai-evals.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/ai-evals",subtoc:"ai-application",order:33,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is AI Evaluation (Evals)?",summary:"Evals are an essential part of AI product development. Since AI models produce non-deterministic outputs, traditional software testing cannot guarantee quality. Evals provide a mechanism to assess whether changes achieve expected results. Through evals-driven development, teams ensure decisions are based on data rather than guesswork."},{title:"什么是 AI 的评估机制 (evals)?",date:"2026-02-03",lastmod:"2026-02-03",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"ai-evals",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/ai-evals.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/ai-evals",subtoc:"ai-application",order:33,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 AI 的评估机制 (evals)?",summary:"评估机制是 AI 产品开发中不可或缺的环节。由于 AI 模型的输出不确定，传统软件测试无法保证质量，因此需要评估机制来判断改动是否达到预期。通过评估驱动开发的方式，开发者能确保决策基于数据而非猜测。"},{title:"什麼是 AI 的評估機制 (evals)?",date:"2026-02-03",lastmod:"2026-02-03",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"ai-evals",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/ai-evals.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/ai-evals",subtoc:"ai-application",order:33,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 AI 的評估機制 (evals)?",summary:"評估機制是 AI 產品開發中不可或缺的環節。由於 AI 模型的輸出不確定，傳統軟體測試無法保證品質，因此需要評估機制來判斷改動是否達到預期。透過評估驅動開發的方式，開發者能確保決策基於數據而非猜測。"},{title:"What is the N + 1 Query Problem? How to Avoid It Effectively?",date:"2026-01-25",lastmod:"2026-01-25",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"n-plus-one-problem",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/n-plus-one-problem.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/n-plus-one-problem",subtoc:"database",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is the N + 1 Query Problem%3F How to Avoid It Effectively%3F",summary:"The N + 1 query problem is a common database performance issue that occurs when an application executes one query to fetch a list, then runs additional queries for each result. This causes query count to scale linearly with data volume. Using JOIN or IN clauses can effectively prevent this problem."},{title:"什么是数据库查询 N + 1 问题? 如何有效避免?",date:"2026-01-25",lastmod:"2026-01-25",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"n-plus-one-problem",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/n-plus-one-problem.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/n-plus-one-problem",subtoc:"database",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是数据库查询 N + 1 问题%3F 如何有效避免%3F",summary:"N + 1 问题是一个常见的数据库查询性能问题，当应用程序先查询一次列表后，再针对每个结果逐笔查询相关数据，导致查询次数随数据量线性增加。通过使用 JOIN 或 IN 子句等重构方式，可以有效避免这个问题。"},{title:"什麼是資料庫查詢 N + 1 問題? 如何有效避免?",date:"2026-01-25",lastmod:"2026-01-25",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"n-plus-one-problem",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/n-plus-one-problem.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/n-plus-one-problem",subtoc:"database",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是資料庫查詢 N + 1 問題%3F 如何有效避免%3F",summary:"N + 1 問題是一個常見的資料庫查詢效能問題，當應用程式先查詢一次列表後，再針對每個結果逐筆查詢相關資料，導致查詢次數隨資料量線性增加。透過使用 JOIN 或 IN 子句等重構方式，可以有效避免這個問題。"},{title:"How Should Senior Engineers Oversee Code Reviews?",date:"2026-01-22",lastmod:"2026-01-22",toc:"swe-read",lang:"en",fileName:"senior-engineer-code-review-gatekeeper",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/senior-engineer-code-review-gatekeeper.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/senior-engineer-code-review-gatekeeper",subtoc:"else",order:18,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How Should Senior Engineers Oversee Code Reviews?",summary:"Exploring how senior engineers can elevate code review practices at the team level, focusing on systemic quality improvements, knowledge transfer, and fostering a healthy team culture. Addresses common pitfalls like lenient reviews, emotional attacks, and unconstructive feedback."},{title:"资深工程师如何把关 Code Review?",date:"2026-01-22",lastmod:"2026-01-22",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"senior-engineer-code-review-gatekeeper",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/senior-engineer-code-review-gatekeeper.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/senior-engineer-code-review-gatekeeper",subtoc:"else",order:18,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=资深工程师如何把关 Code Review?",summary:"从资深工程师的角度，探讨如何通过 Code Review 的把关，提升团队整体品质、传递知识，以及塑造健康的团队文化。包含把关低门槛审查、情绪性攻击、没建设性的沟通等常见问题。"},{title:"資深工程師如何把關 Code Review?",date:"2026-01-22",lastmod:"2026-01-22",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"senior-engineer-code-review-gatekeeper",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/senior-engineer-code-review-gatekeeper.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/senior-engineer-code-review-gatekeeper",subtoc:"else",order:18,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=%E8%B3%87%E6%B7%B1%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%81%E5%B8%AB%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%8A%E9%97%9C%20Code%20Review%3F",summary:"這篇文章將從資深工程師的角度，探討如何透過 Code Review 的把關，提升團隊整體品質、傳遞知識，以及塑造健康的團隊文化。包含把關低門檻審查、情緒性攻擊、沒建設性的溝通等常見問題。"},{title:"Linus Torvalds Is Vibe Coding Now—Are Software Engineers Doomed?",date:"2026-01-13",lastmod:"2026-01-13",toc:"ai-resources",lang:"en",fileName:"linus-torvalds-vibe-coding",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/linus-torvalds-vibe-coding.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/linus-torvalds-vibe-coding",subtoc:"ai-insight",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Linus Torvalds Is Vibe Coding Now—Are Software Engineers Doomed?",summary:"Linux creator Linus Torvalds has started vibe coding, sparking heated debate. This article explores his views on AI-assisted development, where vibe coding works (and where it doesn't), and why software engineers remain essential as gatekeepers in the AI era."},{title:"Linus Torvalds 也开始 Vibe Coding，软件工程师就玩完了吗?",date:"2026-01-13",lastmod:"2026-01-13",toc:"ai-resources",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"linus-torvalds-vibe-coding",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/linus-torvalds-vibe-coding.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/linus-torvalds-vibe-coding",subtoc:"ai-insight",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Linus Torvalds 也开始 Vibe Coding，软件工程师就玩完了吗?",summary:"Linux 之父 Linus Torvalds 开始使用 Vibe Coding，引发社区热议。本文探讨 Linus 对 AI 辅助开发的看法、Vibe Coding 的适用场景与局限，以及在 AI 时代下软件工程师扮演守门人角色的重要性。"},{title:"Linus Torvalds 也開始 Vibe Coding，軟體工程師就玩完了嗎?",date:"2026-01-13",lastmod:"2026-01-13",toc:"ai-resources",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"linus-torvalds-vibe-coding",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/linus-torvalds-vibe-coding.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/linus-torvalds-vibe-coding",subtoc:"ai-insight",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Linus Torvalds 也開始 Vibe Coding，軟體工程師就玩完了嗎?",summary:""},{title:"What Are Agent Skills? What Problems Do They Solve?",date:"2026-01-08",lastmod:"2026-01-08",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"agent-skills",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/agent-skills.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/agent-skills",subtoc:"ai-application",order:32,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Are Agent Skills? What Problems Do They Solve?",summary:"From launch to adoption by the AI engineering community, Agent Skills took only about two months. This prompts the question: what exactly are Agent Skills, what problems do they solve, and why has the community adopted them so quickly? In this article, we explore the pain points in developing and using AI agents, then progressively address these challenges to help developers understand the value of Agent Skills."},{title:"代理技能 (Agent Skills) 是什么? 解决了什么问题?",date:"2026-01-08",lastmod:"2026-01-08",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"agent-skills",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/agent-skills.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/agent-skills",subtoc:"ai-application",order:32,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=代理技能 (Agent Skills) 是什么? 解决了什么问题?",summary:"代理技能从推出到被 AI 工程社群采纳，仅花了约两个月的时间。这不禁让人问，究竟代理技能是什么、解决了什么问题，让社群会如此快速地采用这个新模式。在这篇文章，我们会试着从开发与使用代理的痛点出发，然后一步步带着读者们，解决这些痛点，进而能够理解代理技能的价值。"},{title:"代理技能 (Agent Skills) 是什麼? 解決了什麼問題?",date:"2026-01-08",lastmod:"2026-01-08",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"agent-skills",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/agent-skills.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/agent-skills",subtoc:"ai-application",order:32,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=代理技能 (Agent Skills) 是什麼? 解決了什麼問題?",summary:"代理技能從推出到被 AI 工程社群採納，僅花了約兩個月的時間。這不禁讓人問，究竟代理技能是什麼、解決了什麼問題，讓社群會如此快速地採用這個新模式。在這篇文章，我們會試著從開發與使用代理的痛點出發，然後一步步帶著讀者們，解決這些痛點，進而能夠理解代理技能的價值。"},{title:"What Is Web Worker? Where Can It Be Used?",date:"2026-01-06",lastmod:"2026-01-06",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-web-worker",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-web-worker.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-web-worker",subtoc:"browser",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Web Worker? Where Can It Be Used?",summary:"In the early days of frontend development, there wasn't much to process on the frontend side, mostly simple event handling and animation effects. However, as frontend development has matured, developers are handling more and more tasks on the frontend, and the original JavaScript design gradually became insufficient for new demands. Various technologies have emerged to fill these gaps. Web Worker and Service Worker, commonly heard in frontend development, fall into this category."},{title:"Web Worker 是什么? 可以用在哪?",date:"2026-01-06",lastmod:"2026-01-06",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-web-worker",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-web-worker.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-web-worker",subtoc:"browser",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Web Worker 是什么? 可以用在哪?",summary:"在早期的前端开发，会放在前端处理的东西不多，基本上不脱离简单的事件操作、动画特效；不过随着前端发展越来越纯熟，开发者在前端做的事情越来越多，当初 JavaScript 的设计就逐渐不足以支应新的需求。这时前端社群逐渐有了不同的技术，来弥补 JavaScript 做不到的，藉此让开发者们能在前端做更复杂的操作；在前端开发很常听到的 Web Worker 与 Service Worker 都在这个范畴中。"},{title:"Web Worker 是什麼? 可以用在哪?",date:"2026-01-06",lastmod:"2026-01-06",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-web-worker",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-web-worker.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-web-worker",subtoc:"browser",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Web Worker 是什麼? 可以用在哪?",summary:"在早期的前端開發，會放在前端處理的東西不多，基本上不脫離簡單的事件操作、動畫特效；不過隨著前端發展越來越純熟，開發者在前端做的事情越來越多，當初 JavaScript 的設計就逐漸不足以支應新的需求。這時前端社群逐漸有了不同的技術，來彌補 JavaScript 做不到的，藉此讓開發者們能在前端做更複雜的操作；在前端開發很常聽到的 Web Worker 與 Service Worker 都在這個範疇中。"},{title:"ExplainThis 2025 年度反思 & 2026 年展望",date:"2026-01-01",lastmod:"2026-01-01",toc:"",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"2026-goal",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/blog/2026-goal.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/blog/2026-goal",subtoc:"",order:"",images:"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/ets-web-8484d.firebasestorage.app/o/images%2F2026-goals.png?alt=media&token=11954cb3-781d-4af3-9602-985c5c9efe01",summary:"在今年的年度反思與新年展望中，我們會先聊聊，今年的我們是否與我們的理想相符。接著會談 2025 年讓我們最有感的體悟，以及這體悟對我們帶來的具體改變，讓 2026 年的 ExplainThis 會聚焦在哪些面向。"},{title:"ExplainThis 2025 年度回顧",date:"2025-12-31",lastmod:"2025-12-31",toc:"",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"2025-reflection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/blog/2025-reflection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/blog/2025-reflection",subtoc:"",order:"",images:"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/ets-web-8484d.firebasestorage.app/o/images%2F2025-reflections.png?alt=media&token=bbfd8c66-188b-41d9-8954-83b5096fc047",summary:"在 2025 的年末往回頭檢視時，很慶幸我們能夠說自己有達到去年自己的期許。如果讀者們到 ExplainThis 的「所有文章」專區，看過去一年我們新增的每篇文章，相信即使已經是年末的今天，這些內容也沒有過時的問題；即使在一年、三年、甚至五年後，我們相信這些內容，都能持續對未來的讀者有幫助。"},{title:"工程師培訓與成長三大痛點，E+ 會員如何一次解決？",date:"2025-08-01",lastmod:"2025-12-31",toc:"",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"accelerate-engineering-career-with-eplus",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/e-plus/blog/accelerate-engineering-career-with-eplus.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/e-plus/blog/accelerate-engineering-career-with-eplus",subtoc:"",order:"",images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=工程師培訓與成長三大痛點，E+ 會員如何一次解決？",summary:"E+ 會員中的前後端技術內容，以及軟實力的深度內容、線上課程，都能實際運用在工作上，來協助讀者在工作中有更好的表現。透過 E+ 不僅能獲得個人成長，也能因為自己的成長讓所任職的公司受益；這也是為什麼，有不少讀者透過公司教育訓練補助購買 E+ 會員。"},{title:"What is XSS?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2025-12-24",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-xss",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-xss.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-xss",subtoc:"security",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is XSS?",summary:"This article covers the basics of cross-site scripting (XSS) attacks, a common form of online attack. It explores how XSS attacks work and the potential consequences of an attack. The article then outlines three approaches to defending against XSS attacks, including using content security policy, preventing user input from being executed, and checking for vulnerable fields."},{title:"什么是 XSS 攻击？如何防范？",date:"2022-11-29",lastmod:"2025-12-24",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-xss",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-xss.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-xss",subtoc:"security",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 XSS 攻击？如何防范？",summary:"XSS (cross-site scripting) 是很常见的网路攻击。身为网页前端或后端工程师，在面试中，很常会问到 XSS 的问题，因为面试官要确定你对于 XSS 的基本概念需要有所掌握。"},{title:"什麼是 XSS 攻擊？如何防範？",date:"2022-11-29",lastmod:"2025-12-24",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-xss",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-xss.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-xss",subtoc:"security",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 XSS 攻擊？如何防範？",summary:"XSS (cross-site scripting) 是很常見的網路攻擊。身為網頁前端或後端工程師，在面試中，很常會問到 XSS 的問題，因為面試官要確定你對於 XSS 的基本概念需要有所掌握。"},{title:"付费自媒体两年经营心得",date:"2025-12-23",lastmod:"2025-12-23",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"paid-media-2-year-reflection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:19,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=付费自媒体两年经营心得",summary:"今年即将迎来尾声，我们在 2024 年初开始的订阅制内容 E+，也即将推出满两年了。虽然我们一直没有以自媒体来看自己做的事，但假如要找一个词汇描述 E+，目前社群爱用的「付费自媒体」可能是最贴切的。"},{title:"付費自媒體兩年經營心得",date:"2025-12-23",lastmod:"2025-12-23",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"paid-media-2-year-reflection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:19,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=付費自媒體兩年經營心得",summary:"今年即將迎來尾聲，我們在 2024 年初開始的訂閱制內容 E+，也即將推出滿兩年了。雖然我們一直沒有以自媒體來看自己做的事，但假如要找一個詞彙描述 E+，目前社群愛用的「付費自媒體」可能是最貼切的。"},{title:"Understanding Reactivity from a Frontend Development Perspective",date:"2025-12-20",lastmod:"2025-12-20",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Understanding Reactivity from a Frontend Development Perspective",summary:"Reactivity is a programming paradigm that automatically responds to changes in data or state, ensuring applications stay synchronized with their underlying data. This article explores reactivity from a frontend development perspective, discussing its definition, why it matters, and how modern frameworks like React and Vue implement it."},{title:"从前端开发角度了解响应式 (Reactivity)",date:"2025-12-20",lastmod:"2025-12-20",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=从前端开发角度了解响应式 (Reactivity)",summary:"响应式 (Reactivity) 是一种编程范式，能够自动对数据或状态的变化做出响应，确保应用程序与其底层数据保持同步更新。这篇文章从前端开发角度探讨响应式的定义、为什么前端开发需要响应式，以及 React 和 Vue 等现代框架如何实践响应式。"},{title:"從前端開發角度了解回應式 (Reactivity)",date:"2025-12-20",lastmod:"2025-12-20",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=從前端開發角度了解回應式 (Reactivity)",summary:"回應式 (Reactivity) 是一種程式典範，能夠自動對資料或狀態的變化做出回應，確保應用程式與其底層資料保持同步更新。這篇文章從前端開發角度探討回應式的定義、為什麼前端開發需要回應式，以及 React 和 Vue 等現代框架如何實踐回應式。"},{title:"What is a Database Index? Why B+ Tree?",date:"2025-12-18",lastmod:"2025-12-18",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"database-index",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/database-index.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/database-index",subtoc:"database",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is a Database Index?",summary:"Database indexes are crucial for accelerating data retrieval. By creating indexes on specific columns, databases can quickly locate and fetch data instead of scanning entire tables, significantly improving query performance."},{title:"数据库索引 (Database Index) 是什么? 为什么用 B+ tree?",date:"2025-12-18",lastmod:"2025-12-18",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"database-index",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/database-index.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/database-index",subtoc:"database",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=数据库索引 (Database Index) 是什么?",summary:"数据库索引是用来加快数据查询速度的重要技术。通过在表格的一个或多个列上建立索引，数据库可以更快地定位和检索数据，从而显著提升查询性能。"},{title:"資料庫索引 (Database Index) 是什麼? 為什麼用 B+ tree?",date:"2025-12-18",lastmod:"2025-12-18",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"database-index",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/database-index.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/database-index",subtoc:"database",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=資料庫索引 (Database Index) 是什麼?",summary:"資料庫索引是用來加快資料查詢速度的重要技術。透過在表格的一個或多個欄位上建立索引，資料庫可以更快地定位和檢索資料，從而顯著提升查詢性能。"},{title:"Writing Maintainable Code: Low Coupling",date:"2025-12-13",lastmod:"2025-12-13",toc:"swe-read",lang:"en",fileName:"low-coupling",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/low-coupling.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/low-coupling",subtoc:"maintainable-code",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Writing Maintainable Code: Low Coupling",summary:"Learn how low coupling reduces dependencies between modules, making your code easier to modify and extend through real-world examples."},{title:"写出好维护的程式码 — 低耦合",date:"2025-12-13",lastmod:"2025-12-13",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"low-coupling",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/low-coupling.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/low-coupling",subtoc:"maintainable-code",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=写出好维护的程式码 — 低耦合",summary:"本篇文章为写出好维护的程式码系列文，会透过日常生活的例子，深入说明低耦合 low coupling 在软体设计中的意义，让模组之间松散耦合、更易维护。"},{title:"寫出好維護的程式碼 — 低耦合",date:"2025-12-13",lastmod:"2025-12-13",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"low-coupling",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/low-coupling.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/low-coupling",subtoc:"maintainable-code",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=寫出好維護的程式碼 — 低耦合",summary:"本篇文章為寫出好維護的程式碼系列文，會透過日常生活的例子，深入說明低耦合 low coupling 在軟體設計中的意義，讓模組之間鬆散耦合、更易維護。"},{title:"What is Sandboxing? Why Do AI Agents Need Sandboxes?",date:"2025-12-11",lastmod:"2025-12-11",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"ai-sandboxing",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/ai-sandboxing.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/ai-sandboxing",subtoc:"ai-application",order:31,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is Sandboxing? Why Do AI Agents Need Sandboxes?",summary:"In this article, we discuss what sandboxing is, why we need it, and how to build a basic AI agent sandbox."},{title:"沙箱 (sandboxing) 是什么? 为什么 AI 代理需要沙箱?",date:"2025-12-11",lastmod:"2025-12-11",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"ai-sandboxing",filePath:"src/pages/zh-