at is a Frontend Bundler (Module Bundler)? Why Use One?",date:"2025-12-06",lastmod:"2025-12-06",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"frontend-bundler",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/frontend-bundler.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/frontend-bundler",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is a Frontend Bundler (Module Bundler)? Why Use One?",summary:"A deep dive into what bundlers do, why they're essential, and how they transform your code for browsers."},{title:"前端打包工具 (bundler) 是什么? 为什么要用?",date:"2025-12-06",lastmod:"2025-12-06",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"frontend-bundler",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/frontend-bundler.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend-bundler",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端打包工具 (bundler) 是什么? 为什么要用?",summary:"这篇文章将会深入探讨打包工具的核心作用，以及它在现代前端中扮演的角色。"},{title:"前端打包工具 (bundler) 是什麼? 為什麼要用?",date:"2025-12-06",lastmod:"2025-12-06",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"frontend-bundler",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/frontend-bundler.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/frontend-bundler",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端打包工具 (bundler) 是什麼? 為什麼要用?",summary:"這篇文章將會深入探討打包工具的核心作用，以及它在現代前端中扮演的角色。"},{title:"How to Seek Help Effectively in Your Software Engineering Career?",date:"2025-12-05",lastmod:"2025-12-05",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",subtoc:"effective",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Seek Help Effectively in Your Software Engineering Career?",summary:"In a software engineer's career, most people encounter problems they cannot solve alone. In such situations, 'seeking help' becomes crucial. However, many hesitate to ask for help due to fears like 'not wanting to bother others' or 'worrying about rejection.' This indecision can leave problems unresolved for extended periods, causing frustration and wasted time."},{title:"在职涯中如何有效寻求协助?",date:"2025-12-05",lastmod:"2025-12-05",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",subtoc:"effective",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在职涯中如何有效寻求协助?",summary:"在软件工程师的职涯中，相信多数人或多或少会遇到自己没办法单独解决的问题，在这种状况下「寻求协助」会变得很重要。然而，许多人可能基于「不好意思打扰人」或「担心被人拒绝」，又或者是其他各类的理由，没有主动去寻求协助，不愿意开口提问，导致自己问题卡了很久，让自己感到折腾被折磨。"},{title:"在職涯中如何有效尋求協助?",date:"2025-12-05",lastmod:"2025-12-05",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",subtoc:"effective",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在職涯中如何有效尋求協助?",summary:"在軟體工程師的職涯中，相信多數人或多或少會遇到自己沒辦法單獨解決的問題，在這種狀況下「尋求協助」會變得很重要。然而，許多人可能基於「不好意思打擾人」或「擔心被人拒絕」，又或者是其他各類的理由，沒有主動去尋求協助，不願意開口提問，導致自己問題卡了很久，讓自己感到折騰被折磨。"},{title:"Writing Maintainable Code — Using Comments to Make Code Easier to Maintain",date:"2025-11-27",lastmod:"2025-11-27",toc:"swe-read",lang:"en",fileName:"maintainable-code-comments",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/maintainable-code-comments.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/maintainable-code-comments",subtoc:"maintainable-code",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Writing Maintainable Code - Using Comments to Make Code Easier to Maintain",summary:"This article explores how effective code comments can improve code readability and maintainability."},{title:"写出好维护的代码 — 通过注释让代码更容易维护",date:"2025-11-27",lastmod:"2025-11-27",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"maintainable-code-comments",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/maintainable-code-comments.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/maintainable-code-comments",subtoc:"maintainable-code",orde