/www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=寫出好維護的程式碼 — 寫出複雜度更低的程式碼",summary:"在軟體工程中，複雜度是影響程式碼可維護性的關鍵因素。本文探討如何識別複雜度的來源，並透過實踐降低複雜度的方法，寫出更容易維護的程式碼。"},{title:"What is a CDN? Why Use a CDN?",date:"2025-11-16",lastmod:"2025-11-16",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-cdn",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-cdn.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-cdn",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is a CDN? Why Use a CDN?",summary:"CDN (Content Delivery Network) accelerates static resource delivery through globally distributed edge nodes, reducing origin server load and improving system availability. Learn how CDN works and its applications in system design."},{title:"什么是 CDN？为什么要用 CDN？",date:"2025-11-16",lastmod:"2025-11-16",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-cdn",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-cdn.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-cdn",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 CDN？为什么要用 CDN？",summary:"CDN（内容传递网络）通过在全球部署边界节点，加快静态资源的传输速度，降低原始服务器压力，提升系统可用性和容错能力。了解 CDN 的工作原理和应用场景。"},{title:"什麼是 CDN？為什麼要用 CDN？",date:"2025-11-16",lastmod:"2025-11-16",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-cdn",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-cdn.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-cdn",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 CDN？為什麼要用 CDN？",summary:"CDN（內容傳遞網路）通過在全球部署邊界節點，加快靜態資源的傳輸速度，降低原始伺服器壓力，提升系統可用性和容錯能力。了解 CDN 的工作原理和應用場景。"},{title:"一张图搞懂 SQL JOIN",date:"2025-11-12",lastmod:"2025-11-12",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"sql-join",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/sql-join.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-join",subtoc:"database",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=一张图搞懂 SQL JOIN",summary:"SQL JOIN 是用来连接两个或多个表格的关键字。常见的 JOIN 类型包括 INNER JOIN、LEFT JOIN、RIGHT JOIN 和 FULL OUTER JOIN，各自适用于不同的资料查询需求。"},{title:"一張圖搞懂 SQL JOIN",date:"2025-11-12",lastmod:"2025-11-12",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"sql-join",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/sql-join.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-join",subtoc:"database",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=一張圖搞懂 SQL JOIN",summary:"SQL JOIN 是用來連接兩個或多個表格的關鍵字。常見的 JOIN 類型包括 INNER JOIN、LEFT JOIN、RIGHT JOIN 和 FULL OUTER JOIN，各自適用於不同的資料查詢需求。"},{title:"What is Bun? Why Use It? How Does It Solve Node.js Problems?",date:"2024-11-13",lastmod:"2025-11-08",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-bun",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-bun.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-bun",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is Bun? Why Use It? How Does It Solve Node.js Problems?",summary:"Bun is a JavaScript runtime - basically a place where JavaScript code runs. While Node.js dominates the JavaScript runtime landscape today, its creator Ryan Dahl later developed Deno to address Node.js's design limitations. Now, the Oven team has introduced Bun as another alternative runtime."},{title:"Bun 是什么? 为什么要用 Bun? 它解决了哪些 Node.js 的问题?",date:"2023-09-11",lastmod:"2025-11-08",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-bun",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-bun.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-bun",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:4,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/e0ae19c7cc994d45aece680416af1a07.png",summary:"Bun 是 JavaScript 的执行环境，也就是能跑 JavaScript 程式的地方。目前社群最多人用的 JavaScript 执行环境莫过于 Node.js。因为 Node.js 在设计上有些问题，但打掉重练的成本太大，所以他的创作者 Ryan Dahl 后来另外开发了 Deno 这个新的执行环境，来解决那些问题。而 Bun 则是由 Oven 团队开发的执行环境。"},{title:"Bun 是什麼? 為什麼要用 Bun? 它解決了哪些 Node.js 的問題?",date:"2023-09-11",lastmod:"2025-11-08",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-bun",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-bun.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-bun",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Bun 是什麼? 為什麼要用 Bun? 它解決了哪些 Node.js 的問題?",summary:"Bun 是 JavaScript 的執行環境，也就是能跑 JavaScript 程式的地方。目前社群最多人用的 JavaScript 執行環境莫過於 Node.js。因為 Node.js 在設計上有些問題，但打掉重練的成本太大，所以他的創作者 Ryan Dahl 後來另外開發了 Deno 這個新的執行環境，來解決那些問題。而 Bun 則是由 Oven 團隊開發的執行環境。"},