n",fileName:"what-is-ci",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-ci.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-ci",subtoc:"basic",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Should Be Included in a CI Pipeline?",summary:"This article explores the essential steps in a CI (Continuous Integration) pipeline, including code formatting checks, static analysis, and automated testing. Through CI processes, teams can ensure code quality, consistency, and reliability by automatically performing crucial checks after code is pushed to remote branches, improving development efficiency and code quality."},{title:"CI/CD 中的 CI 流程中该包含什么?",date:"2024-03-26",lastmod:"2024-03-26",toc:"devops",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-ci",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-ci.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-ci",subtoc:"basic",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CI/CD 中的 CI 流程中该包含什么?",summary:"本文介绍了CI（持续整合）流程中的重要步骤，包括代码格式化检查、静态检查和自动化测试等。透过CI流程，团队能够确保代码的品质、一致性和可靠性，并在代码推到远端分支后自动完成各项重要检测，进而提高开发效率和代码品质。"},{title:"CI/CD 中的 CI 流程中該包含什麼?",date:"2024-03-26",lastmod:"2024-03-26",toc:"devops",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-ci",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-ci.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-ci",subtoc:"basic",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CI/CD 中的 CI 流程中該包含什麼?",summary:"本文介紹了CI（持續整合）流程中的重要步驟，包括程式碼格式化檢查、靜態檢查和自動化測試等。透過CI流程，團隊能夠確保程式碼的品質、一致性和可靠性，並在程式碼推到遠端分支後自動完成各項重要檢測，進而提高開發效率和程式碼品質。"},{title:"4 Recommended Open Source System Design Diagramming Tools",date:"2024-03-24",lastmod:"2024-03-24",toc:"pinthis",lang:"en",fileName:"system-design-tools",filePath:"src/pages/en/pinthis/blog/system-design-tools.md",fullPath:"/en/pinthis/blog/system-design-tools",subtoc:"Software Development",order:"",images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/091f8daa1838408992671f855a1bb460.png",summary:"Whether you are practicing system design interviews or drawing system diagrams during actual work, useful tools can make it easier for you to draw system diagrams. There are several open source communities that allow you to draw system diagrams. System diagramming tools are highly recommended by people. In this article, we have selected four of the most recommended ones for everyone."},{title:"值得你一看再看的 AI 相关线上讲座与影片 (持续更新)",date:"2024-03-23",lastmod:"2024-03-23",toc:"pinthis",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"event-recommendation",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/pinthis/blog/event-recommendation.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/pinthis/blog/event-recommendation",subtoc:"AI 人工智慧",order:"",images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/d025f06c7404410db0e5462f7e5892fd.png",summary:"目前网路上有许多AI 相关的线上讲座、影片，许多充满洞见。本篇文章汇整了我们自己觉得值得一看再看的，也推荐大家看的同时，不忘思考你是否同意讲者 的观点? 为什么?"},{title:"Forage: 与知名企业合作的免费模拟工作计画",date:"2024-03-23",lastmod:"2024-03-23",toc:"pinthis",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"job-simulations",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/pinthis/blog/job-simulations.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/pinthis/blog/job-simulations",subtoc:"职涯与面试",order:"",images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/48576f4bd9dc4ff998e8764843405ad0.png",summary:"Forage 的平台与许多公司合作，包含HP (惠普)、Lyft、JPMorgan、Goldman Sachs (高盛)、BCG 等公司合作，让企业提供真实的情境来模拟。该平台是免费使用的，以软体 工程来说，Lyft 出的模拟项目，就包含了完成技术设计架构图、重构代码、写单元测试等等。而当完成了这些工作模拟后，合作的企业会提供相关证书，让你可以 放到LinkedIn 或履历上面"},{title:"系統設計案例實戰 - 導覽",date:"2024-01-27",lastmod:"2024-03-19",toc:"system-design",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"system-design",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/system-design.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/system-design",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/6c20b248cb6b412a97d861670fc0cab7.png",summary:"本系列彙整了系統設計基礎與實戰題"},{title:"[Easy] 反转链表 Reverse a Linked List",date:"2024-03-18",lastmod:"2024-03-18",toc:"coding-question",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"reverse-linked-list",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/reverse-linked-list.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/reverse-linked-list",subtoc:"common-coding-question",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=反转链表 Reverse a Linked List",summary:"反转链表 Reverse a Linked List 是程式面试中常见的入门考题，