打造更符合搜寻引擎需求的网站。"},{title:"2024 Google 最新 SEO 入門手冊，別再用過時的 SEO 觀念了！",date:"2024-02-03",lastmod:"2024-02-03",toc:"performance-seo",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"seo-you-should-not-focus",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/seo-you-should-not-focus.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/seo-you-should-not-focus",subtoc:"seo",order:10,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/8a358b80bed84e02be1f9ca529b31193.png",summary:"SEO 是搜尋引擎優化 (Search Engine Optimization) 的縮寫，是指透過一系列的優化手法，提升網站的搜尋排名。隨著搜尋引擎演算法的不斷更新，許多過去被奉為圭臬的 SEO 做法如今已經不再適用，甚至可能會產生反效果。本文將分享 10 大 SEO 迷思，幫助你避免誤踩地雷，打造更符合搜尋引擎需求的網站。"},{title:"What is CI/CD? Why Do We Need CI/CD?",date:"2024-01-29",lastmod:"2024-01-29",toc:"devops",lang:"en",fileName:"cicd",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/cicd.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/cicd",subtoc:"basic",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is CI/CD? Why Do We Need CI/CD?",summary:"CI/CD combines CI (Continuous Integration) and CD (Continuous Delivery/Deployment). While some companies have dedicated DevOps engineers handling CI/CD, many still rely on development engineers - frontend, backend, and full-stack developers - to manage these processes."},{title:"DevOps Development and Operations - Navigation",date:"2024-01-29",lastmod:"2024-01-29",toc:"devops",lang:"en",fileName:"devops",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/devops.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/devops",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/edc3f9e0977949508dbf8cda50abd088.png",summary:"This series covers common DevOps topics"},{title:"如何有效提高获得面试的成功率",date:"2024-01-29",lastmod:"2024-01-29",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"improve-get-interview",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/improve-get-interview.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/improve-get-interview",subtoc:"job-search",order:6,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/0068459ac2e34caab992944b08b33fa2.png",summary:"要如何提高求职成功率，相信是多数人感兴趣的议题。前 Google 工程师 NeetCode 先前分享了一个谈论这主题的短片，看到后觉得挺不错的，在此摘要同时加上我们的一些延伸想法与大家分享。"},{title:"CI/CD 是什么? 为什么要 CI/CD?",