2-26",lastmod:"2023-03-05",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"notion-ai-discord",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/notion-ai-discord.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/notion-ai-discord",subtoc:"api",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Notion AI 串接 Discord 教学 — 双剑合璧让你的团队协作再升级",summary:"Notion AI 和ChatGPT 相似，但提供多种不同的功能，例如翻译、行程规划、Email 撰写、文案发想、头脑风暴等。本文将教你如何在Discord 上使用Notion AI，增强团队协作。而目前免费的方案使用Notion AI 次数是有限的，因此透过这个方法，就能一人升级，全团队使用！"},{title:"Notion AI 串接 Discord 教學 — 雙劍合璧讓你的團隊協作再升級",date:"2023-02-26",lastmod:"2023-03-05",toc:"ai-resources",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"notion-ai-discord",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/notion-ai-discord.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/notion-ai-discord",subtoc:"ai-insight",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Notion AI 串接 Discord 教學 — 雙劍合璧讓你的團隊協作再升級",summary:"Notion AI 和 ChatGPT 相似，但提供多種不同的功能，例如翻譯、行程規劃、Email 撰寫、文案發想、頭腦風暴等。本文將教你如何在 Discord 上使用 Notion AI，增強團隊協作。而目前免費的方案使用 Notion AI 次數是有限的，因此透過這個方法，就能一人升級，全團隊使用！"},{title:"Differences between Encryption, Encoding, and Hashing",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"hash-encode-encrypt",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/hash-encode-encrypt.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/hash-encode-encrypt",subtoc:"security",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Differences between Encryption, Encoding, and Hashing",summary:"This document explains the differences between encryption, encoding, and hashing. Encoding presents data in a different way, encryption uses keys to encrypt data, and hashing maps data to a fixed-length digital feature code. Additionally, it introduces symmetric encryption, asymmetric encryption, and common hashing algorithms like md5."},{title:"How to Refactor? What Are the Benefits of Refactoring?",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-refactor",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/how-to-refactor.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/how-to-refactor",subtoc:"architecture",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Refactor? What Are the Benefits of Refactoring?",summary:"This article introduces the benefits and how to refactor. Refactoring can improve the readability, maintainability, performance, and security of the code. Refactoring can be performed when the code is duplicated, technical debt, adding new features, performance optimization, bug fixing, or team collaboration. Common refactoring techniques include Red-Green-Refactor, abstraction, and composing method."},{title:"What is Object-Oriented Programming? (OOP)",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"object-oriented-programming",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/object-oriented-programming.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/object-oriented-programming",subtoc:"architecture",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is Object-Oriented Programming? (OOP)",summary:"This article introduces the three characteristics of object-oriented programming: encapsulation, inheritance, and polymorphism, and explains them using the example of a car class. Encapsulation can protect an objects internal state from direct access or modification, inheritance can reuse existing object code while also extending or modifying its functionality, and polymorphism allows an object to exhibit different behaviors depending on the context, improving program flexibility and extensibility."},{title:"加密、编码、杂凑的区别为何？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"hash-encode-encrypt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/hash-encode-encrypt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/hash-encode-encrypt",subtoc:"security",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=加密、编码、杂凑的区别为何？",summary:"此文介绍了编码、加密和杂凑的区别。编码是一种将资料转换为另一种形式的方法，而加密则是使用密钥对资料进行加密，杂凑则是将任意长度的资料映射到固定长度的数字特征码的算法。文章还介绍了对称式加密和非对称式加密的区别，以及常见的加密演算法和杂凑演算法。"},{title:"重构带来的好处为何？如何重构？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-refactor",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/how-to-refactor.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/how-to-refactor",subtoc:"architecture",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=重构带来的好处为何？如何重构？",summary:"本篇文章介绍了重构的好处和如何进行重构。重构可以改善代码的可读性、可维护性、性能和安全性。当代码重复、技术债务、添加新功能、性能优化、错误修复或团队合作时，就可以进行重构。常见的重构技术包括Red-Green-Refactor、抽象化和合成方法等。"},{title:"物件导向程序设计的三大特性为何？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"object-oriented-programming",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/object-oriented-programming.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/object-oriented-programming",subtoc:"architecture",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=物件导向程序设计的三大特性为何？",summary:"本篇文章介绍了物件导向程序设计的三大特性：封装、继承和多型，并以汽车类别为例子进行说明。封装可以保护物件的内部状态不被直接访问或修改，继承可以重复使用已有物件的代码，同时也可以扩展或修改已有物件的功能，而多型则可以让物件可以根据上下文表现出不同的行为，提高程式的灵活性和可扩展性。"},{title:"加密、編碼、雜湊的區別為何？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"hash-encode-encrypt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/hash-encode-encrypt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/hash-encode-encrypt",subtoc:"security",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=加密、編碼、雜湊的區別為何？",summary:"此文介紹了編碼、加密和雜湊的區別。編碼是一種將資料轉換為另一種形式的方法，而加密則是使用密鑰對資料進行加密，雜湊則是將任意長度的資料映射到固定長度的數字特徵碼的算法。文章還介紹了對稱式加密和非對稱式加密的區別，以及常見的加密演算法和雜湊演算法。"},{title:"重構帶來的好處為何？如何重構？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-refactor",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/how-to-refactor.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/how-to-refactor",subtoc:"architecture",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=重構帶來的好處為何？如何重構？",summary:"本篇文章介紹了重構的好處和如何進行重構。重構可以改善代碼的可讀性、可維護性、性能和安全性。當代碼重複、技術債務、添加新功能、性能優化、錯誤修復或團隊合作時，就可以進行重構。常見的重構技術包括 Red-Green-Refactor、抽象化和合成方法等。"},{title:"物件導向程式設計的三大特性為何？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"object-oriented-programming",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/object-oriented-programming.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/object-oriented-programming",subtoc:"architecture",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=物件導向程式設計的三大特性為何？",summary:"本篇文章介紹了物件導向程式設計的三大特性：封裝、繼承和多型，並以汽車類別為例子進行說明。封裝可以保護物件的內部狀態不被直接訪問或修改，繼承可以重複使用已有物件的程式碼，同時也可以擴展或修改已有物件的功能，而多型則可以讓物件可以根據上下文表現出不同的行為，提高程式的靈活性和可擴展性。"},{title:"Is it Worth Upgrading to ChatGPT Plus? An In-Depth Review",date:"2023-02-27",lastmod:"2023-02-27",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"upgrade-plus",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/upgrade-plus.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/upgrade-plus",subtoc:"use",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Is it Worth Upgrading to ChatGPT Plus? An In-Depth Review",summary:"For users who frequently use ChatGPT, upgrading to ChatGPT Plus is undoubtedly worth. However, for some users, whether or not to upgrade to ChatGPT Plus requires careful consideration and evaluation. In this article, we will share real experiences of using ChatGPT Plus to help you decide whether or not to upgrade."},{title:"How to Integrate ChatGPT to Your Own Discord Bot",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"discord",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/discord.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/discord",subtoc:"api",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Integrate ChatGPT to Your Own Discord Bot",summary:"ChatGPT is a powerful language model developed by OpenAI. This article will teach you how to integrate it with a Discord bot to help teams work more efficiently and foster communication and collaboration. We will show you how to do the integration without writing a single line of code"},{title:"How to Integrate ChatGPT to Tinder APP?",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"tinder",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/tinder.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/tinder",subtoc:"api",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Integrate ChatGPT to Tinder APP?",summary:"Are you usually too busy to make friends? When using a social app to make friends, do you worry about missing out on opportunities because you can not reply to everyone in a timely manner when chatting with multiple people at the same time? With the advent of ChatGPT, you no longer have to worry about these issues. Let ChatGPT automatically respond to messages for you so you never miss an opportunity. With ChatGPT, you can become a master of time management."},{title:"What Is SPA (Single-Page Application)? What Are Its Advantages and Disadvantages?",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"spa",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/spa.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/spa",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is SPA (Single-Page Application)? What Are Its Advantages and Disadvantages?",summary:"SPA is a web application that is a single-page application, which is an application with only one page. All content will be on the same page, instead of like a traditional web application, each page is a complete HTML document."},{title:"用 ChatGPT 来练习独立思考，以黄仁勋的演讲为例",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"chatgpt-critical-thinking",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/chatgpt-critical-thinking.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/chatgpt-critical-thinking",subtoc:"case",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=用 ChatGPT 来练习独立思考，以黄仁勋的演讲为例",summary:"难得有国际级的大咖讲者来台，好奇怎么看昨天NVIDIA 创办人黄仁勋在台大的演讲? 感谢他愿意分享过去那些深刻的学习，但与此同时，对于名人演讲的内容，我们不该照单全收，可以试着以独立思考的角度看，哪些内容真正适用在自己的情境下。在后 ChatGPT 时代，有 ChatGPT 的帮忙，变得更容易能够去分析一段论述，避免落入「因为是 XXX 讲的，所以就一定是的金玉良言」的状况。"},{title:"什么是 SPA (Single-Page Application)？有什么优点和缺点？",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"spa",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/spa.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/spa",subtoc:"else",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 SPA (Single-Page Application)？有什么优点和缺点？",summary:"SPA (Single-Page Application) 是一种网页应用程式，它是一个只有一个页面的应用程式，所有的内容都会在同一个页面上，而不是像传统的网页应用程式，每个页面都是一个完整的HTML 文件。"},{title:"用 ChatGPT 來練習獨立思考，以黃仁勳的演講為例",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"chatgpt-critical-thinking",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/chatgpt-critical-thinking.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/chatgpt-critical-thinking",subtoc:"case",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=用 ChatGPT 來練習獨立思考，以黃仁勳的演講為例",summary:"難得有國際級的大咖講者來台，好奇怎麼看昨天 NVIDIA 創辦人黃仁勳在台大的演講? 感謝他願意分享過去那些深刻的學習，但與此同時，對於名人演講的內容，我們不該照單全收，可以試著以獨立思考的角度看，哪些內容真正適用在自己的情境下。在後 ChatGPT 時代，有 ChatGPT 的幫忙，變得更容易能夠去分析一段論述，避免落入「因為是 XXX 講的，所以就一定是的金玉良言」的狀況。"},{title:"什麼是 SPA (Single-Page Application)？有什麼優點和缺點？",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"spa",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/spa.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/spa",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 SPA (Single-Page Application)？有什麼優點和缺點？",summary:"SPA (Single-Page Application) 是一種網頁應用程式，它是一個只有一個頁面的應用程式，所有的內容都會在同一個頁面上，而不是像傳統的網頁應用程式，每個頁面都是一個完整的 HTML 文件。"},{title:"Think twice before switching career to software engineering (the harsh reality)",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2023-02-20",toc:"pivot",lang:"en",fileName:"think-twice-before-change-career-to-swe",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/think-twice-before-change-career-to-swe.md",fullPath:"/en/career/think-twice-before-change-career-to-swe",subtoc:"before-pivot",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Think twice before switching career to software engineering (the harsh reality)",summary:"While the internet is filled with stories about the benefits of being a software engineer, such as job security, high salaries, and greater freedom, there is little discussion about the challenges and setbacks that come with this career path. In this article, we aim to provide a more balanced perspective for those considering a job switch. We urge you not to make an impulsive decision based solely on the appealing aspects of software engineering. The truth is that this field may not be suitable for everyone, and you may discover that after switching careers, the realit`y of being a software engineer is much different than what you imagined."},{title:"用 ChatGPT 帮自己修英文简历 — UI/UX 设计师篇",date:"2023-02-20",lastmod:"2023-02-20",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"uiux-resume",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/uiux-resume.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/uiux-resume",subtoc:"career",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=用 ChatGPT 帮自己修英文简历 — UI/UX 设计师篇",summary:"最近ChatGPT 这类AI 工具越做越好，在很多回答上精准又精辟，应该要有办法协助编修简历。所以不如来写一篇如何透过ChatGPT 帮自己修英文简历的文章，这样以后读者们就可以直接找ChatGPT 帮忙就行，不仅快速，还可以省下编修费用。"},{title:"用 ChatGPT 幫自己修英文履歷 — UI/UX 設計師篇",date:"2023-02-20",lastmod:"2023-02-20",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"uiux-resume",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/uiux-resume.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/uiux-resume",subtoc:"career",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=用 ChatGPT 幫自己修英文履歷 — UI/UX 設計師篇",summary:"最近 ChatGPT 這類 AI 工具越做越好，在很多回答上精準又精闢，應該要有辦法協助編修履歷。所以不如來寫一篇如何透過 ChatGPT 幫自己修英文履歷的文章，這樣以後讀者們就可以直接找 ChatGPT 幫忙就行，不僅快速，還可以省下編修費用。"},{title:"Without any job experience, why should we hire you?",date:"2023-02-17",lastmod:"2023-02-17",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"why-should-we-hire-you",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/why-should-we-hire-you.md",fullPath:"/en/career/why-should-we-hire-you",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Without any job experience, why should we hire you?",summary:"During an interview, the question Why should we hire you? often comes in different forms. Whether you are a fresh graduate with no work experience or someone who wants to switch to a new field but lacks background, you are often asked Why should we choose you over someone more experienced? When faced with this question, how can you effectively answer it? Let us take a look together"},{title:"面试被问「你缺乏相关经验，公司为什么要选你」该怎么回答呢?",date:"2023-02-17",lastmod:"2023-02-17",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-should-we-hire-you",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/why-should-we-hire-you.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/why-should-we-hire-you",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面试被问「你缺乏相关经验，公司为什么要选你」该怎么回答呢?",summary:"在英文面试时Why should we hire you? 这个问题常以不同形式出现。不论是新鲜人刚毕业没有工作经验，或是想要转职去新领域但缺乏背景，都很常会被问到「为什么要选你? 而不是其他更有经验的人选?」当遇到这个问题时，该如何有效回答呢? 该如何说服人你是公司该选的人才?"},{title:"面試被問「你缺乏相關經驗，公司為什麼要選你」該怎麼回答呢?",date:"2023-02-17",lastmod:"2023-02-17",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"why-should-we-hire-you",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/why-should-we-hire-you.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/why-should-we-hire-you",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面試被問「你缺乏相關經驗，公司為什麼要選你」該怎麼回答呢?",summary:"在英文面試時 Why should we hire you? 這個問題常以不同形式出現。不論是新鮮人剛畢業沒有工作經驗，或是想要轉職去新領域但缺乏背景，都很常會被問到「為什麼要選你? 而不是其他更有經驗的人選?」當遇到這個問題時，該如何有效回答呢? 該如何說服人你是公司該選的人才?"},{title:"What Are Your Strengths and Weaknesses?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-your-weakness",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/what-is-your-weakness.md",fullPath:"/en/career/what-is-your-weakness",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Are Your Strengths and Weaknesses?",summary:"Business Insider has published an article called Questions for job interviews answered by Bill Gates. I was curious about what Bill Gates would say to the common interview questions, so I watched the video and summarized his answers. I hope this article can help you to prepare for your next interview!"},{title:"What Are the Values of Display in CSS? What Is the Difference Between inline, block and inline-block? What Is the Difference Between display:none and visibility:hidden?",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"css-display",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/css-display.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/css-display",subtoc:"css",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Are the Values of Display in CSS? What Is the Difference Between inline, block and inline-block? What Is the Difference Between display:none and visibility:hidden?",summary:"The display property is used to determine whether an element will have block or inline characteristics. If the value of display is set to grid or flex, it will determine how the child elements of this element will be arranged."},{title:"Explain CSS Position Property",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"css-position",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/css-position.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/css-position",subtoc:"css",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Explain CSS Position Property",summary:"This article explains the differences between CSS static, relative, absolute, fixed and sticky positioning, highlighting their reference points and their impact on page layout."},{title:"Why Use Immutable Syntax When Updating React State?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react-why-immutable",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react-why-immutable.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react-why-immutable",subtoc:"advanced",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why Use Immutable Syntax When Updating React State?",summary:"In React, updating state is a common task, but do you know that you should use immutable methods to update state? Why and how should you do it? What is considered an immutable approach? These are frequently asked questions in React interviews, as it is a common problem that developers encounter in their daily work. Lets explore the answers to these questions in this article."},{title:"Where Should the <script> Tags Be Placed in HTML? How About <link> Tags?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"script-link-in-html",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/script-link-in-html.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/script-link-in-html",subtoc:"html",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Where Should the <script> Tags Be Placed in HTML? How About <link> Tags?",summary:"This article discusses the optimal placement of <script> and <link> tags in HTML markup, with <script> recommended at the bottom of the <body> to reduce page load times and <link> placed in the <head> to ensure required external resources are loaded before rendering the webpage content."},{title:"What Is useEffect? What Is the Difference Between useEffect and useLayoutEffect?",date:"2023-02-02",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect",subtoc:"hooks",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is useEffect? What Is the Difference Between useEffect and useLayoutEffect?",summary:"useEffect is a React Hook that is often used in React applications. It is also a common React interview question, including how to use useEffect, the execution time of useEffect, etc. Another similar Hook to useEffect is useLayoutEffect, which is also a high-frequency question in React interviews."},{title:"What Is Webpack Loader And Plugin?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"webpack-loader-plugin",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/webpack-loader-plugin.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/webpack-loader-plugin",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Webpack Loader And Plugin?",summary:"Webpack loader and plugin are two important concepts in webpack. In this article, we will introduce what is loader and plugin, how to use them, and what are the common loaders and plugins."},{title:"What Is a Higher-Order Function in JavaScript?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-hof",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-hof.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-hof",subtoc:"function",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is a Higher-Order Function in JavaScript?",summary:"The article explains the concept of higher order functions, which is the ability of a function to receive another function as a parameter or return a function as its result. This technique is important in functional programming and can help improve code modularity, reusability, and maintenance. The article also provides examples of higher order functions, such as callback function wrapping, abstraction of operations, and function composition."},{title:"「你的缺点是什么」这类最常见的面试问题",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-your-weakness",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/what-is-your-weakness.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/what-is-your-weakness",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=「你的缺点是什么」这类最常见的面试问题",summary:"这一题是很常见的「你的优点为何?」、「说说你的缺点」类问题。这不仅是在英文面试很常出现的，在中文面试也很常出现。除了工作面试外，在申请学校面试也很常见。让我们一起来看看比尔盖兹怎么回答吧！ "},{title:"CSS 中 display 的值有什么？有什么差异？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"css-display",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/css-display.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/css-display",subtoc:"css",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CSS 中 display 的值有什么？有什么差异？",summary:"display 属性是 CSS 中最常使用的属性之一，它可以用来决定一个元素会拥有块状 `block` 或是行内 `inline` 的特性。"},{title:"如何回答「你的缺點是什麼」這類最常見的面試問題",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-your-weakness",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/what-is-your-weakness.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/what-is-your-weakness",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何回答「你的缺點是什麼」這類最常見的面試問題",summary:"這一題是很常見的「你的優點為何?」、「說說你的缺點」類問題。這不僅是在英文面試很常出現的，在中文面試也很常出現。除了工作面試外，在申請學校面試也很常見。讓我們一起來看看比爾蓋茲怎麼回答吧！"},{title:"CSS 中 display 的值有什麼？inline、block 和 inline-block 有什麼差異？display:none 和 visibility:hidden 的差別？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"css-display",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/css-display.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/css-display",subtoc:"css",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CSS 中 display 的值有什麼？",summary:"display 屬性是 CSS 中最常使用的屬性之一，它可以用來決定一個元素會擁有塊狀 `block` 或是行內 `inline` 的特性。"},{title:"Database Sharding & Replication",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"database-sharding-replication",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/database-sharding-replication.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/database-sharding-replication",subtoc:"basic",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Database Sharding & Replication",summary:'This article discusses database sharding and how it can help address single points of failure in a system. It covers various sharding methods and their benefits and drawbacks, as well as the use of replication to mitigate single points of failure. The article also explores single-primary and multi-primary replication and the potential issues they may encounter."'},{title:"Explain the Lifecycle of a React Component",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react-lifecycle",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react-lifecycle.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react-lifecycle",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Explain the Lifecycle of a React Component",summary:"This article explains the lifecycle methods of React. It describes how React updates the DOM and how developers can ensure no side-effects occur during these stages. The article also explains the pre-commit stage and its importance. The author emphasizes the significance of getSnapshotBeforeUpdate() method and highlights its use in specific scenarios."},{title:"What Is a Pure Function? Why Do React Function Components Need to Be Pure?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react-pure-function",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react-pure-function.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react-pure-function",subtoc:"basic",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is a Pure Function? Why Do React Function Components Need to Be Pure?",summary:"React function components must be pure to prevent unstable renderings, unexpected UI presentations and potential bugs. Pure functions ensure that the same input always results in the same output, while impure functions, such as those with side effects, can cause inconsistent renderings. By writing pure functions, React developers can ensure a stable and bug-free application."},{title:"Why Do We Need to Add Keys When Rendering Lists in React?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react-why-key",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react-why-key.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react-why-key",subtoc:"advanced",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why Do We Need to Add Keys When Rendering Lists in React?",summary:"When rendering a list in React, it is important to use a unique key for each child component to prevent bugs and improve performance. Keys need to be stable and predictable and should not be based on the lists index."},{title:"What Is Semantic HTML?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"semantics-in-html",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/semantics-in-html.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/semantics-in-html",subtoc:"html",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Semantic HTML?",summary:"Semantic HTML is developing HTML using semantic tags. This involves utilizing HTML tags that clearly define their purpose which leads to better semantics and structure for your pages. In this article, we will cover what are the HTML semantic tags, and what are the advantages of using them."},{title:"What Is SQL Injection?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"sql-injection",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/sql-injection.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/sql-injection",subtoc:"security",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is SQL Injection?",summary:"The article explains SQL Injection, a malicious attack on a database that involves modifying SQL statements. It provides examples of how hackers can gain access to a database and how to prevent SQL Injection attacks. The suggested solutions include escaping parameters, query parameterization, and using Object Relational Mapping (ORM) instead of SQL statements."},{title:"What Is CSRF?",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-csrf",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-csrf.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-csrf",subtoc:"security",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is CSRF?",summary:"CSRF refers to cross-site request forgery. This way of attack will force users to execute unwanted malicious forgery requests on websites the user has authenticated. Because the user has been authenticated, the website has no ways to distinguish forged requests and actual requests, so the request will be accepted."},{title:"What Is an Event Loop in JavaScript?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-event-loop",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-event-loop.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-event-loop",subtoc:"event-loop",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is an Event Loop in JavaScript?",summary:"Understanding the event loop is a crucial concept for JavaScript developers. The event loop consists of a call stack, task queue, and heap. Asynchronous tasks are divided into macro and micro tasks, with different execution orders. The event loop executes one macro task at a time and completes all micro tasks before executing the next macro task. Common macro tasks include setTimeout, setInterval, I/O, events, and postMessage. Micro tasks include Promise.then, MutationObserver, and process.nextTick. requestAnimationFrame and requestIdleCallback have different execution timings."},{title:"What Is JSX?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-jsx",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-jsx.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-jsx",subtoc:"basic",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is JSX?",summary:"Learn about the syntax extension of JavaScript, JSX, and its benefits in React development. This article also covers the rules for using JSX, which will ensure its proper implementation."},{title:"What Is JavaScript Promise? And How To Use It?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-promise",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-promise.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-promise",subtoc:"event-loop",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is JavaScript Promise? And How To Use It?",summary:"Promise is a new feature in ES6, and it is used to optimize the previous callback function. This interview in-depth discussion will discuss what promise is, why we need Promise, and extend to async/await related questions."},{title:"What Is React Hook?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-react-hook",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-react-hook.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-react-hook",subtoc:"hooks",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is React Hook?",summary:"React Hooks allow stateful logic to be reused and complex components to be simplified. They come with rules, such as only being used at the top level of a React function, and commonly used Hooks include useState, useEffect, useReducer, useCallback, useMemo, and useRef."},{title:"Why Do We Need To Call React Hook at the Top Level? Why Can’t We Call It Inside a Loop or Condition?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"why-call-react-hook-top-level",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/why-call-react-hook-top-level.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/why-call-react-hook-top-level",subtoc:"hooks",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why Do We Need To Call React Hook at the Top Level? Why Can’t We Call It Inside a Loop or Condition?",summary:"In React, when using Hooks like useState, it is important to follow certain rules, such as not calling them inside loops or conditions and only calling them at the top level of the component. This is because React needs to maintain a stable order of the Hooks calls to properly associate each state with its corresponding useState. If the order changes, state associations can become mixed up, leading to unpredictable behavior. By following these rules, developers can ensure their components work as intended and avoid potential bugs."},{title:"Describe a Situation When You Faced a Challenge at Work and How You Overcame It?",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"how-did-you-deal-with-challenges",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Describe a Situation When You Faced a Challenge at Work and How You Overcame It?",summary:"This question is often asked in behavioral interviews to gauge your ability to handle difficult situations in the workplace. The interviewer wants to understand how you have responded to challenges in the past, as it can give insight into how you may handle potential challenges in the future if you were to join their team. To prepare for this topic, it is important to have specific examples ready that demonstrate your problem-solving skills and resilience."},{title:"Describe an Experience with Receiving Challenging Feedback and How It Was Managed",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"how-did-you-deal-with-feedback",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Describe an Experience with Receiving Challenging Feedback and How It Was Managed",summary:"Learn how to answer behavioral interview questions about feedback effectively by understanding the question, preparing your response, and following the structure of a proposed answer."},{title:"Tell Me About Yourself",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"self-introduction",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/self-introduction.md",fullPath:"/en/career/self-introduction",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Tell Me About Yourself",summary:"Make a lasting impression in your interview by effectively answering the self-introduction question. Our guide covers the purpose, making a strong first impression, creating a connection, customizing your introduction, and linking your past to your future."},{title:"Ace Your Job Interview with the STAR Method",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"star-method",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/star-method.md",fullPath:"/en/career/star-method",subtoc:"tips",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Ace Your Job Interview with the STAR Method",summary:"Learn how to successfully ace your next job interview using the STAR method. This powerful tool will help you prepare and communicate your experiences in a clear and concise manner, making you a top candidate for the position you desire."},{title:"Why Did You Leave Your Last Job?",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"why-quit-current-job",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/why-quit-current-job.md",fullPath:"/en/career/why-quit-current-job",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why Did You Leave Your Last Job?",summary:'\'Changing jobs often involves facing common HR questions such as "Why do you want to change jobs?" and "Why do you want to leave your current company?" These questions serve as a way for HR to ensure that the candidate is a good fit for the company and will not leave soon after being hired. In this article, we will explore how to effectively answer these questions, including the importance of avoiding criticism of the former company and common reasons for job changes.\''},{title:"Explain What Hoisting Is in JavaScript",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"hoisting",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/hoisting.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/hoisting",subtoc:"variable",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Explain What Hoisting Is in JavaScript",summary:"In this article, you will learn about hoisting in JavaScript, including how it works with different variable declarations like var, let, and function declarations. The article also covers the differences in hoisting behavior between var and let, as well as the concept of the Temporal Dead Zone (TDZ). This article is perfect for those preparing for a front-end interview or wanting to brush up on their JavaScript knowledge."},{title:"What is the Difference Between Map and Object in JavaScript, and Why Do We Need Map?",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"map-vs-object",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/map-vs-object.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/map-vs-object",subtoc:"basic",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is the Difference Between Map and Object in JavaScript, and Why Do We Need Map?",summary:"The article discusses the differences between Map and plain objects in JavaScript, and the benefits of using Map. It highlights the limitations of plain objects when used for key-value pair operations, and the advantages of Map flexibility in accepting any data type as a key. The article also explains how Map provides several commonly used methods that are not available in plain objects, and the performance differences between Map and plain objects in different contexts."},{title:"What Is the Difference Between Set, Map, WeakSet, and WeakMap in JavaScript?",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"set-map-weakset-weakmap",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/set-map-weakset-weakmap.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/set-map-weakset-weakmap",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is the Difference Between Set, Map, WeakSet, and WeakMap in JavaScript?",summary:"In this article, we explore the differences between Set and WeakSet, as well as Map and WeakMap in JavaScript. We examine the unique features of each data structure and how they can be used in various scenarios. The article highlights the benefits of using WeakSet and WeakMap when the object being referenced may be removed in the future. Overall, this article provides useful insights for web developers looking to optimize their JavaScript code."},{title:'What Is the Purpose of "use strict" in JavaScript and What Are the Benefits of Using It?',date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"use-strict",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/use-strict.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/use-strict",subtoc:"basic",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is the Purpose of use strict in JavaScript and What Are the Benefits of Using It?",summary:'Use strict is a JavaScript syntax that instructs the execution environment to follow strict mode when running code. Under strict mode, JavaScript executes syntax in a stricter manner and will report errors for some non-compliant code. In this article, we will explore what "use strict" is, how it works, and what benefits it provides to JavaScript developers.'},{title:"What is JavaScript Closures?",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-closure",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-closure.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-closure",subtoc:"variable",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is JavaScript Closures?",summary:"Closures are a fundamental concept in programming languages, and their use is widespread in JavaScript. Many important functions in JavaScript libraries utilize closures, including the useState function in the React library, which is implemented using closures. Understanding not only what closures are, but also their practical applications, is crucial to effectively leveraging their power."},{title:"What is an IIFE (Immediately Invoked Function Expression) in JavaScript? What are the Pros and Cons?",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-iife",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-iife.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-iife",subtoc:"function",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is an IIFE (Immediately Invoked Function Expression) in JavaScript? What are the Pros and Cons?",summary:"This article explains the concept of Immediately Invoked Function Expression (IIFE) in JavaScript, its syntax, and its benefits, such as creating a local scope, avoiding naming conflicts, enabling modular programming, and improving code execution efficiency. It also discusses the disadvantages of IIFEs, such as difficulty in maintenance, bad reusability, and increased code complexity. The article provides an example of a classic interview question related to setTimeout, scope, and IIFE and offers solutions to the problem."},{title:'What Is "this" in JavaScript?',date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-this",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-this.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-this",subtoc:"object",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is this in JavaScript?",summary:"Learn about the concept of this in JavaScript, including how it refers to objects and how to use the apply(), call(), and bind() methods to control its behavior. Get a better understanding of how this works in different contexts and scenarios."},{title:"Explain the Difference Between <script async> and <script defer>",date:"2022-01-19",lastmod:"2023-02-12",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"fe-script-async-defer-difference",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference",subtoc:"html",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Explain the Difference Between <script async> and <script defer>",summary:"The async and defer attributes in the script tag in HTML are similar in nature and the difference between the two is a common interview question. This article aims to provide a comprehensive understanding of the need for these attributes, as well as a clear comparison between the two."},{title:"Will passing (a,b) => b - a in JavaScript builit-in sort a be in ascending or descending order? Why?",date:"2023-01-21",lastmod:"2023-02-12",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"javascript-sort-ascending-descending",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/javascript-sort-ascending-descending.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/javascript-sort-ascending-descending",subtoc:"array",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Will passing (a,b) => b - a in JavaScript builit-in sort a be in ascending or descending order? Why?",summary:"Arrays in JavaScript have a built-in sort method, which allows us to have a high-performance sorting without writing our own sorting algorithm. However, do you know how to use sort? How does the compareFn passed in sort work? When compareFn is (a, b) => b - a, will the sort be ascending or descending? Why?"},{title:"What Is the Scope and Scope Chain of JavaScript?",date:"2023-02-12",lastmod:"2023-02-12",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-scope-and-scope-chain",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-scope-and-scope-chain.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-scope-and-scope-chain",subtoc:"variable",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is the Scope and Scope Chain of JavaScript?",summary:"Scope, as the name suggests, refers to the range that a variable can be accessed. There are three types of scope in JavaScript: global scope, function scope, and block scope."},{title:"用 ChatGPT 帮自己修英文简历 — 程序员篇",date:"2023-02-12",lastmod:"2023-02-12",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"swe-resume",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/ai/swe-resume.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/swe-resume",subtoc:"career",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=用 ChatGPT 帮自己修英文简历 — 程序员篇",summary:"最近ChatGPT 这类AI 工具越做越好，在很多回答上精准又精辟，应该要有办法协助编修简历。所以不如来写一篇如何透过ChatGPT 帮自己修英文简历的文章，这样以后读者们就可以直接找ChatGPT 帮忙就行，不仅快速，还可以省下编修费用。"},{title:"用 ChatGPT 幫自己修英文履歷 — 軟體工程師篇",date:"2023-02-12",lastmod:"2023-02-12",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"swe-resume",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/ai/swe-resume.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/ai/swe-resume",subtoc:"career",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=用 ChatGPT 幫自己修英文履歷 — 軟體工程師篇",summary:"最近 ChatGPT 這類 AI 工具越做越好，在很多回答上精準又精闢，應該要有辦法協助編修履歷。所以不如來寫一篇如何透過 ChatGPT 幫自己修英文履歷的文章，這樣以後讀者們就可以直接找 ChatGPT 幫忙就行，不僅快速，還可以省下編修費用。"},{title:"What is debounce? How to implement debounce function",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2023-02-11",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"debounce",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/debounce.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/debounce",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is debounce? How to implement debounce function",summary:"Debounce and throttle are the top ones that are asked frequently in the JavaScript coding interview. This blog post will talk about how to implement a debounce function."},{title:"如何用 JavaScript 算出数组的平均数？",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2023-02-11",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"find-average-in-an-array",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/find-average-in-an-array.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/find-average-in-an-array",subtoc:"array",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何用 JavaScript 算出数组的平均数？",summary:"在入门的JavaScript 面试中，很常会出现数组操作的考题，来确保申请者有基本的JavaScript 能力，算出数组平均数，即是很常考的。给定一个含有数字的数组，例如` [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]`，写一个函式来计算这个数组的平均数。"},{title:"React 纪录片心得 1 — 重新思考最佳实践",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2023-02-11",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"part1",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/react-documentary/part1.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/react-documentary/part1",subtoc:"else",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=React 纪录片心得 1 — 重新思考最佳实践",summary:"Honeypot 在昨天推出了酝酿已久的React 纪录片，看到React 官方的Twitter 帐号分享，好奇之下点开来看。很意外地得知，原来React 的发展之路是相当崎岖的。因为我自己是在2019 年才接触前端开发并开始写React，在那时React 已经超越Backbone、Angular 等框架，成为最热门的框架，所以我其实并不知晓在那之前发生的事。看完整部纪录片，更加了解React 这个UI 套件的哲学，觉得收获很多。所以决定写这篇纪录片心得，也推荐同为React 开发者的人一定不能错过这部纪录片。"},{title:"React 纪录片心得 2 — 社群驱动创新",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2023-02-11",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"part2",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/react-documentary/part2.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/react-documentary/part2",subtoc:"else",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=React 纪录片心得 2 — 社群驱动创新",summary:"在《React 纪录片心得1 — 重新思考最佳实践》一文中谈到，React 在刚发表时，不论在Facebook 内部，或是在JavaScript 的开源社群，都曾受到反弹。然而十年过去的今天，React 是如何从过街老鼠转身华丽成为前端社群中最多人用的开源套件之一？ 本篇我们将会继续《React.js: The Documentary》的第二部分摘要与心得。"},{title:"請解釋 CSS position 有什麼值和作用？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-11",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"css-position",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/css-position.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/css-position",subtoc:"css",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=請解釋 CSS position 有什麼值和作用？",summary:"本篇面試文章會詳解 css 的 position，內容包含 position 的作用、position 的五個值：static、relative、absolute、fixed 和 sticky 的用法以及差別。"},{title:"如何用 JavaScript 算出陣列的平均數？",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2023-02-11",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"find-average-in-an-array",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/find-average-in-an-array.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/find-average-in-an-array",subtoc:"array",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何用 JavaScript 算出陣列的平均數？",summary:"在入門的 JavaScript 面試中，很常會出現陣列操作的考題，來確保申請者有基本的 JavaScript 能力，算出陣列平均數，即是很常考的。給定一個含有數字的陣列，例如 `[10, 20, 30, 40, 50]`，寫一個函式來計算這個陣列的平均數。"},{title:"React 紀錄片心得 1 — 重新思考最佳實踐",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2023-02-11",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"part1",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/react-documentary/part1.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/react-documentary/part1",subtoc:"else",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=React 紀錄片心得 1 — 重新思考最佳實踐",summary:"Honeypot 在昨天推出了醞釀已久的 React 紀錄片，看到 React 官方的 Twitter 帳號分享，好奇之下點開來看。很意外地得知，原來 React 的發展之路是相當崎嶇的。因為我自己是在 2019 年才接觸前端開發並開始寫 React，在那時 React 已經超越 Backbone、Angular 等框架，成為最熱門的框架，所以我其實並不知曉在那之前發生的事。看完整部紀錄片，更加了解 React 這個 UI 套件的哲學，覺得收穫很多。所以決定寫這篇紀錄片心得，也推薦同為 React 開發者的人一定不能錯過這部紀錄片。"},{title:"React 紀錄片心得 2 — 社群驅動創新",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2023-02-11",toc:"swe-read",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"part2",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/react-documentary/part2.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/react-documentary/part2",subtoc:"else",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=React 紀錄片心得 2 — 社群驅動創新",summary:"在《React 紀錄片心得 1 — 重新思考最佳實踐》一文中談到，React 在剛發表時，不論在 Facebook 內部，或是在 JavaScript 的開源社群，都曾受到反彈。然而十年過去的今天，React 是如何從過街老鼠轉身華麗成為前端社群中最多人用的開源套件之一？ 本篇我們將會繼續《React.js: The Documentary》的第二部分摘要與心得。"},{title:"What Is the Difference Between HTTP/1, HTTP/1.1 and HTTP/2?",date:"2022-10-04",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",subtoc:"http",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is the Difference Between HTTP/1, HTTP/1.1 and HTTP/2?",summary:"Since 1989, HTTP has had several generations of evolution, from 1 to 1.1 to 2 and the current 3. What are the differences between these different versions? In this article, we will summarize the similarities and differences between 1 to 1.1 and then to 2."},{title:"请解释 CSS position 有什么值和作用？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"css-position",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/css-position.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/css-position",subtoc:"css",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请解释 CSS position 有什么值和作用？",summary:"本篇面试文章会详解 css 的 position，内容包含 position 的作用、position 的五个值：static、relative、absolute、fixed 和 sticky 的用法以及差别。"},{title:"什么是资料库反正规化？优缺点是什么？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"database-denormalization",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/database-denormalization.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/database-denormalization",subtoc:"database",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是资料库反正规化？优缺点是什么？",summary:"资料库反正规化（Database Denormalization）是一种将资料库中的资料再次加工，将资料从正规化状态转换为非正规化状态的过程。而反正规化不等于非正规化（Unnormalized Form ），反正规化是先遵守正规化的所有规则，再进行局部调整，故意打破一些正规化规则；而后者非正规化是全然不顾规则。"},{title:"<script> 的 async 与 defer 有什么不同？",date:"2022-01-19",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"fe-script-async-defer-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference",subtoc:"html",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=<script> 的 async 与 defer 有什么不同？",summary:"HTML 当中的<script> 标签中，有async 与defer 两个相似的属性，面试中经常会考这两者有什么不同。此篇文张将先讨论为什么需要async 与defer 这两个属性，接着再分析两者的差别。以下为这题的详解"},{title:"HTTP/1、HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 的区别",date:"2022-10-04",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",subtoc:"http",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=HTTP/1、HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 的区别",summary:"从1989 年起，HTTP 经历了数代的演化，从1 到1.1 再到2 以及目前的3，这些不同版本有些什么不同呢？ 不管是前端或后端的面试，都是经常会考的。这篇我们会先针对1 到1.1 再到2 之间的异同处做摘要。"},{title:"TCP 与 UDP 是什么？差异为何？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"tcp-udp",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/tcp-udp.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/tcp-udp",subtoc:"basic",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=TCP 与 UDP 是什么？差异为何？",summary:"TCP 是一种面向连接的协定，它在传送资料前会建立一个可靠的连接，并且在传送过程中提供错误检查和重新传送功能，确保传送的资料不会丢失。UPD 是一种面向非连接的协定，它没有保证传送资料的可靠性，因此传送速度更快，通信引擎也更简单。"},{title:"什麼是資料庫反正規化？優缺點是什麼？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"database-denormalization",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/database-denormalization.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/database-denormalization",subtoc:"database",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是資料庫反正規化？優缺點是什麼？",summary:"資料庫反正規化（Database Denormalization）是一種將資料庫中的資料再次加工，將資料從正規化狀態轉換為非正規化狀態的過程。而反正規化不等於非正規化（Unnormalized Form），反正規化是先遵守正規化的所有規則，再進行局部調整，故意打破一些正規化規則；而後者非正規化是全然不顧規則。"},{title:"<script> 的 async 與 defer 有什麼不同？",date:"2022-01-19",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"fe-script-async-defer-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference",subtoc:"html",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=<script> 的 async 與 defer 有什麼不同？",summary:"HTML 當中的 <script> 標籤中，有 async 與 defer 兩個相似的屬性，面試中經常會考這兩者有什麼不同。此篇文張將先討論為什麼需要 async 與 defer 這兩個屬性，接著再分析兩者的差別。以下為這題的詳解"},{title:"HTTP/1、HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 的區別",date:"2022-10-04",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",subtoc:"http",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=HTTP/1、HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 的區別",summary:"從 1989 年起，HTTP 經歷了數代的演化，從 1 到 1.1 再到 2 以及目前的 3，這些不同版本有些什麼不同呢？ 不管是前端或後端的面試，都是經常會考的。這篇我們會先針對 1 到 1.1 再到 2 之間的異同處做摘要。"},{title:"TCP 與 UDP 是什麼？差異為何？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"tcp-udp",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/tcp-udp.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/tcp-udp",subtoc:"basic",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=TCP 與 UDP 是什麼？差異為何？",summary:"TCP 是一種面向連接的協定，它在傳送資料前會建立一個可靠的連接，並且在傳送過程中提供錯誤檢查和重新傳送功能，確保傳送的資料不會丟失。UPD 是一種面向非連接的協定，它沒有保證傳送資料的可靠性，因此傳送速度更快，通信引擎也更簡單。"},{title:"Explaining the Concept of a Class in ES6 and the Distinction Between a Function Constructor",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-class",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-class.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-class",subtoc:"object",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Explaining the Concept of a Class in ES6 and the Distinction Between a Function Constructor",summary:"This article explains the class concept in JavaScript and the difference between ES6 class and ES5 function constructor. The class was introduced in ES6 as syntactic sugar, which simulates class behavior through prototypal inheritance. The article covers various aspects of class including inheritance, static methods, and private fields. It is an essential read for front-end developers and anyone preparing for JavaScript interviews."},{title:"BASE 是什么？请解释 BASE 特性",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"base-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/base-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/base-intro",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=BASE 是什么？请解释 BASE 特性",summary:"BASE 理论本质上是对CAP 的延伸和补充，更举体来说是对AP 方案的一个补充，核心思想为，在无法达到[CAP 理论] 的Consistency （强一致性）的状况下，是否能够达成最终一致性。而BASE 又可以拆成以下三个词来介绍：Basically Available、Soft State 和Eventual Consistency"},{title:"在 JavaScript 中用 var, let, 以及 const 有什么差别？什么时候该用哪个？",date:"2022-01-27",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"js-var-let-const-in-javascript",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/js-var-let-const-in-javascript.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/js-var-let-const-in-javascript",subtoc:"variable",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在 JavaScript 中用 var, let, 以及 const 有什么差别？什么时候该用哪个？",summary:"「在 JavaScript 中用 var, let, 以及 const 有什么差别?」是在前端、JavaScript 面试中常见的考题。在面试时可以先大方向地列点说出异同之处，然后再针对每一个点进行深入说明。主要有作用域、重复宣告、提升上的差别等。 "},{title:"NoSQL 是什么？请说明 NoSQL 资料库的特点",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"nosql-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/nosql-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/nosql-intro",subtoc:"database",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=NoSQL 是什么？请说明 NoSQL 资料库的特点",summary:"最初表示NoSQL 后来转解为Not Only SQL，是对不同于传统资料库的统称，其未支援传统资料库ACID 的特性，而是遵守BASE 模型特性，只能保持最终一致性。但NoSQL本身的优势为：灵活性：相比于SQL 需要事先定义栏位与资料型别，NoSQL 则可以很自由的储存资料。扩展性：NoSQL 利于横向扩展，支援更多流量，因此也提升可用性与高效性。"},{title:"ORM 是什么？ORM 的优缺点是什么？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"orm-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/orm-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/orm-intro",subtoc:"database",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ORM 是什么？ORM 的优缺点是什么？",summary:"在后端开发上，通常都要与资料库做操作（新增、修改、删除、查找）。后端会撰写SQL 语句，并且透过一些工具或套件（例如：pymysql）向SQL 资料库来做沟通。ORM 是再往上进行一层封装，而无需去编写原生的SQL 语句，取而代之的是基于物件导向的思想去编写Class、Object、Method 等。"},{title:"什么是 SQL Injection？该如何避免？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"sql-injection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/sql-injection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-injection",subtoc:"security",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 SQL Injection？该如何避免？",summary:"SQL Injection 是透过修改SQL 语句，进而达到对资料库的恶意攻击，常见的方法为，用户填写的表格中，刻意填写SQL 语句，使得后端获得文字后，用拼接的方式可能会得到意想不到的SQL 语句，并且对资料库做执行。"},{title:"严格模式 (use strict) 的用途？有什么好处？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"use-strict",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/use-strict.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/use-strict",subtoc:"basic",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=严格模式 (use strict) 的用途？有什么好处？",summary:"use strict 是一个JavaScript 语法，它告诉执行环境执行代码时应该遵循严格模式。而在严格模式之下，JavaScript 会以更严格的方式执行语法，并且对于一些不符合规范的代码会回报错误。"},{title:"ES6 中的 class 是什么？和函式构造函式差别是什么？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-class",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-class.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-class",subtoc:"object",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ES6 中的 class 是什么？和函式构造函式差别是什么？",summary:"这篇文章会讨论到 class 的概念，以及 ES6 class 和 ES5 函式构造函式 (constructor function) 的差别。还有 class 的常见方法，如继承、静态方法、私有领域 private field 等。"},{title:"什么是 CSRF 攻击？如何防范？",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-csrf",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-csrf.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-csrf",subtoc:"security",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 CSRF 攻击？如何防范？",summary:"CSRF 是指跨站的请求伪造，这种攻击方法会强迫使用者在他们已经验证身份的网站中，执行某些恶意的伪造操作，因为已经验证过该使用者，所以网站就会以操作来自该使用者，因此接受了该操作。举例来说，某个使用者登入银行帐户后，去逛别的网站，但不小心点开恶意网站，该恶意网站中的代码用这名使用者的名义，进行未经同意的转帐操作。"},{title:"JavaScript 立即调用函式 IIFE (Immediately Invoked Function Expression) 是什么？优缺点是什么？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-iife",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-iife.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-iife",subtoc:"function",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=JavaScript 立即调用函式 IIFE (Immediately Invoked Function Expression) 是什么？优缺点是什么？",summary:"JavaScript 中的立即调用函式 (IIFE，Immediately Invoked Function Expression)，指的是一种在定义时立即执行的匿名函式，通常用于创建一个局部作用域，避免全局污染。"},{title:"Promise 是什么？有什么用途？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-promise",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-promise.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-promise",subtoc:"event-loop",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Promise 是什么？有什么用途？",summary:"Promise 是在ES6 出现的新功能，并且是用来优化过去回调函式callback 的写法。这篇面试详解中会讨论到， promise 是什么、为什么需要有Promise，以及延伸到async/await 相关问题。"},{title:"BASE 是什麼？請解釋 BASE 特性",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"base-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/base-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/base-intro",subtoc:"basic",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=BASE 是什麼？請解釋 BASE 特性",summary:"BASE 理論本質上是對 CAP 的延伸和補充，更舉體來說是對 AP 方案的一個補充，核心思想為，在無法達到 [CAP 理論] 的 Consistency （強一致性）的狀況下，是否能夠達成最終一致性。而 BASE 又可以拆成以下三個詞來介紹：Basically Available、Soft State 和 Eventual Consistency"},{title:"在 JavaScript 中用 var, let, 以及 const 有什麼差別？什麼時候該用哪個？ ",date:"2022-01-27",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"js-var-let-const-in-javascript",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/js-var-let-const-in-javascript.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/js-var-let-const-in-javascript",subtoc:"variable",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在 JavaScript 中用 var, let, 以及 const 有什麼差別？什麼時候該用哪個？",summary:"「在 JavaScript 中用 var, let, 以及 const 有什麼差別?」是在前端、JavaScript 面試中常見的考題。在面試時可以先大方向地列點說出異同之處，然後再針對每一個點進行深入說明。主要有作用域、重複宣告、提升上的差別等。"},{title:"NoSQL 是什麼？請說明 NoSQL 資料庫的特點",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"nosql-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/nosql-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/nosql-intro",subtoc:"database",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=NoSQL 是什麼？請說明 NoSQL 資料庫的特點",summary:"最初表示 NoSQL 後來轉解為 Not Only SQL，是對不同於傳統資料庫的統稱，其未支援傳統資料庫 ACID 的特性，而是遵守 BASE 模型特性，只能保持最終一致性。但 NoSQL 本身的優勢為：靈活性：相比於 SQL 需要事先定義欄位與資料型別，NoSQL 則可以很自由的儲存資料。擴展性：NoSQL 利於橫向擴展，支援更多流量，因此也提升可用性與高效性。"},{title:"ORM 是什麼？ORM 的優缺點是什麼？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"orm-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/orm-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/orm-intro",subtoc:"database",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ORM 是什麼？ORM 的優缺點是什麼？",summary:"在後端開發上，通常都要與資料庫做操作（新增、修改、刪除、查找）。後端會撰寫 SQL 語句，並且透過一些工具或套件（例如：pymysql）向 SQL 資料庫來做溝通。ORM 是再往上進行一層封裝，而無需去編寫原生的 SQL 語句，取而代之的是基於物件導向的思想去編寫 Class、Object、Method 等。"},{title:"什麼是 SQL Injection？該如何避免？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"sql-injection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/sql-injection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-injection",subtoc:"security",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 SQL Injection？該如何避免？",summary:"SQL Injection 是透過修改 SQL 語句，進而達到對資料庫的惡意攻擊，常見的方法為，用戶填寫的表格中，刻意填寫 SQL 語句，使得後端獲得文字後，用拼接的方式可能會得到意想不到的 SQL 語句，並且對資料庫做執行。"},{title:"嚴格模式 (use strict) 的用途？有什麼好處？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"use-strict",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/use-strict.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/use-strict",subtoc:"basic",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=嚴格模式 (use strict) 的用途？有什麼好處？",summary:"use strict 是一個 JavaScript 語法，它告訴執行環境執行程式碼時應該遵循嚴格模式。而在嚴格模式之下，JavaScript 會以更嚴格的方式執行語法，並且對於一些不符合規範的程式碼會回報錯誤。"},{title:"ES6 中的 class 是什麼？和函式構造函式差別是什麼？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-class",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-class.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-class",subtoc:"object",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ES6 中的 class 是什麼？和函式構造函式差別是什麼？",summary:"這篇文章會討論到 class 的概念，以及 ES6 class 和 ES5 函式構造函式 (constructor function) 的差別。還有 class 的常見方法，如繼承、靜態方法、私有領域 private field 等。"},{title:"什麼是 CSRF 攻擊？如何防範？",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-csrf",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-csrf.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-csrf",subtoc:"security",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 CSRF 攻擊？如何防範？",summary:"CSRF 是指跨站的請求偽造，這種攻擊方法會強迫使用者在他們已經驗證身份的網站中，執行某些惡意的偽造操作，因為已經驗證過該使用者，所以網站就會以操作來自該使用者，因此接受了該操作。舉例來說，某個使用者登入銀行帳戶後，去逛別的網站，但不小心點開惡意網站，該惡意網站中的程式碼用這名使用者的名義，進行未經同意的轉帳操作。"},{title:"JavaScript 立即調用函式 IIFE (Immediately Invoked Function Expression) 是什麼？優缺點是什麼？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-iife",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-iife.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-iife",subtoc:"function",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=JavaScript 立即調用函式 IIFE (Immediately Invoked Function Expression) 是什麼？優缺點是什麼？",summary:"JavaScript 中的立即調用函式 (IIFE，Immediately Invoked Function Expression)，指的是一種在定義時立即執行的匿名函式，通常用於創建一個局部作用域，避免全局污染。"},{title:"Promise 是什麼？有什麼用途？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-promise",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-promise.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-promise",subtoc:"event-loop",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Promise 是什麼？有什麼用途？",summary:"Promise 是在 ES6 出現的新功能，並且是用來優化過去回調函式 callback 的寫法。這篇面試詳解中會討論到， promise 是什麼、為什麼需要有 Promise，以及延伸到 async/await 相關問題。"},{title:"什么是提升 (Hoisting)？",date:"2023-02-07",lastmod:"2023-02-07",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"hoisting",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/hoisting.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/hoisting",subtoc:"variable",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是提升 (Hoisting)？",summary:"提升 (Hoisting) 指的是来形容 JavaScript 编译阶段将变数和函式的宣告存入记忆体的概念"},{title:"什麼是提升 (Hoisting)？",date:"2023-02-07",lastmod:"2023-02-07",toc:"javascript",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"hoisting",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/hoisting.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/hoisting",subtoc:"variable",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是提升 (Hoisting)？",summary:"提升 (Hoisting) 指的是"},{title:"What Is Git and Git Flow? How To Use It?",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"git-flow",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/git-flow.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/git-flow",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Git and Git Flow? How To Use It?",summary:"Ever wondered how large development teams manage code without stepping on each other's toes? Let's explore Git and Git Flow - the tools that transformed chaotic coding into organized collaboration."},{title:"What Is MVC?",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"mvc",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/mvc.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/mvc",subtoc:"architecture",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is MVC?",summary:"MVC is an architectural pattern that separates an application into three main logical components: the model, the view, and the controller. Each of these components are built to handle specific development aspects of an application."},{title:"什么是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的机制为何？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"cache-mechanism",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/cache-mechanism.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/cache-mechanism",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的机制为何？",summary:"快取(Cache) 是为了弥补Database 在复杂业务下的不足，基本原理是将可重使用的资料存放到记忆体中，这样可以避免每一次都去Database 读取，进而将地效能。而以Memcache 为例，查询可达到TPS 50,000 以上。虽然说增加Cache 可以减轻Database 的压力，但会让系统变得复杂，因此若Cache 没有设计好，则有可能造成系统崩溃。"},{title:"Git 和 Git Flow 是什么？如何应用？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"git-flow",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/git-flow.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/git-flow",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Git 和 Git Flow 是什么？如何应用？",summary:"Git 是分散版本控制系统，常被用于软件开发专案的版本控制、合作和备份。面试时常被问到的 Git 相关题目包括：Git 是什么、Git Flow 是什么、以及如何应用。"},{title:"JWT 的运作原理是什么？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"jwt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/jwt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/jwt",subtoc:"basic",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=JWT 的运作原理是什么？",summary:"'JWT 是一种以 JSON 为基础的开放标准（RFC 7519），通过 HMAC、RSA、ECDS 等算法进行加密，它由 Header、Payload、Signature 组成，以 Base64 编码，并以 \".\" 分开。 JWT 的工作原理是通过加密。 JWT 的使用场合是在需要加密传输数据时使用。 '"},{title:"什么是 MVC 模式？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"mvc",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/mvc.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/mvc",subtoc:"architecture",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 MVC 模式？",summary:"MVC 是 Model-View-Controller 的缩写，是一种软件架构模式。 MVC 把一个应用程序分成三个主要部分：模型（Model）、视图（View）和控制器 (Controller)。"},{title:"什麼是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的機制為何？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"cache-mechanism",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/cache-mechanism.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/cache-mechanism",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的機制為何？",summary:"快取 (Cache) 是為了彌補 Database 在複雜業務下的不足，基本原理是將可重使用的資料存放到記憶體中，這樣可以避免每一次都去 Database 讀取，進而將地效能。而以 Memcache 為例，查詢可達到 TPS 50,000 以上。雖然說增加 Cache 可以減輕 Database 的壓力，但會讓系統變得複雜，因此若 Cache 沒有設計好，則有可能造成系統崩潰。"},{title:"Git 和 Git Flow 是什麼？如何應用？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"git-flow",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/git-flow.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/git-flow",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Git 和 Git Flow 是什麼？如何應用？",summary:"當團隊開發遇到程式碼衝突、版本混亂時，Git 和 Git Flow 就是最好的解決方案。讓我們一起瞭解如何運用這些工具來讓團隊協作更順暢。"},{title:"JWT 的運作原理是什麼？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"jwt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/jwt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/jwt",subtoc:"basic",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的機制為何？",summary:"'JWT 是一種以 JSON 為基礎的開放標準（RFC 7519），通過 HMAC、RSA、ECDS 等算法進行加密，它由 Header、Payload、Signature 組成，以 Base64 編碼，並以 \".\" 分開。 JWT 的工作原理是通過加密。 JWT 的使用場合是在需要加密傳輸數據時使用。'"},{title:"什麼是 MVC 模式？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"mvc",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/mvc.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/mvc",subtoc:"architecture",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 MVC 模式？",summary:"MVC 是 Model-View-Controller 的縮寫，是一種軟體架構模式。 MVC 把一個應用程序分成三個主要部分：模型（Model）、視圖（View）和控制器 (Controller)。"},{title:"转职程序员，该自学还是去培训课程? Alpha Camp 与 AppWorks School 经验分享",date:"2022-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"pivot",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"coding-bootcamp-selection-criteria",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/coding-bootcamp-selection-criteria.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/coding-bootcamp-selection-criteria",subtoc:"before-pivot",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=转职程序员，该自学还是去培训课程? Alpha Camp 与 AppWorks School 经验分享",summary:"当提到转职资源，许多人会想到coding bootcamp (程式战斗营)。目前在台湾有存在已久的资策会，或是完全免费的AppWorks School、好想工作室Web Camp 等实体课程；也有Alpha Camp、六角学院等线上课程。在这些众多选项中，该选哪一个呢?"},{title:"听说你想转职程序员？先来读这篇劝退文吧",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"pivot",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"the-cost-of-being-a-software-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/the-cost-of-being-a-software-engineer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/the-cost-of-being-a-software-engineer",subtoc:"before-pivot",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=听说你想转职程序员？先来读这篇劝退文吧",summary:"工作不是人生的全部，转职不该仅用单一面向思考(例如百万年薪)。毕竟转换职涯不是容易的决定，要投入的成本也不小；假如能在做决定前有更多角度的思考，可以避免真的投入后反悔。希望透过这篇劝退文，让在思考年后转职的版友，可以有更多元的思考维度来评估转职工程师这件事。"},{title:"什么是资料库正规化？为什么需要正规化？",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"database-normalization",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/database-normalization.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/database-normalization",subtoc:"database",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是资料库正规化？为什么需要正规化？",summary:"正规化是为了让资料库中重复的栏位资料减到最少，并且能快速的找到资料，提高关联性资料库的效能，因此其两大目标为：1. 降低资料的重复性2 .避免资料更新异常。"},{title:"系统设计基础 — 资料库分片与复写 (Database Sharding & Replication)",date:"2022-09-27",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"database-sharding-replication",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/database-sharding-replication.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/database-sharding-replication",subtoc:"basic",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=系统设计基础 — 资料库分片与复写 (Database Sharding & Replication)",summary:"在负载均衡器(load balancer) 单元有提到，当网站的流量变大时，我们可以透过负载均衡器，把请求分派给多个不同的服务器。不过，当我们怎么做，却只有一个资料库时，多个服务器会同时向资料库做操作。而资料库本身也是硬体，硬体也有其上限，能同时处理的请求并非无限，或是能存的资料也非无限。因此，当流量大起来时，很可能单一资料库会不堪负荷。这时候我们会需要进一步思考如何扩增我们的资料库。"},{title:"Nginx 是什么？有哪些用途？",date:"2022-09-27",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-nginx",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/why-nginx.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/why-nginx",subtoc:"basic",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Nginx 是什么？有哪些用途？",summary:"Nginx 是一个非同步框架的网页服务器，可以做到反向代理、负载均衡、http 快取。Nginx 比起Apache 属于轻量级且高并发、处理静态档案的效率较高、耗费的记忆体较少、负载效能好，很适合做前端服务器使用。"},{title:"轉職軟體工程師，該自學還是去培訓課程? Alpha Camp 與 AppWorks School 經驗分享",date:"2022-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"pivot",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"coding-bootcamp-selection-criteria",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/coding-bootcamp-selection-criteria.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/coding-bootcamp-selection-criteria",subtoc:"before-pivot",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=轉職軟體工程師，該自學還是去培訓課程? Alpha Camp 與 AppWorks School 經驗分享",summary:"當提到轉職資源，許多人會想到 coding bootcamp (程式戰鬥營)。目前在台灣有存在已久的資策會，或是完全免費的 AppWorks School、好想工作室 Web Camp 等實體課程；也有 Alpha Camp、六角學院等線上課程。在這些眾多選項中，該選哪一個呢?"},{title:"聽說你想轉職軟體工程師？先來讀這篇勸退文吧",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"pivot",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"the-cost-of-being-a-software-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/the-cost-of-being-a-software-engineer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/the-cost-of-being-a-software-engineer",subtoc:"before-pivot",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=聽說你想轉職軟體工程師？先來讀這篇勸退文吧",summary:"工作不是人生的全部，轉職不該僅用單一面向思考(例如百萬年薪)。畢竟轉換職涯不是容易的決定，要投入的成本也不小；假如能在做決定前有更多角度的思考，可以避免真的投入後反悔。希望透過這篇勸退文，讓在思考年後轉職的版友，可以有更多元的思考維度來評估轉職工程師這件事。"},{title:"什麼是資料庫正規化？為什麼需要正規化？",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"database-normalization",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/database-normalization.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/database-normalization",subtoc:"database",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是資料庫正規化？為什麼需要正規化？",summary:"正規化是為了讓資料庫中重複的欄位資料減到最少，並且能快速的找到資料，提高關聯性資料庫的效能，因此其兩大目標為：1. 降低資料的重複性 2.避免資料更新異常。"},{title:"系統設計基礎 — 資料庫分片與複寫 (Database Sharding & Replication)",date:"2022-09-27",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"system-design-tutorial",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"database-sharding-replication",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/database-sharding-replication.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/database-sharding-replication",subtoc:"basic",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=系統設計基礎 — 資料庫分片與複寫 (Database Sharding & Replication)",summary:"在負載均衡器 (load balancer) 單元有提到，當網站的流量變大時，我們可以透過負載均衡器，把請求分派給多個不同的伺服器。不過，當我們怎麼做，卻只有一個資料庫時，多個伺服器會同時向資料庫做操作。而資料庫本身也是硬體，硬體也有其上限，能同時處理的請求並非無限，或是能存的資料也非無限。因此，當流量大起來時，很可能單一資料庫會不堪負荷。這時候我們會需要進一步思考如何擴增我們的資料庫。"},{title:"What are Reflow and Repaint? How to optimize?",date:"2023-02-03",lastmod:"2023-02-03",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"repaint-and-reflow",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/repaint-and-reflow.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/repaint-and-reflow",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What are Reflow and Repaint? How to optimize?",summary:"Reflow and Repaint are two important concepts in browser rendering process. Reflow is the process of browser re-calculating the layout and position of elements on the page. Repaint is the process of browser re-drawing elements on the page. In this article, we will discuss the browser rendering process, Reflow and Repaint, and how to optimize."},{title:"The most common JavaScript prototype interview questions and answers (prototype, prototypal inheritance, prototype chain)",date:"2023-02-02",lastmod:"2023-02-02",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"most-common-js-prototype-questions",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/most-common-js-prototype-questions.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/most-common-js-prototype-questions",subtoc:"object",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=The most common JavaScript prototype interview questions and answers (prototype, prototypal inheritance, prototype chain)",summary:"In this article, we will introduce the most common JavaScript prototype interview questions and answers. Including what is prototype, what is the difference between __proto__ and [[Prototype]], what is the difference between __proto__ and prototype, what is the prototype chain, what is prototypal inheritance, etc."},{title:"What are pseudo-classes and pseudo-elements?",