ktok-frontend-interview",subtoc:"interview-share",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=My TikTok (ByteDance) Frontend Software Engineer Interview Experience",summary:"This is a blog post on my interview experience with TikTok in summer 2022. The role I interviewed for was Frontend Software Engineer. I applied this frontend software engineer position through TikTok career website."},{title:"The Most Common JavaScript Event Loop Interview Questions",date:"2023-01-22",lastmod:"2023-01-25",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"js-event-loop-questions",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/js-event-loop-questions.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/js-event-loop-questions",subtoc:"event-loop",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=The Most Common JavaScript Event Loop Interview Questions",summary:"The event loop is a common question in interviews. In addition to knowing the concept, You also need to know how it works in code. Here we have listed common JavaScript event loop code interpretation questions"},{title:"What is the difference between null, undefined and undeclared in JavaScript?",date:"2023-01-23",lastmod:"2023-01-25",toc:"javascript",lang:"en",fileName:"js-undefined-null-undeclared",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/js-undefined-null-undeclared.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/js-undefined-null-undeclared",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is the difference between null, undefined and undeclared in JavaScript?",summary:"'What is the difference between null, undefined and undeclared? undefined means that the value has not yet been defined, so when a variable is declared but not assigned any value, the variable will be `undefined`, which can be understood as \"not yet\".'"},{title:"Stop Asking Kids What They Want to Be",date:"2023-01-24",lastmod:"2023-01-24",toc:"li-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be.md",fullPath:"/en/career/do-not-as