避免DOM 管理困难和效率低下的问题。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/react-virtual-dom"}]},{title:"React Hooks",links:[{title:"React Hooks 是什么?",date:"2022-11-16",lastmod:"2022-11-16",toc:"react",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-react-hook",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-react-hook.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-react-hook",subtoc:"hooks",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=React Hooks 是什么?",summary:"虽然近几年大部分开发 React 都是使用 Hooks，但 Hooks 是在 React 16.8 之后出现的，在面试时也会被问到 Hooks 的相关问题，本篇文章总结了 React Hook 常见问题",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-react-hook"},{title:"为什么只能在最顶端层呼叫 Hook？从 useState 实作原理来回答",date:"2022-10-24",lastmod:"2022-10-24",toc:"react",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-call-react-hook-top-level",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/why-call-react-hook-top-level.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/why-call-react-hook-top-level",subtoc:"hooks",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=为什么只能在最顶端层呼叫 Hook？从 useState 实作原理来回答",summary:"在React 的官方文件中，有特别一篇文章在讲述Hook 的使用规则，其中提到「不要在回圈、条件式或是巢状的function 内呼叫Hook」以及「只能在最顶端层呼叫Hook」 的原因。为什么有这些规则呢? 让我们一起了解这个问题。 ",href:"/zh-hans/swe/why-call-react-hook-top-level"},{title:"请解释 useEffect？与 useLayoutEffect 的区别？",date:"2023-02-02",lastmod:"2023-02-02",toc:"react",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect",subtoc:"hooks",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请解释 useEffect？与 useLayoutEffect 的区别？",summary:"了解 React 生命周期不仅是学习 React 最基本的概念之一，也是面试经典问题。本文会介绍三大生命周期、以及在 Class Component 中常用的生命周期方法。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect"}]},{title:"React 进阶",links:[{title:"为什么 React 渲染列表时需要加上 key？",date:"2022-02-13",lastmod:"2022-02-15",toc:"react",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"react-why-key",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/react-why-key.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/react-why-key",subtoc:"advanced",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=为什么 React 渲染列表时需要加上 key？",summary:"当我们在React 要渲染一个列表时，如果没有在每一个被渲染的元件加上key 这个prop，就会跳出`Warning: Each child in a list should have a unique “key” prop.` 这个错误讯息。直到开发者把`key` 加上后，这个警告讯息才会消失。为什么要加上key? 以及key 有什么原则需要遵守? 这是在开发React 时需要有的重要概念，也是面试经常会问的基础题。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/react-why-key"},{title:"为什么更新 React 中的 state 要用 immutable 的写法? 什么是 immutable? 该如何写才会是 immutable? ",date:"2023-02-01",lastmod:"2023-02-01",toc:"react",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"react-why-immutable",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/react-why-immutable.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/react-why-immutable",subtoc:"advanced",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=为什么更新 React 中的 state 要用 immutable 的写法? 什么是 immutable? 该如何写才会是 immutable? ",summary:"在React 当中，更新state 是我们很常要做的一件事。然而你知道更新state 时，应该要用immutable 的写法吗? 为什么该怎么做? 怎么写才算是immutable? 上面这一连串的问题，是React 面试中的高频题，因为这也是React 开发者在日常开发中，几乎天天会遇到的问题。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/react-why-immutable"}]}],"en-react":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"React interview questions",date:"2023-08-27",lastmod:"2024-01-27",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/8cb7a5ceb26146748127623dfdc5671f.png",summary:"This series compiles common React interview questions, including basics, React hooks, and advanced React",href:"/en/swe/react"}]},{title:"React Basic",links:[{title:"What Is a Pure Function? Why Do React Function Components Need to Be Pure?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react-pure-function",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react-pure-function.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react-pure-function",subtoc:"basic",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is a Pure Function? Why Do React Function Components Need to Be Pure?",summary:"React function components must be pure to prevent unstable renderings, unexpected UI presentations and potential bugs. Pure functions ensure that the same input always results in the same output, while impure functions, such as those with side effects, can cause inconsistent renderings. By writing pure functions, React developers can ensure a stable and bug-free application.",href:"/en/swe/react-pure-function"},{title:"What Is JSX?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-jsx",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-jsx.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-jsx",subtoc:"basic",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is JSX?",summary:"Learn about the syntax extension of JavaScript, JSX, and its benefits in React development. This article also covers the rules for using JSX, which will ensure its proper implementation.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-jsx"},{title:"Explain the Lifecycle of a React Component",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react-lifecycle",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react-lifecycle.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react-lifecycle",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Explain the Lifecycle of a React Component",summary:"This article explains the lifecycle methods of React. It describes how React updates the DOM and how developers can ensure no side-effects occur during these stages. The article also explains the pre-commit stage and its importance. The author emphasizes the significance of getSnapshotBeforeUpdate() method and highlights its use in specific scenarios.",href:"/en/swe/react-lifecycle"},{title:"What is Virtual DOM?",date:"2023-02-01",lastmod:"2023-02-01",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react-virtual-dom",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react-virtual-dom.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react-virtual-dom",subtoc:"basic",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is Virtual DOM?",summary:"Virtual DOM is a programming concept used in React and other frameworks that uses JavaScript objects to mimic the real DOM. However, Virtual DOM is usually slower than directly manipulating the DOM, but it has the following benefits: it allows React to be written with declarative syntax, avoiding the difficulties and inefficiencies of DOM management.",href:"/en/swe/react-virtual-dom"}]},{title:"React Hooks",links:[{title:"What Is React Hook?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-react-hook",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-react-hook.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-react-hook",subtoc:"hooks",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is React Hook?",summary:"React Hooks allow stateful logic to be reused and complex components to be simplified. They come with rules, such as only being used at the top level of a React function, and commonly used Hooks include useState, useEffect, useReducer, useCallback, useMemo, and useRef.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-react-hook"},{title:"Why Do We Need To Call React Hook at the Top Level? Why Can’t We Call It Inside a Loop or Condition?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"why-call-react-hook-top-level",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/why-call-react-hook-top-level.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/why-call-react-hook-top-level",subtoc:"hooks",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why Do We Need To Call React Hook at the Top Level? Why Can’t We Call It Inside a Loop or Condition?",summary:"In React, when using Hooks like useState, it is important to follow certain rules, such as not calling them inside loops or conditions and only calling them at the top level of the component. This is because React needs to maintain a stable order of the Hooks calls to properly associate each state with its corresponding useState. If the order changes, state associations can become mixed up, leading to unpredictable behavior. By following these rules, developers can ensure their components work as intended and avoid potential bugs.",href:"/en/swe/why-call-react-hook-top-level"},{title:"What Is useEffect? What Is the Difference Between useEffect and useLayoutEffect?",date:"2023-02-02",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect",subtoc:"hooks",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is useEffect? What Is the Difference Between useEffect and useLayoutEffect?",summary:"useEffect is a React Hook that is often used in React applications. It is also a common React interview question, including how to use useEffect, the execution time of useEffect, etc. Another similar Hook to useEffect is useLayoutEffect, which is also a high-frequency question in React interviews.",href:"/en/swe/use-effect-vs-use-layout-effect"}]},{title:"React Advanced",links:[{title:"Why Do We Need to Add Keys When Rendering Lists in React?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react-why-key",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react-why-key.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react-why-key",subtoc:"advanced",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why Do We Need to Add Keys When Rendering Lists in React?",summary:"When rendering a list in React, it is important to use a unique key for each child component to prevent bugs and improve performance. Keys need to be stable and predictable and should not be based on the lists index.",href:"/en/swe/react-why-key"},{title:"Why Use Immutable Syntax When Updating React State?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"react",lang:"en",fileName:"react-why-immutable",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/react-why-immutable.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/react-why-immutable",subtoc:"advanced",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why Use Immutable Syntax When Updating React State?",summary:"In React, updating state is a common task, but do you know that you should use immutable methods to update state? Why and how should you do it? What is considered an immutable approach? These are frequently asked questions in React interviews, as it is a common problem that developers encounter in their daily work. Lets explore the answers to these questions in this article.",href:"/en/swe/react-why-immutable"}]}],"zh-hant-browser":[{title:"目錄",links:[{title:"瀏覽器與網路面試詳解 - 導覽",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2024-01-27",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"browser",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/browser.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/browser",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/34e24aeac1ec41c8ba21de30d7e75a12.png",summary:"本系列彙整了常見的瀏覽器 (browser) 與網絡 (networking) 相關面試題目與詳解，包含 HTTP、HTTPS、CORS、瀏覽器事件與儲存、資訊安全",href:"/zh-hant/swe/browser"}]},{title:"瀏覽器與網路",links:[{title:"請說明瀏覽器中的事件委派、捕獲、冒泡",date:"2022-02-01",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble",subtoc:"browser",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=請說明瀏覽器中的事件委派、捕獲、冒泡",summary:"當使用者與瀏覽器互動時，會觸發各類不同的事件 (event)，例如常見的點擊 (click)、滑動 (scroll)。我們可以透過 JavaScript 的事件處理器 (handler)，來處理這些事件。讓我們能在事件觸發時，做出我們要的效果，例如點擊某個按鈕，觸發某個邏輯。針對瀏覽器事件，最常見的考題之一，便是事件委派、事件捕獲、事件冒泡，是很常見的面試考題。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble"},{title:"請說明 DOMContentLoaded, load, beforeunload, unload 的觸發時機",date:"2022-01-15",lastmod:"2024-07-15",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference",subtoc:"browser",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=請說明 DOMContentLoaded, load, beforeunload, unload 的觸發時機",summary:"本篇文章解釋了網頁生命週期中的重要事件：DOMContentLoaded、load、beforeunload 和 unload，並說明它們的觸發時機和應用場景，例如 JavaScript 腳本執行、資源載入完成、離開網頁前的確認和數據分析等。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference"},{title:"請描述 cookie, sessionStorage 和 localStorage 的差異",date:"2023-12-29",lastmod:"2023-12-29",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference",subtoc:"browser",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=請說明瀏覽器中的事件委派、捕獲、冒泡",summary:"在開發網頁時，我們有時候會需要將資料儲存在客戶端 (瀏覽器)。在存資料到瀏覽器的方式中，最常使用到的就是 cookie、localStorage 和 sessionStorage，這三者都可以拿來儲存資料，但有不同的適用情境和限制。而三者的異同，也是前端面試時常會考的。以下我們將會從使用方式、使用場景、生命週期、存放空間的大小，以及 HTTP 請求等多個角度，來分析它們的異同。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference"},{title:"你知道 localStorage 但你知道 IndexedDB 嗎？",date:"2023-12-31",lastmod:"2023-12-31",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-indexeddb",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-indexeddb.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-indexeddb",subtoc:"browser",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=你知道 localStorage 但你知道 IndexedDB 嗎？",summary:"現代瀏覽器中有幾個讓你可以儲存資料的地方，假如打開瀏覽器的開發者工具，可以看到 LocalStorage、SessionStorage、CacheStorage、IndexedDB、Cookies 等。多數前端開發者平常可能比較常用 localStorage，但其實 IndexedDB 也很好用，在這篇文章讓我們來聊聊 IndexedDB。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-indexeddb"},{title:"Web Worker 是什麼? 可以用在哪?",date:"2026-01-06",lastmod:"2026-01-06",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-web-worker",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-web-worker.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-web-worker",subtoc:"browser",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Web Worker 是什麼? 可以用在哪?",summary:"在早期的前端開發，會放在前端處理的東西不多，基本上不脫離簡單的事件操作、動畫特效；不過隨著前端發展越來越純熟，開發者在前端做的事情越來越多，當初 JavaScript 的設計就逐漸不足以支應新的需求。這時前端社群逐漸有了不同的技術，來彌補 JavaScript 做不到的，藉此讓開發者們能在前端做更複雜的操作；在前端開發很常聽到的 Web Worker 與 Service Worker 都在這個範疇中。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-web-worker"},{title:"從瀏覽器網址列輸入網址、按下 Enter 後會發生什麼事？",date:"2024-07-22",lastmod:"2024-07-22",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-happens-when-you-type-a-url",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-happens-when-you-type-a-url.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-happens-when-you-type-a-url",subtoc:"browser",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=從瀏覽器網址列輸入網址、按下 Enter 後會發生什麼事？",summary:"從瀏覽器網址列輸入網址並按下 Enter 後，瀏覽器將通過 DNS 查找 IP，發送 HTTP 請求到伺服器並獲取回應。這個過程涉及網頁開發和網絡技術的關鍵概念，對於軟體工程師面試非常重要。了解這些步驟不僅有助於面試，也能提升網頁開發的專業能力。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-happens-when-you-type-a-url"}]},{title:"HTTP、HTTPS、CORS",links:[{title:"HTTP/1、HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 的區別",date:"2022-10-04",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",subtoc:"http",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=HTTP/1、HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 的區別",summary:"從 1989 年起，HTTP 經歷了數代的演化，從 1 到 1.1 再到 2 以及目前的 3，這些不同版本有些什麼不同呢？ 不管是前端或後端的面試，都是經常會考的。這篇我們會先針對 1 到 1.1 再到 2 之間的異同處做摘要。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference"},{title:"請解釋 HTTP caching 機制",date:"2022-09-28",lastmod:"2022-09-28",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"http-caching",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/http-caching.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/http-caching",subtoc:"http",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=請解釋 HTTP caching 機制",summary:"如果要加快網頁應用程式的速度，caching 是個經常被用的策略 (caching 中文有被翻譯成緩存或快取，但因為工作與面試時都還是會說 caching 居多，這篇就暫不翻譯這個詞了)。當我們已經跟後端請求過某個資源，例如某筆資料或某張圖片，下一次再次請求時，如果該資源沒有改變，這時再次請求會相對浪費網路頻寬；反之，如果第一次請求來的資源已經被存下來，那麼下次請求時，可以直接用該資源，這樣可以減少不必要的請求。而這也是 caching 的概念。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/http-caching"},{title:"CORS 是什麼? 為什麼要有 CORS？",date:"2022-10-04",lastmod:"2022-10-04",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-cors",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-cors.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-cors",subtoc:"http",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CORS 是什麼? 為什麼要有 CORS?",summary:"相信很多人在開發時遇過，呼叫 API 但瀏覽器卻報 CORS 的相關錯誤；也因此 CORS 的問題經常會在面試中被問到。這篇文章會來討論為何會有這些錯誤 CORS? 以及要如何解決?",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-cors"},{title:"前端與後端開發都要懂得 HTTP 狀態碼",date:"2024-05-23",lastmod:"2024-05-23",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"http-status-code",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/http-status-code.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/http-status-code",subtoc:"http",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端與後端開發都要懂得 HTTP 狀態碼",summary:"了解 HTTP 狀態碼對於前端和後端開發至關重要。這篇文章詳細介紹了常見的 HTTP 狀態碼，包括 1xx、2xx、3xx、4xx 和 5xx 類別，幫助開發者在處理客戶端和伺服器通訊時更高效。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/http-status-code"}]},{title:"資訊安全",links:[{title:"什麼是 DDoS 攻擊？如何防禦？",date:"2023-11-22",lastmod:"2023-11-22",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-ddos",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-ddos.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-ddos",subtoc:"security",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/43a049c77d194897a2cfe0d0f20afbd3.png",summary:"DDoS (Distributed Denial of Service) 是很常見的網路攻擊手法。許多知名的網站都時常會被當作攻擊目標。舉例來說 ChatGPT 推出了讓人可以客製化的 GPTs 後，大家突然發現有一段時間進不去 ChatGPT 的網站，而 OpenAI 的員工也在 X (推特) 上發文說 ChatGPT 被 DDoS 攻擊，他們正在處理。所以，到底什麼是 DDoS? 又該如何防禦 DDoS? 在這篇貼文，我們將用白話的方式跟大家聊聊",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-ddos"},{title:"什麼是 XSS 攻擊？如何防範？",date:"2022-11-29",lastmod:"2025-12-24",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-xss",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-xss.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-xss",subtoc:"security",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 XSS 攻擊？如何防範？",summary:"XSS (cross-site scripting) 是很常見的網路攻擊。身為網頁前端或後端工程師，在面試中，很常會問到 XSS 的問題，因為面試官要確定你對於 XSS 的基本概念需要有所掌握。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-xss"},{title:"什麼是 CSRF 攻擊？如何防範？",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-csrf",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-csrf.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-csrf",subtoc:"security",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 CSRF 攻擊？如何防範？",summary:"CSRF 是指跨站的請求偽造，這種攻擊方法會強迫使用者在他們已經驗證身份的網站中，執行某些惡意的偽造操作，因為已經驗證過該使用者，所以網站就會以操作來自該使用者，因此接受了該操作。舉例來說，某個使用者登入銀行帳戶後，去逛別的網站，但不小心點開惡意網站，該惡意網站中的程式碼用這名使用者的名義，進行未經同意的轉帳操作。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-csrf"},{title:"什麼是 SQL Injection？該如何避免？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"sql-injection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/sql-injection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-injection",subtoc:"security",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 SQL Injection？該如何避免？",summary:"SQL Injection 是透過修改 SQL 語句，進而達到對資料庫的惡意攻擊，常見的方法為，用戶填寫的表格中，刻意填寫 SQL 語句，使得後端獲得文字後，用拼接的方式可能會得到意想不到的 SQL 語句，並且對資料庫做執行。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-injection"},{title:"加密、編碼、雜湊的區別為何？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"hash-encode-encrypt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/hash-encode-encrypt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/hash-encode-encrypt",subtoc:"security",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=加密、編碼、雜湊的區別為何？",summary:"此文介紹了編碼、加密和雜湊的區別。編碼是一種將資料轉換為另一種形式的方法，而加密則是使用密鑰對資料進行加密，雜湊則是將任意長度的資料映射到固定長度的數字特徵碼的算法。文章還介紹了對稱式加密和非對稱式加密的區別，以及常見的加密演算法和雜湊演算法。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/hash-encode-encrypt"}]}],"zh-hans-browser":[{title:"目录",links:[{title:"浏览器与网路面试详解-导览",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2024-01-27",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"browser",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/browser.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/browser",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/e6206c9ebd694fa283d650161adf4bfb.png",summary:"本系列汇整了常见的浏览器 (browser) 与网络 (networking) 相关面试题目与详解，包含 HTTP、HTTPS、CORS、浏览器事件与储存、资讯安全",href:"/zh-hans/swe/browser"}]},{title:"浏览器与网路",links:[{title:"请说明浏览器中的事件委派、捕获、冒泡",date:"2022-02-01",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble",subtoc:"browser",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请说明浏览器中的事件委派、捕获、冒泡",summary:"当使用者与浏览器互动时，会触发各类不同的事件 (event)，例如常见的点击 (click)、滑动 (scroll)。我们可以透过 JavaScript 的事件处理器 (handler)，来处理这些事件。让我们能在事件触发时，做出我们要的效果，例如点击某个按钮，触发某个逻辑。针对浏览器事件，最常见的考题之一，便是事件委派、事件捕获、事件冒泡，是很常见的面试考题。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble"},{title:"请说明 DOMContentLoaded, load, beforeunload, unload 的触发时机",date:"2022-01-15",lastmod:"2024-07-15",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference",subtoc:"browser",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请说明 DOMContentLoaded, load, beforeunload, unload 的触发时机",summary:"本篇文章解释了网页生命周期中的重要事件：DOMContentLoaded、load、beforeunload 和 unload，并说明它们的触发时机和应用场景，例如 JavaScript 脚本执行、资源载入完成、离开网页前的确认和数据分析等。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference"},{title:"请描述 cookie,\xa0sessionStorage\xa0和\xa0localStorage 的差异",date:"2022-10-02",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference",subtoc:"browser",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请描述 cookie,\xa0sessionStorage\xa0和\xa0localStorage 的差异",summary:"在开发网页时，我们有时候会需要将资料储存在客户端(浏览器)。在存资料到浏览器的方式中，最常使用到的就是cookie、localStorage 和sessionStorage，这三者都可以拿来储存资料，但有不同的适用情境和限制。而三者的异同，也是前端面试时常会考的。以下我们将会从使用方式、使用场景、生命周期、存放空间的大小，以及HTTP 请求等多个角度，来分析它们的异同。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference"},{title:"你知道 localStorage 但你知道 IndexedDB 吗？",date:"2023-12-31",lastmod:"2023-12-31",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-indexeddb",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-indexeddb.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-indexeddb",subtoc:"browser",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=你知道 localStorage 但你知道 IndexedDB 吗？",summary:"现代浏览器中有几个让你可以储存资料的地方，假如打开浏览器的开发者工具，可以看到 LocalStorage、SessionStorage、CacheStorage、IndexedDB、Cookies 等。多数前端开发者平常可能比较常用 localStorage，但其实 IndexedDB 也很好用，在这篇文章让我们来聊聊 IndexedDB。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-indexeddb"},{title:"Web Worker 是什么? 可以用在哪?",date:"2026-01-06",lastmod:"2026-01-06",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-web-worker",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-web-worker.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-web-worker",subtoc:"browser",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Web Worker 是什么? 可以用在哪?",summary:"在早期的前端开发，会放在前端处理的东西不多，基本上不脱离简单的事件操作、动画特效；不过随着前端发展越来越纯熟，开发者在前端做的事情越来越多，当初 JavaScript 的设计就逐渐不足以支应新的需求。这时前端社群逐渐有了不同的技术，来弥补 JavaScript 做不到的，藉此让开发者们能在前端做更复杂的操作；在前端开发很常听到的 Web Worker 与 Service Worker 都在这个范畴中。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-web-worker"},{title:"从浏览器网址列输入网址、按下 Enter 后会发生什么事？",date:"2024-07-22",lastmod:"2024-07-22",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-happens-when-you-type-a-url",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-happens-when-you-type-a-url.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-happens-when-you-type-a-url",subtoc:"browser",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=从浏览器网址列输入网址、按下 Enter 后会发生什么事？",summary:"从浏览器网址列输入网址并按下 Enter 后，浏览器将通过 DNS 查找 IP，发送 HTTP 请求到伺服器并获取回应。这个过程涉及网页开发和网络技术的关键概念，对于软体工程师面试非常重要。了解这些步骤不仅有助于面试，也能提升网页开发的专业能力。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-happens-when-you-type-a-url"}]},{title:"HTTP、HTTPS、CORS",links:[{title:"HTTP/1、HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 的区别",date:"2022-10-04",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",subtoc:"http",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=HTTP/1、HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 的区别",summary:"从1989 年起，HTTP 经历了数代的演化，从1 到1.1 再到2 以及目前的3，这些不同版本有些什么不同呢？ 不管是前端或后端的面试，都是经常会考的。这篇我们会先针对1 到1.1 再到2 之间的异同处做摘要。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference"},{title:"CORS 是什么? 为什么要有 CORS? ",date:"2022-10-04",lastmod:"2022-10-04",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-cors",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-cors.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-cors",subtoc:"http",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CORS 是什么? 为什么要有 CORS? ",summary:"相信很多人在开发时遇过，呼叫API 但浏览器却报CORS 的相关错误；也因此CORS 的问题经常会在面试中被问到。这篇文章会来讨论为何会有这些错误CORS ? 以及要如何解决?",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-cors"},{title:"请解释 HTTP caching 机制",date:"2022-09-28",lastmod:"2022-09-28",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"http-caching",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/http-caching.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/http-caching",subtoc:"http",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请解释 HTTP caching 机制",summary:"如果要加快网页应用程式的速度，caching 是个经常被用的策略(caching 中文有被翻译成缓存或快取，但因为工作与面试时都还是会说caching 居多，这篇就暂不翻译这个词了)。当我们已经跟后端请求过某个资源，例如某笔资料或某张图片，下一次再次请求时，如果该资源没有改变，这时再次请求会相对浪费网路频宽；反之，如果第一次请求来的资源已经被存下来，那么下次请求时，可以直接用该资源，这样可以减少不必要的请求。而这也是caching 的概念。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/http-caching"},{title:"前端与后端开发都要懂得 HTTP 状态码",date:"2024-05-23",lastmod:"2024-05-23",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"http-status-code",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/http-status-code.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/http-status-code",subtoc:"http",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端与后端开发都要懂得 HTTP 状态码",summary:"了解 HTTP 状态码对于前端和后端开发至关重要。这篇文章详细介绍了常见的 HTTP 状态码，包括 1xx、2xx、3xx、4xx 和 5xx 类别，帮助开发者在处理客户端和伺服器通讯时更高效。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/http-status-code"}]},{title:"资讯安全",links:[{title:"什么是 DDoS 攻击？如何防御？",date:"2023-11-22",lastmod:"2023-11-22",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-ddos",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-ddos.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-ddos",subtoc:"security",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 DDoS 攻击？如何防御？",summary:"DDoS (Distributed Denial of Service) 是很常见的网路攻击手法。许多知名的网站都时常会被当作攻击目标。举例来说 ChatGPT 推出了让人可以客制化的 GPTs 后，大家突然发现有一段时间进不去 ChatGPT 的网站，而 OpenAI 的员工也在 X (推特) 上发文说 ChatGPT 被 DDoS 攻击，他们正在处理。所以，到底什么是 DDoS? 又该如何防御 DDoS? 在这篇贴文，我们将用白话的方式跟大家聊聊",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-ddos"},{title:"什么是 XSS 攻击？如何防范？",date:"2022-11-29",lastmod:"2025-12-24",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-xss",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-xss.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-xss",subtoc:"security",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 XSS 攻击？如何防范？",summary:"XSS (cross-site scripting) 是很常见的网路攻击。身为网页前端或后端工程师，在面试中，很常会问到 XSS 的问题，因为面试官要确定你对于 XSS 的基本概念需要有所掌握。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-xss"},{title:"什么是 CSRF 攻击？如何防范？",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-csrf",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-csrf.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-csrf",subtoc:"security",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 CSRF 攻击？如何防范？",summary:"CSRF 是指跨站的请求伪造，这种攻击方法会强迫使用者在他们已经验证身份的网站中，执行某些恶意的伪造操作，因为已经验证过该使用者，所以网站就会以操作来自该使用者，因此接受了该操作。举例来说，某个使用者登入银行帐户后，去逛别的网站，但不小心点开恶意网站，该恶意网站中的代码用这名使用者的名义，进行未经同意的转帐操作。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-csrf"},{title:"什么是 SQL Injection？该如何避免？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"sql-injection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/sql-injection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-injection",subtoc:"security",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 SQL Injection？该如何避免？",summary:"SQL Injection 是透过修改SQL 语句，进而达到对资料库的恶意攻击，常见的方法为，用户填写的表格中，刻意填写SQL 语句，使得后端获得文字后，用拼接的方式可能会得到意想不到的SQL 语句，并且对资料库做执行。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-injection"},{title:"加密、编码、杂凑的区别为何？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"browser",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"hash-encode-encrypt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/hash-encode-encrypt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/hash-encode-encrypt",subtoc:"security",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=加密、编码、杂凑的区别为何？",summary:"此文介绍了编码、加密和杂凑的区别。编码是一种将资料转换为另一种形式的方法，而加密则是使用密钥对资料进行加密，杂凑则是将任意长度的资料映射到固定长度的数字特征码的算法。文章还介绍了对称式加密和非对称式加密的区别，以及常见的加密演算法和杂凑演算法。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/hash-encode-encrypt"}]}],"en-browser":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Browser and network interview questions",date:"2023-08-27",lastmod:"2024-01-27",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"browser",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/browser.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/browser",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/4f4c8a006901439ea544b6b526b43238.png",summary:"Networking protocols and security",href:"/en/swe/browser"}]},{title:"Browser and Network",links:[{title:"What Is Event Delegation, Capturing, and Bubbling in a Browser?",date:"2023-01-20",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble",subtoc:"browser",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Event Delegation, Capturing, and Bubbling in a Browser?",summary:"When the user interacts with the browser, various events are triggered, such as clicks and scrolls. We can handle these events through JavaScript event handlers. Event delegation is an important pattern you can use when you handle an event. Hence, it is one of the most common interview questions",href:"/en/swe/fe-event-delegation-capture-bubble"},{title:"What Is the Difference Between Cookie, sessionStorage and localStorage?",date:"2023-01-20",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference",subtoc:"browser",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is the Difference Between Cookie, sessionStorage and localStorage?",summary:"When developing web pages, we sometimes need to store data on the client side (browser). Among the methods of saving data to the browser, the most commonly used ones are cookie, localStorage and sessionStorage, all three of which can be used to store data, but have different applicable scenarios and restrictions. The similarities and differences between the three are often tested in front-end interviews. In the following, we will analyze their similarities and differences from multiple perspectives such as usage, life cycle, storage space, and HTTP requests. ",href:"/en/swe/cookie-sessionstorage-localstorage-difference"},{title:"Beyond localStorage: Understanding IndexedDB in\xa0Modern Browsers",date:"2024-12-03",lastmod:"2024-12-03",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-indexeddb",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-indexeddb.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-indexeddb",subtoc:"browser",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Beyond localStorage: Understanding IndexedDB in\xa0Modern Browsers",summary:"Most web\xa0developers are familiar with localStorage, but there's a\xa0more powerful storage solution built into modern browsers: IndexedDB. Let's explore why\xa0it matters and how it's\xa0different.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-indexeddb"},{title:"What Is Web Worker? Where Can It Be Used?",date:"2026-01-06",lastmod:"2026-01-06",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-web-worker",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-web-worker.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-web-worker",subtoc:"browser",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Web Worker? Where Can It Be Used?",summary:"In the early days of frontend development, there wasn't much to process on the frontend side, mostly simple event handling and animation effects. However, as frontend development has matured, developers are handling more and more tasks on the frontend, and the original JavaScript design gradually became insufficient for new demands. Various technologies have emerged to fill these gaps. Web Worker and Service Worker, commonly heard in frontend development, fall into this category.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-web-worker"}]},{title:"HTTP、HTTPS、CORS",links:[{title:"What Is the Difference Between HTTP/1, HTTP/1.1 and HTTP/2?",date:"2022-10-04",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference",subtoc:"http",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is the Difference Between HTTP/1, HTTP/1.1 and HTTP/2?",summary:"Since 1989, HTTP has had several generations of evolution, from 1 to 1.1 to 2 and the current 3. What are the differences between these different versions? In this article, we will summarize the similarities and differences between 1 to 1.1 and then to 2.",href:"/en/swe/http1.0-http1.1-http2.0-difference"},{title:"How Does the HTTP Caching Mechanism Work?",date:"2023-01-20",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"http-caching",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/http-caching.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/http-caching",subtoc:"http",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How Does the HTTP Caching Mechanism Work?",summary:"If you want to speed up web applications, caching is a strategy that is often used. When we have already requested a certain resource from the backend, such as a piece of data or an image, if the resource will not change in the next time we request it, it will be a waste of network bandwidth. On the contrary, if we save the requested resource when we request it for the first time, the resource can be used directly in the next request, which can reduce unnecessary requests. And this is the concept of caching.",href:"/en/swe/http-caching"},{title:"What Is CORS? Why Using CORS?",date:"2022-10-04",lastmod:"2022-10-04",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-cors",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-cors.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-cors",subtoc:"http",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is CORS? Why Using CORS?",summary:"CORS-related errors are common when calling a API. Do you know why does the error exist? How to fix it? These are also common questions in the interview.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-cors"}]},{title:"Web Security",links:[{title:"What is XSS?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2025-12-24",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-xss",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-xss.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-xss",subtoc:"security",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is XSS?",summary:"This article covers the basics of cross-site scripting (XSS) attacks, a common form of online attack. It explores how XSS attacks work and the potential consequences of an attack. The article then outlines three approaches to defending against XSS attacks, including using content security policy, preventing user input from being executed, and checking for vulnerable fields.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-xss"},{title:"What Is CSRF?",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-csrf",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-csrf.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-csrf",subtoc:"security",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is CSRF?",summary:"CSRF refers to cross-site request forgery. This way of attack will force users to execute unwanted malicious forgery requests on websites the user has authenticated. Because the user has been authenticated, the website has no ways to distinguish forged requests and actual requests, so the request will be accepted.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-csrf"},{title:"What Is SQL Injection?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"sql-injection",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/sql-injection.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/sql-injection",subtoc:"security",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is SQL Injection?",summary:"The article explains SQL Injection, a malicious attack on a database that involves modifying SQL statements. It provides examples of how hackers can gain access to a database and how to prevent SQL Injection attacks. The suggested solutions include escaping parameters, query parameterization, and using Object Relational Mapping (ORM) instead of SQL statements.",href:"/en/swe/sql-injection"},{title:"Differences between Encryption, Encoding, and Hashing",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"browser",lang:"en",fileName:"hash-encode-encrypt",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/hash-encode-encrypt.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/hash-encode-encrypt",subtoc:"security",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Differences between Encryption, Encoding, and Hashing",summary:"This document explains the differences between encryption, encoding, and hashing. Encoding presents data in a different way, encryption uses keys to encrypt data, and hashing maps data to a fixed-length digital feature code. Additionally, it introduces symmetric encryption, asymmetric encryption, and common hashing algorithms like md5.",href:"/en/swe/hash-encode-encrypt"}]}],"zh-hant-fe-whiteboard":[{title:"前端程式題彙整",links:[{title:"前端手寫題 50 題大補帖",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2024-03-09",toc:"fe-whiteboard",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"fe-whiteboard",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/fe-whiteboard.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/fe-whiteboard",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端手寫題 50 題大補帖",summary:"這個文件收錄了前端工程面試，常見的 Promise、Time、函式、陣列操作、閉包、物件、class 程式題。每一題都有題目描述與解答，此外也有標上難度分類。建議還不熟悉前端程式題的人，可以先從 Easy 的開始做起，都做完後再練習 Medium 的題目。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/fe-whiteboard"},{title:"前端面試常考的 JavaScript 手寫題總彙整",date:"2022-10-06",lastmod:"2023-01-07",toc:"fe-whiteboard",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"javascript-utility-functions",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/javascript-utility-functions.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/javascript-utility-functions",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端面試常考的 JavaScript 手寫題總彙整",summary:"前端手寫題是許多面試會考的題型，從最基本上的各類效用函式 (例如 `debounce` 、 `curry` 、 `deepClone` 等等)，到常見的 JavaScript 方法 (例如 `Promise.all`)，都不能只會用，還要會自己手寫出來。本篇文章將會節錄常見的手寫題目，並附上解答。除此之外，每一題也都有詳細解說版的連結，供讀者們參考。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/javascript-utility-functions"}]},{title:"Closure 系列",links:[{title:"[Easy] LeetCode JS 30 - 2667. Create Hello World Function (創建閉包函式)",date:"2024-03-07",lastmod:"2024-03-07",toc:"fe-whiteboard",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"create-hello-world-function",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/cre