block 和 inline-block 有什麼差異？display:none 和 visibility:hidden 的差別？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"css-display",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/css-display.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/css-display",subtoc:"css",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CSS 中 display 的值有什麼？",summary:"display 屬性是 CSS 中最常使用的屬性之一，它可以用來決定一個元素會擁有塊狀 `block` 或是行內 `inline` 的特性。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/css-display"},{title:"CSS 水平垂直置中的方法 (flex, grid)",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2024-07-07",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"css-center",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/css-center.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/css-center",subtoc:"css",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CSS 水平垂直置中的方法 (flex, grid)",summary:"CSS 置中是一個非常重要的基本概念，對於前端開發者來說是一個必須掌握的技巧。因此也是面試的常考題目。本篇詳解會提供 5 種做法，其中包含 flex 和 grid 的做法。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/css-center"},{title:"StyleX 是什麼? 解決了什麼問題? 適用在什麼場景?",date:"2023-12-18",lastmod:"2023-12-18",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"stylex-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/stylex-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/stylex-intro",subtoc:"css",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=StyleX 是什麼? 解決了什麼問題? 適用在什麼場景?",summary:"最近 Meta 開源了內部使用的 CSS 解決方案 StyleX，不意外地引來社群的一陣討論。事實上，StyleX 並不是什麼新東西，早在 React Conf 2019 時的《Building the New Facebook with React and Relay》講座中，Frank Yan 就已經提到了，只是當時這個工具還沒被開源。在這一期雙週報，我們從 Frank 當時的講座出發，來跟大家聊聊 StyleX。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/stylex-intro"}]},{title:"前端工具",links:[{title:"什麼是前端模組化？",date:"2022-11-21",lastmod:"2024-10-25",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-frontend-module",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-frontend-module.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-frontend-module",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是前端模組化？",summary:"面試中，關於打包工具的相關知識是非常常見的考題，無可避免的可能會被問到，為什麼需要使用到打包工具、或前端工程化的實現，而要回答這些問題前，需要先了解的就是前端模組化。所以在本篇筆記中，會讓大家了解前端模組化的演進和功用。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-frontend-module"},{title:"webpack 中的 loader 和 plugin 的差別是什麼?",date:"2022-12-30",lastmod:"2022-12-30",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"webpack-loader-plugin",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/webpack-loader-plugin.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/webpack-loader-plugin",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=webpack 中的 loader 和 plugin 的差別是什麼?",summary:"webpack 在前端業界中被廣泛使用，當使用 webpack 時，多半會搭配不同的 loader 或 plugin。假如你有在履歷上提到你會的技術中包含 webpack，那就可能會被問到 loader 與 plugin 分別是什麼、 兩者有什麼不同的問題。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/webpack-loader-plugin"},{title:"為什麼 pnpm 比 npm 更快且更省空間？",date:"2024-01-01",lastmod:"2024-01-01",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"why-is-pnpm-faster",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/why-is-pnpm-faster.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/why-is-pnpm-faster",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=為什麼 pnpm 比 npm 更快且更省空間？",summary:"身為前端開發者，你大概一定聽過 npm 這個套件管理工具，可能也聽過社群許多人會用的 yarn，以及過去兩年熱門的 bun。但其實還有一個叫 pnpm 的套件管理工具，是在 bun 出來之前，受到許多開發團隊親賴的。這篇文章我們來聊聊 pnpm。在 pnpm 的官網中是用 Fast, disk space efficient package manager 來介紹 pnpm 的。可以看到，這邊強調的是兩個特點，一個是在時間維度上快，另一個是在空間維度上有效率。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/why-is-pnpm-faster"},{title:"Vite 是什麼? 為什麼要用 Vite? 它解決了哪些問題? 又是如何解決?",date:"2022-10-27",lastmod:"2024-04-30",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-vite",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-vite.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-vite",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Vite 是什麼? 為什麼要用 Vite? 它解決了哪些問題? 又是如何解決?",summary:"Vite 是近幾年前端業界熱門的建構工具 (build tool)，它大幅地簡化了前端建構的流程與時間。Vite 的核心功能有幾點：作為開發伺服器 (dev server)和打包程式碼。這篇文章將會介紹 Vite 是什麼? 解決了什麼問題? 以及如何解決這些問題?",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-vite"},{title:"Bun 是什麼? 為什麼要用 Bun? 它解決了哪些 Node.js 的問題?",date:"2023-09-11",lastmod:"2025-11-08",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-bun",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-bun.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-bun",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Bun 是什麼? 為什麼要用 Bun? 它解決了哪些 Node.js 的問題?",summary:"Bun 是 JavaScript 的執行環境，也就是能跑 JavaScript 程式的地方。目前社群最多人用的 JavaScript 執行環境莫過於 Node.js。因為 Node.js 在設計上有些問題，但打掉重練的成本太大，所以他的創作者 Ryan Dahl 後來另外開發了 Deno 這個新的執行環境，來解決那些問題。而 Bun 則是由 Oven 團隊開發的執行環境。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-bun"},{title:"前端建構工具 (build tool) 是什麼? 為什麼要用?",date:"2025-11-02",lastmod:"2025-11-02",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"frontend-build-tool",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/frontend-build-tool.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/frontend-build-tool",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端建構工具 (build tool) 是什麼? 為什麼要用?",summary:"拆解前端建構工具的角色，說明它與打包工具的差異，並解析現代團隊為何離不開建構流程。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/frontend-build-tool"},{title:"前端打包工具 (bundler) 是什麼? 為什麼要用?",date:"2025-12-06",lastmod:"2025-12-06",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"frontend-bundler",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/frontend-bundler.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/frontend-bundler",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端打包工具 (bundler) 是什麼? 為什麼要用?",summary:"這篇文章將會深入探討打包工具的核心作用，以及它在現代前端中扮演的角色。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/frontend-bundler"},{title:"你很常聽到 monorepo，但為什麼要用 monorepo?",date:"2023-12-29",lastmod:"2023-12-29",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"why-use-monorepo",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/why-use-monorepo.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/why-use-monorepo",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:54,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=你很常聽到 monorepo，但為什麼要用 monorepo?",summary:"身為前端工程師，或許你很常聽到別人說用 monorepo 的好處很多。以前端來說，Lerna、Nx，以及 Turborepo，都是社群許多人會用的選擇。多數大公司的前端基礎建設團隊 (frontend infra team) 都會有專職在負責 monorepo。但是什麼是 monorepo? 為什麼要用 monorepo? 好處是什麼? 在這一期我們將與大家聊這個主題。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/why-use-monorepo"}]},{title:"前端效能優化",links:[{title:"回流 (Reflow) 和重繪 (Repaint) 是什麼？以及如何優化？",date:"2023-02-03",lastmod:"2024-08-30",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"repaint-and-reflow",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/repaint-and-reflow.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/repaint-and-reflow",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=回流 (Reflow) 和重繪 (Repaint) 是什麼？以及如何優化？",summary:"回流 (Reflow) 是指網頁渲染引擎根據元素的尺寸、位置和顯示屬性來重新計算頁面的排版和布局，是網頁渲染過程中的一個重要步驟。重繪 (Repaint) 是指網頁渲染引擎根據顯示屬性 (如顏色、文字大小等) 重新繪制頁面元素，不影響元素的位置和尺寸。通過有效控制回流和重繪，可以提高網頁的渲染性能。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/repaint-and-reflow"},{title:"什麼是防抖 (debounce)？如何實踐防抖 (debounce) 函式？",date:"2022-12-11",lastmod:"2024-03-08",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"debounce",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/debounce.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/debounce",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是防抖 (debounce)？如何實踐防抖 (debounce) 函式？",summary:"本文介紹什麼是防抖 (debounce) 函式，以及如何實作防抖 (debounce) 函式。防抖 (debounce) 可以用來優化程式碼，避免在短時間內重複執行相同的函式。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/debounce"},{title:"什麼是節流 (throttle)？如何實踐節流 (throttle) 函式？",date:"2022-12-11",lastmod:"2022-12-11",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"throttle",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/throttle.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/throttle",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是節流 (throttle)？如何實踐節流 (throttle) 函式？",summary:"本文介紹什麼是節流 (throttle) 函式，以及如何實作節流 (throttle) 函式。節流 (throttle) 可以用來優化程式碼，避免在短時間內重複執行相同的函式。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/throttle"},{title:"什麼是關鍵渲染路徑 (critical rendering path)?",date:"2024-09-07",lastmod:"2024-09-07",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"critical-rendering-path",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/critical-rendering-path.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/critical-rendering-path",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是關鍵渲染路徑 (critical rendering path)?",summary:"了解關鍵渲染路徑 (critical rendering path) 是前端工程師效能優化的必修課。本文深入解釋了從 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 下載到頁面渲染的每一步驟，並提供優化建議，幫助提升網站載入速度與使用者體驗。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/critical-rendering-path"},{title:"前端渲染模式的選擇",date:"2026-07-23",lastmod:"2026-07-23",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"frontend-rendering-strategies",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/frontend-rendering-strategies.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/frontend-rendering-strategies",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端渲染模式的選擇",summary:"本文介紹前端常見的渲染模式，從客戶端渲染、傳統伺服器端渲染，到搭配注水與串流的現代 SSR。透過比較各模式在載入效能、SEO 與互動體驗上的取捨，協助前端工程師依專案需求選擇合適的渲染策略。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/frontend-rendering-strategies"},{title:"如何避免前端系統的記憶體洩漏 (memory leak)？",date:"2024-09-26",lastmod:"2024-09-26",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"frontend-memory-leak",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/frontend-memory-leak.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/frontend-memory-leak",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何避免前端系統的記憶體洩漏 (memory leak)？",summary:"學習如何避免前端系統中的記憶體洩漏 (memory leak)，了解 JavaScript 的垃圾回收機制及常見的記憶體管理錯誤，提升程式效能，防止頁面崩潰。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/frontend-memory-leak"},{title:"如何用瀏覽器開發者工具 (DevTools) 定位效能相關問題?",date:"2025-07-03",lastmod:"2025-07-03",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"devtools-performance-debugging-guide",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/devtools-performance-debugging-guide.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/devtools-performance-debugging-guide",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何用瀏覽器開發者工具 (DevTools) 定位效能相關問題?",summary:"學會用瀏覽器開發者工具 (DevTools) 定位效能問題，是前端工程師提升效率的關鍵。本文介紹如何透過 Performance 面板分析頁面加載、函式執行時間與主執行緒忙碌程度，快速找出效能瓶頸，助你打造更順暢的網頁體驗。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/devtools-performance-debugging-guide"},{title:"DevTools — 如何在開發者工具上 debug 原始程式碼?",date:"2025-08-11",lastmod:"2025-08-11",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"devtools-debug-original-source-code",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/devtools-debug-original-source-code.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/devtools-debug-original-source-code",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:25,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DevTools — 如何在開發者工具上 debug 原始程式碼?",summary:"本文介紹如何在瀏覽器開發者工具（DevTools）的來源面板中，透過 source map 將壓縮或轉譯過的程式碼對應回原始碼，讓前端工程師能更高效地 debug。內容涵蓋預處理流程、source map 原理與實務應用，協助讀者解決難以閱讀程式碼的問題。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/devtools-debug-original-source-code"},{title:"DevTools — 如何用善用設置斷點 (breakpoint) 加速 debug?",date:"2025-08-12",lastmod:"2025-08-12",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"devtools-breakpoint-debug-tutorial",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/devtools-breakpoint-debug-tutorial.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/devtools-breakpoint-debug-tutorial",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DevTools — 如何用善用設置斷點 (breakpoint) 加速 debug?",summary:"本文介紹如何在瀏覽器開發者工具的來源面板中設置斷點 (breakpoint) 進行前端程式 debug，比較其與 `console.log` 的差異與優勢，並示範使用 `debugger` 指令與直接點擊程式碼行的操作方式，幫助開發者更高效地排查問題與檢查變數狀態。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/devtools-breakpoint-debug-tutorial"},{title:"前端效能優化之列表虛擬化 (virtualization)",date:"2026-05-27",lastmod:"2026-05-27",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"list-virtualization-performance",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/list-virtualization-performance.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/list-virtualization-performance",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:31,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端效能優化之列表虛擬化 (virtualization)",summary:"本文介紹列表虛擬化如何透過只渲染可視區域附近的項目，降低大量 DOM 對瀏覽器造成的負擔。文中也說明虛擬化的基本實作概念、TanStack Virtual 的使用方式，以及判斷是否該導入虛擬化時需要考量的取捨。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/list-virtualization-performance"}]},{title:"其他",links:[{title:"前端圖片格式選擇，什麼時候該用JPG、 PNG、WebP 或 SVG  呢?",date:"2022-02-13",lastmod:"2022-02-13",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"fe-jpg-png-webp-svg",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/fe-jpg-png-webp-svg.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/fe-jpg-png-webp-svg",subtoc:"else",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端圖片格式選擇，什麼時候該用JPG、 PNG、WebP 或 SVG  呢?",summary:"在寫前端，不論是網頁或是行動裝置的原生 APP，都很常會遇到附上圖片的狀況。然而現代網頁可以選擇的圖片格式非常多種，在主流格式中，什麼時候該用 JPG、 PNG、SVG 或 WebP 呢? 這是前端面試很常出現的題目。讓我們透過本文，一起快速來了解這幾種格式的差異，以及什麼狀況該用哪一種格式。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/fe-jpg-png-webp-svg"},{title:"從前端開發角度了解回應式 (Reactivity)",date:"2025-12-20",lastmod:"2025-12-20",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=從前端開發角度了解回應式 (Reactivity)",summary:"回應式 (Reactivity) 是一種程式典範，能夠自動對資料或狀態的變化做出回應，確保應用程式與其底層資料保持同步更新。這篇文章從前端開發角度探討回應式的定義、為什麼前端開發需要回應式，以及 React 和 Vue 等現代框架如何實踐回應式。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend"},{title:"什麼是 SPA (Single-Page Application)？有什麼優點和缺點？",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"spa",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/spa.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/spa",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 SPA (Single-Page Application)？有什麼優點和缺點？",summary:"SPA (Single-Page Application) 是一種網頁應用程式，它是一個只有一個頁面的應用程式，所有的內容都會在同一個頁面上，而不是像傳統的網頁應用程式，每個頁面都是一個完整的 HTML 文件。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/spa"}]}],"zh-hans-frontend":[{title:"目录",links:[{title:"前端工程面试题详解 - 导览",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2024-01-27",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"frontend",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/frontend.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/db275f5afe79489580d7275ee1eef36a.png",summary:"本系列汇整了常见的前端工程面试题，包含基础、型别、变数、作用域、闭包、数组、函式、物件、原型，以及事件循环",href:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend"}]},{title:"HTML 系列",links:[{title:"什么是 HTML 语意化?",date:"2022-10-06",lastmod:"2023-02-02",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"semantics-in-html",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/semantics-in-html.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/semantics-in-html",subtoc:"html",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 HTML 语意化?",summary:"简单来说，HTML 语意化就是用合乎语意的HTML 标签开发，例如：`<form>`、`<table>`，标签会清楚定义其内容、让页面兼具良好的语意和结构。以下会提到两个重点，HTML 语意化标签有哪些，另一个是，优点有哪些。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/semantics-in-html"},{title:"<script> 标签应该放在 HTML 的什么位置？<link> 呢？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2024-07-10",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"script-link-in-html",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/script-link-in-html.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/script-link-in-html",subtoc:"html",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=<script> 标签应该放在 HTML 的什么位置？<link> 呢？",summary:"探讨<script>和<link>标签在HTML中的最佳放置位置。<script>通常建议放在</body>前，以加快页面载入和避免错误。<link>则应放在<head>中，确保样式先载入。文章深入分析各种放置方式的优缺点，并提供实用的程式码范例。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/script-link-in-html"},{title:"如何在 HTML 中插入 CSS 样式？优先顺序是什么？",date:"2024-07-15",lastmod:"2024-07-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-add-css-in-html",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/how-to-add-css-in-html.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/how-to-add-css-in-html",subtoc:"html",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何在 HTML 中插入 CSS 样式？优先级是什么？",summary:"说明如何在 HTML 中插入 CSS 样式及其优先顺序。本文涵盖内联样式（Inline Styles）、内部样式（Internal Styles）和外部样式表（External Stylesheet）的适用场景及其优缺点，并介绍它们在现代开发中的常见实践方法。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/how-to-add-css-in-html"},{title:"<script> 的 async 与 defer 有什么不同？",date:"2022-01-19",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"fe-script-async-defer-difference",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference",subtoc:"html",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=<script> 的 async 与 defer 有什么不同？",summary:"HTML 当中的<script> 标签中，有async 与defer 两个相似的属性，面试中经常会考这两者有什么不同。此篇文张将先讨论为什么需要async 与defer 这两个属性，接着再分析两者的差别。以下为这题的详解",href:"/zh-hans/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference"}]},{title:"CSS 系列",links:[{title:"请说明 CSS 选择器的优先级",date:"2022-10-08",lastmod:"2022-10-08",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"css-specificity",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/css-specificity.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/css-specificity",subtoc:"css",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请说明 CSS 选择器的优先级",summary:"CSS 有许多选择器，例如：id、class，当有一个元素重复用到选择器定义的样式时，优先级的概念就很重要，优先级高的选择器样式会优先出现，而这些选择器的优先级也是被定义好的，以下文章会分享到大部分选择器的优先级排列。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/css-specificity"},{title:"CSS 中有哪些单位? 该如何使用?",date:"2022-10-06",lastmod:"2022-10-06",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"css-px-em-rem-differences",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/css-px-em-rem-differences.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/css-px-em-rem-differences",subtoc:"css",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CSS 中有哪些单位? 该如何使用?",summary:"在 CSS 中，有许多不同的单位，例如：px、em、rem 等，在面试中，可能会被问到，CSS 这些单位的差别跟什么情境该如何使用。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/css-px-em-rem-differences"},{title:"说说你对 CSS 盒模型 (Box Model) 的理解",date:"2022-12-22",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"css-box-model",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/css-box-model.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/css-box-model",subtoc:"css",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=说说你对 CSS 盒模型 (Box Model) 的理解",summary:"浏览器引擎在布局文档(document) 时，会根据CSS 的Box Model 把每个元素视为长方形状的Box，这个Box 是由内容(content)、内距(padding)、边框(border)和外距(margin) 所组成。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/css-box-model"},{title:"伪类 (pseudo-classes) 和伪元素 (pseudo-elements) 是什么？",date:"2023-02-02",lastmod:"2023-02-02",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"pseudo-classes-and-pseudo-elements",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/pseudo-classes-and-pseudo-elements.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/pseudo-classes-and-pseudo-elements",subtoc:"css",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=伪类 (pseudo-classes) 和伪元素 (pseudo-elements) 是什么？",summary:"本篇文章将介绍伪类(pseudo-classes) 和伪元素(pseudo-elements)，并介绍一些常见的用法。例如：`:hover`、`:link`、`:visited`、`: disabled`、`:enabled`、`:first-child`、`:last-child`、`:before`、`:after`。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/pseudo-classes-and-pseudo-elements"},{title:"请解释 CSS position 有什么值和作用？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"css-position",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/css-position.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/css-position",subtoc:"css",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请解释 CSS position 有什么值和作用？",summary:"本篇面试文章会详解 css 的 position，内容包含 position 的作用、position 的五个值：static、relative、absolute、fixed 和 sticky 的用法以及差别。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/css-position"},{title:"CSS 水平垂直置中的方法 (flex, grid)",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2024-07-07",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"css-center",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/css-center.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/css-center",subtoc:"css",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CSS 水平垂直置中的方法 (flex, grid)",summary:"CSS 置中是一个非常重要的基本概念，对于前端开发者来说是一个必须掌握的技巧。因此也是面试的常考题目。本篇详解会提供5 种做法，其中包含flex 和grid 的做法。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/css-center"},{title:"CSS 中 display 的值有什么？有什么差异？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"css-display",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/css-display.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/css-display",subtoc:"css",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=CSS 中 display 的值有什么？有什么差异？",summary:"display 属性是 CSS 中最常使用的属性之一，它可以用来决定一个元素会拥有块状 `block` 或是行内 `inline` 的特性。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/css-display"},{title:"StyleX 是什么? 解决了什么问题? 适用在什么场景?",date:"2023-12-18",lastmod:"2023-12-18",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"stylex-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/stylex-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/stylex-intro",subtoc:"css",order:10,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/4de9eaa798404c388a2ae82fb7f4793f.png",summary:"最近 Meta 开源了内部使用的 CSS 解决方案 StyleX，不意外地引来社群的一阵讨论。事实上，StyleX 并不是什么新东西，早在 React Conf 2019 时的《Building the New Facebook with React and Relay》讲座中，Frank Yan 就已经提到了，只是当时这个工具还没被开源。在这一期双周报，我们从 Frank 当时的讲座出发，来跟大家聊聊 StyleX。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/stylex-intro"}]},{title:"前端工具",links:[{title:"什么是前端模组化？",date:"2022-11-21",lastmod:"2022-02-09",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-frontend-module",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-frontend-module.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-frontend-module",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是前端模组化？",summary:"面试中，关于打包工具的相关知识是非常常见的考题，无可避免的可能会被问到，为什么需要使用到打包工具、或前端工程化的实现，而要回答这些问题前，需要先了解的就是前端模组化。所以在本篇笔记中，会让大家了解前端模组化的演进和功用。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-frontend-module"},{title:"webpack 中的 loader 和 plugin 的差别是什么?",date:"2022-12-30",lastmod:"2022-12-30",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"webpack-loader-plugin",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/webpack-loader-plugin.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/webpack-loader-plugin",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=webpack 中的 loader 和 plugin 的差别是什么?",summary:"webpack 在前端业界中被广泛使用，当使用webpack 时，多半会搭配不同的loader 或plugin。假如你有在简历上提到你会的技术中包含webpack，那就可能会被问到loader与plugin 分别是什么、 两者有什么不同的问题。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/webpack-loader-plugin"},{title:"为什么 pnpm 比 npm 更快且更省空间？",date:"2024-01-01",lastmod:"2024-01-01",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-is-pnpm-faster",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/why-is-pnpm-faster.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/why-is-pnpm-faster",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=为什么 pnpm 比 npm 更快且更省空间？",summary:"身为前端开发者，你大概一定听过 npm 这个套件管理工具，可能也听过社群许多人会用的 yarn，以及过去两年热门的 bun。但其实还有一个叫 pnpm 的套件管理工具，是在 bun 出来之前，受到许多开发团队亲赖的。这篇文章我们来聊聊 pnpm。在 pnpm 的官网中是用 Fast, disk space efficient package manager 来介绍 pnpm 的。可以看到，这边强调的是两个特点，一个是在时间维度上快，另一个是在空间维度上有效率。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/why-is-pnpm-faster"},{title:"Vite 是什么? 为什么要用 Vite? 它解决了哪些问题? 又是如何解决?",date:"2022-10-27",lastmod:"2023-11-19",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-vite",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-vite.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-vite",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Vite 是什么? 为什么要用 Vite? 它解决了哪些问题? 又是如何解决?",summary:"Vite 是近几年前端业界热门的建构工具 (build tool)，它大幅地简化了前端建构的流程与时间。Vite 的核心功能有几点：作为开发服务器 (dev server)和打包代码。这篇文章将会介绍 Vite 是什么? 解决了什么问题? 以及如何解决这些问题?",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-vite"},{title:"Bun 是什么? 为什么要用 Bun? 它解决了哪些 Node.js 的问题?",date:"2023-09-11",lastmod:"2025-11-08",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-bun",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-bun.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-bun",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:4,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/e0ae19c7cc994d45aece680416af1a07.png",summary:"Bun 是 JavaScript 的执行环境，也就是能跑 JavaScript 程式的地方。目前社群最多人用的 JavaScript 执行环境莫过于 Node.js。因为 Node.js 在设计上有些问题，但打掉重练的成本太大，所以他的创作者 Ryan Dahl 后来另外开发了 Deno 这个新的执行环境，来解决那些问题。而 Bun 则是由 Oven 团队开发的执行环境。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-bun"},{title:"你很常听到 monorepo，但为什么要用 monorepo?",date:"2023-12-29",lastmod:"2023-12-29",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-use-monorepo",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/why-use-monorepo.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/why-use-monorepo",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=你很常听到 monorepo，但为什么要用 monorepo?",summary:"身为前端工程师，或许你很常听到别人说用 monorepo 的好处很多。以前端来说，Lerna、Nx，以及 Turborepo，都是社群许多人会用的选择。多数大公司的前端基础建设团队 (frontend infra team) 都会有专职在负责 monorepo。但是什么是 monorepo? 为什么要用 monorepo? 好处是什么? 在这一期我们将与大家聊这个主题。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/why-use-monorepo"},{title:"前端构建工具 (build tool) 是什么? 为什么要用?",date:"2025-11-02",lastmod:"2025-11-02",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"frontend-build-tool",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/frontend-build-tool.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend-build-tool",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端构建工具 (build tool) 是什么? 为什么要用?",summary:"拆解前端构建工具的角色，说明它与打包工具的差异，并解析现代团队为何离不开构建流程。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend-build-tool"},{title:"前端打包工具 (bundler) 是什么? 为什么要用?",date:"2025-12-06",lastmod:"2025-12-06",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"frontend-bundler",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/frontend-bundler.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend-bundler",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端打包工具 (bundler) 是什么? 为什么要用?",summary:"这篇文章将会深入探讨打包工具的核心作用，以及它在现代前端中扮演的角色。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend-bundler"}]},{title:"前端效能优化",links:[{title:"回流 (Reflow) 和重绘 (Repaint) 是什么？以及如何优化？",date:"2023-02-03",lastmod:"2024-08-30",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"repaint-and-reflow",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/repaint-and-reflow.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/repaint-and-reflow",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=回流 (Reflow) 和重绘 (Repaint) 是什么？以及如何优化？",summary:"回流 (Reflow) 是指网页渲染引擎根据元素的尺寸、位置和显示属性来重新计算页面的排版和布局，是网页渲染过程中的一个重要步骤。重绘 (Repaint) 是指网页渲染引擎根据显示属性 (如颜色、文字大小等) 重新绘制页面元素，不影响元素的位置和尺寸。通过有效控制回流和重绘，可以提高网页的渲染性能。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/repaint-and-reflow"},{title:"什么是防抖 (debounce)？ 如何实践防抖 (debounce) 函式？",date:"2022-12-11",lastmod:"2022-12-11",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"debounce",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/debounce.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/debounce",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是防抖 (debounce)？ 如何实践防抖 (debounce) 函式？",summary:"防抖(debounce) 和节流(throttle) 绝对是在考手写题时最常出现的前几名，这两者都能做到优化，但使用情境不太相同，本篇介绍防抖函式，在下篇文中会继续讨论节流。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/debounce"},{title:"什么是节流 (throttle)？ 如何实践节流 (throttle) 函式？",date:"2022-12-11",lastmod:"2022-12-11",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"throttle",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/throttle.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/throttle",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是节流 (throttle)？ 如何实践节流 (throttle) 函式？",summary:"防抖(debounce) 和节流(throttle) 绝对是在考手写题时最常出现的前几名，这两者都能做到优化，但使用情境不太相同，本篇介绍节流(throttle)函式，在下篇文中会继续讨论防抖。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/throttle"},{title:"什么是关键渲染路径 (critical rendering path)?",date:"2024-09-07",lastmod:"2024-09-07",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"critical-rendering-path",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/critical-rendering-path.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/critical-rendering-path",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是关键渲染路径 (critical rendering path)?",summary:"了解关键渲染路径 (critical rendering path) 是前端工程师效能优化的必修课。本文深入解释了从 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 下载到页面渲染的每一步骤，并提供优化建议，帮助提升网站载入速度与使用者体验。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/critical-rendering-path"},{title:"前端渲染模式的选择",date:"2026-07-23",lastmod:"2026-07-23",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"frontend-rendering-strategies",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/frontend-rendering-strategies.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend-rendering-strategies",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端渲染模式的选择",summary:"本文介绍前端常见的渲染模式，从客户端渲染、传统服务器端渲染，到搭配注水与流式传输的现代 SSR。通过比较各模式在加载性能、SEO 与交互体验上的取舍，帮助前端工程师根据项目需求选择合适的渲染策略。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend-rendering-strategies"},{title:"如何避免前端系统的记忆体泄漏 (memory leak)？",date:"2024-09-26",lastmod:"2024-09-26",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"frontend-memory-leak",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/frontend-memory-leak.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend-memory-leak",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何避免前端系统的记忆体泄漏 (memory leak)？",summary:"学习如何避免前端系统中的记忆体泄漏 (memory leak)，了解 JavaScript 的垃圾回收机制及常见的记忆体管理错误，提升程式效能，防止页面崩溃。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/frontend-memory-leak"},{title:"如何用浏览器开发者工具 (DevTools) 定位效能相关问题?",date:"2025-07-03",lastmod:"2025-07-03",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"devtools-performance-debugging-guide",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/devtools-performance-debugging-guide.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/devtools-performance-debugging-guide",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何用浏览器开发者工具 (DevTools) 定位效能相关问题?",summary:"学会用浏览器开发者工具 (DevTools) 定位效能问题，是前端工程师提升效率的关键。本文介绍如何透过 Performance 面板分析页面加载、函式执行时间与主执行绪忙碌程度，快速找出效能瓶颈，助你打造更顺畅的网页体验。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/devtools-performance-debugging-guide"},{title:"DevTools — 如何在开发者工具上 debug 原始程式码?",date:"2025-08-11",lastmod:"2025-08-11",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"devtools-debug-original-source-code",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/devtools-debug-original-source-code.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/devtools-debug-original-source-code",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:25,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DevTools — 如何在开发者工具上 debug 原始程式码?",summary:"本文介绍如何在浏览器开发者工具（DevTools）的来源面板中，透过 source map 将压缩或转译过的程式码对应回原始码，让前端工程师能更高效地 debug。内容涵盖预处理流程、source map 原理与实务应用，协助读者解决难以阅读程式码的问题。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/devtools-debug-original-source-code"},{title:"DevTools — 如何用善用设置断点 (breakpoint) 加速 debug?",date:"2025-08-12",lastmod:"2025-08-12",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"devtools-breakpoint-debug-tutorial",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/devtools-breakpoint-debug-tutorial.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/devtools-breakpoint-debug-tutorial",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=DevTools — 如何用善用设置断点 (breakpoint) 加速 debug?",summary:"本文介绍如何在浏览器开发者工具的来源面板中设置断点 (breakpoint) 进行前端程式 debug，比较其与 `console.log` 的差异与优势，并示范使用 `debugger` 指令与直接点击程式码行的操作方式，帮助开发者更高效地排查问题与检查变数状态。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/devtools-breakpoint-debug-tutorial"},{title:"前端性能优化之列表虚拟化 (virtualization)",date:"2026-05-27",lastmod:"2026-05-27",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"list-virtualization-performance",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/list-virtualization-performance.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/list-virtualization-performance",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:31,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端性能优化之列表虚拟化 (virtualization)",summary:"本文介绍列表虚拟化如何通过只渲染可视区域附近的项目，降低大量 DOM 给浏览器带来的负担。文中也说明虚拟化的基本实现概念、TanStack Virtual 的使用方式，以及判断是否该引入虚拟化时需要考虑的取舍。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/list-virtualization-performance"}]},{title:"其他",links:[{title:"什么是 SPA (Single-Page Application)？有什么优点和缺点？",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"spa",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/spa.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/spa",subtoc:"else",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 SPA (Single-Page Application)？有什么优点和缺点？",summary:"SPA (Single-Page Application) 是一种网页应用程式，它是一个只有一个页面的应用程式，所有的内容都会在同一个页面上，而不是像传统的网页应用程式，每个页面都是一个完整的HTML 文件。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/spa"},{title:"从前端开发角度了解响应式 (Reactivity)",date:"2025-12-20",lastmod:"2025-12-20",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=从前端开发角度了解响应式 (Reactivity)",summary:"响应式 (Reactivity) 是一种编程范式，能够自动对数据或状态的变化做出响应，确保应用程序与其底层数据保持同步更新。这篇文章从前端开发角度探讨响应式的定义、为什么前端开发需要响应式，以及 React 和 Vue 等现代框架如何实践响应式。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend"},{title:"前端图片格式选择，什么时候该用JPG、 PNG、WebP 或 SVG  呢?",date:"2022-02-13",lastmod:"2022-02-13",toc:"frontend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"fe-jpg-png-webp-svg",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/fe-jpg-png-webp-svg.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/fe-jpg-png-webp-svg",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=前端图片格式选择，什么时候该用JPG、 PNG、WebP 或 SVG  呢?",summary:"在写前端，不论是网页或是行动装置的原生APP，都很常会遇到附上图片的状况。然而现代网页可以选择的图片格式非常多种，在主流格式中，什么时候该用JPG 、 PNG、SVG 或WebP 呢? 这是前端面试很常出现的题目。让我们透过本文，一起快速来了解这几种格式的差异，以及什么状况该用哪一种格式。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/fe-jpg-png-webp-svg"}]}],"en-frontend":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Frontend interview questions",date:"2023-08-27",lastmod:"2024-01-27",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"frontend",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/frontend.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/frontend",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/9db5905f92dc4996980c862ab2c4bd23.png",summary:"This series compiles common frontend interview questions, including HTML, CSS, and frontend tooling",href:"/en/swe/frontend"}]},{title:"HTML",links:[{title:"What Is Semantic HTML?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2023-02-14",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"semantics-in-html",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/semantics-in-html.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/semantics-in-html",subtoc:"html",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Semantic HTML?",summary:"Semantic HTML is developing HTML using semantic tags. This involves utilizing HTML tags that clearly define their purpose which leads to better semantics and structure for your pages. In this article, we will cover what are the HTML semantic tags, and what are the advantages of using them.",href:"/en/swe/semantics-in-html"},{title:"Explain the Difference Between DOMContentLoaded, load, beforeunload and unload",date:"2022-01-15",lastmod:"2022-01-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference",subtoc:"html",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Explain the Difference Between DOMContentLoaded, load, beforeunload and unload",summary:"'Web pages and DOM also have a life cycle that we are familiar with. For example, `DOMContentLoaded` is used by many developers. In a JavaScript interview, if the interviewer wants to test your understanding of the browser life cycle, he might ask you \"What is the difference between `DOMContentLoaded` and `load` events?'",href:"/en/swe/fe-DOMContentLoaded-load-beforeunload-unload-difference"},{title:"Where Should the <script> Tags Be Placed in HTML? How About <link> Tags?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"script-link-in-html",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/script-link-in-html.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/script-link-in-html",subtoc:"html",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Where Should the <script> Tags Be Placed in HTML? How About <link> Tags?",summary:"This article discusses the optimal placement of <script> and <link> tags in HTML markup, with <script> recommended at the bottom of the <body> to reduce page load times and <link> placed in the <head> to ensure required external resources are loaded before rendering the webpage content.",href:"/en/swe/script-link-in-html"},{title:"Explain the Difference Between <script async> and <script defer>",date:"2022-01-19",lastmod:"2023-02-12",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"fe-script-async-defer-difference",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference",subtoc:"html",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Explain the Difference Between <script async> and <script defer>",summary:"The async and defer attributes in the script tag in HTML are similar in nature and the difference between the two is a common interview question. This article aims to provide a comprehensive understanding of the need for these attributes, as well as a clear comparison between the two.",href:"/en/swe/fe-script-async-defer-difference"}]},{title:"CSS",links:[{title:"What is the specificity of CSS selectors",date:"2022-10-08",lastmod:"2022-10-08",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"css-specificity",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/css-specificity.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/css-specificity",subtoc:"css",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is the specificity of CSS selectors",summary:"CSS has many selectors, such as: id, class, when an element is selected by different selectors, the concept of specificity of CSS selectors is very important, the choice with the highest specificity of CSS selectors, the style of the selector will appear first. This article will talk about the detailed specificity of most selectors.",href:"/en/swe/css-specificity"},{title:"What units are there in CSS? How do I use them?",date:"2022-10-06",lastmod:"2022-10-06",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"css-px-em-rem-differences",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/css-px-em-rem-differences.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/css-px-em-rem-differences",subtoc:"css",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What units are there in CSS? How do I use them?",summary:"In CSS, there are many different units, such as: px, em, rem, etc. During the interview, you may be asked about the difference between these units in CSS and how to use them in what situation. ",href:"/en/swe/css-px-em-rem-differences"},{title:"What is the CSS Box Model?",date:"2023-01-20",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"css-box-model",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/css-box-model.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/css-box-model",subtoc:"css",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is the CSS Box Model?",summary:"When the browser engine lays out the document, it will treat each element as a rectangular Box according to the Box Model of CSS. This Box is composed of content, padding, border and margin.",href:"/en/swe/css-box-model"},{title:"What are pseudo-classes and pseudo-elements?",date:"2023-02-02",lastmod:"2023-02-02",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"pseudo-classes-and-pseudo-elements",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/pseudo-classes-and-pseudo-elements.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/pseudo-classes-and-pseudo-elements",subtoc:"css",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What are pseudo-classes and pseudo-elements?",summary:"This article will introduce pseudo-classes (pseudo-classes) and pseudo-elements (pseudo-elements), and introduce some common usage. For example: `:hover`, `:link`, `:visited`, `:disabled`, `:enabled`, `:first-child`, `:last-child`, `:before`, `:after` .",href:"/en/swe/pseudo-classes-and-pseudo-elements"},{title:"Explain CSS Position Property",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"css-position",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/css-position.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/css-position",subtoc:"css",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Explain CSS Position Property",summary:"This article explains the differences between CSS static, relative, absolute, fixed and sticky positioning, highlighting their reference points and their impact on page layout.",href:"/en/swe/css-position"},{title:"What Are the Values of Display in CSS? What Is the Difference Between inline, block and inline-block? What Is the Difference Between display:none and visibility:hidden?",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"css-display",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/css-display.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/css-display",subtoc:"css",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Are the Values of Display in CSS? What Is the Difference Between inline, block and inline-block? What Is the Difference Between display:none and visibility:hidden?",summary:"The display property is used to determine whether an element will have block or inline characteristics. If the value of display is set to grid or flex, it will determine how the child elements of this element will be arranged.",href:"/en/swe/css-display"},{title:"How to Center a Div with CSS?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2024-07-07",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"css-center",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/css-center.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/css-center",subtoc:"css",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Center a Div with CSS?",summary:"In this article, we will introduce five ways to center a div with CSS including using display: flex, display: grid, position: absolute, and transform: translate(-50%, -50%).",href:"/en/swe/css-center"},{title:"What is StyleX? What Problems Does It Solve? When Should You Use It?",date:"2023-12-18",lastmod:"2023-12-18",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"stylex-intro",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/stylex-intro.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/stylex-intro",subtoc:"css",order:10,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/4de9eaa798404c388a2ae82fb7f4793f.png",summary:"Meta recently open-sourced StyleX, their internal CSS solution, sparking community discussion. Though StyleX was mentioned as early as React Conf 2019, it's only now publicly available. Let's explore what StyleX solves and when you should consider using it.",href:"/en/swe/stylex-intro"}]},{title:"Frontend Tooling",links:[{title:"What Is JavaScript Modules?",date:"2023-02-14",lastmod:"2024-10-25",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-frontend-module",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-frontend-module.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-frontend-module",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is JavaScript Modules?",summary:"In this article, we will let you know about the evolution and function of JavaScript modules. Including CommonJS, AMD, CMD, UMD, ES Module, and Module Bundler.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-frontend-module"},{title:"What Is Webpack Loader And Plugin?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"webpack-loader-plugin",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/webpack-loader-plugin.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/webpack-loader-plugin",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Webpack Loader And Plugin?",summary:"Webpack loader and plugin are two important concepts in webpack. In this article, we will introduce what is loader and plugin, how to use them, and what are the common loaders and plugins.",href:"/en/swe/webpack-loader-plugin"},{title:"Why pnpm is Faster and More Space-Efficient than npm?",date:"2024-11-07",lastmod:"2024-11-07",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"why-is-pnpm-faster",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/why-is-pnpm-faster.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/why-is-pnpm-faster",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why pnpm is Faster and More Space-Efficient than npm?",summary:"If you work in frontend development, you've certainly heard of npm, probably know about yarn, and may have encountered the buzzy newcomer bun in the last two years. But there's another package manager that many development teams relied on before bun came along: pnpm.",href:"/en/swe/why-is-pnpm-faster"},{title:"What Is Vite? Why Use Vite? What Problems Does It Solve?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-11-19",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-vite",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-vite.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-vite",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Vite? Why Use Vite? What Problems Does It Solve?",summary:"Vite is a build tool that is popular in the frontend industry in recent years. It greatly simplifies the process and time of frontend building. The core features of Vite are: As a development server: It allows developers to develop locally (localhost).",href:"/en/swe/what-is-vite"},{title:"What is Bun? Why Use It? How Does It Solve Node.js Problems?",date:"2024-11-13",lastmod:"2025-11-08",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-bun",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-bun.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-bun",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is Bun? Why Use It? How Does It Solve Node.js Problems?",summary:"Bun is a JavaScript runtime - basically a place where JavaScript code runs. While Node.js dominates the JavaScript runtime landscape today, its creator Ryan Dahl later developed Deno to address Node.js's design limitations. Now, the Oven team has introduced Bun as another alternative runtime.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-bun"},{title:"What is a Frontend Bundler (Module Bundler)? Why Use One?",date:"2025-12-06",lastmod:"2025-12-06",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"frontend-bundler",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/frontend-bundler.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/frontend-bundler",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is a Frontend Bundler (Module Bundler)? Why Use One?",summary:"A deep dive into what bundlers do, why they're essential, and how they transform your code for browsers.",href:"/en/swe/frontend-bundler"},{title:"What Is a Monorepo? Why Using a Monorepo?",date:"2024-11-18",lastmod:"2024-11-18",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"why-use-monorepo",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/why-use-monorepo.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/why-use-monorepo",subtoc:"frontend-tools",order:54,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is a Monorepo? Why Using a Monorepo?",summary:"Discover what a monorepo is and why it’s a game-changer for managing multiple projects in a single repository. Learn how it simplifies code sharing, enables atomic changes, and reduces inconsistencies, making it the preferred choice for major tech companies like Google and Facebook.",href:"/en/swe/why-use-monorepo"}]},{title:"Frontend Optimization",links:[{title:"What are Reflow and Repaint? How to optimize?",date:"2023-02-03",lastmod:"2023-02-03",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"repaint-and-reflow",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/repaint-and-reflow.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/repaint-and-reflow",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What are Reflow and Repaint? How to optimize?",summary:"Reflow and Repaint are two important concepts in browser rendering process. Reflow is the process of browser re-calculating the layout and position of elements on the page. Repaint is the process of browser re-drawing elements on the page. In this article, we will discuss the browser rendering process, Reflow and Repaint, and how to optimize.",href:"/en/swe/repaint-and-reflow"},{title:"What is debounce? How to implement debounce function",date:"2023-02-11",lastmod:"2023-02-11",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"debounce",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/debounce.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/debounce",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is debounce? How to implement debounce function",summary:"Debounce and throttle are the top ones that are asked frequently in the JavaScript coding interview. This blog post will talk about how to implement a debounce function.",href:"/en/swe/debounce"},{title:"Choosing the Right Frontend Rendering Strategy",date:"2026-07-23",lastmod:"2026-07-23",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"frontend-rendering-strategies",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/frontend-rendering-strategies.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/frontend-rendering-strategies",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Choosing the Right Frontend Rendering Strategy",summary:"This article explains the most common frontend rendering strategies, from client-side rendering and traditional server-side rendering to modern SSR with hydration and streaming. It compares their trade-offs in loading performance, SEO, and interactivity so you can choose the right approach for your project.",href:"/en/swe/frontend-rendering-strategies"},{title:"How to Use Browser DevTools to Debug Performance Issues",date:"2025-07-03",lastmod:"2025-07-03",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"devtools-performance-debugging-guide",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/devtools-performance-debugging-guide.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/devtools-performance-debugging-guide",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Use Browser DevTools to Debug Performance Issues",summary:"Master browser DevTools to identify and fix performance problems in your web applications. Learn how to use the Performance panel to analyze page loading, function execution times, and main thread activity to create smoother user experiences.",href:"/en/swe/devtools-performance-debugging-guide"},{title:"Frontend Performance Optimization: List Virtualization",date:"2026-05-27",lastmod:"2026-05-27",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"list-virtualization-performance",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/list-virtualization-performance.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/list-virtualization-performance",subtoc:"frontend-performance",order:31,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Frontend Performance Optimization: List Virtualization",summary:"This article explains how list virtualization reduces browser workload by rendering only the items near the visible viewport instead of the entire list. It also covers the core implementation model, how TanStack Virtual works, and when virtualization is worth the added complexity.",href:"/en/swe/list-virtualization-performance"}]},{title:"Others",links:[{title:"Front-end image format selection, when should I use JPG, PNG, WebP or SVG?",date:"2022-02-13",lastmod:"2023-12-21",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"fe-jpg-png-webp-svg",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/fe-jpg-png-webp-svg.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/fe-jpg-png-webp-svg",subtoc:"else",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Front-end image format selection, when should I use JPG, PNG, WebP or SVG?",summary:"When developing the frontend, whether it is a web page or a mobile app, it is very common to use images. However, there are many image formats that modern web pages can choose from. When should I use JPG, PNG, SVG or WebP?",href:"/en/swe/fe-jpg-png-webp-svg"},{title:"Understanding Reactivity from a Frontend Development Perspective",date:"2025-12-20",lastmod:"2025-12-20",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Understanding Reactivity from a Frontend Development Perspective",summary:"Reactivity is a programming paradigm that automatically responds to changes in data or state, ensuring applications stay synchronized with their underlying data. This article explores reactivity from a frontend development perspective, discussing its definition, why it matters, and how modern frameworks like React and Vue implement it.",href:"/en/swe/understanding-reactivity-from-frontend"},{title:"What Is SPA (Single-Page Application)? What Are Its Advantages and Disadvantages?",date:"2023-02-24",lastmod:"2023-02-24",toc:"frontend",lang:"en",fileName:"spa",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/spa.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/spa",subtoc:"else",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is SPA (Single-Page Application)? What Are Its Advantages and Disadvantages?",summary:"SPA is a web application that is a single-page application, which is an application with only one page. All content will be on the same page, instead of like a traditional web application, each page is a complete HTML document.",href:"/en/swe/spa"}]}],"zh-hant-backend":[{title:"目錄",links:[{title:"後端工程面試詳解 - 導覽",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2024-02-15",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"backend",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/backend.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/backend",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/0a089cb51fe64ee887c431f07513aeed.png",summary:"本系列彙整了常見的 JavaScript 面試題，包含基礎、型別、變數、作用域、閉包、陣列、函式、物件、原型，以及事件循環",href:"/zh-hant/swe/backend"}]},{title:"後端基礎",links:[{title:"Git 和 Git Flow 是什麼？如何應用？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"git-flow",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/git-flow.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/git-flow",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Git 和 Git Flow 是什麼？如何應用？",summary:"當團隊開發遇到程式碼衝突、版本混亂時，Git 和 Git Flow 就是最好的解決方案。讓我們一起瞭解如何運用這些工具來讓團隊協作更順暢。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/git-flow"},{title:"什麼是 Nginx？",date:"2022-09-27",lastmod:"2025-07-17",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"why-nginx",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/why-nginx.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/why-nginx",subtoc:"basic",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 Nginx？",summary:"Nginx 透過事件驅動架構解決了 C10K 問題，能夠有效處理數千個併發連線。了解 Nginx 如何作為反向代理、負載平衡器和 HTTP 快取來建構可擴展的網路應用程式。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/why-nginx"},{title:"什麼是 CDN？為什麼要用 CDN？",date:"2025-11-16",lastmod:"2025-11-16",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-cdn",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/what-is-cdn.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-cdn",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 CDN？為什麼要用 CDN？",summary:"CDN（內容傳遞網路）通過在全球部署邊界節點，加快靜態資源的傳輸速度，降低原始伺服器壓力，提升系統可用性和容錯能力。了解 CDN 的工作原理和應用場景。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/what-is-cdn"},{title:"什麼是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的機制為何？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"cache-mechanism",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/cache-mechanism.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/cache-mechanism",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的機制為何？",summary:"快取 (Cache) 是為了彌補 Database 在複雜業務下的不足，基本原理是將可重使用的資料存放到記憶體中，這樣可以避免每一次都去 Database 讀取，進而將地效能。而以 Memcache 為例，查詢可達到 TPS 50,000 以上。雖然說增加 Cache 可以減輕 Database 的壓力，但會讓系統變得複雜，因此若 Cache 沒有設計好，則有可能造成系統崩潰。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/cache-mechanism"},{title:"JWT 的運作原理是什麼？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"jwt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/jwt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/jwt",subtoc:"basic",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的機制為何？",summary:"'JWT 是一種以 JSON 為基礎的開放標準（RFC 7519），通過 HMAC、RSA、ECDS 等算法進行加密，它由 Header、Payload、Signature 組成，以 Base64 編碼，並以 \".\" 分開。 JWT 的工作原理是通過加密。 JWT 的使用場合是在需要加密傳輸數據時使用。'",href:"/zh-hant/swe/jwt"},{title:"TCP 與 UDP 是什麼？差異為何？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"tcp-udp",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/tcp-udp.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/tcp-udp",subtoc:"basic",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=TCP 與 UDP 是什麼？差異為何？",summary:"TCP 是一種面向連接的協定，它在傳送資料前會建立一個可靠的連接，並且在傳送過程中提供錯誤檢查和重新傳送功能，確保傳送的資料不會丟失。UPD 是一種面向非連接的協定，它沒有保證傳送資料的可靠性，因此傳送速度更快，通信引擎也更簡單。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/tcp-udp"},{title:"限流器 (Rate Limiter) 是什麼? 有哪些限流策略?",date:"2024-02-15",lastmod:"2024-02-15",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"rate-limiter",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/rate-limiter.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/rate-limiter",subtoc:"basic",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=限流器 (Rate Limiter) 是什麼? 有哪些限流策略?",summary:"限流器 (Rate Limiter) 是一種用來限制流量的工具，可以阻擋 DoS 攻擊、降低成本。常見的限流策略包含令牌桶、固定窗口、滑動窗口。本文介紹了 Upstash 開源限流器套件，並分析了這三種限流策略的優缺點。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/rate-limiter"},{title:"權限管理設計：ACL、RBAC",date:"2024-12-03",lastmod:"2024-12-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"permission-management-models",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/permission-management-models.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/permission-management-models",subtoc:"basic",order:40,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=權限管理設計：ACL、RBAC",summary:"探討權限管理的兩種方式：ACL 與 RBAC，解釋各自的運作原理、優缺點，並討論如何選擇適合的模式來滿足系統的授權需求",href:"/zh-hant/swe/permission-management-models"},{title:"session-based 與 token-based 的驗證，有什麼不同?",date:"2025-08-05",lastmod:"2025-08-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"session-vs-token-authentication",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/session-vs-token-authentication.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/session-vs-token-authentication",subtoc:"basic",order:45,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=session-based 與 token-based 的驗證，有什麼不同?",summary:"session-based 與 token-based 是常見的驗證機制，差異關鍵在於是否需維持伺服器狀態。本篇將從實作與系統設計角度，解析兩者在擴展性、安全性與架構上的優劣，協助工程師理解適用場景。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/session-vs-token-authentication"},{title:"並行 (Concurrency) 與平行 (Parallelism) 有什麼不同?",date:"2026-02-21",lastmod:"2026-02-21",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"concurrency-vs-parallelism",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism",subtoc:"basic",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=%E4%B8%A6%E8%A1%8C%20%28Concurrency%29%20%E8%88%87%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%8C%20%28Parallelism%29%20%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%3F",summary:"並行 (Concurrency) 和平行 (Parallelism) 經常被混淆，但兩者有本質區別。並行是在單一運算資源下快速切換管理多個任務以減少閒置，適合處理 I/O 受限的工作；平行則是透過多個運算單元同時執行多個任務，適合加速 CPU 受限的工作。理解兩者的差異對系統設計與面試回答至關重要。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism"}]},{title:"API 設計",links:[{title:"什麼是 RESTful API？從日常生活理解 REST 架構原理",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2025-09-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"restful-api",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/restful-api.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/restful-api",subtoc:"api",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 RESTful API？從日常生活理解 REST 架構原理",summary:"在眾多的 API 撰寫方式中，有一個特別熱門的 REST 原則。理解 REST 是對前端與後端工程師來說，都必須要掌握的基本。在這篇文章中，我們將探討什麼是具有 REST 風格的 API (俗稱 RESTful API)，讓讀者能掌握 RESTful API 的基本原則。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/restful-api"},{title:"什麼是 GraphQL? 為什麼要用 GraphQL? 它解決了什麼問題?",date:"2023-03-07",lastmod:"2025-07-14",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"graphql",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/graphql.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/graphql",subtoc:"api",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 GraphQL？",summary:"GraphQL 是一種 API 的風格，它能解決傳統 REST API 的拿太多 (over-fetching) 和拿不夠 (under-fetching) 的問題。不用發送多個 API 請求，客戶端可以在單一請求中獲得所需的資料。這篇文章將會介紹 GraphQL 的運作原理、使用時機，以及實際的 GraphQL 範例。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/graphql"},{title:"SOAP vs REST：如何選擇？",date:"2023-03-15",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"soap-vs-rest",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/soap-vs-rest.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/soap-vs-rest",subtoc:"api",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=SOAP vs REST：如何選擇？",summary:"SOAP 和 REST 都是用於分散式計算的網路通訊協議，但它們有許多不同之處，例如傳輸協議、資料格式、操作風格和傳輸效率等。REST 強調簡潔、自由度高、易於擴展等特點，適用於量級且可伸縮的解決方案，尤其是在 Web 應用程序上。SOAP 則較為嚴格，可以提供高度安全性和事務支持，適用於大型企業系統中傳輸複雜的、高度結構化的數據，並保證消息的完整性。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/soap-vs-rest"},{title:"API 設計 — 好的 API 設計有什麼特點？",date:"2024-09-16",lastmod:"2024-09-16",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"good-api-design",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/good-api-design.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/good-api-design",subtoc:"api",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=API 設計 — 好的 API 設計有什麼特點？",summary:"了解如何設計好的 API，並學習簡單直觀、命名可讀性高且範圍窄的 API 設計原則，讓開發工作更有效率，提升團隊的開發體驗。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/good-api-design"},{title:"API 設計 — 如何設計穩定可預測的 API (談冪等性)？",date:"2024-10-17",lastmod:"2024-10-17",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis",subtoc:"api",order:25,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=API 設計 — 如何設計穩定可預測的 API (談冪等性)",summary:"了解如何設計穩定且可預測的 API，透過冪等性機制確保系統的穩定性與一致性。本文討論冪等性的關鍵概念，並提供實務操作建議，適用於各種 API 設計。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis"},{title:"API 設計 — 優化團隊的 API 設計流程",date:"2024-11-07",lastmod:"2024-11-07",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"api-design-process",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/api-design-process.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/api-design-process",subtoc:"api",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=API 設計 — 優化團隊的 API 設計流程",summary:"本篇文章從資深工程師的角度，探討如何透過流程優化、設計指南與文件化來提升團隊 API 品質，並提供具體的實務建議，幫助讀者提升 API 設計的整體水準。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/api-design-process"}]},{title:"資料庫",links:[{title:"請說明條件判斷語法 CASE 的用法",date:"2022-09-29",lastmod:"2022-09-29",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"sql-case",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/sql-case.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-case",subtoc:"database",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=請說明條件判斷語法 CASE 的用法",summary:"跟多數程式語言一樣，在寫 SQL 時可以用 IF... ELSE 來寫條件判斷；也跟多數程式語言一樣，除了 IF 之外，也有 CASE 的條件判斷語法。許多程式語言會用 swtich... case ，而在 SQL 則有點不同，會是用 CASE... WHEN",href:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-case"},{title:"請說明 (NOT) LIKE 運算子是用來做什麼的?",date:"2022-9-29",lastmod:"2022-9-29",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"sql-like",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/sql-like.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-like",subtoc:"database",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=請說明 (NOT) LIKE 運算子是用來做什麼的?",summary:"LIKE 運算子是用來做模糊搜尋時使用的，它可以協助我們找到「具有特定模式」的資料，在使用上經常會搭配 % 來用。而 NOT LIKE 則是反過來，它可以協助我們找到「不具」特定模式的資料。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-like"},{title:"一張圖搞懂 SQL JOIN",date:"2025-11-12",lastmod:"2025-11-12",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"sql-join",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/sql-join.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-join",subtoc:"database",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=一張圖搞懂 SQL JOIN",summary:"SQL JOIN 是用來連接兩個或多個表格的關鍵字。常見的 JOIN 類型包括 INNER JOIN、LEFT JOIN、RIGHT JOIN 和 FULL OUTER JOIN，各自適用於不同的資料查詢需求。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/sql-join"},{title:"資料庫索引 (Database Index) 是什麼? 為什麼用 B+ tree?",date:"2025-12-18",lastmod:"2025-12-18",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"database-index",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/database-index.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/database-index",subtoc:"database",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=資料庫索引 (Database Index) 是什麼?",summary:"資料庫索引是用來加快資料查詢速度的重要技術。透過在表格的一個或多個欄位上建立索引，資料庫可以更快地定位和檢索資料，從而顯著提升查詢性能。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/database-index"},{title:"什麼是資料庫正規化？為什麼需要正規化？",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"database-normalization",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/database-normalization.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/database-normalization",subtoc:"database",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是資料庫正規化？為什麼需要正規化？",summary:"正規化是為了讓資料庫中重複的欄位資料減到最少，並且能快速的找到資料，提高關聯性資料庫的效能，因此其兩大目標為：1. 降低資料的重複性 2.避免資料更新異常。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/database-normalization"},{title:"什麼是資料庫反正規化？優缺點是什麼？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"database-denormalization",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/database-denormalization.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/database-denormalization",subtoc:"database",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是資料庫反正規化？優缺點是什麼？",summary:"資料庫反正規化（Database Denormalization）是一種將資料庫中的資料再次加工，將資料從正規化狀態轉換為非正規化狀態的過程。而反正規化不等於非正規化（Unnormalized Form），反正規化是先遵守正規化的所有規則，再進行局部調整，故意打破一些正規化規則；而後者非正規化是全然不顧規則。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/database-denormalization"},{title:"NoSQL 是什麼？請說明 NoSQL 資料庫的特點",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"nosql-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/nosql-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/nosql-intro",subtoc:"database",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=NoSQL 是什麼？請說明 NoSQL 資料庫的特點",summary:"最初表示 NoSQL 後來轉解為 Not Only SQL，是對不同於傳統資料庫的統稱，其未支援傳統資料庫 ACID 的特性，而是遵守 BASE 模型特性，只能保持最終一致性。但 NoSQL 本身的優勢為：靈活性：相比於 SQL 需要事先定義欄位與資料型別，NoSQL 則可以很自由的儲存資料。擴展性：NoSQL 利於橫向擴展，支援更多流量，因此也提升可用性與高效性。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/nosql-intro"},{title:"ACID 是什麼？請解釋 ACID 特性",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2024-04-01",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"acid-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/acid-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/acid-intro",subtoc:"database",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ACID 是什麼？請解釋 ACID 特性、談論 ACID 時有什麼思考點",summary:"ACID 是指在資料庫的管理系統中，在寫入或更新資料的過程中，為了保證事務（transaction）是正確可靠的，所以須具備四種特性，原子性、一制性、事務隔離、持久性",href:"/zh-hant/swe/acid-intro"},{title:"ORM 是什麼？ORM 的優缺點是什麼？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"orm-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/orm-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/orm-intro",subtoc:"database",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ORM 是什麼？ORM 的優缺點是什麼？",summary:"在後端開發上，通常都要與資料庫做操作（新增、修改、刪除、查找）。後端會撰寫 SQL 語句，並且透過一些工具或套件（例如：pymysql）向 SQL 資料庫來做溝通。ORM 是再往上進行一層封裝，而無需去編寫原生的 SQL 語句，取而代之的是基於物件導向的思想去編寫 Class、Object、Method 等。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/orm-intro"},{title:"什麼是資料庫查詢 N + 1 問題? 如何有效避免?",date:"2026-01-25",lastmod:"2026-01-25",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"n-plus-one-problem",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/n-plus-one-problem.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/n-plus-one-problem",subtoc:"database",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是資料庫查詢 N + 1 問題%3F 如何有效避免%3F",summary:"N + 1 問題是一個常見的資料庫查詢效能問題，當應用程式先查詢一次列表後，再針對每個結果逐筆查詢相關資料，導致查詢次數隨資料量線性增加。透過使用 JOIN 或 IN 子句等重構方式，可以有效避免這個問題。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/n-plus-one-problem"}]},{title:"程式設計/架構",links:[{title:"什麼是 MVC 模式？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"mvc",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/mvc.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/mvc",subtoc:"architecture",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 MVC 模式？",summary:"MVC 是 Model-View-Controller 的縮寫，是一種軟體架構模式。 MVC 把一個應用程序分成三個主要部分：模型（Model）、視圖（View）和控制器 (Controller)。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/mvc"},{title:"什麼是 MVVM？",date:"2023-03-07",lastmod:"2023-03-07",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"mvvm",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/mvvm.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/mvvm",subtoc:"architecture",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 MVVM？",summary:"MVVM是一種軟件設計模式，即模型-視圖-視圖模型。它旨在分離應用程序的用戶界面、業務邏輯和數據模型，使開發過程更加簡便和靈活，方便測試和維護。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/mvvm"},{title:"什麼是 SOLID 原則？",date:"2023-03-07",lastmod:"2023-03-07",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"solid",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/solid.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/solid",subtoc:"architecture",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什麼是 SOLID 原則？",summary:"本文介紹了 SOLID 原則，包括單一職責原則、開放封閉原則、里氏替換原則、介面隔離原則和依賴反轉原則。每個原則都有相應的範例，說明了如何遵循該原則以及如何修復違反該原則的代碼。這些原則可以幫助開發人員設計出更加靈活、可重用和易於維護的代碼。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/solid"},{title:"重構帶來的好處為何？如何重構？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-refactor",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/how-to-refactor.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/how-to-refactor",subtoc:"architecture",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=重構帶來的好處為何？如何重構？",summary:"本篇文章介紹了重構的好處和如何進行重構。重構可以改善代碼的可讀性、可維護性、性能和安全性。當代碼重複、技術債務、添加新功能、性能優化、錯誤修復或團隊合作時，就可以進行重構。常見的重構技術包括 Red-Green-Refactor、抽象化和合成方法等。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/how-to-refactor"},{title:"物件導向程式設計的三大特性為何？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"object-oriented-programming",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/swe/object-oriented-programming.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/swe/object-oriented-programming",subtoc:"architecture",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=物件導向程式設計的三大特性為何？",summary:"本篇文章介紹了物件導向程式設計的三大特性：封裝、繼承和多型，並以汽車類別為例子進行說明。封裝可以保護物件的內部狀態不被直接訪問或修改，繼承可以重複使用已有物件的程式碼，同時也可以擴展或修改已有物件的功能，而多型則可以讓物件可以根據上下文表現出不同的行為，提高程式的靈活性和可擴展性。",href:"/zh-hant/swe/object-oriented-programming"}]}],"zh-hans-backend":[{title:"目录",links:[{title:"后端工程面试详解 - 导览",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2024-02-15",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"backend",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/backend.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/backend",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/9348d499713b4bdfbd80683a8929c355.png",summary:"本系列汇整了常见的 JavaScript 面试题，包含基础、型别、变数、作用域、闭包、数组、函式、物件、原型，以及事件循环",href:"/zh-hans/swe/backend"}]},{title:"后端基础",links:[{title:"Git 和 Git Flow 是什么？如何应用？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"git-flow",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/git-flow.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/git-flow",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Git 和 Git Flow 是什么？如何应用？",summary:"Git 是分散版本控制系统，常被用于软件开发专案的版本控制、合作和备份。面试时常被问到的 Git 相关题目包括：Git 是什么、Git Flow 是什么、以及如何应用。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/git-flow"},{title:"Nginx 是什么？有哪些用途？",date:"2022-09-27",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-nginx",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/why-nginx.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/why-nginx",subtoc:"basic",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Nginx 是什么？有哪些用途？",summary:"Nginx 是一个非同步框架的网页服务器，可以做到反向代理、负载均衡、http 快取。Nginx 比起Apache 属于轻量级且高并发、处理静态档案的效率较高、耗费的记忆体较少、负载效能好，很适合做前端服务器使用。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/why-nginx"},{title:"什么是 CDN？为什么要用 CDN？",date:"2025-11-16",lastmod:"2025-11-16",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-cdn",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-cdn.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-cdn",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 CDN？为什么要用 CDN？",summary:"CDN（内容传递网络）通过在全球部署边界节点，加快静态资源的传输速度，降低原始服务器压力，提升系统可用性和容错能力。了解 CDN 的工作原理和应用场景。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-cdn"},{title:"什么是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的机制为何？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"cache-mechanism",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/cache-mechanism.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/cache-mechanism",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是快取 (Cache)？快取 (Cache) 的机制为何？",summary:"快取(Cache) 是为了弥补Database 在复杂业务下的不足，基本原理是将可重使用的资料存放到记忆体中，这样可以避免每一次都去Database 读取，进而将地效能。而以Memcache 为例，查询可达到TPS 50,000 以上。虽然说增加Cache 可以减轻Database 的压力，但会让系统变得复杂，因此若Cache 没有设计好，则有可能造成系统崩溃。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/cache-mechanism"},{title:"JWT 的运作原理是什么？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"jwt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/jwt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/jwt",subtoc:"basic",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=JWT 的运作原理是什么？",summary:"'JWT 是一种以 JSON 为基础的开放标准（RFC 7519），通过 HMAC、RSA、ECDS 等算法进行加密，它由 Header、Payload、Signature 组成，以 Base64 编码，并以 \".\" 分开。 JWT 的工作原理是通过加密。 JWT 的使用场合是在需要加密传输数据时使用。 '",href:"/zh-hans/swe/jwt"},{title:"TCP 与 UDP 是什么？差异为何？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"tcp-udp",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/tcp-udp.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/tcp-udp",subtoc:"basic",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=TCP 与 UDP 是什么？差异为何？",summary:"TCP 是一种面向连接的协定，它在传送资料前会建立一个可靠的连接，并且在传送过程中提供错误检查和重新传送功能，确保传送的资料不会丢失。UPD 是一种面向非连接的协定，它没有保证传送资料的可靠性，因此传送速度更快，通信引擎也更简单。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/tcp-udp"},{title:"限流器 (Rate Limiter) 是什么? 有哪些限流策略?",date:"2024-02-15",lastmod:"2024-02-15",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"rate-limiter",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/rate-limiter.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/rate-limiter",subtoc:"basic",order:8,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/f72fe90c67bc4605a0c1167287eab8f1.png",summary:"限流器 (Rate Limiter) 是一种用来限制流量的工具，可以阻挡 DoS 攻击、降低成本。常见的限流策略包含令牌桶、固定窗口、滑动窗口。本文介绍了 Upstash 开源限流器套件，并分析了这三种限流策略的优缺点。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/rate-limiter"},{title:"权限管理设计：ACL、RBAC",date:"2024-12-03",lastmod:"2024-12-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"permission-management-models",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/permission-management-models.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/permission-management-models",subtoc:"basic",order:40,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=权限管理设计：ACL、RBAC",summary:"探讨权限管理的两种方式：ACL 与 RBAC，解释各自的运作原理、优缺点，并讨论如何选择适合的模式来满足系统的授权需求。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/permission-management-models"},{title:"session-based 与 token-based 的验证，有什么不同?",date:"2025-08-05",lastmod:"2025-08-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"session-vs-token-authentication",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/session-vs-token-authentication.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/session-vs-token-authentication",subtoc:"basic",order:45,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=session-based 与 token-based 的验证，有什么不同?",summary:"session-based 与 token-based 是常见的验证机制，差异关键在于是否需维持伺服器状态。本篇将从实作与系统设计角度，解析两者在扩展性、安全性与架构上的优劣，协助工程师理解适用场景。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/session-vs-token-authentication"},{title:"并行 (Concurrency) 与并发 (Parallelism) 有什么不同?",date:"2026-02-21",lastmod:"2026-02-21",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"concurrency-vs-parallelism",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism",subtoc:"basic",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=并行 (Concurrency) 与并发 (Parallelism) 有什么不同?",summary:"并行 (Concurrency) 和并发 (Parallelism) 经常被混淆，但两者有本质区别。并行是在单一运算资源下快速切换管理多个任务以减少闲置，适合处理 I/O 受限的工作；并发则是通过多个运算单元同时执行多个任务，适合加速 CPU 受限的工作。理解两者的差异对系统设计与面试回答至关重要。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism"}]},{title:"API 设计",links:[{title:"什么是 RESTful API？从日常生活理解 REST 架构原理",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2025-09-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"restful-api",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/restful-api.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/restful-api",subtoc:"api",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 RESTful API？从日常生活理解 REST 架构原理",summary:"在众多的 API 撰写方式中，有一个特别热门的 REST 原则。理解 REST 是对前端与后端工程师来说，都必须要掌握的基本。在这篇文章中，我们将探讨什么是具有 REST 风格的 API (俗称 RESTful API)，让读者能掌握 RESTful API 的基本原则。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/restful-api"},{title:"什么是 GraphQL？",date:"2023-03-07",lastmod:"2023-03-07",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"graphql",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/graphql.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/graphql",subtoc:"api",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 GraphQL？",summary:"GraphQL 是一种用于API 的查询语言。它由Facebook 于2015 年开发，并在2018 年开源。GraphQL 使客户端可以精确地请求它们需要的数据，并且能够减少不必要的数据传输。与传统的REST API 不同，GraphQL 使用单个端点来提供所有请求的数据，客户端可以使用GraphQL 查询语言来描述需要的数据，这使得查询更加灵活和可控。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/graphql"},{title:"SOAP vs REST：如何选择？",date:"2023-03-15",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"soap-vs-rest",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/soap-vs-rest.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/soap-vs-rest",subtoc:"api",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=SOAP vs REST：如何选择？",summary:"SOAP 和REST 都是用于分散式计算的网路通讯协议，但它们有许多不同之处，例如传输协议、资料格式、操作风格和传输效率等。REST 强调简洁、自由度高、易于扩展等特点，适用于量级且可伸缩的解决方案，尤其是在Web 应用程序上。SOAP 则较为严格，可以提供高度安全性和事务支持，适用于大型企业系统中传输复杂的、高度结构化的数据，并保证消息的完整性。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/soap-vs-rest"},{title:"API 设计 — 好的 API 设计有什么特点？",date:"2024-09-16",lastmod:"2024-09-16",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"good-api-design",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/good-api-design.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/good-api-design",subtoc:"api",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=API 设计 — 好的 API 设计有什么特点？",summary:"了解如何设计好的 API，并学习简单直观、命名可读性高且范围窄的 API 设计原则，让开发工作更有效率，提升团队的开发体验。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/good-api-design"},{title:"API 设计 — 如何设计稳定可预测的 API (谈幂等性)？",date:"2024-10-17",lastmod:"2024-10-17",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis",subtoc:"api",order:25,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=API 设计 — 如何设计稳定可预测的 API (谈幂等性)",summary:"了解如何设计稳定且可预测的 API，透过幂等性机制确保系统的稳定性与一致性。本文讨论幂等性的关键概念，并提供实务操作建议，适用于各种 API 设计。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis"},{title:"API 设计 — 优化团队的 API 设计流程",date:"2024-11-07",lastmod:"2024-11-07",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"api-design-process",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/api-design-process.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/api-design-process",subtoc:"api",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=API 设计 — 优化团队的 API 设计流程",summary:"本篇文章从资深工程师的角度，探讨如何透过流程优化、设计指南与文件化来提升团队 API 品质，并提供具体的实务建议，帮助读者提升 API 设计的整体水准。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/api-design-process"}]},{title:"资料库",links:[{title:"请说明条件判断语法 CASE 的用法",date:"2022-09-29",lastmod:"2022-09-29",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"sql-case",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/sql-case.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-case",subtoc:"database",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请说明条件判断语法 CASE 的用法",summary:"跟多数程式语言一样，在写SQL 时可以用IF... ELSE 来写条件判断；也跟多数程式语言一样，除了IF 之外，也有CASE 的条件判断语法。许多程式语言会用swtich ... case ，而在SQL 则有点不同，会是用CASE... WHEN",href:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-case"},{title:"请说明 (NOT) LIKE 运算子是用来做什么的? ",date:"2022-9-29",lastmod:"2022-9-29",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"sql-like",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/sql-like.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-like",subtoc:"database",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请说明 (NOT) LIKE 运算子是用来做什么的? ",summary:"LIKE 运算子是用来做模糊搜寻时使用的，它可以协助我们找到「具有特定模式」的资料，在使用上经常会搭配 % 来用。而 NOT LIKE 则是反过来，它可以协助我们找到「不具」特定模式的资料。 ",href:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-like"},{title:"一张图搞懂 SQL JOIN",date:"2025-11-12",lastmod:"2025-11-12",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"sql-join",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/sql-join.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-join",subtoc:"database",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=一张图搞懂 SQL JOIN",summary:"SQL JOIN 是用来连接两个或多个表格的关键字。常见的 JOIN 类型包括 INNER JOIN、LEFT JOIN、RIGHT JOIN 和 FULL OUTER JOIN，各自适用于不同的资料查询需求。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/sql-join"},{title:"数据库索引 (Database Index) 是什么? 为什么用 B+ tree?",date:"2025-12-18",lastmod:"2025-12-18",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"database-index",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/database-index.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/database-index",subtoc:"database",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=数据库索引 (Database Index) 是什么?",summary:"数据库索引是用来加快数据查询速度的重要技术。通过在表格的一个或多个列上建立索引，数据库可以更快地定位和检索数据，从而显著提升查询性能。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/database-index"},{title:"什么是资料库正规化？为什么需要正规化？",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2023-02-04",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"database-normalization",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/database-normalization.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/database-normalization",subtoc:"database",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是资料库正规化？为什么需要正规化？",summary:"正规化是为了让资料库中重复的栏位资料减到最少，并且能快速的找到资料，提高关联性资料库的效能，因此其两大目标为：1. 降低资料的重复性2 .避免资料更新异常。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/database-normalization"},{title:"什么是资料库反正规化？优缺点是什么？",date:"2023-02-10",lastmod:"2023-02-10",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"database-denormalization",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/database-denormalization.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/database-denormalization",subtoc:"database",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是资料库反正规化？优缺点是什么？",summary:"资料库反正规化（Database Denormalization）是一种将资料库中的资料再次加工，将资料从正规化状态转换为非正规化状态的过程。而反正规化不等于非正规化（Unnormalized Form ），反正规化是先遵守正规化的所有规则，再进行局部调整，故意打破一些正规化规则；而后者非正规化是全然不顾规则。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/database-denormalization"},{title:"NoSQL 是什么？请说明 NoSQL 资料库的特点",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"nosql-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/nosql-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/nosql-intro",subtoc:"database",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=NoSQL 是什么？请说明 NoSQL 资料库的特点",summary:"最初表示NoSQL 后来转解为Not Only SQL，是对不同于传统资料库的统称，其未支援传统资料库ACID 的特性，而是遵守BASE 模型特性，只能保持最终一致性。但NoSQL本身的优势为：灵活性：相比于SQL 需要事先定义栏位与资料型别，NoSQL 则可以很自由的储存资料。扩展性：NoSQL 利于横向扩展，支援更多流量，因此也提升可用性与高效性。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/nosql-intro"},{title:"ACID 是什么？请解释 ACID 特性",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2024-04-01",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"acid-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/acid-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/acid-intro",subtoc:"database",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ACID 是什么？请解释 ACID 特性、谈论 ACID 时有什么思考点",summary:"ACID 是指在资料库的管理系统中，在写入或更新资料的过程中，为了保证事务（transaction）是正确可靠的，所以须具备四种特性，原子性、一制性、事务隔离、持久性",href:"/zh-hans/swe/acid-intro"},{title:"ORM 是什么？ORM 的优缺点是什么？",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2023-02-09",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"orm-intro",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/orm-intro.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/orm-intro",subtoc:"database",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ORM 是什么？ORM 的优缺点是什么？",summary:"在后端开发上，通常都要与资料库做操作（新增、修改、删除、查找）。后端会撰写SQL 语句，并且透过一些工具或套件（例如：pymysql）向SQL 资料库来做沟通。ORM 是再往上进行一层封装，而无需去编写原生的SQL 语句，取而代之的是基于物件导向的思想去编写Class、Object、Method 等。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/orm-intro"},{title:"什么是数据库查询 N + 1 问题? 如何有效避免?",date:"2026-01-25",lastmod:"2026-01-25",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"n-plus-one-problem",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/n-plus-one-problem.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/n-plus-one-problem",subtoc:"database",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是数据库查询 N + 1 问题%3F 如何有效避免%3F",summary:"N + 1 问题是一个常见的数据库查询性能问题，当应用程序先查询一次列表后，再针对每个结果逐笔查询相关数据，导致查询次数随数据量线性增加。通过使用 JOIN 或 IN 子句等重构方式，可以有效避免这个问题。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/n-plus-one-problem"}]},{title:"程式设计/架构",links:[{title:"物件导向程序设计的三大特性为何？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"object-oriented-programming",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/object-oriented-programming.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/object-oriented-programming",subtoc:"architecture",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=物件导向程序设计的三大特性为何？",summary:"本篇文章介绍了物件导向程序设计的三大特性：封装、继承和多型，并以汽车类别为例子进行说明。封装可以保护物件的内部状态不被直接访问或修改，继承可以重复使用已有物件的代码，同时也可以扩展或修改已有物件的功能，而多型则可以让物件可以根据上下文表现出不同的行为，提高程式的灵活性和可扩展性。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/object-oriented-programming"},{title:"重构带来的好处为何？如何重构？",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-refactor",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/how-to-refactor.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/how-to-refactor",subtoc:"architecture",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=重构带来的好处为何？如何重构？",summary:"本篇文章介绍了重构的好处和如何进行重构。重构可以改善代码的可读性、可维护性、性能和安全性。当代码重复、技术债务、添加新功能、性能优化、错误修复或团队合作时，就可以进行重构。常见的重构技术包括Red-Green-Refactor、抽象化和合成方法等。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/how-to-refactor"},{title:"什么是 MVC 模式？",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"mvc",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/mvc.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/mvc",subtoc:"architecture",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 MVC 模式？",summary:"MVC 是 Model-View-Controller 的缩写，是一种软件架构模式。 MVC 把一个应用程序分成三个主要部分：模型（Model）、视图（View）和控制器 (Controller)。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/mvc"},{title:"什么是 MVVM？",date:"2023-03-07",lastmod:"2023-03-07",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"mvvm",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/mvvm.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/mvvm",subtoc:"architecture",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 MVVM？",summary:"MVVM是一种软件设计模式，即模型-视图-视图模型。它旨在分离应用程序的用户界面、业务逻辑和数据模型，使开发过程更加简便和灵活，方便测试和维护。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/mvvm"},{title:"什么是 SOLID 原则？",date:"2023-03-07",lastmod:"2023-03-07",toc:"backend",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"solid",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/solid.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/solid",subtoc:"architecture",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是 SOLID 原则？",summary:"本文介绍了SOLID 原则，包括单一职责原则、开放封闭原则、里氏替换原则、介面隔离原则和依赖反转原则。每个原则都有相应的范例，说明了如何遵循该原则以及如何修复违反该原则的代码。这些原则可以帮助开发人员设计出更加灵活、可重用和易于维护的代码。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/solid"}]}],"en-backend":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Backend interview questions",date:"2023-08-27",lastmod:"2024-01-27",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"backend",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/backend.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/backend",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/b03a120cf2d44a4090787ec114e449c8.png",summary:"This series compiles common backend interview questions, including database, API design, and backend architecture",href:"/en/swe/backend"}]},{title:"Basic",links:[{title:"What Is Git and Git Flow? How To Use It?",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"git-flow",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/git-flow.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/git-flow",subtoc:"basic",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is Git and Git Flow? How To Use It?",summary:"Ever wondered how large development teams manage code without stepping on each other's toes? Let's explore Git and Git Flow - the tools that transformed chaotic coding into organized collaboration.",href:"/en/swe/git-flow"},{title:"What is Nginx?",date:"2022-09-27",lastmod:"2025-07-17",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"why-nginx",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/why-nginx.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/why-nginx",subtoc:"basic",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is Nginx?",summary:"Nginx solves the C10K problem with event-driven architecture, handling thousands of concurrent connections efficiently. Learn how Nginx works as a reverse proxy, load balancer, and HTTP cache to build scalable web applications.",href:"/en/swe/why-nginx"},{title:"What is a CDN? Why Use a CDN?",date:"2025-11-16",lastmod:"2025-11-16",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-cdn",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/what-is-cdn.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/what-is-cdn",subtoc:"basic",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is a CDN? Why Use a CDN?",summary:"CDN (Content Delivery Network) accelerates static resource delivery through globally distributed edge nodes, reducing origin server load and improving system availability. Learn how CDN works and its applications in system design.",href:"/en/swe/what-is-cdn"},{title:"Beyond Basic Access Control: Understanding RBAC, ABAC, and ReBAC\xa0- A Guide to Modern Permission Systems",date:"2024-12-03",lastmod:"2024-12-03",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"permission-management-models",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/permission-management-models.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/permission-management-models",subtoc:"basic",order:40,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Beyond Basic Access Control: Understanding RBAC, ABAC, and ReBAC\xa0- A Guide to Modern Permission Systems",summary:"Discuss two methods of permission management: ACL and RBAC, explain their operating principles, advantages and disadvantages, and discuss how to choose the appropriate mode to meet the authorization needs of the system.",href:"/en/swe/permission-management-models"},{title:"What's the difference between Concurrency and Parallelism?",date:"2026-02-21",lastmod:"2026-02-21",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"concurrency-vs-parallelism",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism",subtoc:"basic",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What's the difference between Concurrency and Parallelism?",summary:"Concurrency and parallelism are often confused but represent fundamentally different approaches. Concurrency manages multiple tasks by switching between them on a single processing unit to reduce idle time, making it ideal for I/O-bound work. Parallelism executes multiple tasks simultaneously using multiple processing units, suited for speeding up CPU-bound work. Understanding this distinction is crucial for system design and technical interviews.",href:"/en/swe/concurrency-vs-parallelism"}]},{title:"API Design",links:[{title:"What is RESTful API? A Deep Dive into REST Architecture",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2025-07-13",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"restful-api",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/restful-api.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/restful-api",subtoc:"api",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is RESTful API? A Deep Dive into REST Architecture",summary:"Understand REST architecture through real examples. Learn why statelessness matters, how uniform interfaces work in practice, and what makes an API truly RESTful. We'll explore GitHub's API to see REST principles in action.",href:"/en/swe/restful-api"},{title:"What Is GraphQL?",date:"2023-03-07",lastmod:"2025-07-14",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"graphql",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/graphql.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/graphql",subtoc:"api",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is GraphQL?",summary:"GraphQL is a query language for APIs that solves the over-fetching and under-fetching problems of REST APIs. Instead of making multiple API calls, clients can request exactly the data they need in a single request. Learn when to use GraphQL, how it works, and see practical examples of GraphQL queries in action.",href:"/en/swe/graphql"},{title:"How to Choose between SOAP and REST for Your API ?",date:"2023-03-15",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"soap-vs-rest",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/soap-vs-rest.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/soap-vs-rest",subtoc:"api",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Choose between SOAP and REST?",summary:"SOAP and REST are both distributed computing network communication protocols, but they have many differences, such as transmission protocols, data formats, operation styles, and transmission efficiency. REST emphasizes simplicity, high degree of freedom, and easy expansion, which is suitable for scalable solutions, especially in Web applications. SOAP is more strict and can provide high security and transaction support. It is suitable for large enterprise systems to transmit complex and highly structured data, and ensure the integrity of messages.",href:"/en/swe/soap-vs-rest"},{title:"API Design — What Makes a Good API?",date:"2024-09-16",lastmod:"2024-09-16",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"good-api-design",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/good-api-design.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/good-api-design",subtoc:"api",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=API Design — What Makes a Good API?",summary:"Learn the essential principles of good API design: simplicity, readability, and focused scope. Understand how these characteristics make your APIs more usable and help teams work more effectively.",href:"/en/swe/good-api-design"},{title:"API Design — How to Build Stable and Predictable APIs (Understanding Idempotency)",date:"2024-10-17",lastmod:"2024-10-17",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis",subtoc:"api",order:25,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=API Design — How to Build Stable and Predictable APIs (Understanding Idempotency)",summary:"Learn how to design stable and predictable APIs using idempotency mechanisms to ensure system stability and consistency. This guide covers key concepts and practical implementation advice for various API designs.",href:"/en/swe/api-design-stable-predictable-idempotent-apis"},{title:"API Design — Optimizing Your Team's API Design Process",date:"2024-11-07",lastmod:"2024-11-07",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"api-design-process",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/api-design-process.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/api-design-process",subtoc:"api",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=API Design — Optimizing Your Team's API Design Process",summary:"From a senior engineer's perspective, explore how to improve your team's API quality through process optimization, design guidelines, and documentation. Learn practical steps to elevate your API design standards.",href:"/en/swe/api-design-process"}]},{title:"Database",links:[{title:"What is a Database Index? Why B+ Tree?",date:"2025-12-18",lastmod:"2025-12-18",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"database-index",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/database-index.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/database-index",subtoc:"database",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is a Database Index?",summary:"Database indexes are crucial for accelerating data retrieval. By creating indexes on specific columns, databases can quickly locate and fetch data instead of scanning entire tables, significantly improving query performance.",href:"/en/swe/database-index"},{title:"What is ACID? Understanding ACID Properties in Databases",date:"2023-02-09",lastmod:"2024-04-01",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"acid-intro",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/acid-intro.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/acid-intro",subtoc:"database",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is ACID? Understanding ACID Properties in Databases",summary:"ACID ensures database transactions are reliable through four key properties: Atomicity, Consistency, Isolation, and Durability. Learn why these matter for data integrity in your applications.",href:"/en/swe/acid-intro"},{title:"What is the N + 1 Query Problem? How to Avoid It Effectively?",date:"2026-01-25",lastmod:"2026-01-25",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"n-plus-one-problem",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/n-plus-one-problem.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/n-plus-one-problem",subtoc:"database",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is the N + 1 Query Problem%3F How to Avoid It Effectively%3F",summary:"The N + 1 query problem is a common database performance issue that occurs when an application executes one query to fetch a list, then runs additional queries for each result. This causes query count to scale linearly with data volume. Using JOIN or IN clauses can effectively prevent this problem.",href:"/en/swe/n-plus-one-problem"}]},{title:"Software Design and Architecture",links:[{title:"What is Object-Oriented Programming? (OOP)",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"object-oriented-programming",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/object-oriented-programming.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/object-oriented-programming",subtoc:"architecture",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is Object-Oriented Programming? (OOP)",summary:"This article introduces the three characteristics of object-oriented programming: encapsulation, inheritance, and polymorphism, and explains them using the example of a car class. Encapsulation can protect an objects internal state from direct access or modification, inheritance can reuse existing object code while also extending or modifying its functionality, and polymorphism allows an object to exhibit different behaviors depending on the context, improving program flexibility and extensibility.",href:"/en/swe/object-oriented-programming"},{title:"How to Refactor? What Are the Benefits of Refactoring?",date:"2023-03-03",lastmod:"2023-03-03",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-refactor",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/how-to-refactor.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/how-to-refactor",subtoc:"architecture",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Refactor? What Are the Benefits of Refactoring?",summary:"This article introduces the benefits and how to refactor. Refactoring can improve the readability, maintainability, performance, and security of the code. Refactoring can be performed when the code is duplicated, technical debt, adding new features, performance optimization, bug fixing, or team collaboration. Common refactoring techniques include Red-Green-Refactor, abstraction, and composing method.",href:"/en/swe/how-to-refactor"},{title:"What Is MVC?",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-02-05",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"mvc",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/mvc.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/mvc",subtoc:"architecture",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is MVC?",summary:"MVC is an architectural pattern that separates an application into three main logical components: the model, the view, and the controller. Each of these components are built to handle specific development aspects of an application.",href:"/en/swe/mvc"},{title:"What Is MVVM?",date:"2023-03-07",lastmod:"2023-03-07",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"mvvm",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/mvvm.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/mvvm",subtoc:"architecture",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Is MVVM?",summary:"MVVM is a software design pattern, i.e. Model-View-ViewModel. It aims to separate the application’s user interface, business logic, and data model, making the development process more convenient and flexible, and facilitating testing and maintenance.",href:"/en/swe/mvvm"},{title:"What Are the SOLID Principles?",date:"2023-03-07",lastmod:"2023-03-07",toc:"backend",lang:"en",fileName:"solid",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/solid.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/solid",subtoc:"architecture",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Are the SOLID Principles?",summary:"This article introduces the SOLID principles, including the Single Responsibility Principle, the Open-Closed Principle, the Liskov Substitution Principle, the Interface Segregation Principle, and the Dependency Inversion Principle. Each principle has a corresponding example that explains how to follow the principle and how to fix the code that violates the principle. These principles can help developers design more flexible, reusable, and maintainable code.",href:"/en/swe/solid"}]}],"zh-hant-coding-question":[{title:"目錄",links:[{title:"常見程式題詳解 - 導覽",date:"20