效率。探索可观测性与监控的差异。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-observability-and-why-it-matters"},{title:"SLO 是什么? 为什么 SLO 对软件团队很重要? ",date:"2026-02-01",lastmod:"2026-07-14",toc:"devops",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"slo-what-is-slo-and-how-to-set-slo",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/slo-what-is-slo-and-how-to-set-slo.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/slo-what-is-slo-and-how-to-set-slo",subtoc:"basic",order:51,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=SLO 是什么? 为什么 SLO 对软件团队很重要?",summary:"深入了解 SLO（服务水准目标）的定义，以及它在软件可靠性工程中的关键角色。本文说明 SLI、SLO 与 SLA 三者的差异，也补充为什么衡量可靠性时不该只看平均数，而应使用 P50、P95、P99 等百分位点来观察真实用户体验。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/slo-what-is-slo-and-how-to-set-slo"},{title:"什么是爆炸半径 (blast radius)? 如何有策略地缩减?",date:"2026-03-10",lastmod:"2026-05-09",toc:"devops",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-blast-radius-how-to-reduce-strategically",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/what-is-blast-radius-how-to-reduce-strategically.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-blast-radius-how-to-reduce-strategically",subtoc:"basic",order:52,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是爆炸半径 (blast radius)? 如何有策略地缩减?",summary:"深入探讨软件工程中的爆炸半径 (blast radius) 概念，并从 GitHub 近期可用性事故与开源项目迁出潮，说明为什么缩减事故影响范围对现代软件系统至关重要。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/what-is-blast-radius-how-to-reduce-strategically"},{title:"什么是混沌工程 (Chaos Engineering)? 为什么业界都在用?",date:"2026-04-26",lastmod:"2026-04-26",toc:"devops",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/swe/chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/swe/chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it",subtoc:"basic",order:53,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=什么是混沌工程 (Chaos Engineering)? 为什么业界都在用?",summary:"本文从 Netflix 的混沌猴谈起，说明混沌工程如何通过可控的故障注入，提前验证系统韧性与团队应变流程。你会看到混沌工程的核心价值、真实案例，以及落地执行的四个步骤。",href:"/zh-hans/swe/chaos-engineering-why-industry-uses-it"}]}],"en-devops":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"DevOps Development and Operations - Navigation",date:"2024-01-29",lastmod:"2024-01-29",toc:"devops",lang:"en",fileName:"devops",fi