aintaining runbooks, deploying in small batches, using feature flags, clarifying roles, and creating enough psychological safety for people to stay calm under pressure.",href:"/en/swe/incident-response-team"},{title:"How to Diagnose Problems and Fix Errors During Incidents?",date:"2026-07-29",lastmod:"2026-07-29",toc:"devops",lang:"en",fileName:"incident-diagnosis-fix",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/incident-diagnosis-fix.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/incident-diagnosis-fix",subtoc:"basic",order:22,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Diagnose Problems and Fix Errors During Incidents?",summary:"This article explains how engineering teams can diagnose problems and fix errors in a structured way during incidents. It summarizes the effective troubleshooting approach from Google's SRE book, including triage and examination, diagnosis, hypothesis testing, and the principle of stopping the bleeding before digging into root cause.",href:"/en/swe/incident-diagnosis-fix"},{title:"What are Feature Flags? Why Use Feature Flags?",date:"2025-01-20",lastmod:"2025-01-20",toc:"devops",lang:"en",fileName:"feature-flags",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/feature-flags.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/feature-flags",subtoc:"basic",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What are Feature Flags? Why Use Feature Flags?",summary:"Feature flags enable gradual rollouts and canary deployments, reducing risk by avoiding full releases that could cause catastrophic impact. Learn how feature flags improve software stability through practical examples and real-world applications.",href:"/en/swe/feature-flags"},{title:"What Are the Key Stages in Software Production Deployment?",date:"2025-02-17",lastmod:"2025-02-17",toc:"devops",lang:"en",fileName:"production-process",filePath:"src/pages/en/swe/production-process.md",fullPath:"/en/swe/production-process",subtoc:"basic",order:40,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Are the Key Stages in Software Production Deployment?",summary: