s/career/use-linkedin-for-job-hunting.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/use-linkedin-for-job-hunting",subtoc:"job-search",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=LinkedIn 求职技巧：如何善用 LinkedIn 来找到理想的工作？",summary:"了解如何善用 LinkedIn，提升求职成功机会。这篇文章提供 LinkedIn 优化指南，教你如何优化 LinkedIn 页面、使用关键字策略、建立专业人脉，并探索协作文章功能，让你更轻松找到理想工作。",href:"/zh-hans/career/use-linkedin-for-job-hunting"},{title:"如何有效提高获得面试的成功率",date:"2024-01-29",lastmod:"2024-01-29",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"improve-get-interview",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/improve-get-interview.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/improve-get-interview",subtoc:"job-search",order:6,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/0068459ac2e34caab992944b08b33fa2.png",summary:"要如何提高求职成功率，相信是多数人感兴趣的议题。前 Google 工程师 NeetCode 先前分享了一个谈论这主题的短片，看到后觉得挺不错的，在此摘要同时加上我们的一些延伸想法与大家分享。",href:"/zh-hans/career/improve-get-interview"},{title:"如何提高通过面试的成功率？",date:"2024-02-20",lastmod:"2024-02-20",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"improve-pass-interview",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/improve-pass-interview.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/improve-pass-interview",subtoc:"job-search",order:7,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/8435dc351e084672a3b858f18e84524a.png",summary:"如何提高通过面试的成功率？本文将从面试官的角度出发，探讨面试中需要展现哪些讯号，才能让面试官留下深刻印象。除了技术能力之外，沟通能力也是面试中非常重要的考量指标。文章中将引用 Google 的技术面试评标准，并提供实用的建议，帮助你在面试中展现良好的沟通能力，提高通过面试的成功率。",href:"/zh-hans/career/improve-pass-interview"},{title:"面试前花 15 分钟做这三件事，让你留给面试官深刻的印象",date:"2024-05-20",lastmod:"2024-05-20",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"15-min-prepare-interview",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/15-min-prepare-interview.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/15-min-prepare-interview",subtoc:"job-search",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面试前花 15 分钟做这三件事，让你留给面试官深刻的印象",summary:"在面试前花 15 分钟做这三件事：查看面试官资讯、浏览公司网站、搜寻公司最新新闻，让你在面试官心中留下深刻印象，提升录取机会",href:"/zh-hans/career/15-min-prepare-interview"},{title:"Coffee Chat 是什么? 如何在职涯善用 Coffee Chat?",date:"2025-03-14",lastmod:"2025-03-14",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"coffee-chat",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/coffee-chat.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/coffee-chat",subtoc:"job-search",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Coffee Chat 是什么? 如何在职涯善用 Coffee Chat?",summary:"Coffee Chat 是什么？本文介绍 Coffee Chat 的定义与价值，从面对面到线上资讯访谈，教你如何透过与业界前辈对话获取职涯建议、建立人脉，并为未来内推铺路。提供实用谈话主题与注意事项，助你善用 Coffee Chat 提升职场竞争力。",href:"/zh-hans/career/coffee-chat"},{title:"面试新创公司时，应该要问的问题",date:"2025-07-04",lastmod:"2025-07-04",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"questions-to-ask-when-interviewing-at-a-startup",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/questions-to-ask-when-interviewing-at-a-startup.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/questions-to-ask-when-interviewing-at-a-startup",subtoc:"job-search",order:40,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面试新创公司时，应该要问的问题",summary:"想加入新创公司？面试时该问哪些关键问题？本文整理 PostHog 执行长 James Hawkins 的建议，教你如何询问产品市场契合度、公司财务稳定性及个人贡献方向，助你评估新创潜力，做出明智职涯选择。",href:"/zh-hans/career/questions-to-ask-when-interviewing-at-a-startup"}]},{title:"提升英文能力",links:[{title:"如何培养英文能力？分享 5 招自学方法 (土生土长 TOEFL 115+)",date:"2023-01-15",lastmod:"2023-01-15",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-i-learn-english",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-i-learn-english.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-i-learn-english",subtoc:"english",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何培养英文能力？分享 5 招自学方法 (土生土长 TOEFL 115+)",summary:"这篇主要会着重在务实面的英文能力养成的五种方法，包括:为自己打造全英文环境、从有兴趣的主题开始学英文、提升英语口说方法等...。很多人会说在台湾没有学好英文的环境。从客观层面来说，因为官方语言不是英文，所以的确在日常中没有太多用到英文的机会。但是这不代表没有办法在台湾为自己创造一个可以持续精进英文的环境。可以藉由把自己平常接触的内容，都转换成英文的，但这实践起来不容易。如果要让做这件事的门槛降低，推荐先从自己感兴趣的主题下手。如果你是想要面试海外工作，我会推荐先多下功夫在你的领域上。找工作不像考托福，托福会有五花八门各种主题，所以你需要懂不同的单字，你要能在不同情境下回答口说问题；但是找工作则不是，所以如果要投资报酬效益高一点，建议专注在掌握你的领域的常用字。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-i-learn-english"},{title:"找海外程序员，英文要多好？",date:"2023-01-09",lastmod:"2023-01-09",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-proficient-should-your-english-be",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-proficient-should-your-english-be.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-proficient-should-your-english-be",subtoc:"english",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=找海外程序员，英文要多好？",summary:"要找海外程序员外语能力需要到什么程度? 到德国当工程师需要会德文吗? 英文多益八百分足够海外求职吗? 需要懂各国的腔调吗? 平时要如何提升英文程度呢? 这让我意识到，有蛮大一部分的人之所以对于找海外工作有迟疑，不是因为技术能力不足，而是外语能力受限。所以决定要整理两篇文章，一篇谈找海外工作需要的英文程度，另一篇谈我过去提升英文的学习经验与方法。这篇是谈找海外工作需要的英文程度。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-proficient-should-your-english-be"},{title:"最近软件业大裁员，这些裁员相关英文词汇你都看得懂吗?",date:"2023-01-28",lastmod:"2023-01-28",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"layoff-related-terms-in-english",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/layoff-related-terms-in-english.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/layoff-related-terms-in-english",subtoc:"english",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=最近软件业大裁员，这些裁员相关英文词汇你都看得懂吗?",summary:"最近软件业大厂小厂接力裁员，看到一些英文新闻、英文论坛(Blind) 的词汇时，没有很懂，例如一开始看不懂国外乡民说的RIF 是指什么；或是看到LinkedIn 上看到有人说自己的职位is made redundant，查了才知道原来redundant 除了多余的意思，还有被裁员的意思。于是想说整理一篇裁员相关的英文单字，在这阵裁员潮的新闻或网路讨论时，可以看比较懂。",href:"/zh-hans/career/layoff-related-terms-in-english"},{title:"12 个在海外科技业工作的英文常用句",date:"2024-10-22",lastmod:"2024-10-22",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"common-english-phrases-must-know",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/common-english-phrases-must-know.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/common-english-phrases-must-know",subtoc:"english",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=12 个在海外科技业工作的英文常用句",summary:"了解 12 个海外科技业常用的英文句子及其中文解释，帮助读者在外商职场更自如地沟通。这些句子涵盖会议用语、策略讨论及技术沟通，适合有志于海外工作的工程师掌握。",href:"/zh-hans/career/common-english-phrases-must-know"}]}],"en-job-hunting":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Job Hunting and Resume Tips",date:"2024-01-23",lastmod:"2024-01-23",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"en",fileName:"job-hunting",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/job-hunting.md",fullPath:"/en/career/job-hunting",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Job Hunting and Resume Tips",summary:"This series compiles common articles on job hunting and resumes, covering topics such as improving English proficiency, resume skills, and sharing job hunting channels and techniques.",href:"/en/career/job-hunting"}]},{title:"Resume Tips",links:[{title:"How to Prepare Resume Content Long-Term: 3 Areas to Build",date:"2025-09-04",lastmod:"2025-09-04",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"en",fileName:"resume-keyword",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/resume-keyword.md",fullPath:"/en/career/resume-keyword",subtoc:"resume",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=長期準備履歷的要點：透過 3 個面向累積",summary:"Great resumes are not built in a weekend. This article explains how to intentionally build stronger resume material over time by accumulating measurable outcomes, role-relevant technical keywords, and soft-skill evidence that hiring teams care about.",href:"/en/career/resume-keyword"},{title:"Software Engineer Resume Guide: How I Landed Interviews at Amazon, TikTok, and More",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"en",fileName:"english-resume-writing",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/english-resume-writing.md",fullPath:"/en/career/english-resume-writing",subtoc:"resume",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=軟體工程師的英文履歷全攻略 — 這樣寫讓我拿到 Amazon、TikTok 等大廠面試",summary:"If you want software engineering interviews, your resume still does most of the heavy lifting. This guide covers practical resume structure, one-page formatting, keyword strategy, results-driven writing, and action-verb phrasing so your experience is easier for recruiters and hiring managers to evaluate quickly.",href:"/en/career/english-resume-writing"},{title:"Use ChatGPT to Improve Your English Resume: Software Engineer Edition",date:"2023-02-12",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"en",fileName:"use-ChatGPT-to-help-you-polish-swe-resume",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/use-ChatGPT-to-help-you-polish-swe-resume.md",fullPath:"/en/career/use-ChatGPT-to-help-you-polish-swe-resume",subtoc:"resume",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=用 ChatGPT 幫自己修英文履歷 — 軟體工程師篇",summary:"This walkthrough shows how software engineers can use ChatGPT to turn rough Chinese resume bullets into stronger English resume lines. It covers practical prompts, iterative refinement steps, and how to validate AI-generated claims before using them in real applications.",href:"/en/career/use-ChatGPT-to-help-you-polish-swe-resume"},{title:"Use ChatGPT to Improve Your English Resume: UI/UX Designer Edition",date:"2023-02-12",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"en",fileName:"use-ChatGPT-to-help-you-polish-uiux-resume",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/use-ChatGPT-to-help-you-polish-uiux-resume.md",fullPath:"/en/career/use-ChatGPT-to-help-you-polish-uiux-resume",subtoc:"resume",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=用 ChatGPT 幫自己修英文履歷 — UI/UX 設計師篇",summary:"This article shows a practical prompt workflow for UI/UX designers to improve English resume bullets with ChatGPT. It covers critique prompts, rewrite prompts, quantitative polishing, and how to keep AI output concise and truthful before sending applications.",href:"/en/career/use-ChatGPT-to-help-you-polish-uiux-resume"},{title:"Cursor VP of Engineering on Writing Resumes That Actually Get Seen",date:"2026-05-12",lastmod:"2026-05-12",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"en",fileName:"cursor-vp-resume-tips",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/cursor-vp-resume-tips.md",fullPath:"/en/career/cursor-vp-resume-tips",subtoc:"resume",order:31,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Cursor 工程副總談，如何寫履歷讓求職申請更容易被看見",summary:"Based on reviewing hundreds of recent applications, Cursor VP of Engineering Lee Robinson shared practical advice for making engineering resumes stand out. This article breaks down his recommendations on one-page resumes, portfolio and GitHub quality, role-specific tailoring, and clearly showing AI workflow experience.",href:"/en/career/cursor-vp-resume-tips"}]},{title:"Job Hunting",links:[{title:"Software Engineers: How to Let Jobs Come to You",date:"2025-09-01",lastmod:"2025-09-01",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-attract-job-opportunities",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-to-attract-job-opportunities.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-to-attract-job-opportunities",subtoc:"job-search",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Software Engineers: How to Let Jobs Come to You",summary:"What if you never had to write another cover letter or cold-apply to companies again? Through three real success stories, discover how software engineers can attract opportunities by building in public, contributing to open source, and showcasing their work effectively.",href:"/en/career/how-to-attract-job-opportunities"},{title:"Beyond LinkedIn and Job Boards: 3 Methods to Help You Find Software Engineering Jobs",date:"2024-01-23",lastmod:"2024-01-23",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"en",fileName:"programs-that-increase-your-chance-of-getting-a-job",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/programs-that-increase-your-chance-of-getting-a-job.md",fullPath:"/en/career/programs-that-increase-your-chance-of-getting-a-job",subtoc:"job-search",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Beyond LinkedIn and Job Boards: 3 Methods to Help You Find Software Engineering Jobs",summary:"Discover unconventional paths to secure software engineering jobs. Explore referral networks, apprenticeship programs, and mentorship initiatives like MLH Fellowship and Formation. Boost your job hunting success with these alternative approaches.",href:"/en/career/programs-that-increase-your-chance-of-getting-a-job"},{title:"Questions You Should Ask When Interviewing at a Startup",date:"2025-07-04",lastmod:"2025-07-04",toc:"job-hunting",lang:"en",fileName:"questions-to-ask-when-interviewing-at-a-startup",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/questions-to-ask-when-interviewing-at-a-startup.md",fullPath:"/en/career/questions-to-ask-when-interviewing-at-a-startup",subtoc:"job-search",order:40,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Questions You Should Ask When Interviewing at a Startup",summary:"Thinking about joining a startup? Learn what questions to ask during your interview to evaluate if the company is worth your time. Based on insights from PostHog CEO James Hawkins, this guide covers how to assess product-market fit, financial stability, and your potential impact.",href:"/en/career/questions-to-ask-when-interviewing-at-a-startup"}]},{title:"Improve English",links:[]}],"zh-hant-behavioral":[{title:"目錄",links:[{title:"行為面試解析與題庫 — 導覽",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2023-08-26",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"behavioral",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/behavioral.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/behavioral",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=行為面試解析與題庫",summary:"本系列彙整了常見的行為面試解析與題庫文章，包含面試準備要訣、行為面試解析與題庫，以及談薪技巧分享",href:"/zh-hant/career/behavioral"}]},{title:"面試準備要訣",links:[{title:"透過 STAR 原則，有架構地回答行為面試問題",date:"2022-11-29",lastmod:"2022-11-29",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"star-method",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/star-method.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/star-method",subtoc:"tips",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=透過 STAR 原則，有架構地回答行為面試問題",summary:"回答行為面試 (behavior interview) 的方式有很多種，但是若想要在簡短的面試中，有架構地清楚回答，STAR 原則是非常推薦的方法。",href:"/zh-hant/career/star-method"},{title:"如何準備前端面試？超完整經驗分享",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"experience-how-to-prepare-frontend-interview",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/experience-how-to-prepare-frontend-interview.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/experience-how-to-prepare-frontend-interview",subtoc:"tips",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何準備前端面試？超完整經驗分享",summary:"前端面試的種類非常多，不同公司往往也會有不同的面試類型。舉例來說，通常軟體大廠即使是前端職位也是會考資料結構與演算法 (俗稱 LeetCode 題、刷題)，但多數公司的前端職位面試都不太需要刷題。又或是比較資深的工程師會有前端系統設計面試，但資淺一點的職位則多半不會有。會建議在面試前，針對你申請的公司上網搜尋或打聽該公司會面哪類的題目，然後可以特別針對該類題目做準備。如果要面試海外的工作，Glassdoor 或者 Blind 上可以找到一些前人分享的面試心得。以下整理了不同類型的面試，以及針對這些不同類的面試，可以如何準備。",href:"/zh-hant/career/experience-how-to-prepare-frontend-interview"},{title:"如何準備前端面試？常見疑問的 Q&A",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-prepare-frontend-interview-q-and-a",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-prepare-frontend-interview-q-and-a.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-prepare-frontend-interview-q-and-a",subtoc:"tips",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何準備前端面試？常見疑問的 Q&A",summary:"本篇文章整理了在準備前端面試的常見問題，著重在筆者是如何前端面試、時程規劃、心得和準備技巧，文章最後也分享了一些讀者寄信來詢問的問題，包括要辭職找工作嗎？工作很忙怎麼安排時間在職找工作？如何準備前端面試等",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-prepare-frontend-interview-q-and-a"},{title:"Amazon 工程總監分享的 25 個技術面試要點",date:"2023-12-29",lastmod:"2023-12-29",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"25-technical-interview-tips",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/25-technical-interview-tips.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/25-technical-interview-tips",subtoc:"tips",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Amazon 工程總監分享的 25 個技術面試要點",summary:"\uDB40\uDC20Amazon 工程總監 Omar Halabieh 分享了 25 個技術面試的要點，這篇文章翻譯成中文與大家分享，同時談其中最讓我們覺得有感的要點",href:"/zh-hant/career/25-technical-interview-tips"},{title:"面試技巧：如何在行為面試讓人覺得你像資深工程師？",date:"2024-07-24",lastmod:"2024-07-24",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"behave-like-a-senior",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/behave-like-a-senior.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/behave-like-a-senior",subtoc:"tips",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面試技巧：如何在行為面試讓人覺得你像資深工程師？",summary:"在行為面試中，展示資深工程師的思維和行為是成功的關鍵。本文深入探討了初階、中階和資深工程師在思考開發與寫程式上的不同行為，並提供實戰題目解析，幫助你在面試中脫穎而出，拿到更高的職級。",href:"/zh-hant/career/behave-like-a-senior"}]},{title:"行為面試解析與題庫",links:[{title:"面試時如何自我介紹? 一起練習回答 Tell me about yourself",date:"2022-10-27",lastmod:"2024-06-05",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"self-introduction",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/self-introduction.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/self-introduction",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面試時如何自我介紹? 一起練習回答 Tell me about yourself",summary:"自我介紹幾乎是每個面試都會問到的問題，假如回答這問題時，只是千篇壹律地說自己過去讀的學校、做過的工作，可能沒辦法在面試官心中留下太多印象。因此這篇文章，我們將會分析如何回答這個問題。",href:"/zh-hant/career/self-introduction"},{title:"如何回答「你的缺點是什麼」這類最常見的面試問題",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-is-your-weakness",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/what-is-your-weakness.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/what-is-your-weakness",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何回答「你的缺點是什麼」這類最常見的面試問題",summary:"這一題是很常見的「你的優點為何?」、「說說你的缺點」類問題。這不僅是在英文面試很常出現的，在中文面試也很常出現。除了工作面試外，在申請學校面試也很常見。讓我們一起來看看比爾蓋茲怎麼回答吧！",href:"/zh-hant/career/what-is-your-weakness"},{title:"面試被問「你缺乏相關經驗，公司為什麼要選你」該怎麼回答呢?",date:"2023-02-17",lastmod:"2023-02-17",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"why-should-we-hire-you",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/why-should-we-hire-you.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/why-should-we-hire-you",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面試被問「你缺乏相關經驗，公司為什麼要選你」該怎麼回答呢?",summary:"在英文面試時 Why should we hire you? 這個問題常以不同形式出現。不論是新鮮人剛畢業沒有工作經驗，或是想要轉職去新領域但缺乏背景，都很常會被問到「為什麼要選你? 而不是其他更有經驗的人選?」當遇到這個問題時，該如何有效回答呢? 該如何說服人你是公司該選的人才?",href:"/zh-hant/career/why-should-we-hire-you"},{title:"面試如何回答「為什麼想離開前公司」或「為什麼想換工作」？",date:"2022-10-25",lastmod:"2024-08-03",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"why-quit-current-job",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/why-quit-current-job.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/why-quit-current-job",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面試如何回答「為什麼想離開前公司」或「為什麼想換工作」？",summary:"在面試中被問到「為什麼想離開前公司？」這類問題時，如何用正向表述來回答，不僅能避免給 HR 留下負面印象，還能強調自己對新機會的興奮與契合，本文詳述了多種實用的回應策略，幫助求職者在求職過程中表現更佳。",href:"/zh-hant/career/why-quit-current-job"},{title:"面試如何回答「請分享你曾在工作上碰過的困難與挑戰，以及你是如何解決的」？",date:"2022-11-29",lastmod:"2022-11-29",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-did-you-deal-with-challenges",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=請分享你曾在工作上碰過的困難與挑戰，以及你是如何解決的",summary:"如何解決在工作上遇到的困難與挑戰，是行為面試很常會出現的問題。在實際工作中，困難與挑戰是無可避免的，透過這個問題，面試官可以了解你過去如何應對困難與挑戰，藉此推估如果未來你加入到團隊，又會如何應對潛在的困難與挑戰。讓我們透過這篇文章，一起來分析如何準備這個題目。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges"},{title:"面試如何回答「請分享一個你曾經收過的回饋，以及收到該回饋後你如何應對」？",date:"2022-12-08",lastmod:"2022-12-08",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-did-you-deal-with-feedback",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=請分享一個你曾經收過的回饋，以及收到該回饋後你如何應對",summary:"在團隊合作中，回饋是非常重要的元素。透過給予和接受回饋，可以讓團隊中的個人變得更好，也可以讓團隊的協作改善。因此在行為面試中，「過去接受過哪些回饋?以及收到該回饋後你如何應對」是非常重要的題目。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback"}]},{title:"談出滿意的薪水",links:[{title:"拿到 offer 後談薪水 — 讓我多談 35% 的談薪筆記",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2023-09-01",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-negotiate-your-big-tech-offer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-negotiate-your-big-tech-offer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-negotiate-your-big-tech-offer",subtoc:"salary-negotiation",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=拿到 offer 後談薪水 — 讓我多談 35% 的談薪筆記",summary:"探索談判技巧，在獲得首份FAANG工程師職位後，巧妙獲得更有利的薪資條件。了解如何避免即時接受低薪提議，以及展現自信、克服談判恐懼的方法。透過保留底線、充分利用多重待遇等策略，爭取更優越的薪資待遇。內容真誠表達對加入公司的渴望，同時引用其他相關文章作參考。通過這篇文章，您將更精明地處理薪資談判，達成更滿意的結果。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-negotiate-your-big-tech-offer"}]}],"zh-hans-behavioral":[{title:"目录",links:[{title:"行为面试解析与题库—导览",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2023-08-26",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"behavioral",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/behavioral.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/behavioral",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=行为面试解析与题库—导览",summary:"本系列汇整了常见的行为面试解析与题库文章，包含面试准备要诀、行为面试解析与题库，以及谈薪技巧分享",href:"/zh-hans/career/behavioral"}]},{title:"面试准备要诀",links:[{title:"透过 STAR 原则，有架构地回答行为面试问题",date:"2022-11-29",lastmod:"2022-11-29",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"star-method",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/star-method.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/star-method",subtoc:"tips",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=透过 STAR 原则，有架构地回答行为面试问题",summary:"回答行为面试 (behavior interview) 的方式有很多种，但是若想要在简短的面试中，有架构地清楚回答，STAR 原则是非常推荐的方法。",href:"/zh-hans/career/star-method"},{title:"如何准备前端面试？超完整经验分享",date:"2023-02-05",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"experience-how-to-prepare-frontend-interview",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/experience-how-to-prepare-frontend-interview.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/experience-how-to-prepare-frontend-interview",subtoc:"tips",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何准备前端面试？超完整经验分享",summary:"前端面试的种类非常多，不同公司往往也会有不同的面试类型。举例来说，通常软件大厂即使是前端职位也是会考资料结构与演算法(俗称LeetCode 题、刷题)，但多数公司的前端职位面试都不太需要刷题。又或是比较资深的工程师会有前端系统设计面试，但资浅一点的职位则多半不会有。会建议在面试前，针对你申请的公司上网搜寻或打听该公司会面哪类的题目，然后可以特别针对该类题目做准备。如果要面试海外的工作，Glassdoor 或者Blind 上可以找到一些前人分享的面试心得。以下整理了不同类型的面试，以及针对这些不同类的面试，可以如何准备。",href:"/zh-hans/career/experience-how-to-prepare-frontend-interview"},{title:"如何准备前端面试？常见疑问的 Q&A",date:"2023-02-04",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-prepare-frontend-interview-q-and-a",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-prepare-frontend-interview-q-and-a.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-prepare-frontend-interview-q-and-a",subtoc:"tips",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何准备前端面试？常见疑问的 Q&A",summary:"本篇文章整理了在准备前端面试的常见问题，着重在笔者是如何前端面试、时程规划、心得和准备技巧，文章最后也分享了一些读者寄信来询问的问题，包括要辞职找工作吗？工作很忙怎么安排时间在职找工作？如何准备前端面试等",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-prepare-frontend-interview-q-and-a"},{title:"Amazon 工程总监分享的 25 个技术面试要点",date:"2023-12-29",lastmod:"2023-12-29",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"25-technical-interview-tips",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/25-technical-interview-tips.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/25-technical-interview-tips",subtoc:"tips",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Amazon 工程总监分享的 25 个技术面试要点",summary:"\uDB40\uDC20Amazon 工程总监 Omar Halabieh 分享了 25 个技术面试的要点，这篇文章翻译成中文与大家分享，同时谈其中最让我们觉得有感的要点",href:"/zh-hans/career/25-technical-interview-tips"},{title:"面试技巧：如何在行为面试让人觉得你像资深工程师？",date:"2024-07-24",lastmod:"2024-07-24",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"behave-like-a-senior",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/behave-like-a-senior.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/behave-like-a-senior",subtoc:"tips",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面试技巧：如何在行为面试让人觉得你像资深工程师？",summary:"在行为面试中，展示资深工程师的思维和行为是成功的关键。本文深入探讨了初阶、中阶和资深工程师在思考开发与写程式上的不同行为，并提供实战题目解析，帮助你在面试中脱颖而出，拿到更高的职级。",href:"/zh-hans/career/behave-like-a-senior"}]},{title:"行为面试解析与题库",links:[{title:"面试时如何自我介绍? 一起练习回答 Tell me about yourself",date:"2022-10-27",lastmod:"2024-06-05",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"self-introduction",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/self-introduction.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/self-introduction",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面试时如何自我介绍? 一起练习回答 Tell me about yourself",summary:"自我介绍几乎是每个面试都会问到的问题，假如回答这问题时，只是千篇壹律地说自己过去读的学校、做过的工作，可能没办法在面试官心中留下太多印象。因此这篇文章，我们将会分析如何回答这个问题。",href:"/zh-hans/career/self-introduction"},{title:"「你的缺点是什么」这类最常见的面试问题",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-is-your-weakness",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/what-is-your-weakness.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/what-is-your-weakness",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=「你的缺点是什么」这类最常见的面试问题",summary:"这一题是很常见的「你的优点为何?」、「说说你的缺点」类问题。这不仅是在英文面试很常出现的，在中文面试也很常出现。除了工作面试外，在申请学校面试也很常见。让我们一起来看看比尔盖兹怎么回答吧！ ",href:"/zh-hans/career/what-is-your-weakness"},{title:"面试被问「你缺乏相关经验，公司为什么要选你」该怎么回答呢?",date:"2023-02-17",lastmod:"2023-02-17",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-should-we-hire-you",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/why-should-we-hire-you.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/why-should-we-hire-you",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面试被问「你缺乏相关经验，公司为什么要选你」该怎么回答呢?",summary:"在英文面试时Why should we hire you? 这个问题常以不同形式出现。不论是新鲜人刚毕业没有工作经验，或是想要转职去新领域但缺乏背景，都很常会被问到「为什么要选你? 而不是其他更有经验的人选?」当遇到这个问题时，该如何有效回答呢? 该如何说服人你是公司该选的人才?",href:"/zh-hans/career/why-should-we-hire-you"},{title:"面试如何回答「为什么想离开前公司」或「为什么想换工作」？",date:"2022-10-25",lastmod:"2024-08-03",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-quit-current-job",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/why-quit-current-job.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/why-quit-current-job",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面试如何回答「为什么想离开前公司」或「为什么想换工作」？",summary:"在面试中被问到「为什么想离开前公司？」这类问题时，如何用正向表述来回答，不仅能避免给 HR 留下负面印象，还能强调自己对新机会的兴奋与契合，本文详述了多种实用的回应策略，帮助求职者在求职过程中表现更佳。",href:"/zh-hans/career/why-quit-current-job"},{title:"请分享你曾在工作上碰过的困难与挑战，以及你是如何解决的",date:"2022-11-29",lastmod:"2022-11-29",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-did-you-deal-with-challenges",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请分享你曾在工作上碰过的困难与挑战，以及你是如何解决的",summary:"如何解决在工作上遇到的困难与挑战，是行为面试很常会出现的问题。在实际工作中，困难与挑战是无可避免的，透过这个问题，面试官可以了解你过去如何应对困难与挑战，借此推估如果未来你加入到团队，又会如何应对潜在的困难与挑战。让我们透过这篇文章，一起来分析如何准备这个题目。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges"},{title:"请分享一个你曾经收过的回馈，以及收到该回馈后你如何应对",date:"2022-12-08",lastmod:"2022-12-08",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-did-you-deal-with-feedback",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=请分享一个你曾经收过的回馈，以及收到该回馈后你如何应对",summary:"在团队合作中，回馈是非常重要的元素。透过给予和接受回馈，可以让团队中的个人变得更好，也可以让团队的协作改善。因此在行为面试中，「过去接受过哪些回馈?以及收到该回馈后你如何应对」是非常重要的题目。 ",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback"}]},{title:"谈出满意的薪水",links:[{title:"拿到 offer 后谈薪水 — 让我多谈 35% 的谈薪笔记",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2022-12-02",toc:"behavioral",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-negotiate-your-big-tech-offer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-negotiate-your-big-tech-offer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-negotiate-your-big-tech-offer",subtoc:"salary-negotiation",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=拿到 offer 后谈薪水 — 让我多谈 35% 的谈薪笔记",summary:"从结果而论，虽然我有录取FAANG 公司，也录取目前世界最大独角兽公司，但连面试都没发给我的公司不胜枚举(基本上你想得到的国际软件大公司我都投了)。这让我深刻体会到，在不稳定的大环境下求职，真的蛮大一部分的因素不在自己的掌握中。举例来说，今年新加坡我也有投Foodpanda，然后连面试都没有拿到，而在我投的当周，就看到他们新加坡办公室大裁员。而新加坡Shopee 虽然有拿到面试，但OA 与一面结束后，等了快三周没收到回覆，然后就看到新闻报导出他们大裁员(九月底时)，所以就没有后续。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-negotiate-your-big-tech-offer"}]}],"en-behavioral":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Behavioral Interview Tips",date:"2023-08-27",lastmod:"2023-08-27",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"behavioral",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/behavioral.md",fullPath:"/en/career/behavioral",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Behavioral Interview Tips",summary:"In this series, we list out common behavioral interview questions and tips",href:"/en/career/behavioral"}]},{title:"Interview Tips",links:[{title:"Ace Your Job Interview with the STAR Method",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"star-method",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/star-method.md",fullPath:"/en/career/star-method",subtoc:"tips",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Ace Your Job Interview with the STAR Method",summary:"Learn how to successfully ace your next job interview using the STAR method. This powerful tool will help you prepare and communicate your experiences in a clear and concise manner, making you a top candidate for the position you desire.",href:"/en/career/star-method"}]},{title:"Behavioral Interview Questions",links:[{title:"Tell Me About Yourself",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"self-introduction",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/self-introduction.md",fullPath:"/en/career/self-introduction",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Tell Me About Yourself",summary:"Make a lasting impression in your interview by effectively answering the self-introduction question. Our guide covers the purpose, making a strong first impression, creating a connection, customizing your introduction, and linking your past to your future.",href:"/en/career/self-introduction"},{title:"What Are Your Strengths and Weaknesses?",date:"2023-02-15",lastmod:"2023-02-15",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"what-is-your-weakness",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/what-is-your-weakness.md",fullPath:"/en/career/what-is-your-weakness",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Are Your Strengths and Weaknesses?",summary:"Business Insider has published an article called Questions for job interviews answered by Bill Gates. I was curious about what Bill Gates would say to the common interview questions, so I watched the video and summarized his answers. I hope this article can help you to prepare for your next interview!",href:"/en/career/what-is-your-weakness"},{title:"Without any job experience, why should we hire you?",date:"2023-02-17",lastmod:"2023-02-17",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"why-should-we-hire-you",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/why-should-we-hire-you.md",fullPath:"/en/career/why-should-we-hire-you",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Without any job experience, why should we hire you?",summary:"During an interview, the question Why should we hire you? often comes in different forms. Whether you are a fresh graduate with no work experience or someone who wants to switch to a new field but lacks background, you are often asked Why should we choose you over someone more experienced? When faced with this question, how can you effectively answer it? Let us take a look together",href:"/en/career/why-should-we-hire-you"},{title:"Why Did You Leave Your Last Job?",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"why-quit-current-job",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/why-quit-current-job.md",fullPath:"/en/career/why-quit-current-job",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why Did You Leave Your Last Job?",summary:'\'Changing jobs often involves facing common HR questions such as "Why do you want to change jobs?" and "Why do you want to leave your current company?" These questions serve as a way for HR to ensure that the candidate is a good fit for the company and will not leave soon after being hired. In this article, we will explore how to effectively answer these questions, including the importance of avoiding criticism of the former company and common reasons for job changes.\'',href:"/en/career/why-quit-current-job"},{title:"Describe a Situation When You Faced a Challenge at Work and How You Overcame It?",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"how-did-you-deal-with-challenges",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Describe a Situation When You Faced a Challenge at Work and How You Overcame It?",summary:"This question is often asked in behavioral interviews to gauge your ability to handle difficult situations in the workplace. The interviewer wants to understand how you have responded to challenges in the past, as it can give insight into how you may handle potential challenges in the future if you were to join their team. To prepare for this topic, it is important to have specific examples ready that demonstrate your problem-solving skills and resilience.",href:"/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-challenges"},{title:"Describe an Experience with Receiving Challenging Feedback and How It Was Managed",date:"2023-02-13",lastmod:"2023-02-13",toc:"behavioral",lang:"en",fileName:"how-did-you-deal-with-feedback",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback",subtoc:"behavioral-interview",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Describe an Experience with Receiving Challenging Feedback and How It Was Managed",summary:"Learn how to answer behavioral interview questions about feedback effectively by understanding the question, preparing your response, and following the structure of a proposed answer.",href:"/en/career/how-did-you-deal-with-feedback"}]}],"zh-hant-promotion":[{title:"目錄",links:[{title:"科技業升遷攻略 — 導覽",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2023-08-26",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"promotion",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/promotion.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/promotion",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=科技業升遷攻略",summary:"本系列彙整了科技業升遷要訣相關主題文章",href:"/zh-hant/career/promotion"}]},{title:"成為高效工程師",links:[{title:"成為高效工程師之前，先追求做好",date:"2024-08-29",lastmod:"2024-08-29",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"doing-well-first",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/doing-well-first.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/doing-well-first",subtoc:"effective",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=成為高效工程師之前，先追求做好",summary:"成為高效工程師的關鍵：從「做」到「做好」，打造高品質輸出。 本文深入探討工程師在工作中常見的迷思，強調「做好」比「做完」更重要。透過具體案例，說明如何將抽象的「做好」概念落實到實際工作中。此外，文章也指出，主動承擔責任、拓展工作範疇，以及持續優化流程的重要性。",href:"/zh-hant/career/doing-well-first"},{title:"軟體工程師都該有的炫耀文件 (brag document)",date:"2024-08-01",lastmod:"2024-08-01",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"brag-document",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/brag-document.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/brag-document",subtoc:"effective",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=軟體工程師都該有的炫耀文件 (brag document)",summary:"炫耀文件 (Brag Document) 是軟體工程師用來記錄和展示成果的關鍵工具。透過定期記錄工作成就，不僅能加強主管對你的印象、提升績效考核結果，還能為未來的求職和面試提供豐富的素材。學會使用 STAR 方法來記錄這些成就，並加上學習和反思，將助你在職場中更具競爭力。",href:"/zh-hant/career/brag-document"},{title:"軟體工程師如何排定優先順序？",date:"2024-08-30",lastmod:"2024-08-30",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"prioritize",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/prioritize.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/prioritize",subtoc:"effective",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=軟體工程師如何排定優先順序？",summary:"了解軟體工程師如何毫不留情地排定優先順序，提高工作效率。透過衡量「影響力/所花的時間」來決定該專注的工作項目，避免因無法取捨而陷入效率低下的困境，掌握真正能帶來升遷與成果的關鍵技巧。",href:"/zh-hant/career/prioritize"},{title:"想在新團隊中迅速建立關係並有效合作？高效工程師的團隊合作技巧",date:"2024-09-07",lastmod:"2024-09-07",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"build-relationships-with-your-team",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/build-relationships-with-your-team.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/build-relationships-with-your-team",subtoc:"effective",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=想在新團隊中迅速建立關係並有效合作？高效工程師的團隊合作技巧",summary:"想在新團隊中迅速建立關係並有效合作？本篇文章分享多個實用策略，包括主動與同事交流、了解團隊成員的協作偏好、製作個人「工作說明書」，幫助你與團隊更緊密合作，成為更高效的軟體工程師。",href:"/zh-hant/career/build-relationships-with-your-team"},{title:"軟體工程師如何有效與工程經理協作，快速提升職涯",date:"2024-09-07",lastmod:"2024-09-07",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"software-engineers-collaborate-with-managers",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/software-engineers-collaborate-with-managers.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/software-engineers-collaborate-with-managers",subtoc:"effective",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=軟體工程師如何有效與工程經理協作？",summary:"如何與工程經理 (EM) 或技術領導經理 (TLM) 有效協作，對於軟體工程師的職涯發展至關重要。本文深入探討如何辨別不適合作為協作對象的工程經理類型，並分享具體的協作建議，幫助工程師從與工程經理的互動中獲得最大效益。",href:"/zh-hant/career/software-engineers-collaborate-with-managers"},{title:"如何做好向上管理？與主管溝通的 6 個技巧",date:"2024-08-28",lastmod:"2024-08-28",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-manage-up-successfully",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-manage-up-successfully.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-manage-up-successfully",subtoc:"effective",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何做好向上管理？與主管溝通的 6 個技巧",summary:"學會向上管理，提升與主管溝通的技巧。本文提供 6 個實用策略，包括瞭解主管溝通偏好、講重點、有方案、檢查清單、情緒管理，遠離有毒主管，設定協作邊界，幫助你與主管建立健康的工作關係。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-manage-up-successfully"},{title:"工程師技術溝通策略：如何有效同理與表達觀點",date:"2024-09-30",lastmod:"2024-09-30",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"swe-communicate-effectively",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/swe-communicate-effectively.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/swe-communicate-effectively",subtoc:"effective",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=工程師技術溝通策略：如何有效同理與表達觀點",summary:"工程師的技術溝通不僅限於程式碼審查，還包括同理對方的難處與清晰表達觀點。本文分享有效溝通技巧，幫助工程師在職場上更高效協作與表達。",href:"/zh-hant/career/swe-communicate-effectively"},{title:"軟體工程師如何做好專案技術負責人的角色？",date:"2024-10-08",lastmod:"2024-10-08",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"project-tech-lead-role-best-practices",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/project-tech-lead-role-best-practices.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/project-tech-lead-role-best-practices",subtoc:"effective",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=軟體工程師如何做好專案技術負責人的角色？",summary:"擔任專案技術負責人，不僅僅是處理技術問題，更是從需求確認到技術方案比較，再到分工與時程規劃的全方位掌控者。本文深入探討了技術負責人應具備的能力，包括需求確認、技術分析、架構設計與團隊協作，並分享實務經驗，讓你能在專案中領導技術團隊取得成功。",href:"/zh-hant/career/project-tech-lead-role-best-practices"},{title:"工程師在專案不同階段，必問的核心問題",date:"2024-12-10",lastmod:"2024-12-10",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"swe-must-ask-questions-in-project",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/swe-must-ask-questions-in-project.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/swe-must-ask-questions-in-project",subtoc:"effective",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=工程師在專案不同階段，必問的核心問題",summary:"資深工程師的成長關鍵在於思考能力與提問技巧。本篇文章深入探討如何透過提問提升專案品質，並提供實用範例與框架，幫助讀者邁向資深之路。",href:"/zh-hant/career/swe-must-ask-questions-in-project"},{title:"資深工程師的思考力 — 開會與反思檢討該提什麼問題?",date:"2025-03-13",lastmod:"2025-03-13",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"senior-engineer-thinking-meeting-reflection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/senior-engineer-thinking-meeting-reflection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/senior-engineer-thinking-meeting-reflection",subtoc:"effective",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=資深工程師的思考力 — 開會與反思檢討該提什麼問題?",summary:"資深工程師如何透過會議前、中、後的關鍵提問，提升團隊效率與決策品質？本文分享實務問題，助你善用會議時間，並介紹反思檢討的技巧，幫助工程師持續成長。",href:"/zh-hant/career/senior-engineer-thinking-meeting-reflection"},{title:"工程師如何高效率開會、避免無效會議?",date:"2025-06-12",lastmod:"2025-06-12",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"efficient-meetings-for-engineers",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/efficient-meetings-for-engineers.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/efficient-meetings-for-engineers",subtoc:"effective",order:35,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=工程師如何高效率開會、避免無效會議??",summary:"工程師在成為資深角色後，必須學會高效主持會議。本篇整理會前準備與常見誤區，幫助你避免無效會議。",href:"/zh-hant/career/efficient-meetings-for-engineers"},{title:"如何有效在團隊導入新技術、新工具?",date:"2025-03-25",lastmod:"2025-03-25",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team",subtoc:"effective",order:40,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效在團隊導入新技術、新工具?",summary:"探討如何有效在團隊導入新技術與工具，以 Google 廁所測試案例為例，分享「先做再說」與尋找夥伴的實務原則，助你推動改變。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team"},{title:"如何有效主持會議、高效帶技術討論?",date:"2025-08-06",lastmod:"2025-08-06",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-lead-effective-tech-meetings",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-lead-effective-tech-meetings.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-lead-effective-tech-meetings",subtoc:"effective",order:45,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效主持會議、高效帶技術討論?",summary:"本文延續工程師會議效率主題，聚焦在「會議負責人」角色，探討主持技術會議時應有的思維與實用技巧，幫助團隊高效進行討論與決策，避免會議時間浪費與討論失焦。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-lead-effective-tech-meetings"},{title:"在職涯中如何有效尋求協助?",date:"2025-12-05",lastmod:"2025-12-05",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",subtoc:"effective",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在職涯中如何有效尋求協助?",summary:"在軟體工程師的職涯中，相信多數人或多或少會遇到自己沒辦法單獨解決的問題，在這種狀況下「尋求協助」會變得很重要。然而，許多人可能基於「不好意思打擾人」或「擔心被人拒絕」，又或者是其他各類的理由，沒有主動去尋求協助，不願意開口提問，導致自己問題卡了很久，讓自己感到折騰被折磨。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career"},{title:"如何有效面對模糊的工作任務?",date:"2026-04-08",lastmod:"2026-04-08",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",subtoc:"effective",order:47,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效面對模糊的工作任務?",summary:"在軟體工程工作中，許多任務一開始都不會被清楚定義。本文用「導入 AI」案例，對比面對模糊時的兩種行為，說明主動釐清目標、提出假設並持續對齊的重要性。也進一步解釋為何 navigating ambiguity 是邁向資深工程師不可或缺的核心能力。",href:"/zh-hant/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks"}]},{title:"升遷要訣",links:[{title:"剛入職新團隊要如何快速進入狀況",date:"2022-12-04",lastmod:"2022-12-04",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-ramp-up-at-work",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-ramp-up-at-work.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-ramp-up-at-work",subtoc:"tips",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=剛入職新團隊要如何快速進入狀況",summary:"在換工作或是換組後，很可能會遇到與原本做的事毫不相關的全新業務，會碰到陌生的程式碼，需要了解沒碰過的商業邏輯，同時也要跟新同事們建立關係。筆者過去曾經待過兩個截然不同的軟體開發團隊，也體認到快速融入團隊、快速開始能有產出的重要性。所以在今年換工作前，特別花了點時間研究這個主題。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-ramp-up-at-work"},{title:"1 on 1 聊什麼？如何有效利用 1 on 1 幫助職涯發展",date:"2022-12-31",lastmod:"2022-12-31",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-1-on-1",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-1-on-1.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-1-on-1",subtoc:"tips",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=1 on 1 聊什麼？如何有效利用 1 on 1 幫助職涯發展",summary:"在多數的軟體大廠，工程師都會定期跟主管有 1:1 會議，然而很多時候大家不太知道如何好好把握 1:1 會議的時間。以筆者自己過去待過的兩間公司，我自己覺得都沒有在 1:1 上做得太好 (不論是主管或我自己)，很多時候不知道要聊什麼，就這樣帶著尷尬地聊一些不是太重要的事，白白耗掉那寶貴的時間。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-1-on-1"},{title:"如何有效通過試用期、降低被 PIP 的風險?",date:"2025-10-05",lastmod:"2025-10-05",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip",subtoc:"tips",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效通過試用期、降低被 PIP 的風險?",summary:"整理試用期期間的重點策略，幫助工程師順利轉正並遠離 PIP 風險。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip"},{title:"軟體工程師的職涯路徑概覽",date:"2024-12-20",lastmod:"2024-12-20",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"career-framework",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/career-framework.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/career-framework",subtoc:"tips",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=軟體工程師的職涯路徑概覽",summary:"深入解析軟體工程師的職涯發展路徑，從初階工程師到技術長，剖析不同職級的職責與技能重點，並比較技術與管理路線的差異，助你規劃清晰的職涯目標。",href:"/zh-hant/career/career-framework"},{title:"軟體工程師如何在職涯持續成長?",date:"2024-12-20",lastmod:"2024-12-20",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"career-growth",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/career-growth.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/career-growth",subtoc:"tips",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=軟體工程師如何在職涯持續成長?",summary:"分享工程師職涯成長的三大策略：主動尋求回饋、擴大守備範圍與讓自己可被取代，結合實用建議幫助讀者提升技能與職涯層級。",href:"/zh-hant/career/career-growth"},{title:"資深工程師的自我檢核清單",date:"2025-02-10",lastmod:"2025-02-10",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"senior-self-check",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/senior-self-check.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/senior-self-check",subtoc:"tips",order:16,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=資深工程師的自我檢核清單",summary:"探索資深工程師必備的軟硬實力，透過檢核清單提升自我，專注重要決策、團隊協作與技術深度，邁向更高職涯階段。",href:"/zh-hant/career/senior-self-check"},{title:"如何有效從初階工程師升遷到資深?",date:"2025-02-25",lastmod:"2025-02-25",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"effectively-advance-junior-to-senior",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/effectively-advance-junior-to-senior.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/effectively-advance-junior-to-senior",subtoc:"tips",order:18,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效從初階工程師升遷到資深?",summary:"想從初階工程師升遷到資深？關鍵不只是技術，還包括領域知識與團隊協作能力。本篇深入解析升遷所需的三大核心能力，並提供實用策略，幫助你提前準備，成功邁向下一階段。",href:"/zh-hant/career/effectively-advance-junior-to-senior"},{title:"初階工程師 L3 與中階工程師 L4 的區別是什麼？升遷到中階工程師 L4 具體要做什麼？",date:"2023-12-20",lastmod:"2023-12-20",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"l3-to-l4",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/l3-to-l4.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/l3-to-l4",subtoc:"tips",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=初階工程師 L3 與中階工程師 L4 的區別是什麼？升遷到中階工程師 L4 具體要做什麼？",summary:"在軟體大廠的升遷中，有件跟我過去以為的很不同的差別處是「假如把現階段職級的事情都做得很好，不代表能升遷到下個職級」。原因其實不難理解，因為能勝任現在的職級，不代表能做好下個職級在做的事。那你可能會問「該如何做才能升到下個職級？」，其實很簡單，就是做下個職級要做的事。唯有當你持續展現出自己有能力做下一個職級在做的事，才會被認定夠格升遷到下一職級。",href:"/zh-hant/career/l3-to-l4"},{title:"中階工程師 L4 與資深工程師 L5 的差別？如何升遷到資深工程師 L5？",date:"2023-12-20",lastmod:"2023-12-20",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"l4-to-l5",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/l4-to-l5.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/l4-to-l5",subtoc:"tips",order:35,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=中階工程師 L4 與資深工程師 L5 的差別？如何升遷到資深工程師 L5？",summary:"一般來說，L4 是指中階工程師，而如果想要在科技大廠成為資深，需要往 L5 邁進。在這篇文章中，我們將摘要究竟什麼是 L5 資深工程師。",href:"/zh-hant/career/l4-to-l5"},{title:"如何成為更有影響力的工程師?",date:"2026-02-18",lastmod:"2026-02-18",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-become-influential-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer",subtoc:"tips",order:36,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何成為更有影響力的工程師?",summary:"許多工程師擔心自己做的工作沒有影響力，但其實同樣的問題可以有不同層次的解決方法。本文探討如何從提升可靠性開始，逐步邁向更有影響力的工程師。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer"}]}],"zh-hans-promotion":[{title:"目录",links:[{title:"科技业升迁攻略—导览",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2023-08-26",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"promotion",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/promotion.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/promotion",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=科技业升迁攻略—导览",summary:"本系列汇整了科技业升迁要诀相关主题文章",href:"/zh-hans/career/promotion"}]},{title:"成为高效工程师",links:[{title:"成为高效工程师之前，先追求做好",date:"2024-08-29",lastmod:"2024-08-29",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"doing-well-first",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/doing-well-first.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/doing-well-first",subtoc:"effective",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=成为高效工程师之前，先追求做好",summary:"成为高效工程师的关键：从「做」到「做好」，打造高品质输出。 本文深入探讨工程师在工作中常见的迷思，强调「做好」比「做完」更重要。透过具体案例，说明如何将抽象的「做好」概念落实到实际工作中。此外，文章也指出，主动承担责任、拓展工作范畴，以及持续优化流程的重要性。",href:"/zh-hans/career/doing-well-first"},{title:"软体工程师都该有的炫耀文件 (brag document)",date:"2024-08-01",lastmod:"2024-08-01",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"brag-document",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/brag-document.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/brag-document",subtoc:"effective",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=软体工程师都该有的炫耀文件 (brag document)",summary:"炫耀文件 (Brag Document) 是软体工程师用来记录和展示成果的关键工具。透过定期记录工作成就，不仅能加强主管对你的印象、提升绩效考核结果，还能为未来的求职和面试提供丰富的素材。学会使用 STAR 方法来记录这些成就，并加上学习和反思，将助你在职场中更具竞争力。",href:"/zh-hans/career/brag-document"},{title:"软体工程师如何排定优先顺序？",date:"2024-08-30",lastmod:"2024-08-30",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"prioritize",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/prioritize.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/prioritize",subtoc:"effective",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=软体工程师如何排定优先顺序？",summary:"了解软体工程师如何毫不留情地排定优先顺序，提高工作效率。透过衡量「影响力/所花的时间」来决定该专注的工作项目，避免因无法取舍而陷入效率低下的困境，掌握真正能带来升迁与成果的关键技巧。",href:"/zh-hans/career/prioritize"},{title:"想在新团队中迅速建立关系并有效合作？高效工程师的团队合作技巧",date:"2024-09-07",lastmod:"2024-09-07",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"build-relationships-with-your-team",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/build-relationships-with-your-team.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/build-relationships-with-your-team",subtoc:"effective",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=想在新团队中迅速建立关系并有效合作？高效工程师的团队合作技巧",summary:"想在新团队中迅速建立关系并有效合作？本篇文章分享多个实用策略，包括主动与同事交流、了解团队成员的协作偏好、制作个人「工作说明书」，帮助你与团队更紧密合作，成为更高效的软体工程师。",href:"/zh-hans/career/build-relationships-with-your-team"},{title:"软体工程师如何有效与工程经理协作，快速提升职涯",date:"2024-09-07",lastmod:"2024-09-07",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"software-engineers-collaborate-with-managers",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/software-engineers-collaborate-with-managers.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/software-engineers-collaborate-with-managers",subtoc:"effective",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=软体工程师如何有效与工程经理协作？",summary:"如何与工程经理 (EM) 或技术领导经理 (TLM) 有效协作，对于软体工程师的职涯发展至关重要。本文深入探讨如何辨别不适合作为协作对象的工程经理类型，并分享具体的协作建议，帮助工程师从与工程经理的互动中获得最大效益。",href:"/zh-hans/career/software-engineers-collaborate-with-managers"},{title:"如何做好向上管理？与主管沟通的 6 个技巧",date:"2024-08-28",lastmod:"2024-08-28",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-manage-up-successfully",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-manage-up-successfully.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-manage-up-successfully",subtoc:"effective",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何做好向上管理？与主管沟通的 6 个技巧",summary:"学会向上管理，提升与主管沟通的技巧。本文提供 6 个实用策略，包括了解主管沟通偏好、讲重点、有方案、检查清单、情绪管理，远离有毒主管，设定协作边界，帮助你与主管建立健康的工作关系。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-manage-up-successfully"},{title:"工程师技术沟通策略：如何有效同理与表达观点",date:"2024-09-30",lastmod:"2024-09-30",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"swe-communicate-effectively",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/swe-communicate-effectively.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/swe-communicate-effectively",subtoc:"effective",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=工程师技术沟通策略：如何有效同理与表达观点",summary:"工程师的技术沟通不仅限于程式码审查，还包括同理对方的难处与清晰表达观点。本文分享有效沟通技巧，帮助工程师在职场上更高效协作与表达。",href:"/zh-hans/career/swe-communicate-effectively"},{title:"软体工程师如何做好专案技术负责人的角色？",date:"2024-10-08",lastmod:"2024-10-08",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"project-tech-lead-role-best-practices",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/project-tech-lead-role-best-practices.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/project-tech-lead-role-best-practices",subtoc:"effective",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=软体工程师如何做好专案技术负责人的角色？",summary:"担任专案技术负责人，不仅仅是处理技术问题，更是从需求确认到技术方案比较，再到分工与时程规划的全方位掌控者。本文深入探讨了技术负责人应具备的能力，包括需求确认、技术分析、架构设计与团队协作，并分享实务经验，让你能在专案中领导技术团队取得成功。",href:"/zh-hans/career/project-tech-lead-role-best-practices"},{title:"工程师在专案不同阶段，必问的核心问题",date:"2024-12-10",lastmod:"2024-12-10",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"swe-must-ask-questions-in-project",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/swe-must-ask-questions-in-project.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/swe-must-ask-questions-in-project",subtoc:"effective",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=工程师在专案不同阶段，必问的核心问题",summary:"资深工程师的成长关键在于思考能力与提问技巧。本篇文章深入探讨如何透过提问提升专案品质，并提供实用范例与框架，帮助读者迈向资深之路。",href:"/zh-hans/career/swe-must-ask-questions-in-project"},{title:"资深工程师的思考力 — 开会与反思检讨该提什么问题?",date:"2025-03-13",lastmod:"2025-03-13",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"senior-engineer-thinking-meeting-reflection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/senior-engineer-thinking-meeting-reflection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/senior-engineer-thinking-meeting-reflection",subtoc:"effective",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=资深工程师的思考力 — 开会与反思检讨该提什么问题?",summary:"资深工程师如何透过会议前、中、后的关键提问，提升团队效率与决策品质？本文分享实务问题，助你善用会议时间，并介绍反思检讨的技巧，帮助工程师持续成长。",href:"/zh-hans/career/senior-engineer-thinking-meeting-reflection"},{title:"工程师如何高效率开会、避免无效会议?",date:"2025-06-12",lastmod:"2025-06-12",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"efficient-meetings-for-engineers",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/efficient-meetings-for-engineers.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/efficient-meetings-for-engineers",subtoc:"effective",order:35,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=工程师如何高效率开会、避免无效会议??",summary:"工程师在成为资深角色后，必须学会高效主持会议。本篇整理会前准备与常见误区，帮助你避免无效会议。",href:"/zh-hans/career/efficient-meetings-for-engineers"},{title:"如何有效在团队导入新技术、新工具?",date:"2025-03-25",lastmod:"2025-03-25",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team",subtoc:"effective",order:40,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效在团队导入新技术、新工具?",summary:"探讨如何有效在团队导入新技术与工具，以 Google 厕所测试案例为例，分享「先做再说」与寻找伙伴的实务原则，助你推动改变。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team"},{title:"如何有效主持会议、高效带技术讨论?",date:"2025-08-06",lastmod:"2025-08-06",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-lead-effective-tech-meetings",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-lead-effective-tech-meetings.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-lead-effective-tech-meetings",subtoc:"effective",order:45,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效主持会议、高效带技术讨论?",summary:"本文延续工程师会议效率主题，聚焦在「会议负责人」角色，探讨主持技术会议时应有的思维与实用技巧，帮助团队高效进行讨论与决策，避免会议时间浪费与讨论失焦。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-lead-effective-tech-meetings"},{title:"在职涯中如何有效寻求协助?",date:"2025-12-05",lastmod:"2025-12-05",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",subtoc:"effective",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在职涯中如何有效寻求协助?",summary:"在软件工程师的职涯中，相信多数人或多或少会遇到自己没办法单独解决的问题，在这种状况下「寻求协助」会变得很重要。然而，许多人可能基于「不好意思打扰人」或「担心被人拒绝」，又或者是其他各类的理由，没有主动去寻求协助，不愿意开口提问，导致自己问题卡了很久，让自己感到折腾被折磨。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career"},{title:"如何有效面对模糊的工作任务?",date:"2026-04-08",lastmod:"2026-04-08",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",subtoc:"effective",order:47,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效面对模糊的工作任务?",summary:"在软件工程工作中，很多任务一开始都不会被清晰定义。本文通过“导入 AI”案例，对比面对模糊时的两种行为，说明主动澄清目标、提出假设并持续对齐的重要性。也进一步解释了为什么 navigating ambiguity 是迈向资深工程师不可或缺的核心能力。",href:"/zh-hans/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks"}]},{title:"升迁要诀",links:[{title:"刚入职新团队要如何快速进入状况",date:"2022-12-04",lastmod:"2022-12-04",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-ramp-up-at-work",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-ramp-up-at-work.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-ramp-up-at-work",subtoc:"tips",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=刚入职新团队要如何快速进入状况",summary:"在换工作或是换组后，很可能会遇到与原本做的事毫不相关的全新业务，会碰到陌生的代码，需要了解没碰过的商业逻辑，同时也要跟新同事们建立关系。笔者过去曾经待过两个截然不同的软件开发团队，也体认到快速融入团队、快速开始能有产出的重要性。所以在今年换工作前，特别花了点时间研究这个主题。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-ramp-up-at-work"},{title:"1 on 1 聊什么？如何有效利用 1 on 1 帮助职涯发展",date:"2022-12-31",lastmod:"2022-12-31",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-1-on-1",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-1-on-1.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-1-on-1",subtoc:"tips",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=1 on 1 聊什么？如何有效利用 1 on 1 帮助职涯发展",summary:"在多数的软件大厂，工程师都会定期跟主管有1:1 会议，然而很多时候大家不太知道如何好好把握1:1 会议的时间。以笔者自己过去待过的两间公司，我自己觉得都没有在1:1 上做得太好(不论是主管或我自己)，很多时候不知道要聊什么，就这样带着尴尬地聊一些不是太重要的事，白白耗掉那宝贵的时间。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-1-on-1"},{title:"如何有效通过试用期、降低被 PIP 的风险?",date:"2025-10-05",lastmod:"2025-10-05",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip",subtoc:"tips",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何有效通过试用期、降低被 PIP 的风险?",summary:"整理试用期期间的关键策略，帮助工程师顺利转正并远离 PIP 风险。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip"},{title:"软体工程师的职涯路径概览",date:"2024-