tps://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=初阶工程师 L3 与中阶工程师 L4 的区别是什么？升迁到中阶工程师 L4 具体要做什么？",summary:"在软体大厂的升迁中，有件跟我过去以为的很不同的差别处是「假如把现阶段职级的事情都做得很好，不代表能升迁到下个职级」。原因其实不难理解，因为能胜任现在的职级，不代表能做好下个职级在做的事。那你可能会问「该如何做才能升到下个职级？」，其实很简单，就是做下个职级要做的事。唯有当你持续展现出自己有能力做下一个职级在做的事，才会被认定够格升迁到下一职级。",href:"/zh-hans/career/l3-to-l4"},{title:"中阶工程师 L4 与资深工程师 L5 的差别？如何升迁到资深工程师 L5？",date:"2023-12-20",lastmod:"2023-12-20",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"l4-to-l5",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/l4-to-l5.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/l4-to-l5",subtoc:"tips",order:35,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=中阶工程师 L4 与资深工程师 L5 的差别？如何升迁到资深工程师 L5？",summary:"一般来说，L4 是指中阶工程师，而如果想要在科技大厂成为资深，需要往 L5 迈进。在这篇文章中，我们将摘要究竟什么是 L5 资深工程师。",href:"/zh-hans/career/l4-to-l5"},{title:"如何成为更有影响力的工程师?",date:"2026-02-18",lastmod:"2026-02-18",toc:"promotion",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-become-influential-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer",subtoc:"tips",order:36,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何成为更有影响力的工程师?",summary:"许多工程师担心自己做的工作没有影响力，但其实同样的问题可以有不同层次的解决方法。本文探讨如何从提升可靠性开始，逐步迈向更有影响力的工程师。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer"}]}],"en-promotion":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Promotion in Tech - Overview",date:"2024-03-10",lastmod:"2024-03-10",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"promotion",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/promotion.md",fullPath:"/en/career/promotion",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Promotion in Tech - Overview",summary:"This series compiles articles on key aspects of promotion in the tech industry.",href:"/en/career/promotion"}]},{title:"Becoming an Effective Engineer",links:[{title:"Ho to Build Strong Relationships and Collaborate Effectively in Your New Team?",date:"2024-09-07",lastmod:"2024-09-07",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"build-relationships-with-your-team",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/build-relationships-with-your-team.md",fullPath:"/en/career/build-relationships-with-your-team",subtoc:"effective",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Build Strong Relationships and Collaborate Effectively in Your New Team?",summary:"Want to build strong relationships and collaborate effectively in your new team? This article shares practical strategies, including proactively connecting with colleagues, understanding team members' collaboration preferences, and creating a personal 'How to Work With Me' document to help you collaborate more closely with your team and become a more effective software engineer.",href:"/en/career/build-relationships-with-your-team"},{title:"How Engineers Can Run Efficient Meetings and Avoid Wasted Time",date:"2025-06-12",lastmod:"2025-06-12",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"efficient-meetings-for-engineers",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/efficient-meetings-for-engineers.md",fullPath:"/en/career/efficient-meetings-for-engineers",subtoc:"effective",order:35,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How Engineers Can Run Efficient Meetings and Avoid Wasted Time",summary:"As engineers advance to senior roles, they must learn to run effective meetings. This guide covers preparation strategies and common pitfalls to help you avoid ineffective meetings.",href:"/en/career/efficient-meetings-for-engineers"},{title:"How to Effectively Advocate For New Technologies and Tools in Your Team",date:"2025-07-10",lastmod:"2025-07-10",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team",subtoc:"effective",order:40,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Effectively Advocate For New Technologies and Tools in Your Team",summary:"Learn how to successfully advocate for new technologies and tools in your team using Google's famous 'Testing on the Toilet' case study. Discover the 'show and tell' approach and how to find allies for change.",href:"/en/career/how-to-adopt-tech-tools-in-team"},{title:"How to Seek Help Effectively in Your Software Engineering Career?",date:"2025-12-05",lastmod:"2025-12-05",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career",subtoc:"effective",order:46,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Seek Help Effectively in Your Software Engineering Career?",summary:"In a software engineer's career, most people encounter problems they cannot solve alone. In such situations, 'seeking help' becomes crucial. However, many hesitate to ask for help due to fears like 'not wanting to bother others' or 'worrying about rejection.' This indecision can leave problems unresolved for extended periods, causing frustration and wasted time.",href:"/en/career/how-to-seek-help-effectively-in-career"},{title:"How to Effectively Handle Ambiguous Work Tasks?",date:"2026-04-08",lastmod:"2026-04-08",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks.md",fullPath:"/en/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks",subtoc:"effective",order:47,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Effectively Handle Ambiguous Work Tasks?",summary:"In software engineering, many tasks are not clearly defined at the start. Using an “introduce AI to the team” scenario, this article contrasts two common reactions to ambiguity and explains why proactively clarifying goals, forming hypotheses, and aligning with stakeholders matters. It also shows why navigating ambiguity is a core skill for engineers aiming to grow into senior roles.",href:"/en/career/handle-ambiguous-work-tasks"}]},{title:"Tech Career Promotion",links:[{title:"How to ramp up at work?",date:"2024-01-23",lastmod:"2024-01-23",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-ramp-up-at-work",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-to-ramp-up-at-work.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-to-ramp-up-at-work",subtoc:"tips",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to ramp up at work?",summary:"When switching jobs or teams, encountering entirely new tasks, unfamiliar code, understanding unexplored business logic, and building relationships with new colleagues are common challenges. Drawing from experience in two distinct software development teams, the author emphasizes the importance of rapid team integration and quick productivity. This article summarizes key insights and helpful approaches for those joining a new team.",href:"/en/career/how-to-ramp-up-at-work"},{title:"How to pass probation and avoid being put on a PIP?",date:"2025-10-05",lastmod:"2025-10-05",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip",subtoc:"tips",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to pass probation and avoid being put on a PIP?",summary:"Key strategies engineers can use to navigate probation confidently, earn trust, and stay far away from a PIP.",href:"/en/career/how-to-pass-probation-avoid-pip"},{title:"How to Become a More Influential Engineer?",date:"2026-02-18",lastmod:"2026-02-18",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-become-influential-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer",subtoc:"tips",order:36,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Become a More Influential Engineer?",summary:"Many engineers worry their work lacks impact, but the same problem can be solved in different ways with varying levels of influence. This article explores how to become more impactful, starting with building reliability.",href:"/en/career/how-to-become-influential-engineer"}]},{title:"Others",links:[{title:"How to get the return offer as a software engineering intern?",date:"2024-03-10",lastmod:"2024-03-10",toc:"promotion",lang:"en",fileName:"how-to-get-return-offer",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/how-to-get-return-offer.md",fullPath:"/en/career/how-to-get-return-offer",subtoc:"others",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to get the return offer as a software engineering intern?",summary:"Getting an internship at a top tech company is just the first step. The real challenge? Turning that temporary gig into a full-time offer. It's a high bar, but with the right mindset and hustle, you can blow their expectations out of the water",href:"/en/career/how-to-get-return-offer"}]}],"zh-hant-career-talk":[{title:"目錄",links:[{title:"科技與職涯思維 — 導覽",date:"2023-10-12",lastmod:"2023-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"career-talk",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/career-talk.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/career-talk",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=科技與職涯思維",summary:"本系列彙整了科技與職涯思維的專欄文章，包含工作選擇、職涯思維、職涯發展與方向、職涯回顧與心得，以及面試心得",href:"/zh-hant/career/career-talk"}]},{title:"工作選擇",links:[{title:"Blind 75 作者的軟體工程師職涯選擇",date:"2024-07-02",lastmod:"2024-07-02",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"blind-75-career-share",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/blind-75-career-share.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/blind-75-career-share",subtoc:"job-choose",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Blind 75 作者的軟體工程師職涯選擇",summary:"探索 Blind 75 作者從 Meta 離職創業的軟體工程師職涯選擇，了解他如何憑藉熱愛分享和前端開發創立 GreatFrontend，並為前端工程師提供面試準備和技能提升的資源。本文還提供專屬 20% 折扣碼，助你提升前端能力。",href:"/zh-hant/career/blind-75-career-share"},{title:"職涯路徑該選產品開發? 還是選基礎建設?",date:"2023-12-29",lastmod:"2023-12-29",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"product-or-infra",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/product-or-infra.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/product-or-infra",subtoc:"job-choose",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=職涯路徑該選產品開發? 還是選基礎建設?",summary:"在升到主任工程師之前，不論選產品端 (product) 或走基礎建設 (infra)，影響上並沒有那麼大，兩條路線都能順利升遷到主任工程師。只是往下一個階段升遷，這兩個路線就有區別。從技術的角度來看，走基礎建設路線的工程師，比較能有高的技術影響力，因為一個優化就可以讓下游使用該技術的工程團隊都獲益 (這讓人想到 GPT-3.5 升級到 GPT-4 後，對世界的影響量級非常可觀)。這是走產品開發的工程師比較難有的。",href:"/zh-hant/career/product-or-infra"},{title:"Paul Graham 《How to Start Google》- 做自己感興趣的事",date:"2024-04-08",lastmod:"2024-04-08",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"do-what-you-interested",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/do-what-you-interested.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/do-what-you-interested",subtoc:"job-choose",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=讀 Paul Graham 《How to Start Google》- 做自己感興趣的事",summary:"Paul Graham 在《How to Start Google》一文中談到，年輕人創立像 Google 規模公司的三個要素是精通科技、有點子與共同創辦人。他建議年輕人不要刻意預測熱門科技，而是選擇自己感興趣的領域精進，透過動手做專案來學習。當你學會某個技術，你看待世界的視角將會截然不同，許多潛在的新創點子也將因此而生。Facebook、Apple、Google 早期都是從創辦人感興趣的問題開始，先解決自身周遭的問題，再逐步發展成大公司。",href:"/zh-hant/career/do-what-you-interested"},{title:"做 To B 與 To C 的前端開發有什麼不同?",date:"2023-12-31",lastmod:"2023-12-31",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"to-b-or-to-c",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/to-b-or-to-c.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/to-b-or-to-c",subtoc:"job-choose",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=做 To B 與 To C 的前端開發有什麼不同?",summary:"前端工程是一個很廣泛的名詞，很可能都是做前端工程師，但你的工作內容跟另一個人完全不同。雖然都是前端開發，產品開發、多媒體開發、設計系統、前端架構，這幾個類別會有非常不同的工作內容。進一步說，光是做產品開發的前端，To C 的產品與 To B 的產品，就有很不同的側重點。讓我們在這一期聊聊他們的區別。",href:"/zh-hant/career/to-b-or-to-c"},{title:"諾貝爾獎得主本庶佑談「該如何選要投入的領域」",date:"2025-10-12",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"tasuku-honjo-choose-field",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/tasuku-honjo-choose-field.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/tasuku-honjo-choose-field",subtoc:"job-choose",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=諾貝爾獎得主本庶佑談「該如何選要投入的領域」",summary:"整理諾貝爾獎得主本庶佑對於挑選投入領域時的思考重點，作為職涯選擇的參考。",href:"/zh-hant/career/tasuku-honjo-choose-field"}]},{title:"職涯思維",links:[{title:"AI 時代要花更多時間做 AI 做不到的事",date:"2024-10-21",lastmod:"2024-10-21",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"focus-on-what-ai-cannot-do-in-ai-era",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/focus-on-what-ai-cannot-do-in-ai-era.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/focus-on-what-ai-cannot-do-in-ai-era",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=AI 時代要花更多時間做 AI 做不到的事",summary:"在 AI 時代，工程師與招聘者需投入更多時間在人際連結上，如參與技術小聚與實體會議，來進行更有效的互動與求職。",href:"/zh-hant/career/focus-on-what-ai-cannot-do-in-ai-era"},{title:"ChatGPT 之父 Sam Altman 反思 17 件希望早點知道的事",date:"2023-12-23",lastmod:"2023-12-23",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"sam-altman-rethink-17-things",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/sam-altman-rethink-17-things.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/sam-altman-rethink-17-things",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ChatGPT 之父 Sam Altman 反思 17 件希望早點知道的事",summary:"ChatGPT 之父 Sam Altman 今年經歷 ChatGPT 的爆紅，以及被 OpenAI 董事會開除後再回歸。在年末他寫下了 17 件他希望早點有人告訴他的事，原文是《What I Wish Someone Had Told Me》，這邊翻譯成中文與大家分享",href:"/zh-hant/career/sam-altman-rethink-17-things"},{title:"ChatGPT 之父 Sam Altman 30 歲時的 36 項人生省思",date:"2023-12-23",lastmod:"2023-12-23",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"sam-altman-30-year-old",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/sam-altman-30-year-old.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/sam-altman-30-year-old",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=ChatGPT 之父 Sam Altman 30 歲時的 36 項人生省思",summary:"ChatGPT 之父 Sam Altman 在創立 OpenAI 前，是全球知名的新創孵化器 Y Combinator 的總裁。在他三十歲時，他寫下《The days are long but the decades are short》，一文，深刻地記錄下他的反思。這邊翻譯成中文與大家分享",href:"/zh-hant/career/sam-altman-30-year-old"},{title:"圖靈獎得主 David Patterson 的 16 點人生體悟",date:"2024-11-06",lastmod:"2024-11-06",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"16-life-lessons-from-david-patterson",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/16-life-lessons-from-david-patterson.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/16-life-lessons-from-david-patterson",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=圖靈獎得主 David Patterson 的 16 點人生體悟",summary:"從圖靈獎得主 David Patterson 的 16 點人生體悟中，探索如何設立人生基準，避免被虛榮指標迷惑，專注於帶來正向影響的目標。本篇摘錄重點，帶領讀者思考如何選擇適合自己的人生衡量標準。",href:"/zh-hant/career/16-life-lessons-from-david-patterson"},{title:"做自己感興趣的事，前提是要有永續模式",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2024-04-28",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"do-interested-with-sustainable",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/do-interested-with-sustainable.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/do-interested-with-sustainable",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=做自己感興趣的事，前提是要有永續模式",summary:"兩週前，Volar.js 的創作者 Johnson Chu 在 Volar 的 GitHub 發了一個公告，說先前 Volar 獲得的贊助，只夠他繼續全職開發 Volar 到今年十月；因此，在尋求新的贊助者的同時，他創建了一個付費的 Official Insiders 版本，如果訂閱支持，就可以優先獲得新功能的使用權等加值",href:"/zh-hant/career/do-interested-with-sustainable"},{title:"《回顧在 Google 的 18 年》翻譯文",date:"2023-11-24",lastmod:"2023-11-24",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"reflecting-18-years-at-google",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/reflecting-18-years-at-google.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/reflecting-18-years-at-google",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=《回顧在 Google 的 18 年》翻譯文",summary:"因為過去分享過自己的轉職前端工程師的經驗，以及轉職後順利拿到 FAANG 工程師 offer 的經驗，陸陸續續有收到讀者詢問關於轉職工程師的事宜。其中很常被問到要如何轉職成功，所以想說與其一一回答，不如整理一篇文章給有想要轉職的讀者朋友們。以下五個點，是我根據自己轉職經驗、看到身邊其他轉職的例子後整理出來，推薦大家要避免的誤區。如果你能避免下面提到的問題，相信會更有機會成功轉職。",href:"/zh-hant/career/reflecting-18-years-at-google"},{title:"網路之父 Vint Cerf 分享的 5 項職涯建議",date:"2023-09-03",lastmod:"2023-12-06",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"vint-cerf-career-advice",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/vint-cerf-career-advice.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/vint-cerf-career-advice",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=網路之父 Vint Cerf 分享的 5 項職涯建議",summary:"IEEE 網站先前訪問了，網路之父 Vint Cerf，(Vint Cerf 是 TCP/IP 發明者，也是圖靈獎得主)，在訪談中他給了工程師們 5 項職涯建議。這些建議非常精闢，我們翻譯了他提的每個建議，並給出相關的解讀",href:"/zh-hant/career/vint-cerf-career-advice"},{title:"Paul Buchheit 改變人生的 6 個思維模式",date:"2023-11-27",lastmod:"2023-11-27",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"paul-buchheit-the-technology",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/paul-buchheit-the-technology.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/paul-buchheit-the-technology",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Paul Buchheit 改變人生的 6 個思維模式",summary:"所謂的預設模式，是指你在做決策時，不自覺會透過的模式。舉例來說，同樣是做選擇，有人會預設選擇風險小、不會遭受責罵的；但有人會預設選擇更有趣但可能風險比較高的。這兩種預設的反應，會讓這兩類人發展出截然不同的樣貌。Paul Buchheit 認為，我們常常為生活中的重大決策而苦惱，但真正重要的其實是那些我們每天要做上千次、常常甚至不自覺的小決策。大決策是這些小決策的必然結果。我們可能會覺得自己在某些狀況下，做出了重大決策，但實際上，這個大決策往往是由之前成千上萬的小決策共同疊加出來的。而你選擇的預設模式，則會影響著你每天做的各種小決策。",href:"/zh-hant/career/paul-buchheit-the-technology"},{title:"Ruby on Rails 的創作者 DHH 談能力養成",date:"2024-01-27",lastmod:"2024-01-27",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"dhh-commit-to-competence",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/dhh-commit-to-competence.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/dhh-commit-to-competence",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Ruby on Rails 的創作者 DHH 談能力養成",summary:"Ruby on Rails 的創作者 DHH 在去年底分享了一篇《Commit to competence in this coming year》，要理解這篇文章，要先懂 competence 這個單字，這個字直接翻譯是指能力、本領，或者是在某個工作崗位上所需的必要技能。為什麼要談這個字，因為 DHH 認為在歲末年終，或者一年的最開始，很多人會說自己要有新年新希望，例如讀更多本書，或者做到 XYZ 等事情。",href:"/zh-hant/career/dhh-commit-to-competence"},{title:"開發出 Claude Code 前，Boris Cherny 曾在奈良過著釀味噌的生活",date:"2026-07-16",lastmod:"2026-07-16",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"boris-cherny-before-claude-code",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/boris-cherny-before-claude-code.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/boris-cherny-before-claude-code",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:16,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=開發出 Claude Code 前，Boris Cherny 曾在奈良過著釀味噌的生活",summary:"Claude Code 創造者 Boris Cherny 在加入 Anthropic 前，曾住在奈良，一邊釀味噌，一邊以全遠端方式擔任 Instagram 首席工程師。他透過重新投入寫程式、授權他人與非同步溝通，在遠離矽谷的時區持續擴大影響力，也從釀味噌學會用更長期的眼光打造 Claude Code。",href:"/zh-hant/career/boris-cherny-before-claude-code"}]},{title:"職涯發展與方向",links:[{title:"擅長爬職涯階梯的人，不代表會打造對使用者好的產品",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2024-04-28",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"the-man-killed-google-search",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/the-man-killed-google-search.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/the-man-killed-google-search",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=擅長爬職涯階梯的人，不代表會打造對使用者好的產品",summary:"最近在 Hacker News 上有廣大討論的一篇文，是矽谷知名媒體人 Edward Zitron 寫的《The Man Who Killed Google Search》。這篇文爬梳了美國司法部針對 Google 的反托拉斯法案的展示證據，把當中 Google VP、SVP 層級高管間的 email 串拉出來分析。該文的論點是，Prabhakar Raghavan 是扼殺 Google 搜尋的那個人。Prabhakar 是誰呢? 他是 Google 的 SVP，現在 Google 搜尋的負責人，在那之前是 Google 廣告的負責人。\uDB40\uDC20\uDB40\uDC20",href:"/zh-hant/career/the-man-killed-google-search"},{title:"後 ChatGPT 時代，寫程式這件事將要滅絕了嗎?",date:"2023-05-20",lastmod:"2023-05-20",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"the-end-of-programming",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/the-end-of-programming.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/the-end-of-programming",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=後 ChatGPT 時代，寫程式這件事將要滅絕了嗎?",summary:"前幾個月前哈佛大學電腦科學系教授 Matt Welsh 在 ACM 上談到，他認為傳統的「寫程式」將在未來滅絕，因為隨著大型語言模型、生成式 AI 時代來臨，人類與機器溝通的媒介，可以不再是程式語言，而是可以自然語言來跟機器溝通，而程式碼將轉由機器來寫。當機器能幫人類寫程式，人的價值何在? 工程師的職涯發展又該如何轉變? Matt Welsh 談到，有兩項技能在 AI 時代特別重要。",href:"/zh-hant/career/the-end-of-programming"},{title:"技術上很困難，但對使用者沒價值的事",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2024-04-28",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"ai-pin",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/ai-pin.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/ai-pin",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=技術上很困難，但對使用者沒價值的事",summary:"最近社群討論度很大的一個 AI 產品，是 Humane 的 Ai Pin。Humane 這家公司是由兩位前 Apple 員工創辦，去年拿到 2.3 億美元融資，投資人包含微軟、OpenAI 甚至 Sam Altman 本人。然而最近 Humane 推出的 Ai Pin 被全世界最有名的科技評論 YouTuber MKBHD 評價為他至今評論過最糟的產品 (the worst product)",href:"/zh-hant/career/ai-pin"},{title:"為什麼第一性原理思考很重要？",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2024-04-28",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"first-principle",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/first-principle.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/first-principle",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=為什麼第一性原理思考很重要？",summary:"論是馬斯克或黃仁勳，經常在對談或演講時提到第一性原理思考 (first principles thinking)。所謂第一性原理思考，是要從本質拆解，而不是直接類比或模仿。前幾天看到一個有趣同時值得一題的例子，很好地說明為什麼第一性原理思考很重要。",href:"/zh-hant/career/first-principle"},{title:"做一個有意義的個人專案",date:"2025-07-14",lastmod:"2025-07-14",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"meaningful-peronal-project",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/meaningful-peronal-project.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/meaningful-peronal-project",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=做一個有意義的個人專案",summary:"個人專案不只是寫程式練習，更是職涯成長的重要工具。本文分析三種有意義的個人專案切入角度：解決自己的實際問題、獲得工作無法接觸的技術成長，以及提升履歷競爭力。透過具體案例說明如何選擇題目，讓個人專案發揮最大價值。",href:"/zh-hant/career/meaningful-peronal-project"},{title:"AI 時代工程師職涯發展的不同路線",date:"2026-07-02",lastmod:"2026-07-02",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"engineer-career-paths-ai-era",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/engineer-career-paths-ai-era.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/engineer-career-paths-ai-era",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=AI 時代工程師職涯發展的不同路線",summary:"Claude Code 作者 Boris Cherny 觀察到，AI 時代的團隊角色正在從傳統工程、產品、設計分工，轉向原型探索者、建造者、整理者、成長者與維護者等不同典型。這種分類有助於團隊理解不同階段需要什麼人才，但個人不該因此被定型，而應隨著產品與團隊演進持續調整自己的角色。",href:"/zh-hant/career/engineer-career-paths-ai-era"}]}],"zh-hans-career-talk":[{title:"目录",links:[{title:"科技与职涯思维—导览",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2023-08-26",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"career-talk",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/career-talk.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/career-talk",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=科技与职涯思维—导览",summary:"本系列汇整了科技与职涯思维的专栏文章，包含工作选择、职涯思维、职涯发展与方向、职涯回顾与心得，以及面试心得",href:"/zh-hans/career/career-talk"}]},{title:"工作选择",links:[{title:"Blind 75 作者的软体工程师职涯选择",date:"2024-07-02",lastmod:"2024-07-02",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"blind-75-career-share",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/blind-75-career-share.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/blind-75-career-share",subtoc:"job-choose",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Blind 75 作者的软体工程师职涯选择",summary:"探索 Blind 75 作者从 Meta 离职创业的软体工程师职涯选择，了解他如何凭藉热爱分享和前端开发创立 GreatFrontend，并为前端工程师提供面试准备和技能提升的资源。本文还提供专属 20% 折扣码，助你提升前端能力。",href:"/zh-hans/career/blind-75-career-share"},{title:"职涯路径该选产品开发? 还是选基础建设?",date:"2023-12-29",lastmod:"2023-12-29",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"product-or-infra",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/product-or-infra.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/product-or-infra",subtoc:"job-choose",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=职涯路径该选产品开发? 还是选基础建设?",summary:"在升到主任工程师之前，不论选产品端 (product) 或走基础建设 (infra)，影响上并没有那么大，两条路线都能顺利升迁到主任工程师。只是往下一个阶段升迁，这两个路线就有区别。从技术的角度来看，走基础建设路线的工程师，比较能有高的技术影响力，因为一个优化就可以让下游使用该技术的工程团队都获益 (这让人想到 GPT-3.5 升级到 GPT-4 后，对世界的影响量级非常可观)。这是走产品开发的工程师比较难有的。",href:"/zh-hans/career/product-or-infra"},{title:"做 To B 与 To C 的前端开发有什么不同?",date:"2023-12-31",lastmod:"2023-12-31",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"to-b-or-to-c",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/to-b-or-to-c.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/to-b-or-to-c",subtoc:"job-choose",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=做 To B 与 To C 的前端开发有什么不同?",summary:"前端工程是一个很广泛的名词，很可能都是做前端工程师，但你的工作内容跟另一个人完全不同。虽然都是前端开发，产品开发、多媒体开发、设计系统、前端架构，这几个类别会有非常不同的工作内容。进一步说，光是做产品开发的前端，To C 的产品与 To B 的产品，就有很不同的侧重点。让我们在这一期聊聊他们的区别。",href:"/zh-hans/career/to-b-or-to-c"},{title:"Paul Graham 《How to Start Google》- 做自己感兴趣的事",date:"2024-04-08",lastmod:"2024-04-08",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"do-what-you-interested",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/do-what-you-interested.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/do-what-you-interested",subtoc:"job-choose",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=读 Paul Graham 《How to Start Google》- 做自己感兴趣的事",summary:"Paul Graham 在《How to Start Google》一文中谈到，年轻人创立像 Google 规模公司的三个要素是精通科技、有点子与共同创办人。他建议年轻人不要刻意预测热门科技，而是选择自己感兴趣的领域精进，透过动手做专案来学习。当你学会某个技术，你看待世界的视角将会截然不同，许多潜在的新创点子也将因此而生。Facebook、Apple、Google 早期都是从创办人感兴趣的问题开始，先解决自身周遭的问题，再逐步发展成大公司。",href:"/zh-hans/career/do-what-you-interested"},{title:"诺贝尔奖得主本庶佑谈「该如何选要投入的领域」",date:"2025-10-12",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"tasuku-honjo-choose-field",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/tasuku-honjo-choose-field.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/tasuku-honjo-choose-field",subtoc:"job-choose",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=诺贝尔奖得主本庶佑谈「该如何选要投入的领域」",summary:"整理诺贝尔奖得主本庶佑对于挑选投入领域时的思考重点，作为职涯选择的参考。",href:"/zh-hans/career/tasuku-honjo-choose-field"}]},{title:"职涯思维",links:[{title:"AI 时代要花更多时间做 AI 做不到的事",date:"2024-10-21",lastmod:"2024-10-21",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"focus-on-what-ai-cannot-do-in-ai-era",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/focus-on-what-ai-cannot-do-in-ai-era.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/focus-on-what-ai-cannot-do-in-ai-era",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=AI 时代要花更多时间做 AI 做不到的事",summary:"在 AI 时代，工程师与招聘者需投入更多时间在人际连结上，如参与技术小聚与实体会议，来进行更有效的互动与求职。",href:"/zh-hans/career/focus-on-what-ai-cannot-do-in-ai-era"},{title:"ChatGPT 之父 Sam Altman 反思 17 件希望早点知道的事",date:"2023-12-23",lastmod:"2023-12-23",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"sam-altman-rethink-17-things",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/sam-altman-rethink-17-things.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/sam-altman-rethink-17-things",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:1,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/bdf02275e2c2422cab2dd89090427d94.png",summary:"ChatGPT 之父 Sam Altman 今年经历 ChatGPT 的爆红，以及被 OpenAI 董事会开除后再回归。在年末他写下了 17 件他希望早点有人告诉他的事，原文是《What I Wish Someone Had Told Me》，这边翻译成中文与大家分享",href:"/zh-hans/career/sam-altman-rethink-17-things"},{title:"ChatGPT 之父 Sam Altman 30 岁时的 36 项人生省思",date:"2023-12-23",lastmod:"2023-12-23",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"sam-altman-30-year-old",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/sam-altman-30-year-old.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/sam-altman-30-year-old",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:2,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/9a2959c6fcd74c57a65ad447b89299fe.png",summary:"ChatGPT 之父Sam Altman 在创立OpenAI 前，是全球知名的新创孵化器Y Combinator 的总裁。在他三十岁时，他写下《The days are long but the decades are short》，一文，深刻地记录下他的反思。这边翻译成中文与大家分享",href:"/zh-hans/career/sam-altman-30-year-old"},{title:"图灵奖得主 David Patterson 的 16 点人生体悟",date:"2024-11-06",lastmod:"2024-11-06",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"16-life-lessons-from-david-patterson",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/16-life-lessons-from-david-patterson.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/16-life-lessons-from-david-patterson",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=图灵奖得主 David Patterson 的 16 点人生体悟",summary:"从图灵奖得主 David Patterson 的 16 点人生体悟中，探索如何设立人生基准，避免被虚荣指标迷惑，专注于带来正向影响的目标。本篇摘录重点，带领读者思考如何选择适合自己的人生衡量标准。",href:"/zh-hans/career/16-life-lessons-from-david-patterson"},{title:"做自己感兴趣的事，前提是要有永续模式",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2024-04-28",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"do-interested-with-sustainable",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/do-interested-with-sustainable.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/do-interested-with-sustainable",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=做自己感兴趣的事，前提是要有永续模式",summary:"两周前，Volar.js 的创作者 Johnson Chu 在 Volar 的 GitHub 发了一个公告，说先前 Volar 获得的赞助，只够他继续全职开发 Volar 到今年十月；因此，在寻求新的赞助者的同时，他创建了一个付费的 Official Insiders 版本，如果订阅支持，就可以优先获得新功能的使用权等加值",href:"/zh-hans/career/do-interested-with-sustainable"},{title:"《回顾在 Google 的 18 年》翻译文",date:"2023-11-24",lastmod:"2023-11-24",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"reflecting-18-years-at-google",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/reflecting-18-years-at-google.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/reflecting-18-years-at-google",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=《回顾在 Google 的 18 年》翻译文",summary:"因为过去分享过自己的转职前端工程师的经验，以及转职后顺利拿到 FAANG 工程师 offer 的经验，陆陆续续有收到读者询问关于转职工程师的事宜。其中很常被问到要如何转职成功，所以想说与其一一回答，不如整理一篇文章给有想要转职的读者朋友们。以下五个点，是我根据自己转职经验、看到身边其他转职的例子后整理出来，推荐大家要避免的误区。如果你能避免下面提到的问题，相信会更有机会成功转职。",href:"/zh-hans/career/reflecting-18-years-at-google"},{title:"网路之父 Vint Cerf 分享的 5 项职涯建议",date:"2023-09-03",lastmod:"2023-09-03",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"vint-cerf-career-advice",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/vint-cerf-career-advice.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/vint-cerf-career-advice",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=网路之父 Vint Cerf 分享的 5 项职涯建议",summary:"IEEE 网站先前访问了，网路之父 Vint Cerf，(Vint Cerf 是 TCP/IP 发明者，也是图灵奖得主)，在访谈中他给了工程师们 5 项职涯建议。这些建议非常精辟，我们翻译了他提的每个建议，并给出相关的解读",href:"/zh-hans/career/vint-cerf-career-advice"},{title:"Paul Buchheit 改变人生的 6 个思维模式",date:"2023-11-27",lastmod:"2023-11-27",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"paul-buchheit-the-technology",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/paul-buchheit-the-technology.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/paul-buchheit-the-technology",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Paul Buchheit 改变人生的 6 个思维模式",summary:"所谓的预设模式，是指你在做决策时，不自觉会透过的模式。举例来说，同样是做选择，有人会预设选择风险小、不会遭受责骂的；但有人会预设选择更有趣但可能风险比较高的。这两种预设的反应，会让这两类人发展出截然不同的样貌。Paul Buchheit 认为，我们常常为生活中的重大决策而苦恼，但真正重要的其实是那些我们每天要做上千次、常常甚至不自觉的小决策。大决策是这些小决策的必然结果。我们可能会觉得自己在某些状况下，做出了重大决策，但实际上，这个大决策往往是由之前成千上万的小决策共同叠加出来的。而你选择的预设模式，则会影响着你每天做的各种小决策。",href:"/zh-hans/career/paul-buchheit-the-technology"},{title:"Ruby on Rails 的创作者 DHH 谈能力养成",date:"2024-01-27",lastmod:"2024-01-27",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"dhh-commit-to-competence",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/dhh-commit-to-competence.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/dhh-commit-to-competence",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Ruby on Rails 的创作者 DHH 谈能力养成",summary:"Ruby on Rails 的创作者 DHH 在去年底分享了一篇《Commit to competence in this coming year》，要理解这篇文章，要先懂 competence 这个单字，这个字直接翻译是指能力、本领，或者是在某个工作岗位上所需的必要技能。为什么要谈这个字，因为 DHH 认为在岁末年终，或者一年的最开始，很多人会说自己要有新年新希望，例如读更多本书，或者做到 XYZ 等事情。",href:"/zh-hans/career/dhh-commit-to-competence"},{title:"开发出 Claude Code 前，Boris Cherny 曾在奈良过着酿味噌的生活",date:"2026-07-16",lastmod:"2026-07-16",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"boris-cherny-before-claude-code",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/boris-cherny-before-claude-code.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/boris-cherny-before-claude-code",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:16,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=开发出 Claude Code 前，Boris Cherny 曾在奈良过着酿味噌的生活",summary:"Claude Code 创造者 Boris Cherny 在加入 Anthropic 前，曾住在奈良，一边酿味噌，一边以全远程方式担任 Instagram 首席工程师。他通过重新投入写程序、授权他人与异步沟通，在远离硅谷的时区持续扩大影响力，也从酿味噌中学会以更长远的眼光打造 Claude Code。",href:"/zh-hans/career/boris-cherny-before-claude-code"}]},{title:"职涯发展与方向",links:[{title:"擅长爬职涯阶梯的人，不代表会打造对使用者好的产品",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2024-04-28",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"the-man-killed-google-search",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/the-man-killed-google-search.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/the-man-killed-google-search",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=擅长爬职涯阶梯的人，不代表会打造对使用者好的产品",summary:"最近在 Hacker News 上有广大讨论的一篇文，是矽谷知名媒体人 Edward Zitron 写的《The Man Who Killed Google Search》。这篇文爬梳了美国司法部针对 Google 的反托拉斯法案的展示证据，把当中 Google VP、SVP 层级高管间的 email 串拉出来分析。该文的论点是，Prabhakar Raghavan 是扼杀 Google 搜寻的那个人。Prabhakar 是谁呢? 他是 Google 的 SVP，现在 Google 搜寻的负责人，在那之前是 Google 广告的负责人。\uDB40\uDC20\uDB40\uDC20",href:"/zh-hans/career/the-man-killed-google-search"},{title:"后 ChatGPT 时代，写程式这件事将要灭绝了吗?",date:"2023-05-20",lastmod:"2023-05-20",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"the-end-of-programming",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/the-end-of-programming.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/the-end-of-programming",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=后 ChatGPT 时代，写程式这件事将要灭绝了吗?",summary:"前几个月前哈佛大学电脑科学系教授Matt Welsh 在ACM 上谈到，他认为传统的「写程式」将在未来灭绝，因为随着大型语言模型、生成式AI 时代来临，人类与机器沟通的媒介，可以不再是程式语言，而是可以自然语言来跟机器沟通，而代码将转由机器来写。当机器能帮人类写程式，人的价值何在? 工程师的职涯发展又该如何转变? Matt Welsh 谈到，有两项技能在 AI 时代特别重要。 ",href:"/zh-hans/career/the-end-of-programming"},{title:"技术上很困难，但对使用者没价值的事",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2024-04-28",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"ai-pin",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/ai-pin.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/ai-pin",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=技术上很困难，但对使用者没价值的事",summary:"最近社群讨论度很大的一个 AI 产品，是 Humane 的 Ai Pin。Humane 这家公司是由两位前 Apple 员工创办，去年拿到 2.3 亿美元融资，投资人包含微软、OpenAI 甚至 Sam Altman 本人。然而最近 Humane 推出的 Ai Pin 被全世界最有名的科技评论 YouTuber MKBHD 评价为他至今评论过最糟的产品 (the worst product)",href:"/zh-hans/career/ai-pin"},{title:"为什么第一性原理思考很重要? ",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2024-04-28",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"first-principle",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/first-principle.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/first-principle",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=为什么第一性原理思考很重要?",summary:"论是马斯克或黄仁勋，经常在对谈或演讲时提到第一性原理思考 (first principles thinking)。所谓第一性原理思考，是要从本质拆解，而不是直接类比或模仿。前几天看到一个有趣同时值得一题的例子，很好地说明为什么第一性原理思考很重要。",href:"/zh-hans/career/first-principle"},{title:"做一个有意义的个人专案",date:"2025-07-14",lastmod:"2025-07-14",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"meaningful-peronal-project",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/meaningful-peronal-project.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/meaningful-peronal-project",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=做一个有意义的个人专案",summary:"个人专案不只是写程式练习，更是职涯成长的重要工具。本文分析三种有意义的个人专案切入角度：解决自己的实际问题、获得工作无法接触的技术成长，以及提升履历竞争力。透过具体案例说明如何选择题目，让个人专案发挥最大价值。",href:"/zh-hans/career/meaningful-peronal-project"},{title:"AI 时代工程师职业发展的不同路线",date:"2026-07-02",lastmod:"2026-07-02",toc:"career-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"engineer-career-paths-ai-era",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/engineer-career-paths-ai-era.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/engineer-career-paths-ai-era",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=AI 时代工程师职业发展的不同路线",summary:"Claude Code 作者 Boris Cherny 观察到，AI 时代的团队角色正在从传统工程、产品、设计分工，转向原型探索者、建造者、整理者、成长者与维护者等不同典型。这种分类有助于团队理解不同阶段需要什么人才，但个人不该因此被定型，而应随着产品与团队演进持续调整自己的角色。",href:"/zh-hans/career/engineer-career-paths-ai-era"}]}],"en-career-talk":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Tech Career Experience and Interview Insights",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2023-08-26",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"career-talk",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/career-talk.md",fullPath:"/en/career/career-talk",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Tech Career Experience and Interview Insights",summary:"Tech Career Experience and Interview Insights",href:"/en/career/career-talk"}]},{title:"Job Choices",links:[{title:"Career Choices of the Blind 75 Author as a Software Engineer",date:"2024-10-01",lastmod:"2024-10-01",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"blind-75-career-share",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/blind-75-career-share.md",fullPath:"/en/career/blind-75-career-share",subtoc:"job-choose",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Career Choices of the Blind 75 Author as a Software Engineer",summary:"Explore the career choices of the Blind 75 author, who left Meta to start his own business. Learn how his passion for sharing and frontend development led to the creation of GreatFrontend, a platform providing resources for frontend engineers to prepare for interviews and improve their skills. This article also offers a special 20% discount code to help you enhance your frontend abilities.",href:"/en/career/blind-75-career-share"},{title:"Should You Build Products or Infrastructure?",date:"2023-12-29",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"product-or-infra",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/product-or-infra.md",fullPath:"/en/career/product-or-infra",subtoc:"job-choose",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Product%20vs%20Infrastructure%20Career%20Paths",summary:"Ryan Peterman lays out what changes when you pick a product track versus an infrastructure track at staff levels.",href:"/en/career/product-or-infra"},{title:"Paul Graham’s Reminder to Work on What Truly Interests You",date:"2024-04-08",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"do-what-you-interested",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/do-what-you-interested.md",fullPath:"/en/career/do-what-you-interested",subtoc:"job-choose",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Work%20on%20What%20Truly%20Interests%20You",summary:"Paul Graham’s advice to teenagers still works for adults: curiosity creates the deepest skills and the best startup ideas.",href:"/en/career/do-what-you-interested"},{title:"What’s Different About Building B2B vs. B2C Products?",date:"2023-12-31",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"to-b-or-to-c",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/to-b-or-to-c.md",fullPath:"/en/career/to-b-or-to-c",subtoc:"job-choose",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Building%20B2B%20vs%20B2C%20Products",summary:'"Consumer teams chase polish at scale. Enterprise teams wrestle with deep logic and longevity." ',href:"/en/career/to-b-or-to-c"},{title:"Nobel Laureate Tasuku Honjo on Choosing the Field You Should Pursue",date:"2025-10-12",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"tasuku-honjo-choose-field",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/tasuku-honjo-choose-field.md",fullPath:"/en/career/tasuku-honjo-choose-field",subtoc:"job-choose",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Tasuku%20Honjo%20Choosing%20a%20Field",summary:'"Tasuku Honjo’s advice is to aim for work that makes you the only one, not the number one." ',href:"/en/career/tasuku-honjo-choose-field"}]},{title:"Career Thinking",links:[{title:"Spend More Time on What AI Still Can’t Do",date:"2024-10-21",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-ta