illed-google-search",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Climbing%20The%20Ladder%20Isnt%20Enough",summary:'"Edward Zitron’s investigation into Google Search is a reminder to judge leaders by the outcomes they protect, not the titles they earn." ',href:"/en/career/the-man-killed-google-search"},{title:"When Brilliance in Hardware Isn’t Enough",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"ai-pin",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/ai-pin.md",fullPath:"/en/career/ai-pin",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=When%20Brilliance%20in%20Hardware%20Isnt%20Enough",summary:"Humane’s Ai Pin proves a simple point: people reward tools that make life easier, not gadgets that only look clever.",href:"/en/career/ai-pin"},{title:"Why First-Principles Thinking Still Matters",date:"2024-04-28",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"first-principle",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/first-principle.md",fullPath:"/en/career/first-principle",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Why%20First%20Principles%20Thinking%20Matters",summary:"A Windows NT story proves that copying big companies often means copying their shortcuts. Better to rebuild the logic yourself.",href:"/en/career/first-principle"},{title:"What Makes a Personal Project Meaningful",date:"2025-07-14",lastmod:"2025-10-12",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"meaningful-peronal-project",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/meaningful-peronal-project.md",fullPath:"/en/career/meaningful-peronal-project",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Meaningful%20Personal%20Projects",summary:"Pick projects that solve your own pain, teach what work won’t, or leave proof you can point to.",href:"/en/career/meaningful-peronal-project"},{title:"Different Career Paths for Engineers in the AI Era",date:"2026-07-02",lastmod:"2026-07-02",toc:"career-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"engineer-career-paths-ai-era",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/engineer-career-paths-ai-era.md",fullPath:"/en/career/engineer-career-paths-ai-era",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Different Career Paths for Engineers in the AI Era",summary:"Boris Cherny, the creator of Claude Code, observed that as AI reshapes how teams work, roles are starting to blur beyond the old engineering, product, and design boundaries. The five archetypes he describes can help teams understand what kind of people they need at each product stage, but individual engineers should be careful not to let those labels limit their growth.",href:"/en/career/engineer-career-paths-ai-era"}]}],"zh-hant-li-talk":[{title:"目錄",links:[{title:"Li / 科技職涯觀點 — 導覽",date:"2024-10-01",lastmod:"2024-10-01",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"li-talk",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/li-talk.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/li-talk",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Li / 科技職涯觀點",summary:"本系列彙整了 Li 科技與職涯思維的專欄文章，包含工作選擇、職涯思維、職涯發展與方向、職涯回顧與心得，以及面試心得",href:"/zh-hant/career/li-talk"}]},{title:"工作選擇",links:[{title:"淺談在台灣做全球遠端工作的利與弊",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2022-12-07",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"working-global-remote-pros-and-cons",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/working-global-remote-pros-and-cons.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/working-global-remote-pros-and-cons",subtoc:"job-choose",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=淺談在台灣做全球遠端工作的利與弊",summary:"我個人很喜歡遠端的某些元素，但在經過這個全球遠端的經驗，現在的我會比較偏好混合模式 (hybrid mode)，而不是完全遠端。以下我會先分享我覺得遠端好的地方，後面會再分享為何現在的我並不偏好完全遠端。",href:"/zh-hant/career/working-global-remote-pros-and-cons"},{title:"淺談海外工作 — 家庭大於工作",date:"2023-11-02",lastmod:"2023-11-02",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"working-oversea-family",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/working-oversea-family.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/working-oversea-family",subtoc:"job-choose",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=淺談海外工作 — 家庭大於工作",summary:"關於舉家搬到海外，我個人的觀點是家庭大於工作。我大學時有個學長，工作幾年後到哈佛讀 MBA，之前跟他吃飯時，聊到他當年在哈佛畢業前有修一門課，課中討論了工作與家庭，那時他推薦了我 Clayton Christensen 教授寫的《How will you measure your life?》一書",href:"/zh-hant/career/working-oversea-family"},{title:"找工程師工作的萬年問題，該選新創或大公司?",date:"2023-12-31",lastmod:"2023-12-31",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"bigtech-or-startup",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/bigtech-or-startup.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/bigtech-or-startup",subtoc:"job-choose",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=找工程師工作的萬年問題，該選新創或大公司?",summary:"在選擇工作時，不該只看財務上的報酬，而是該全方位的考量，包含自己是否能做的快樂、有成就感、工作與生活平衡。因此，回到「新創與大公司」這個職涯選擇上，沒有絕對的哪個比較好，即使錯過某個超棒的工作機會，也不代表你選擇的不是個好職涯。",href:"/zh-hant/career/bigtech-or-startup"},{title:"選一間冷靜的公司 (calm company)",date:"2024-04-11",lastmod:"2024-04-11",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"calm-company",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/calm-company.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/calm-company",subtoc:"job-choose",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=選一間冷靜的公司 (calm company)",summary:"當今天有幸拿到多個工作機會，下個問題自然會是問該選擇哪一個?選擇去哪一間公司是很個人的問題，沒有所謂的標準答案，只有取捨。因此，過去我們能與讀者分享的，是選擇的指標，或說用什麼角度去思考該選什麼?",href:"/zh-hant/career/calm-company"},{title:"選工作前，先了解該公司怎麼做事故檢討",date:"2024-11-15",lastmod:"2024-11-15",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-companies-handle-incident-reviews",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-companies-handle-incident-reviews.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-companies-handle-incident-reviews",subtoc:"job-choose",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=選工作前，先了解該公司怎麼做事故檢討",summary:"從 AWS 的重大事故談起，深入探討不指責人的事故檢討文化，並分享如何透過改善流程避免人為錯誤。想了解在面試時該如何評估公司的事故處理機制？這篇文章提供實用建議。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-companies-handle-incident-reviews"}]},{title:"職涯觀點",links:[{title:"軟體工程師與米其林大廚：掌握技能的職涯成長之路",date:"2024-10-06",lastmod:"2024-10-06",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"similarities-between-software-engineers-and-chefs",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/similarities-between-software-engineers-and-chefs.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/similarities-between-software-engineers-and-chefs",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Li / 科技職涯觀點",summary:"軟體工程師如何像米其林大廚般掌握技能，從工具到團隊領導，追求職涯成長的多面向挑戰。了解如何讓程式碼如同精緻料理般具備高可讀性與效能，並學會帶領團隊突破標準，成為業界頂尖",href:"/zh-hant/career/similarities-between-software-engineers-and-chefs"},{title:"短影音很有效，但為何我們仍決定不再製作？",date:"2024-11-13",lastmod:"2024-11-13",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"why-we-decided-not-to-make-shorts",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/why-we-decided-not-to-make-shorts.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/why-we-decided-not-to-make-shorts",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=短影音很有效，但為何我們仍決定不再製作？",summary:"短影音在流量成效不錯，但侷限無法深入呈現技術知識，加上製作流程不符興趣，因此 ExplainThis 決定不再製作短影音，專注於更具價值的長內容。",href:"/zh-hant/career/why-we-decided-not-to-make-shorts"},{title:"貼「天才」這個標籤，是件非常危險的事",date:"2024-05-05",lastmod:"2024-05-05",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"dangerous-label-genius",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/dangerous-label-genius.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/dangerous-label-genius",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:18,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=貼「天才」這個標籤，是件非常危險的事",summary:"本篇文章探討貼上「天才」標籤的危險性，強調了成長型思維的重要性。透過教育界名人的觀點以及一位高中生程式開發者的例子，突顯了持續努力和成長的價值，並呼籲對於努力和堅持的肯定。文章強調了人們應該更注重個人的努力和學習過程，而非將天賦和才華當作絕對評價的依據。",href:"/zh-hant/career/dangerous-label-genius"},{title:"Kelsey Hightower 談重來一次他會如何進科技業",date:"2024-11-14",lastmod:"2024-11-14",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"kelsey-hightower-how-to-start-tech-career-again",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/kelsey-hightower-how-to-start-tech-career-again.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/kelsey-hightower-how-to-start-tech-career-again",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Kelsey Hightower 談重來一次他會如何進科技業",summary:"Kelsey Hightower 分享他如何從非科班背景一路成為 Google 傑出工程師的經驗。即使重來一次，他也會從基礎做起，善用技能學習與內部升遷機會，逐步實現科技業職涯目標。適合非科班背景者參考。",href:"/zh-hant/career/kelsey-hightower-how-to-start-tech-career-again"},{title:"21 項給軟體工程師的職涯提醒",date:"2024-11-18",lastmod:"2024-11-18",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"21-career-tips-for-software-engineers",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/21-career-tips-for-software-engineers.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/21-career-tips-for-software-engineers",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=21 項給軟體工程師的職涯提醒",summary:"兩位前 Meta 主任工程師所匯集，給軟體工程師的 21 個職涯提醒",href:"/zh-hant/career/21-career-tips-for-software-engineers"}]},{title:"職涯發展與方向",links:[{title:"成為主任工程師要懂的提攜 (Sponsorship)",date:"2024-10-29",lastmod:"2024-10-29",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"understanding-sponsorship-principal-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/understanding-sponsorship-principal-engineer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/understanding-sponsorship-principal-engineer",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=成為主任工程師要懂的提攜 (Sponsorship)",summary:"最近讀了被說是邁向主任工程師必讀的《Staff Engineer: Leadership beyond the management track》一書，讀到一個特別有感的章節，該章節在講提攜 (sponsorship)，以及談了為什麼做到主任工程師以上的職位 (例如首席工程師或技術掌)，想要在職位上發揮更大的影響力，需要有效提攜他人。",href:"/zh-hant/career/understanding-sponsorship-principal-engineer"},{title:"反思軟體工程師的「強者文化」",date:"2023-10-12",lastmod:"2023-10-12",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"rethink-success",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/rethink-success.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/rethink-success",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=反思軟體工程師的「強者文化」",summary:"要成為工程師你需要會寫程式，但要成為資深工程師，程式是否寫得快又好不是重點區別。然而，要成為資深工程師所要具備的，在傳統資工系的教育中沒有被推崇。這導致一個弔詭的現象，就是在學校時能解出別人解不出的東西會被叫電神，但真的進到業界，才發現當好軟體工程師，你需要一堆「電」以外的軟技能。先前 Google Chrome 的 DX 負責人 Addy Osmani 出過一本叫《Software Engineering - The Soft Parts》的書，就是因為他看過太多工程師在職涯無法突破，是「軟」技能缺乏所致。",href:"/zh-hant/career/rethink-success"},{title:"那件別人覺得苦，但你卻覺得「蛤？」的事",date:"2024-11-19",lastmod:"2024-11-19",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-others-find-hard-but-you-dont",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/what-others-find-hard-but-you-dont.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/what-others-find-hard-but-you-dont",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=那件別人覺得苦，但你卻覺得「蛤？」的事",summary:"探索那些別人覺得辛苦但你投入其中卻不以為苦的領域，這往往是屬於你的天賦所在。本篇深入探討如何辨識自己的優勢，並分享讓人職涯突圍的思維與工具。",href:"/zh-hant/career/what-others-find-hard-but-you-dont"},{title:"反思「單一指標衡量成功」的問題",date:"2023-10-12",lastmod:"2023-10-12",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"rethink-measure",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/rethink-measure.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/rethink-measure",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=反思軟體工程師的「強者文化」",summary:"要成為工程師你需要會寫程式，但要成為資深工程師，程式是否寫得快又好不是重點區別。然而，要成為資深工程師所要具備的，在傳統資工系的教育中沒有被推崇。這導致一個弔詭的現象，就是在學校時能解出別人解不出的東西會被叫電神，但真的進到業界，才發現當好軟體工程師，你需要一堆「電」以外的軟技能。先前 Google Chrome 的 DX 負責人 Addy Osmani 出過一本叫《Software Engineering - The Soft Parts》的書，就是因為他看過太多工程師在職涯無法突破，是「軟」技能缺乏所致。",href:"/zh-hant/career/rethink-measure"},{title:"不要再問親戚小孩長大後要做什麼",date:"2023-01-24",lastmod:"2023-01-24",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=不要再問親戚小孩長大後要做什麼",summary:"「我想當太空人」、「我想當醫生」在小學的作文本裡，許多人會如此寫下自己的未來志願與夢想。然而，寫出這樣的夢想真的好嗎? 背後是否其實大有問題在? 更進一步問，為什麼會寫下這樣的回答呢? 賓州大學的心理學教授 Adam Grant，呼籲換個方式問孩子。他指出與其問孩子長大後想當什麼，不如邀請孩子去想「自己想成為什麼樣的人? 想做什麼事? 想解決什麼問題?」",href:"/zh-hant/career/do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be"},{title:"選一個讓你不感覺苦也不倦怠的職涯",date:"2025-10-04",lastmod:"2025-10-04",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"choose-a-career-without-burnout",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/choose-a-career-without-burnout.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/choose-a-career-without-burnout",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:16,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=選一個讓你不感覺苦也不倦怠的職涯",summary:"這篇文章正在撰寫中，稍後會補上完整內容。",href:"/zh-hant/career/choose-a-career-without-burnout"}]},{title:"職涯反思",links:[{title:"文組轉職前端工程師三年回顧",date:"2023-01-01",lastmod:"2023-01-01",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"pivoting-to-frontend-3-year-review",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/pivoting-to-frontend-3-year-review.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/pivoting-to-frontend-3-year-review",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=文組轉職前端工程師三年回顧",summary:"因為過去分享過自己的轉職前端工程師的經驗，以及轉職後順利拿到 FAANG 工程師 offer 的經驗，陸陸續續有收到讀者詢問關於轉職工程師的事宜。其中很常被問到要如何轉職成功，所以想說與其一一回答，不如整理一篇文章給有想要轉職的讀者朋友們。以下五個點，是我根據自己轉職經驗、看到身邊其他轉職的例子後整理出來，推薦大家要避免的誤區。如果你能避免下面提到的問題，相信會更有機會成功轉職。",href:"/zh-hant/career/pivoting-to-frontend-3-year-review"},{title:"文組轉職全端工程師四年反思",date:"2024-01-01",lastmod:"2024-01-01",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"pivoting-to-swe-4-year-review",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/pivoting-to-swe-4-year-review.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/pivoting-to-swe-4-year-review",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=文組轉職全端工程師四年反思",summary:"希望透過這篇文章，與大家分享一些反思。包含進到軟體大廠、對成功的定義，以及自己想成為什麼樣的工程師",href:"/zh-hant/career/pivoting-to-swe-4-year-review"},{title:"全端工程師職涯五年體悟",date:"2024-12-11",lastmod:"2024-12-11",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"pivoting-to-swe-5-year-review",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/pivoting-to-swe-5-year-review.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/pivoting-to-swe-5-year-review",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=全端工程師職涯五年體悟",summary:"在連續兩年寫了工程師植牙年度回顧後，一轉眼工程師職涯來到了五年，如果加上轉職工程師前的職涯，2024 是出社會後的第八年。對多數大學畢業後就進入職場的人來說，工作八年也意味著在年齡上也正式從二字頭邁入三字頭。轉入三字頭的 2024 有許多意想不到的事，希望透過這篇文章與讀者們分享。",href:"/zh-hant/career/pivoting-to-swe-5-year-review"},{title:"付費自媒體兩年經營心得",date:"2025-12-23",lastmod:"2025-12-23",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"paid-media-2-year-reflection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:19,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=付費自媒體兩年經營心得",summary:"今年即將迎來尾聲，我們在 2024 年初開始的訂閱制內容 E+，也即將推出滿兩年了。雖然我們一直沒有以自媒體來看自己做的事，但假如要找一個詞彙描述 E+，目前社群愛用的「付費自媒體」可能是最貼切的。",href:"/zh-hant/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection"},{title:"歐洲求職經驗談 — 為何我沒申請碩士",date:"2023-12-20",lastmod:"2023-12-20",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"europe-career-and-apple-master",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/europe-career-and-apple-master.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/europe-career-and-apple-master",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=歐洲求職經驗談 — 為何我沒申請碩士",summary:"但是最後為何我沒有申請碩士呢? 因為看到不少人是直接投遞歐洲工作的職缺，然後也很順利錄取，並獲得簽證辦理、搬家等協助。在權衡下，由於我不是特別喜歡讀書，比較偏好工作，以及從工作中去學習與成長；加上即使歐洲學費相對便宜，但還是一筆錢，同時在讀研究所期間也會沒收入，所以比起直接工作，兩個選擇在對於財務上還是有不小的差別。",href:"/zh-hant/career/europe-career-and-apple-master"}]},{title:"面試心得",links:[{title:"2021 轉職前端工程師的海外求職 (德荷英日新) 心得 I — coding bootcamp 之後的能力養成篇",date:"2022-01-26",lastmod:"2023-01-19",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"part1",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part1.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part1",subtoc:"interview-share",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=2021 轉職前端工程師的海外求職 (德荷英日新) 心得 I — coding bootcamp 之後的能力養成篇",summary:"嗨，相信你會點入這篇文章，可能是因為你看到 coding bootcamp 的標題，也可能是有海外求職的打算。我是透過 coding bootcamp 轉職，在台灣累積約一年前端工作經驗。在花了半年的下班與週末準備，順利找到在歐洲的工作。我將在這篇文章分享我的準備方式與推薦的準備資源。",href:"/zh-hant/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part1"},{title:"2021 轉職前端工程師的海外求職 (德荷英日新) 心得 II — 找工作與面試篇",date:"2022-01-26",lastmod:"2023-01-19",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"part2",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part2.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part2",subtoc:"interview-share",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=2021 轉職前端工程師的海外求職 (德荷英日新) 心得 II — 找工作與面試篇",summary:"在這篇文章將會跟大家分享，前陣子我人在台灣申請海外前端工程師的面試經驗。我將分享我如何透過 LinkedIn、獵人頭獲得不同國家的面試機會，以及分享實際被問到的問題。希望對想要申請海外工作的板友們有幫助。",href:"/zh-hant/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part2"},{title:"2022 轉職前端的海外求職與面試心得 (Amazon 與 ByteDance/TikTok 等)",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"fe-overseas-interview-amazon-tiktok",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/fe-overseas-interview-amazon-tiktok.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/fe-overseas-interview-amazon-tiktok",subtoc:"interview-share",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=2022 轉職前端的海外求職與面試心得 (Amazon 與 ByteDance/TikTok 等)",summary:"從結果而論，雖然我有錄取 FAANG 公司，也錄取目前世界最大獨角獸公司，但連面試都沒發給我的公司不勝枚舉 (基本上你想得到的國際軟體大公司我都投了)。這讓我深刻體會到，在不穩定的大環境下求職，真的蠻大一部分的因素不在自己的掌握中。舉例來說，今年新加坡我也有投 Foodpanda，然後連面試都沒有拿到，而在我投的當週，就看到他們新加坡辦公室大裁員。而新加坡 Shopee 雖然有拿到面試，但 OA 與一面結束後，等了快三週沒收到回覆，然後就看到新聞報導出他們大裁員 (九月底時)，所以就沒有後續。",href:"/zh-hant/career/fe-overseas-interview-amazon-tiktok"},{title:"2025 資深前端、全端工程師面試心得 (日本求職經驗分享)",date:"2025-02-13",lastmod:"2025-02-13",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"2025-interview-experience",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/2025-interview-experience.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/2025-interview-experience",subtoc:"interview-share",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=2025 資深前端、全端工程師面試心得 (日本求職經驗分享)",summary:"過去幾年筆者從德國公司到新加坡，再搬到日本生活，也因此有了這篇寫在 2025 年的求職心得。希望透過這篇文章，分享這次求職過程中遇到的不同問題，讓有意準備面試的讀者們有個具體的參考。",href:"/zh-hant/career/2025-interview-experience"},{title:"2025 如何準備資深前端、全端工程師面試？",date:"2025-02-24",lastmod:"2025-02-24",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"2025-interview-prep",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/2025-interview-prep.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/2025-interview-prep",subtoc:"interview-share",order:5,images:"/api/og?title=如何準備資深前端、全端工程師面試",summary:"在把這次求職經驗寫成《2025 資深前端、全端工程師面試心得 — 日本求職經驗分享》一文的同時，也寫了這一篇來談資深工程師的面試準備。前一篇談的是具體面試時遇到的不同類問題。而這一篇則會進一步來談進到面試之前的準備。",href:"/zh-hant/career/2025-interview-prep"},{title:"面試時如何讓面試官覺得你有洞見？",date:"2024-11-12",lastmod:"2024-11-12",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"how-to-impress-interviewers-with-insight",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/how-to-impress-interviewers-with-insight.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-impress-interviewers-with-insight",subtoc:"interview-share",order:25,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面試時如何讓面試官覺得你有洞見？",summary:"如何在面試中讓面試官覺得你有洞見？本文分享如何在面試中不僅展現知識，更讓面試官有收穫，提升獲得 Strong Hire 的可能性。",href:"/zh-hant/career/how-to-impress-interviewers-with-insight"}]}],"zh-hans-li-talk":[{title:"目录",links:[{title:"Li / 科技职涯观点 — 导览",date:"2024-10-01",lastmod:"2024-10-01",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"li-talk",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/li-talk.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/li-talk",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Li / 科技职涯观点",summary:"本系列汇整了 Li 科技与职涯思维的专栏文章，包含工作选择、职涯思维、职涯发展与方向、职涯回顾与心得，以及面试心得",href:"/zh-hans/career/li-talk"}]},{title:"工作选择",links:[{title:"浅谈在台湾做全球远端工作的利与弊",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2022-12-07",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"working-global-remote-pros-and-cons",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/working-global-remote-pros-and-cons.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/working-global-remote-pros-and-cons",subtoc:"job-choose",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=浅谈在台湾做全球远端工作的利与弊",summary:"我个人很喜欢远端的某些元素，但在经过这个全球远端的经验，现在的我会比较偏好混合模式(hybrid mode)，而不是完全远端。以下我会先分享我觉得远端好的地方，后面会再分享为何现在的我并不偏好完全远端。",href:"/zh-hans/career/working-global-remote-pros-and-cons"},{title:"浅谈海外工作 — 家庭大于工作",date:"2023-11-02",lastmod:"2023-11-02",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"working-oversea-family",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/working-oversea-family.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/working-oversea-family",subtoc:"job-choose",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=浅谈海外工作 — 家庭大于工作",summary:"关于举家搬到海外，我个人的观点是家庭大于工作。我大学时有个学长，工作几年后到哈佛读 MBA，之前跟他吃饭时，聊到他当年在哈佛毕业前有修一门课，课中讨论了工作与家庭，那时他推荐了我 Clayton Christensen 教授写的《How will you measure your life?》一书",href:"/zh-hans/career/working-oversea-family"},{title:"找工程师工作的万年问题，该选新创或大公司?",date:"2023-12-31",lastmod:"2023-12-31",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"bigtech-or-startup",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/bigtech-or-startup.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/bigtech-or-startup",subtoc:"job-choose",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=找工程师工作的万年问题，该选新创或大公司?",summary:"在选择工作时，不该只看财务上的报酬，而是该全方位的考量，包含自己是否能做的快乐、有成就感、工作与生活平衡。因此，回到“新创与大公司”这个职涯选择上，没有绝对的哪个比较好，即使错过某个超棒的工作机会，也不代表你选择的不是个好职涯。",href:"/zh-hans/career/bigtech-or-startup"},{title:"选一间冷静的公司 (calm company)",date:"2024-04-11",lastmod:"2024-04-11",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"calm-company",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/calm-company.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/calm-company",subtoc:"job-choose",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=选一间冷静的公司 (calm company)",summary:"当今天有幸拿到多个工作机会，下个问题自然会是问该选择哪一个?选择去哪一间公司是很个人的问题，没有所谓的标准答案，只有取舍。因此，过去我们能与读者分享的，是选择的指标，或说用什么角度去思考该选什么?",href:"/zh-hans/career/calm-company"},{title:"选工作前，先了解该公司怎么做事故检讨",date:"2024-11-15",lastmod:"2024-11-15",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-companies-handle-incident-reviews",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-companies-handle-incident-reviews.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-companies-handle-incident-reviews",subtoc:"job-choose",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=选工作前，先了解该公司怎么做事故检讨",summary:"从 AWS 的重大事故谈起，深入探讨不指责人的事故检讨文化，并分享如何透过改善流程避免人为错误。想了解在面试时该如何评估公司的事故处理机制？这篇文章提供实用建议。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-companies-handle-incident-reviews"}]},{title:"职涯观点",links:[{title:"软体工程师与米其林大厨：掌握技能的职涯成长之路",date:"2024-10-06",lastmod:"2024-10-06",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"similarities-between-software-engineers-and-chefs",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/similarities-between-software-engineers-and-chefs.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/similarities-between-software-engineers-and-chefs",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Li / 科技职涯观点",summary:"软体工程师如何像米其林大厨般掌握技能，从工具到团队领导，追求职涯成长的多面向挑战。了解如何让程式码如同精致料理般具备高可读性与效能，并学会带领团队突破标准，成为业界顶尖",href:"/zh-hans/career/similarities-between-software-engineers-and-chefs"},{title:"短影音很有效，但为何我们仍决定不再制作？",date:"2024-11-13",lastmod:"2024-11-13",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-we-decided-not-to-make-shorts",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/why-we-decided-not-to-make-shorts.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/why-we-decided-not-to-make-shorts",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=短影音很有效，但为何我们仍决定不再制作？",summary:"短影音在流量成效不错，但局限无法深入呈现技术知识，加上制作流程不符兴趣，因此 ExplainThis 决定不再制作短影音，专注于更具价值的长内容。",href:"/zh-hans/career/why-we-decided-not-to-make-shorts"},{title:"贴“天才”这个标签，是件非常危险的事",date:"2024-05-05",lastmod:"2024-05-05",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"dangerous-label-genius",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/dangerous-label-genius.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/dangerous-label-genius",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:18,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=贴“天才”这个标签，是件非常危险的事",summary:"本篇文章探讨贴上“天才”标签的危险性，强调了成长型思维的重要性。透过教育界名人的观点以及一位高中生程式开发者的例子，突显了持续努力和成长的价值，并呼吁对于努力和坚持的肯定。文章强调了人们应该更注重个人的努力和学习过程，而非将天赋和才华当作绝对评价的依据。",href:"/zh-hans/career/dangerous-label-genius"},{title:"Kelsey Hightower 谈重来一次他会如何进科技业",date:"2024-11-14",lastmod:"2024-11-14",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"kelsey-hightower-how-to-start-tech-career-again",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/kelsey-hightower-how-to-start-tech-career-again.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/kelsey-hightower-how-to-start-tech-career-again",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Kelsey Hightower 谈重来一次他会如何进科技业",summary:"Kelsey Hightower 分享他如何从非科班背景一路成为 Google 杰出工程师的经验。即使重来一次，他也会从基础做起，善用技能学习与内部升迁机会，逐步实现科技业职涯目标。适合非科班背景者参考。",href:"/zh-hans/career/kelsey-hightower-how-to-start-tech-career-again"},{title:"21 项给软体工程师的职涯提醒",date:"2024-11-18",lastmod:"2024-11-18",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"21-career-tips-for-software-engineers",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/21-career-tips-for-software-engineers.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/21-career-tips-for-software-engineers",subtoc:"career-thinking",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=21 项给软体工程师的职涯提醒",summary:"两位前 Meta 主任工程师所汇集，给软体工程师的 21 个职涯提醒",href:"/zh-hans/career/21-career-tips-for-software-engineers"}]},{title:"职涯发展与方向",links:[{title:"成为主任工程师要懂的提携 (Sponsorship)",date:"2024-10-29",lastmod:"2024-10-29",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"understanding-sponsorship-principal-engineer",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/understanding-sponsorship-principal-engineer.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/understanding-sponsorship-principal-engineer",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=成为主任工程师要懂的提携 (Sponsorship)",summary:"最近读了被说是迈向主任工程师必读的《Staff Engineer: Leadership beyond the management track》一书，读到一个特别有感的章节，该章节在讲提携 (sponsorship)，以及谈了为什么做到主任工程师以上的职位 (例如首席工程师或技术掌)，想要在职位上发挥更大的影响力，需要有效提携他人。",href:"/zh-hans/career/understanding-sponsorship-principal-engineer"},{title:"反思程序员的「强者文化」",date:"2023-10-12",lastmod:"2023-10-12",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"rethink-success",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/rethink-success.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/rethink-success",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=反思程序员的「强者文化」",summary:"要成为工程师你需要会写程式，但要成为资深工程师，程式是否写得快又好不是重点区别。然而，要成为资深工程师所要具备的，在传统计算机系的教育中没有被推崇。这导致一个吊诡的现象，就是在学校时能解出别人解不出的东西会被叫电神，但真的进到业界，才发现当好程序员，你需要一堆“电”以外的软技能。先前 Google Chrome 的 DX 负责人 Addy Osmani 出过一本叫《Software Engineering - The Soft Parts》的书，就是因为他看过太多工程师在职涯无法突破，是“软”技能缺乏所致。",href:"/zh-hans/career/rethink-success"},{title:"那件别人觉得苦，但你却觉得「蛤？」的事",date:"2024-11-19",lastmod:"2024-11-19",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-others-find-hard-but-you-dont",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/what-others-find-hard-but-you-dont.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/what-others-find-hard-but-you-dont",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=那件别人觉得苦，但你却觉得「蛤？」的事",summary:"探索那些别人觉得辛苦但你投入其中却不以为苦的领域，这往往是属于你的天赋所在。本篇深入探讨如何辨识自己的优势，并分享让人职涯突围的思维与工具。",href:"/zh-hans/career/what-others-find-hard-but-you-dont"},{title:"反思「单一指标衡量成功」的问题",date:"2023-10-12",lastmod:"2023-10-12",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"rethink-measure",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/rethink-measure.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/rethink-measure",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=反思「单一指标衡量成功」的问题",summary:"要成为工程师你需要会写程式，但要成为资深工程师，程式是否写得快又好不是重点区别。然而，要成为资深工程师所要具备的，在传统计算机系的教育中没有被推崇。这导致一个吊诡的现象，就是在学校时能解出别人解不出的东西会被叫电神，但真的进到业界，才发现当好程序员，你需要一堆“电”以外的软技能。先前 Google Chrome 的 DX 负责人 Addy Osmani 出过一本叫《Software Engineering - The Soft Parts》的书，就是因为他看过太多工程师在职涯无法突破，是“软”技能缺乏所致。",href:"/zh-hans/career/rethink-measure"},{title:"不要再问亲戚小孩长大后要做什么",date:"2023-01-24",lastmod:"2023-01-24",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:15,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=不要再问亲戚小孩长大后要做什么",summary:"「我想当太空人」、「我想当医生」在小学的作文本里，许多人会如此写下自己的未来志愿与梦想。然而，写出这样的梦想真的好吗? 背后是否其实大有问题在? 更进一步问，为什么会写下这样的回答呢? 宾州大学的心理学教授 Adam Grant，呼吁换个方式问孩子。他指出与其问孩子长大后想当什么，不如邀请孩子去想「自己想成为什么样的人? 想做什么事? 想解决什么问题?」",href:"/zh-hans/career/do-not-ask-kids-what-they-want-to-be"},{title:"选一个让你不感觉苦也不倦怠的职业生涯",date:"2025-10-04",lastmod:"2025-10-04",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"choose-a-career-without-burnout",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/choose-a-career-without-burnout.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/choose-a-career-without-burnout",subtoc:"career-advancement",order:16,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=选一个让你不感觉苦也不倦怠的职业生涯",summary:"这篇文章正在撰写中，稍后会补上完整内容。",href:"/zh-hans/career/choose-a-career-without-burnout"}]},{title:"职涯反思",links:[{title:"文组转职前端工程师三年回顾",date:"2023-01-01",lastmod:"2023-01-01",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"pivoting-to-frontend-3-year-review",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/pivoting-to-frontend-3-year-review.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/pivoting-to-frontend-3-year-review",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=文组转职前端工程师三年回顾",summary:"因为过去分享过自己的转职前端工程师的经验，以及转职后顺利拿到FAANG 工程师offer 的经验，陆陆续续有收到读者询问关于转职工程师的事宜。其中很常被问到要如何转职成功，所以想说与其一一回答，不如整理一篇文章给有想要转职的读者朋友们。以下五个点，是我根据自己转职经验、看到身边其他转职的例子后整理出来，推荐大家要避免的误区。如果你能避免下面提到的问题，相信会更有机会成功转职。",href:"/zh-hans/career/pivoting-to-frontend-3-year-review"},{title:"文组转职全端工程师四年反思",date:"2024-01-01",lastmod:"2024-01-01",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"pivoting-to-swe-4-year-review",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/pivoting-to-swe-4-year-review.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/pivoting-to-swe-4-year-review",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=文组转职全端工程师四年反思",summary:"希望透过这篇文章，与大家分享一些反思。包含进到软体大厂、对成功的定义，以及自己想成为什么样的工程师",href:"/zh-hans/career/pivoting-to-swe-4-year-review"},{title:"全端工程师职涯五年体悟",date:"2024-12-11",lastmod:"2024-12-11",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"pivoting-to-swe-5-year-review",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/pivoting-to-swe-5-year-review.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/pivoting-to-swe-5-year-review",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=全端工程师职涯五年体悟",summary:"在连续两年写了工程师植牙年度回顾后，一转眼工程师职涯来到了五年，如果加上转职工程师前的职涯，2024 是出社会后的第八年。对多数大学毕业后就进入职场的人来说，工作八年也意味着在年龄上也正式从二字头迈入三字头。转入三字头的 2024 有许多意想不到的事，希望透过这篇文章与读者们分享。",href:"/zh-hans/career/pivoting-to-swe-5-year-review"},{title:"付费自媒体两年经营心得",date:"2025-12-23",lastmod:"2025-12-23",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"paid-media-2-year-reflection",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:19,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=付费自媒体两年经营心得",summary:"今年即将迎来尾声，我们在 2024 年初开始的订阅制内容 E+，也即将推出满两年了。虽然我们一直没有以自媒体来看自己做的事，但假如要找一个词汇描述 E+，目前社群爱用的「付费自媒体」可能是最贴切的。",href:"/zh-hans/career/paid-media-2-year-reflection"},{title:"欧洲求职经验谈 — 为何我没申请硕士",date:"2023-12-20",lastmod:"2023-12-20",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"europe-career-and-apple-master",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/europe-career-and-apple-master.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/europe-career-and-apple-master",subtoc:"career-reflection",order:20,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/cdaccf5450df4eb98630672d81434595.png",summary:"但是最后为何我没有申请硕士呢? 因为看到不少人是直接投递欧洲工作的职缺，然后也很顺利录取，并获得签证办理、搬家等协助。在权衡下，由于我不是特别喜欢读书，比较偏好工作，以及从工作中去学习与成长；加上即使欧洲学费相对便宜，但还是一笔钱，同时在读研究所期间也会没收入，所以比起直接工作，两个选择在对于财务上还是有不小的差别。",href:"/zh-hans/career/europe-career-and-apple-master"}]},{title:"面试心得",links:[{title:"2021 转职前端工程师的海外求职 (德荷英日新) 心得 I — coding bootcamp 之后的能力养成篇",date:"2022-01-26",lastmod:"2023-01-19",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"part1",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part1.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part1",subtoc:"interview-share",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=2021 转职前端工程师的海外求职 (德荷英日新) 心得 I — coding bootcamp 之后的能力养成篇",summary:"嗨，相信你会点入这篇文章，可能是因为你看到coding bootcamp 的标题，也可能是有海外求职的打算。我是透过coding bootcamp 转职，在台湾累积约一年前端工作经验。在花了半年的下班与周末准备，顺利找到在欧洲的工作。我将在这篇文章分享我的准备方式与推荐的准备资源。",href:"/zh-hans/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part1"},{title:"2021 转职前端工程师的海外求职 (德荷英日新) 心得 II — 找工作与面试篇",date:"2022-01-27",lastmod:"2024-01-26",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"part2",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part2.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part2",subtoc:"interview-share",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=2021 转职前端工程师的海外求职 (德荷英日新) 心得 II — 找工作与面试篇",summary:"在这篇文章将会跟大家分享，前阵子我人在台湾申请海外前端工程师的面试经验。我将分享我如何透过LinkedIn、猎人头获得不同国家的面试机会，以及分享实际被问到的问题。希望对想要申请海外工作的板友们有帮助。",href:"/zh-hans/career/coding-bootcamp-and-career/part2"},{title:"2022 转职前端的海外求职与面试心得 (Amazon 与 ByteDance/TikTok 等)",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2023-03-15",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"fe-overseas-interview-amazon-tiktok",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/fe-overseas-interview-amazon-tiktok.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/fe-overseas-interview-amazon-tiktok",subtoc:"interview-share",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=2022 转职前端的海外求职与面试心得 (Amazon 与 ByteDance/TikTok 等)",summary:"从结果而论，虽然我有录取FAANG 公司，也录取目前世界最大独角兽公司，但连面试都没发给我的公司不胜枚举(基本上你想得到的国际软件大公司我都投了)。这让我深刻体会到，在不稳定的大环境下求职，真的蛮大一部分的因素不在自己的掌握中。举例来说，今年新加坡我也有投Foodpanda，然后连面试都没有拿到，而在我投的当周，就看到他们新加坡办公室大裁员。而新加坡Shopee 虽然有拿到面试，但OA 与一面结束后，等了快三周没收到回覆，然后就看到新闻报导出他们大裁员(九月底时)，所以就没有后续。",href:"/zh-hans/career/fe-overseas-interview-amazon-tiktok"},{title:"2025 资深前端、全端工程师面试心得 (日本求职经验分享)",date:"2025-02-13",lastmod:"2025-02-13",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"2025-interview-experience",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/2025-interview-experience.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/2025-interview-experience",subtoc:"interview-share",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=2025 资深前端、全端工程师面试心得 (日本求职经验分享)",summary:"过去几年笔者从德国公司到新加坡，再搬到日本生活，也因此有了这篇写在 2025 年的求职心得。希望透过这篇文章，分享这次求职过程中遇到的不同问题，让有意准备面试的读者们有个具体的参考。",href:"/zh-hans/career/2025-interview-experience"},{title:"2025 如何准备资深前端、全端工程师面试？",date:"2025-02-24",lastmod:"2025-02-24",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"2025-interview-prep",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/2025-interview-prep.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/2025-interview-prep",subtoc:"interview-share",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=2025 如何准备资深前端、全端工程师面试？",summary:"在把这次求职经验写成《2025 资深前端、全端工程师面试心得 — 日本求职经验分享》一文的同时，也写了这一篇来谈资深工程师的面试准备。前一篇谈的是具体面试时遇到的不同类问题。而这一篇则会进一步来谈进到面试之前的准备。",href:"/zh-hans/career/2025-interview-prep"},{title:"面试时如何让面试官觉得你有洞见？",date:"2024-11-12",lastmod:"2024-11-12",toc:"li-talk",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"how-to-impress-interviewers-with-insight",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/how-to-impress-interviewers-with-insight.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-impress-interviewers-with-insight",subtoc:"interview-share",order:25,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=面试时如何让面试官觉得你有洞见？",summary:"如何在面试中让面试官觉得你有洞见？本文分享如何在面试中不仅展现知识，更让面试官有收获，提升获得 Strong Hire 的可能性。",href:"/zh-hans/career/how-to-impress-interviewers-with-insight"}]}],"en-li-talk":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Li / Technology Career Perspectives Guide",date:"2024-10-01",lastmod:"2024-10-01",toc:"li-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"li-talk",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/li-talk.md",fullPath:"/en/career/li-talk",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:"",images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Li / Technology career perspective",summary:"This series collects Li's column articles on technology and career thinking, including job selection, career thinking, career development and direction, career review and experience, and interview experience.",href:"/en/career/li-talk"}]},{title:"Interview Experience",links:[{title:"My Amazon Frontend Engineer (FEE) interview experience",date:"2023-01-23",lastmod:"2023-01-23",toc:"li-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"my-amazon-frontend-interview",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/my-amazon-frontend-interview.md",fullPath:"/en/career/my-amazon-frontend-interview",subtoc:"interview-share",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=My Amazon Frontend Engineer (FEE) interview experience",summary:"This is a blog post on my interview experience with Amazon in summer 2022. The role I interviewed for was Frontend Engineer (FEE). The interview consisted of several rounds. From OA, Phone Screen, to 4 rounds in the loop interview",href:"/en/career/my-amazon-frontend-interview"},{title:"My TikTok (ByteDance) Frontend Software Engineer Interview Experience",date:"2023-01-24",lastmod:"2023-01-25",toc:"li-talk",lang:"en",fileName:"my-tiktok-frontend-interview",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/my-tiktok-frontend-interview.md",fullPath:"/en/career/my-tiktok-frontend-interview",subtoc:"interview-share",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=My TikTok (ByteDance) Frontend Software Engineer Interview Experience",summary:"This is a blog post on my interview experience with TikTok in summer 2022. The role I interviewed for was Frontend Software Engineer. I applied this frontend software engineer position through TikTok career website.",href:"/en/career/my-tiktok-frontend-interview"}]}],"zh-hant-singapore":[{title:"目錄",links:[{title:"新加坡工作與生活 — 導覽",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2023-08-26",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡工作與生活",summary:"本系列彙整了新加坡工作與生活相關主題文章，包含新加坡工作談、新加坡生活，以及新加坡深度觀察",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore"}]},{title:"新加坡工作談",links:[{title:"來新加坡工作前要知道的大小事",date:"2023-01-18",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"you-should-know-before-work-in-singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/you-should-know-before-work-in-singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/you-should-know-before-work-in-singapore",subtoc:"career",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=來新加坡工作前要知道的大小事",summary:"在這一篇文章，我將會概略介紹新加坡的不同面向，從工作、薪資談到食衣住行。每一個面向都會附上詳細版本的文章連結，假如你想要更深入了解那個面向，可以再透過那些延伸閱讀進一步了解。",href:"/zh-hant/career/you-should-know-before-work-in-singapore"},{title:"軟體工程師為什麼選擇到新加坡工作？",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-01-11",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"why-work-in-sg",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/why-work-in-sg.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/why-work-in-sg",subtoc:"career",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=軟體工程師為什麼選擇到新加坡工作？",summary:"筆者在之前找工作的時候，是各個國家廣投，最後幸運的拿到在不同國家幾間公司的 offer。在選擇的時候，除了比較 offer 本身條件以外，最後國家也是影響我選擇的很大因素，最後落腳新加坡，這些選擇原因也分享給大家，包括薪資高稅率低、前往國際市場的跳板、文化和語言等等。",href:"/zh-hant/career/why-work-in-sg"},{title:"如何找到新加坡工作？分享最有用的 8 個求職網站",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-01-11",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"job-hunting-website-in-singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/job-hunting-website-in-singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/job-hunting-website-in-singapore",subtoc:"career",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何找到新加坡工作？分享最有用的 8 個求職網站",summary:"除了內推、官網投遞履歷以外，最常見的應該就是求職網站尋找工作，以下列出可以找到新加坡工作的 8 個求職網站，假如有想要找新加坡的工作，可以先從這些網站開始。",href:"/zh-hant/career/job-hunting-website-in-singapore"},{title:"在新加坡當工程師薪水有多少？(2024)",date:"2022-12-28",lastmod:"2024-10-10",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"software-engineer-salary-in-singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/software-engineer-salary-in-singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/software-engineer-salary-in-singapore",subtoc:"career",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在新加坡當工程師薪水有多少？(2024)",summary:"新加坡是國際化大都市，許多科技大廠皆在此設有據點，提供優渥的薪資與職涯發展機會。本文將深入分析 2024 年新加坡軟體工程師的薪資水平，並提供不同職涯階段的薪資參考，幫助您評估自身薪資是否合理，以及規劃職涯發展方向。",href:"/zh-hant/career/software-engineer-salary-in-singapore"},{title:"跨海搬家福利與辦公室開箱",date:"2022-12-06",lastmod:"2022-12-18",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-work-relocation-office-unboxing",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-work-relocation-office-unboxing.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-work-relocation-office-unboxing",subtoc:"career",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=跨海搬家福利與辦公室開箱",summary:"跨海搬家福利與辦公室開箱",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-work-relocation-office-unboxing"},{title:"新加坡工作簽證與入境新加坡",date:"2022-12-01",lastmod:"2022-12-01",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-visa-and-entry",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-visa-and-entry.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-visa-and-entry",subtoc:"career",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡工作簽證與入境新加坡",summary:"假如你跟筆者一樣，不是新加坡公民、沒有新加坡永居身份，也沒有富有到可以投資移民，那麼要來新加坡工作的唯一途徑，就是透過簽證來。這篇主要是記錄筆者在 2022 年申請工作簽證，以及入境的一些相關資訊。如果一樣是要到新加坡工作的朋友，相信讀完這篇後，會對接下來的程序有清楚的理解。",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-visa-and-entry"},{title:"軟體業回暖，聊聊在新加坡軟體業工作",date:"2023-12-31",lastmod:"2023-12-31",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-software-industry",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-software-industry.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-software-industry",subtoc:"career",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=軟體業回暖，聊聊在新加坡軟體業工作",summary:"對軟體業來說，想要留亞洲區，同時想要存多一點錢的人，新加坡是個很不錯的選項。因為 ExplainThis 有團隊成員在新加坡工作，過去有寫一系列的新加坡求職相關文章。例如《在新加坡當工程師薪水有多少？》有提到目前新加坡薪資的普遍行情，文中也有附上資料比較齊全的薪資相關網站。一言以蔽之的話，新加坡軟體大廠機會相對多，整體薪水高、稅率低，要存錢會快很多。",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-software-industry"}]},{title:"新加坡生活",links:[{title:"在新加坡都吃些什麼",date:"2022-12-06",lastmod:"2022-12-06",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-eating",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-eating.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-eating",subtoc:"life",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在新加坡都吃些什麼",summary:"在在新加坡一個月會花多少錢？2022 年實際開銷紀錄這篇文章中，記錄了包括食衣住行的開銷。本篇文章會更細部分享在新加坡會吃些什麼，也提供給大家花費的參考。畢竟吃的習慣、吃的能負擔，絕對是評估搬去其他國家需要考量的重點指標之一。",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-eating"},{title:"新加坡交通選擇與費用",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2022-12-29",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"bus-mrt-taxi-compare",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/bus-mrt-taxi-compare.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/bus-mrt-taxi-compare",subtoc:"life",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡交通選擇與費用",summary:"搬到一個新的地方，如何通行會是需要事先了解的。不論是上班或是外出買東西，都需要有移動工具才辦得到。在新加坡也不例外，今天這篇會來談談來新加坡，可以靠哪些交通工具移動。",href:"/zh-hant/career/bus-mrt-taxi-compare"},{title:"新加坡租房前要了解的事",date:"2022-11-26",lastmod:"2022-12-04",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-renting",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-renting.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-renting",subtoc:"life",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡租房前要了解的事",summary:"因為近兩年到新加坡工作的人變多，加上因為新冠疫情關係，新房子的建造被延宕，導致租房供不應求，因此在 2022 新加坡的租房市場，只能以搶手來形容。新加坡的租房市場有多誇張呢? 2021 年時月租兩千多的物件，到了 2022 年至少都漲了一千。筆者在 2021 年時在台北離北車約半小時捷運的地方租一房一廳一衛的小公寓，大概月租三萬台幣，但同樣格局與相似地帶，2022 年在新加坡大約是八萬台幣 (S$3500)。假如要筆者評比新加坡最讓人勸退的點，租房絕對是排行第一。",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-renting"},{title:"新加坡租房經驗分享",date:"2022-11-26",lastmod:"2022-12-04",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-rent-experience",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-rent-experience.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-rent-experience",subtoc:"life",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡租房經驗分享",summary:"實際租房流程分享。瀏覽房源。我在找的時候通常會篩選條件，並選擇時間由新到舊去排序(Sort by Newest)。原因是許多很久沒更新的房源其實已經租出去或是已經簽約中，但仲介並沒有更新，這時我們也不需要放累時間去聯繫仲介了。所以如果張貼時間是一個月以上的，通常都是已經租出去但還沒下架，這些基本上可以不看。",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-rent-experience"},{title:"新加坡辦電信選擇與辦理經驗",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2022-12-02",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"tele-choice",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/tele-choice.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/tele-choice",subtoc:"life",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡辦電信選擇與辦理經驗",summary:"搬到一個新的地方，如何通行會是需要事先了解的。不論是上班或是外出買東西，都需要有移動工具才辦得到。在新加坡也不例外，今天這篇會來談談來新加坡，可以靠哪些交通工具移動。",href:"/zh-hant/career/tele-choice"},{title:"曲折的新加坡 DBS 開戶經驗 (線上辦理 + 補件 + 去了四間分行)",date:"2022-12-17",lastmod:"2022-12-17",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-open-bank-account",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-open-bank-account.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-open-bank-account",subtoc:"life",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=曲折的新加坡 DBS 開戶經驗 (線上辦理 + 補件 + 去了四間分行)",summary:"來新加坡工作後，你會需要一個當地的銀行戶頭，才能領薪水、存錢等處理財務上的大小事。筆者跟另一半來新加坡後，在銀行開戶上遇到了截然不同的經驗。一個是立刻辦好 (不到二十分鐘就有完成開戶)，一個卻拖了很多天，甚至跑了四個分行才處理好。這篇文章記錄了，剛來新加坡的銀行開戶經歷，希望這篇文章可以給大家一個經驗參考，讓大家都能用最有效率的方式開戶！",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-open-bank-account"},{title:"在新加坡一個月會花多少錢？2022 年實際開銷紀錄",date:"2022-12-06",lastmod:"2022-12-06",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-expense",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-expense.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-expense",subtoc:"life",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在新加坡一個月會花多少錢？2022 年實際開銷紀錄",summary:"在評估是否來新加坡 (或者搬去任何其他國家) 工作時，除了看薪水與當地的稅率外，另一個要考量的重要因素就是開銷。畢竟假如搬去了外地，但生活品質降低，那會是得不償失 (除非你真的很想到某個地方生活，那種狀況另當別論)。",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-expense"},{title:"新加坡看牙醫經驗談 + 看牙英文單字",date:"2023-09-10",lastmod:"2023-09-10",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-dental",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-dental.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-dental",subtoc:"life",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡看牙醫經驗談 + 看牙英文單字",summary:"來新加坡工作快一年了，前幾天吃飯時牙齒咬到一個硬物，結果發現是以前補牙的填充物掉了。於是就有了第一次在新加坡看牙醫的經驗。",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-dental"},{title:"我喜歡新加坡的 7 件事",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2022-12-02",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"what-i-like-about-singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/what-i-like-about-singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/what-i-like-about-singapore",subtoc:"life",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=我喜歡新加坡的 7 件事",summary:"因為工作關係搬到新加坡生活一陣子了。除了上工前一週是用比較觀光客的角度逛新加坡的知名景點，上工之後開始每天以一個大眾上班族的角色，體驗新加坡的生活。算是有累積了一些心得，記錄下一些自己喜歡，以及覺得美中不足的部分。",href:"/zh-hant/career/what-i-like-about-singapore"},{title:"小心新加坡電話詐騙！",date:"2022-12-17",lastmod:"2024-08-02",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-scam-be-careful",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-scam-be-careful.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-scam-be-careful",subtoc:"life",order:9,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=小心新加坡電話詐騙！",summary:"本來以為新加坡是個安全讓人無虞的地方，但其實萬萬沒想到的一來到新加坡就接到了好幾個詐騙電話…，雖然說我沒有受騙，但在找尋資料的同時，發現也滿多外國人受騙的。想用文章記錄一下，也提醒想來新加坡的朋友們，詐騙不分國家、一定要小心小心再小心！",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-scam-be-careful"},{title:"聽博恩來新加坡的脫口秀巡迴，順便逛逛國立新加坡大學(NUS)",date:"2023-04-30",lastmod:"2023-04-30",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-nus",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-nus.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-nus",subtoc:"life",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=聽博恩來新加坡的脫口秀巡迴，順便逛逛國立新加坡大學(NUS)",summary:"這次因為去聽博恩辦在 NUS 的脫口秀，在去之前順便逛了 NUS 的校園。總的來說這次逛校園的體驗挺不錯的，透過這篇文章跟想來新加坡玩的朋友分享，假如你在排行程時，有多一個下午的空檔，或許可以來 \xa0NUS\xa0 逛逛。校園餐廳也不少，學生餐廳便宜選項又多，可以順便來這邊順便吃一餐",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-nus"}]},{title:"新加坡深度觀察",links:[{title:"把公務單位當科技公司經營的新加坡 GovTech",date:"2023-04-23",lastmod:"2023-04-23",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-govtech",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-govtech.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-govtech",subtoc:"talk",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=把公務單位當科技公司經營的新加坡 GovTech",summary:"新加坡 GovTech 眼中要搶下的人才，是那些會去一線軟體大廠的人才。所以 GovTech 反問自己「最好的人才為什麼要來政府工作，為什麼不去 Google、Amazon」。對此，他們從提供良好工作環境與待遇、打造卓越的工程文化，到協助員工建立有意義的職涯發展等角度出發，花非常大的力氣再跟這些國際軟體大廠搶人才。",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-govtech"},{title:"新加坡擁抱 ChatGPT 與 AI 的前瞻思維",date:"2023-04-30",lastmod:"2023-04-30",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-embrace-chatgpt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-embrace-chatgpt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-embrace-chatgpt",subtoc:"talk",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡擁抱 ChatGPT 與 AI 的前瞻思維",summary:"在 ChatGPT 浪潮到來後，OGP 的黑客松中，就有團隊開發出 Pair 這個應用程式，直接鑲嵌在微軟的 Word 當中，讓 ChatGPT 這類的大型語言模型，可以在公務員處理文書的過程中，協助提高生產力。例如用在幫忙寫政策報告、電子郵件、消息公告、演講稿等不同類的文字內容。",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-embrace-chatgpt"},{title:"從 AI Singapore 看新加坡如何推動 AI",date:"2023-09-02",lastmod:"2023-09-02",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-ai",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-ai.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-ai",subtoc:"talk",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=從 AI Singapore 看新加坡如何推動 AI",summary:"新加坡有一個 AI Singapore 政府計畫，為新加坡規劃了非常完整的 AI 人才培訓計畫，從小學生的 AI 素養課，一路到在職人士的 AI 技能培訓都有。同時也投入大量的心力，來促成產業與學術間在 AI 的合作",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-ai"},{title:"為什麼新加坡人人都買得了房？",date:"2023-11-26",lastmod:"2023-11-29",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-bto-cpf",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-bto-cpf.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-bto-cpf",subtoc:"talk",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=為什麼新加坡人人都買得了房？",summary:"從 2021 年以來，新加坡政府啟動了三波房價冷卻措施，在 2023 年初租金總算開始往下掉時，因為世界各國陸續重新開放邊界，開始看到新聞報導說，可能會有許多有錢的國際投資客，會來新加坡投資房地產。當時看到這類新聞時，就在擔心好不容易掉下來的租金，會不會因為這些外國投資客來新加坡，導致租金又重新漲回去呢? 感謝新加坡政府在這時跳出來調高額外買家印花稅，看到這新聞真的又安心不少了！",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-bto-cpf"},{title:"政府硬起來打房、年輕人買得起房的新加坡",date:"2023-04-27",lastmod:"2023-04-27",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"singapore-absd",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/singapore-absd.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-absd",subtoc:"talk",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=政府硬起來打房、年輕人買得起房的新加坡",summary:"從 2021 年以來，新加坡政府啟動了三波房價冷卻措施，在 2023 年初租金總算開始往下掉時，因為世界各國陸續重新開放邊界，開始看到新聞報導說，可能會有許多有錢的國際投資客，會來新加坡投資房地產。當時看到這類新聞時，就在擔心好不容易掉下來的租金，會不會因為這些外國投資客來新加坡，導致租金又重新漲回去呢? 感謝新加坡政府在這時跳出來調高額外買家印花稅，看到這新聞真的又安心不少了！",href:"/zh-hant/career/singapore-absd"}]}],"zh-hans-singapore":[{title:"目录",links:[{title:"新加坡工作与生活—导览",date:"2023-08-26",lastmod:"2023-08-26",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡工作与生活—导览",summary:"本系列汇整了新加坡工作与生活相关主题文章，包含新加坡工作谈、新加坡生活，以及新加坡深度观察",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore"}]},{title:"新加坡工作谈",links:[{title:"来新加坡工作前要知道的大小事",date:"2023-01-18",lastmod:"2023-01-20",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"you-should-know-before-work-in-singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/you-should-know-before-work-in-singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/you-should-know-before-work-in-singapore",subtoc:"career",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=来新加坡工作前要知道的大小事",summary:"在这一篇文章，我将会概略介绍新加坡的不同面向，从工作、薪资谈到食衣住行。每一个面向都会附上详细版本的文章连结，假如你想要更深入了解那个面向，可以再透过那些延伸阅读进一步了解。",href:"/zh-hans/career/you-should-know-before-work-in-singapore"},{title:"程序员为什么选择到新加坡工作？",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-01-11",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"why-work-in-sg",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/why-work-in-sg.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/why-work-in-sg",subtoc:"career",order:1,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=程序员为什么选择到新加坡工作？",summary:"笔者在之前找工作的时候，是各个国家广投，最后幸运的拿到在不同国家几间公司的offer。在选择的时候，除了比较offer 本身条件以外，最后国家也是影响我选择的很大因素，最后落脚新加坡，这些选择原因也分享给大家，包括薪资高税率低、前往国际市场的跳板、文化和语言等等。",href:"/zh-hans/career/why-work-in-sg"},{title:"软体业回暖，聊聊在新加坡软体业工作",date:"2023-12-31",lastmod:"2023-12-31",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-software-industry",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-software-industry.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-software-industry",subtoc:"career",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=软体业回暖，聊聊在新加坡软体业工作",summary:"对软体业来说，想要留亚洲区，同时想要存多一点钱的人，新加坡是个很不错的选项。因为 ExplainThis 有团队成员在新加坡工作，过去有写一系列的新加坡求职相关文章。例如《在新加坡当工程师薪水有多少？》有提到目前新加坡薪资的普遍行情，文中也有附上资料比较齐全的薪资相关网站。一言以蔽之的话，新加坡软体大厂机会相对多，整体薪水高、税率低，要存钱会快很多。",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-software-industry"},{title:"跨海搬家福利与办公室开箱",date:"2022-12-06",lastmod:"2022-12-18",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-work-relocation-office-unboxing",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-work-relocation-office-unboxing.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-work-relocation-office-unboxing",subtoc:"career",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=跨海搬家福利与办公室开箱",summary:"跨海搬家福利与办公室开箱",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-work-relocation-office-unboxing"},{title:"新加坡工作签证与入境新加坡",date:"2022-12-01",lastmod:"2022-12-01",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-visa-and-entry",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-visa-and-entry.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-visa-and-entry",subtoc:"career",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡工作签证与入境新加坡",summary:"假如你跟笔者一样，不是新加坡公民、没有新加坡永居身份，也没有富有到可以投资移民，那么要来新加坡工作的唯一途径，就是透过签证来。这篇主要是记录笔者在2022 年申请工作签证，以及入境的一些相关资讯。如果一样是要到新加坡工作的朋友，相信读完这篇后，会对接下来的程序有清楚的理解。",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-visa-and-entry"},{title:"在新加坡当工程师薪水有多少？(2024)",date:"2022-12-28",lastmod:"2024-10-10",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"software-engineer-salary-in-singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/software-engineer-salary-in-singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/software-engineer-salary-in-singapore",subtoc:"career",order:5,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/acf64be175554a55ad34bda3bfedac51.png",summary:"新加坡是国际化大都市，许多科技大厂皆在此设有据点，提供优渥的薪资与职涯发展机会。本文将深入分析 2024 年新加坡软体工程师的薪资水平，并提供不同职涯阶段的薪资参考，帮助您评估自身薪资是否合理，以及规划职涯发展方向。",href:"/zh-hans/career/software-engineer-salary-in-singapore"},{title:"如何找到新加坡工作？分享最有用的 8 个求职网站",date:"2023-01-11",lastmod:"2023-01-11",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"job-hunting-website-in-singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/job-hunting-website-in-singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/job-hunting-website-in-singapore",subtoc:"career",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=如何找到新加坡工作？分享最有用的 8 个求职网站",summary:"除了内推、官网投递简历以外，最常见的应该就是求职网站寻找工作，以下列出可以找到新加坡工作的8 个求职网站，假如有想要找新加坡的工作，可以先从这些网站开始。",href:"/zh-hans/career/job-hunting-website-in-singapore"}]},{title:"新加坡生活",links:[{title:"在新加坡都吃些什么",date:"2022-12-06",lastmod:"2022-12-06",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-eating",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-eating.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-eating",subtoc:"life",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在新加坡都吃些什么",summary:"在在新加坡一个月会花多少钱？2022 年实际开销纪录这篇文章中，记录了包括食衣住行的开销。本篇文章会更细部分享在新加坡会吃些什么，也提供给大家花费的参考。毕竟吃的习惯、吃的能负担，绝对是评估搬去其他国家需要考量的重点指标之一。",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-eating"},{title:"新加坡看牙医经验谈 + 看牙英文单字",date:"2023-09-10",lastmod:"2023-09-10",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-dental",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-dental.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-dental",subtoc:"life",order:1,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/c8c34d5d5a64400dadb46198b9df1d03.png",summary:"来新加坡工作快一年了，前几天吃饭时牙齿咬到一个硬物，结果发现是以前补牙的填充物掉了。于是就有了第一次在新加坡看牙医的经验。",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-dental"},{title:"在新加坡一个月会花多少钱？2024 年实际开销纪录",date:"2022-12-06",lastmod:"2024-06-26",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-expense",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-expense.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-expense",subtoc:"life",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=在新加坡一个月会花多少钱？2024 年实际开销纪录",summary:"在评估是否来新加坡(或者搬去任何其他国家) 工作时，除了看薪水与当地的税率外，另一个要考量的重要因素就是开销。毕竟假如搬去了外地，但生活品质降低，那会是得不偿失(除非你真的很想到某个地方生活，那种状况另当别论)。",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-expense"},{title:"新加坡交通选择与费用",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2022-12-29",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"bus-mrt-taxi-compare",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/bus-mrt-taxi-compare.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/bus-mrt-taxi-compare",subtoc:"life",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡交通选择与费用",summary:"搬到一个新的地方，如何通行会是需要事先了解的。不论是上班或是外出买东西，都需要有移动工具才办得到。在新加坡也不例外，今天这篇会来谈谈来新加坡，可以靠哪些交通工具移动。",href:"/zh-hans/career/bus-mrt-taxi-compare"},{title:"新加坡租房前要了解的事",date:"2022-11-26",lastmod:"2022-12-04",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-renting",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-renting.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-renting",subtoc:"life",order:2.5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡租房前要了解的事",summary:"因为近两年到新加坡工作的人变多，加上因为新冠疫情关系，新房子的建造被延宕，导致租房供不应求，因此在2022 新加坡的租房市场，只能以抢手来形容。新加坡的租房市场有多夸张呢? 2021 年时月租两千多的物件，到了2022 年至少都涨了一千。笔者在2021 年时在台北离北车约半小时捷运的地方租一房一厅一卫的小公寓，大概月租三万台币，但同样格局与相似地带，2022 年在新加坡大约是八万台币(S$3500)。假如要笔者评比新加坡最让人劝退的点，租房绝对是排行第一。",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-renting"},{title:"新加坡租房经验分享",date:"2022-11-26",lastmod:"2022-12-04",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-rent-experience",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-rent-experience.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-rent-experience",subtoc:"life",order:2.6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡租房经验分享",summary:"实际租房流程分享。浏览房源。我在找的时候通常会筛选条件，并选择时间由新到旧去排序(Sort by Newest)。原因是许多很久没更新的房源其实已经租出去或是已经签约中，但仲介并没有更新，这时我们也不需要放累时间去联系仲介了。所以如果张贴时间是一个月以上的，通常都是已经租出去但还没下架，这些基本上可以不看。",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-rent-experience"},{title:"曲折的新加坡 DBS 开户经验 (线上办理 + 补件 + 去了四间分行)",date:"2022-12-17",lastmod:"2022-12-17",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-open-bank-account",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-open-bank-account.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-open-bank-account",subtoc:"life",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=曲折的新加坡 DBS 开户经验 (线上办理 + 补件 + 去了四间分行)",summary:"来新加坡工作后，你会需要一个当地的银行户头，才能领薪水、存钱等处理财务上的大小事。笔者跟另一半来新加坡后，在银行开户上遇到了截然不同的经验。一个是立刻办好(不到二十分钟就有完成开户)，一个却拖了很多天，甚至跑了四个分行才处理好。这篇文章记录了，刚来新加坡的银行开户经历，希望这篇文章可以给大家一个经验参考，让大家都能用最有效率的方式开户！",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-open-bank-account"},{title:"新加坡办电信选择与办理经验",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2022-12-02",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"tele-choice",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/tele-choice.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/tele-choice",subtoc:"life",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=新加坡办电信选择与办理经验",summary:"搬到一个新的地方，如何通行会是需要事先了解的。不论是上班或是外出买东西，都需要有移动工具才办得到。在新加坡也不例外，今天这篇会来谈谈来新加坡，可以靠哪些交通工具移动。",href:"/zh-hans/career/tele-choice"},{title:"我喜欢新加坡的 7 件事",date:"2022-12-02",lastmod:"2022-12-02",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"what-i-like-about-singapore",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/what-i-like-about-singapore.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/what-i-like-about-singapore",subtoc:"life",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=我喜欢新加坡的 7 件事",summary:"因为工作关系搬到新加坡生活一阵子了。除了上工前一周是用比较观光客的角度逛新加坡的知名景点，上工之后开始每天以一个大众上班族的角色，体验新加坡的生活。算是有累积了一些心得，记录下一些自己喜欢，以及觉得美中不足的部分。",href:"/zh-hans/career/what-i-like-about-singapore"},{title:"小心新加坡电话诈骗！",date:"2022-12-17",lastmod:"2024-08-02",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-scam-be-careful",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-scam-be-careful.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-scam-be-careful",subtoc:"life",order:8,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=小心新加坡电话诈骗！",summary:"本来以为新加坡是个安全让人无虞的地方，但其实万万没想到的一来到新加坡就接到了好几个诈骗电话…，虽然说我没有受骗，但在找寻资料的同时，发现也满多外国人受骗的。想用文章记录一下，也提醒想来新加坡的朋友们，诈骗不分国家、一定要小心小心再小心！",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-scam-be-careful"},{title:"听博恩来新加坡的脱口秀巡回，顺便逛逛国立新加坡大学(NUS)",date:"2023-04-30",lastmod:"2023-04-30",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-nus",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-nus.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-nus",subtoc:"life",order:10,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=听博恩来新加坡的脱口秀巡回，顺便逛逛国立新加坡大学(NUS)",summary:"这次因为去听博恩办在NUS 的脱口秀，在去之前顺便逛了NUS 的校园。总的来说这次逛校园的体验挺不错的，透过这篇文章跟想来新加坡玩的朋友分享，假如你在排行程时，有多一个下午的空档，或许可以来\xa0NUS\xa0 逛逛。校园餐厅也不少，学生餐厅便宜选项又多，可以顺便来这边顺便吃一餐。",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-nus"}]},{title:"新加坡深度观察",links:[{title:"把公务单位当科技公司经营的新加坡 GovTech",date:"2023-04-23",lastmod:"2023-04-23",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-govtech",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-govtech.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-govtech",subtoc:"talk",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=把公务单位当科技公司经营的新加坡 GovTech",summary:"新加坡 GovTech 眼中要抢下的人才，是那些会去一线软件大厂的人才。所以 GovTech 反问自己「最好的人才为什么要来政府工作，为什么不去 Google、Amazon」。对此，他们从提供良好工作环境与待遇、打造卓越的工程文化，到协助员工建立有意义的职涯发展等角度出发，花非常大的力气再跟这些国际软件大厂抢人才。 ",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-govtech"},{title:"新加坡拥抱 ChatGPT 与 AI 的前瞻思维",date:"2023-04-30",lastmod:"2023-04-30",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-embrace-chatgpt",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-embrace-chatgpt.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-embrace-chatgpt",subtoc:"talk",order:1,images:"https://explainthis-image.octave.vip/ab7ca7f32c9f45b3b76d25acd8dc8ca5.png",summary:"在ChatGPT 浪潮到来后，OGP 的黑客松中，就有团队开发出Pair 这个应用程式，直接镶嵌在微软的Word 当中，让ChatGPT 这类的大型语言模型，可以在公务员处理文书的过程中，协助提高生产力。例如用在帮忙写政策报告、电子邮件、消息公告、演讲稿等不同类的文字内容。",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-embrace-chatgpt"},{title:"从 AI Singapore 看新加坡如何推动 AI",date:"2023-09-02",lastmod:"2023-09-02",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-ai",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-ai.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-ai",subtoc:"talk",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=从 AI Singapore 看新加坡如何推动 AI",summary:"新加坡有一个 AI Singapore 政府计划，为新加坡规划了非常完整的 AI 人才培训计划，从小学生的 AI 素养课，一路到在职人士的 AI 技能培训都有。同时也投入大量的心力，来促成产业与学术间在 AI 的合作",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-ai"},{title:"政府硬起来打房、年轻人买得起房的新加坡",date:"2023-04-27",lastmod:"2023-04-27",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-absd",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-absd.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-absd",subtoc:"talk",order:3,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=政府硬起来打房、年轻人买得起房的新加坡",summary:"从2021 年以来，新加坡政府启动了三波房价冷却措施，在2023 年初租金总算开始往下掉时，因为世界各国陆续重新开放边界，开始看到新闻报导说，可能会有许多有钱的国际投资客，会来新加坡投资房地产。当时看到这类新闻时，就在担心好不容易掉下来的租金，会不会因为这些外国投资客来新加坡，导致租金又重新涨回去呢? 感谢新加坡政府在这时跳出来调高额外买家印花税，看到这新闻真的又安心不少了！",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-absd"},{title:"为什么新加坡人人都买得了房？",date:"2023-11-29",lastmod:"2023-11-29",toc:"singapore",lang:"zh-hans",fileName:"singapore-bto-cpf",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hans/career/singapore-bto-cpf.md",fullPath:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-bto-cpf",subtoc:"talk",order:4,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=为什么新加坡人人都买得了房？",summary:"从2021 年以来，新加坡政府启动了三波房价冷却措施，在2023 年初租金总算开始往下掉时，因为世界各国陆续重新开放边界，开始看到新闻报导说，可能会有许多有钱的国际投资客，会来新加坡投资房地产。当时看到这类新闻时，就在担心好不容易掉下来的租金，会不会因为这些外国投资客来新加坡，导致租金又重新涨回去呢? 感谢新加坡政府在这时跳出来调高额外买家印花税，看到这新闻真的又安心不少了！",href:"/zh-hans/career/singapore-bto-cpf"}]}],"en-singapore":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Singapore Work and Life",date:"2023-08-27",lastmod:"2023-08-27",toc:"singapore",lang:"en",fileName:"singapore",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/singapore.md",fullPath:"/en/career/singapore",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Singapore Work and Life",summary:"In this series, we share the work and life as an expat tech worker in Singapore",href:"/en/career/singapore"}]},{title:"Singapore Work",links:[{title:"How much can you earn as a software engineer in Singapore? (2024)",date:"2023-01-21",lastmod:"2022-01-21",toc:"singapore",lang:"en",fileName:"software-engineer-salary-in-singapore",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/software-engineer-salary-in-singapore.md",fullPath:"/en/career/software-engineer-salary-in-singapore",subtoc:"career",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How much can you earn as a software engineer in Singapore? (2024)",summary:"Before relocating to Singapore, I did all kinds of research on software engineer salary, and finally decided to come to Singapore after a comprehensive consideration. This article will present all the data about salary in Singapore collected from different sources. I will share the salary level from fresh graduates to senior engineers. Let us find out, how much can you earn as a software engineer in Singapore",href:"/en/career/software-engineer-salary-in-singapore"}]},{title:"Singapore Life",links:[{title:"Where to eat in Singapore?",date:"2022-12-06",lastmod:"2022-12-06",toc:"singapore",lang:"en",fileName:"singapore-eating",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/singapore-eating.md",fullPath:"/en/career/singapore-eating",subtoc:"life",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Where to eat in Singapore?",summary:"In this article, I will share in detail where to eat in Singapore, and the price ranges for different dining options.",href:"/en/career/singapore-eating"},{title:"How much did I spend in a month in Singapore ? (2024 edition)",date:"2023-01-22",lastmod:"2023-01-23",toc:"singapore",lang:"en",fileName:"singapore-expense",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/singapore-expense.md",fullPath:"/en/career/singapore-expense",subtoc:"life",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How much did I spend in a month in Singapore ? (2024 edition)",summary:"When evaluating whether to come to Singapore (or move to any other country) to work, apart from looking at salary and local tax rates, another important factor to consider is cost. After all, if you move to another place, but the quality of life is worse, it will not be worth the move (unless you really want to live in a certain place, which is a different story).",href:"/en/career/singapore-expense"},{title:"Getting around Singapore (Options and Fees)",date:"2023-01-20",lastmod:"2022-01-20",toc:"singapore",lang:"en",fileName:"bus-mrt-taxi-compare",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/bus-mrt-taxi-compare.md",fullPath:"/en/career/bus-mrt-taxi-compare",subtoc:"life",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Getting around Singapore (Options and Fees)",summary:"When moving to a new place, whether it is going to work or shopping, you need a way to go from place A to place B. Singapore is no exception. In this article, we will talk about transportation in Singapore.",href:"/en/career/bus-mrt-taxi-compare"},{title:"How to rent a condo or HDB in Singapore as an expat",date:"2023-04-19",lastmod:"2023-04-19",toc:"singapore",lang:"en",fileName:"singapore-rent-experience",filePath:"src/pages/en/career/singapore-rent-experience.md",fullPath:"/en/career/singapore-rent-experience",subtoc:"life",order:2.6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to rent a condo or HDB in Singapore as an expat",summary:"When browsing for properties, I usually filter my search criteria and sort the results by the newest first. The reason for this is that many outdated listings have already been rented out or are in the process of being leased, but the agents have not updated the information. In these cases, it is unnecessary to waste our time contacting the agents.",href:"/en/career/singapore-rent-experience"}]}],"zh-hant-japan":[{title:"目錄",links:[{title:"日本工作與生活 — 導覽",date:"2024-11-25",lastmod:"2024-11-25",toc:"japan",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"japan",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/japan.md",fullPath:"/zh-hant/career/japan",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=日本工作與生活",summary:"本系列彙整了日本工作與生活相關主題文章，包含日本工作談、日本生活，以及日本深度觀察",href:"/zh-hant/career/japan"}]},{title:"日本工作談",links:[{title:"【日本工作簽證】在留資格認定証明書 (COE) 辦理心得 (2024 年)",date:"2024-11-25",lastmod:"2024-11-25",toc:"japan",lang:"zh-hant",fileName:"japan-coe",filePath:"src/pages/zh-hant/career/japan-coe.md",fullPa