imple",summary:"In late 2022, OpenAI released ChatGPT, which quickly gained worldwide popularity. It has been a hot topic in the news and social media. However, you may be unfamiliar with what ChatGPT is and how it can be utilized. This article aims to explain the concept of ChatGPT in simple language without any technical jargon, and how it can benefit you.",href:"/en/ai/chatgpt-start"},{title:"Is it Worth Upgrading to ChatGPT Plus? An In-Depth Review",date:"2023-02-27",lastmod:"2023-02-27",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"upgrade-plus",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/upgrade-plus.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/upgrade-plus",subtoc:"use",order:2,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Is it Worth Upgrading to ChatGPT Plus? An In-Depth Review",summary:"For users who frequently use ChatGPT, upgrading to ChatGPT Plus is undoubtedly worth. However, for some users, whether or not to upgrade to ChatGPT Plus requires careful consideration and evaluation. In this article, we will share real experiences of using ChatGPT Plus to help you decide whether or not to upgrade.",href:"/en/ai/upgrade-plus"}]},{title:"ChatGPT Use Cases",links:[{title:"I Coded a Website with 60k+ Daily Visitors Using ChatGPT",date:"2023-03-06",lastmod:"2023-03-06",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"website",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/website.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/website",subtoc:"case",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=I Coded a Website with 60k+ Daily Visitors Using ChatGPT",summary:"As an advanced AI, ChatGPT can help you do many things, one of which is help you write codes. In this article, I will show you how front-end engineers can leverage the power of ChatGPT by showing you how I coded a website with the help from ChatGPT. ",href:"/en/ai/website"},{title:"How I used ChatGPT to prepare interviews (ft. STAR format)",date:"2023-03-05",lastmod:"2023-03-05",toc:"chatgpt-tutorial",lang:"en",fileName:"english-interview",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/english-interview.md",full