",fullPath:"/zh-hans/ai/cursor-guide/4-7-mcp-security",subtoc:"mcp",order:7,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=4-7 使用 MCP 时，要注意避免被恶意攻击",summary:"在使用 MCP 的过程中，也有一些需要特别注意的事项，其中最重要的一点，就是确保自己不会受到恶意 MCP 的攻击。换句话说，MCP 虽然好用，但在使用前务必保持谨慎。",href:"/zh-hans/ai/cursor-guide/4-7-mcp-security"}]}],"en-ai-engineering":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[]},{title:"AI Application Development",links:[{title:"What Are AI Agents?",date:"2025-02-07",lastmod:"2025-02-07",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"ai-agent",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/ai-agent.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/ai-agent",subtoc:"ai-application",order:5,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Are AI Agents?",summary:"Understanding AI agents and their applications. Learn how AI agents can automate complex tasks, their real-world applications in software development, and what the future holds.",href:"/en/ai/ai-agent"},{title:"Essential Principles for Working with AI Coding Agents",date:"2025-06-23",lastmod:"2025-06-23",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"agentic-coding",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/agentic-coding.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/agentic-coding",subtoc:"ai-application",order:20,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Essential Principles for Working with AI Coding Agents",summary:"Learn the key principles for effective collaboration between human engineers and AI coding agents, including problem clarification, task decomposition, and iterative feedback.",href:"/en/ai/agentic-coding"},{title:"Information Security Issues to Consider When Developing AI Products",date:"2025-12-10",lastmod:"2025-12-10",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"ai-product-security",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/ai-product-security.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/ai-product-security",subtoc:"ai-application",order:30,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Information Security Issues to Consider When Developing AI Products",summary:"In this article, we discuss the most common attack vectors against AI products and the strategies to prevent them.",href:"/en/ai/ai-product-security"},{title:"What is Sandboxing? Why Do AI Agents Need Sandboxes?",date:"2025-12-11",lastmod:"2025-12-11",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"ai-sandboxing",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/ai-sandboxing.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/ai-sandboxing",subtoc:"ai-application",order:31,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is Sandboxing? Why Do AI Agents Need Sandboxes?",summary:"In this article, we discuss what sandboxing is, why we need it, and how to build a basic AI agent sandbox.",href:"/en/ai/ai-sandboxing"},{title:"What Are Agent Skills? What Problems Do They Solve?",date:"2026-01-08",lastmod:"2026-01-08",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"agent-skills",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/agent-skills.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/agent-skills",subtoc:"ai-application",order:32,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What Are Agent Skills? What Problems Do They Solve?",summary:"From launch to adoption by the AI engineering community, Agent Skills took only about two months. This prompts the question: what exactly are Agent Skills, what problems do they solve, and why has the community adopted them so quickly? In this article, we explore the pain points in developing and using AI agents, then progressively address these challenges to help developers understand the value of Agent Skills.",href:"/en/ai/agent-skills"},{title:"Use Agent Skills to Scale Staff-Engineer Thinking Across Your Team",date:"2026-04-19",lastmod:"2026-04-19",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset",subtoc:"ai-application",order:33,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Use Agent Skills to Scale Staff-Engineer Thinking Across Your Team",summary:"After joining Cursor, former Meta staff engineer Lauren Tan shared a set of agent skills that encode how she explores unfamiliar codebases and technologies. The key idea is to turn senior-level reasoning into a repeatable workflow the whole team can use with AI agents. That gives teams a more consistent way to break down problems, evaluate abstractions, and manage complexity.",href:"/en/ai/agent-skills-staff-engineer-mindset"},{title:"What is AI Evaluation (Evals)?",date:"2026-02-03",lastmod:"2026-02-03",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"ai-evals",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/ai-evals.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/ai-evals",subtoc:"ai-application",order:33,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=What is AI Evaluation (Evals)?",summary:"Evals are an essential part of AI product development. Since AI models produce non-deterministic outputs, traditional software testing cannot guarantee quality. Evals provide a mechanism to assess whether changes achieve expected results. Through evals-driven development, teams ensure decisions are based on data rather than guesswork.",href:"/en/ai/ai-evals"}]},{title:"AI Impact on Engineers",links:[{title:"How Pretext Shows a New AI-Powered Paradigm for Frontend Development",date:"2026-03-30",lastmod:"2026-03-30",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm",subtoc:"ai-with-engineer",order:6,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How Pretext Shows a New AI-Powered Paradigm for Frontend Development",summary:"Pretext enables dynamic multi-line text layout without relying on DOM measurements and expensive reflow, delivering much smoother UI behavior. This article breaks down its core technical breakthrough, why the problem was historically hard, and how AI-driven test loops made large-scale edge-case handling practical.",href:"/en/ai/pretext-ai-frontend-development-paradigm"},{title:"How to Use AI Without Losing Your Technical Judgment",date:"2026-06-12",lastmod:"2026-06-12",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"avoid-ai-eroding-technical-judgment",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/avoid-ai-eroding-technical-judgment.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/avoid-ai-eroding-technical-judgment",subtoc:"ai-with-engineer",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=How to Use AI Without Losing Your Technical Judgment",summary:"AI agents can make engineering teams faster, but over-reliance can lead to cognitive surrender: accepting AI output without understanding or verification. This article explains the risk through research and real-world examples, then offers practical mechanisms such as pre-commit quizzes, human sign-off, and accountable review practices.",href:"/en/ai/avoid-ai-eroding-technical-judgment"}]},{title:"Prompt Engineering",links:[{title:"Context Engineering: How to Give AI Agents Better Inputs",date:"2025-10-04",lastmod:"2025-10-04",toc:"ai-engineering",lang:"en",fileName:"context-engineering",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/context-engineering.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/context-engineering",subtoc:"prompt-engineering",order:11,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Context Engineering",summary:"Learn how context engineering extends prompt engineering by combining intent, instructions, tools, and memory so AI agents deliver accurate, reliable results.",href:"/en/ai/context-engineering"}]}],"en-cursor-guide":[{title:"Table of Contents",links:[{title:"Cursor From Beginner to Pro — Guide",date:"2025-04-06",lastmod:"2025-04-21",toc:"cursor-guide",lang:"en",fileName:"cursor-guide",filePath:"src/pages/en/ai/cursor-guide.md",fullPath:"/en/ai/cursor-guide",subtoc:"table-of-content",order:0,images:"https://www.explainthis.io/api/og?title=Cursor From Beginner to Pro",summary:"Cursor is an AI-powered code editor (IDE) designed for developers. It understands your code and intentions, offering code completion, refactoring suggestions, and even generating complete code snippets. With AI agent capabilities, Cursor can automate tasks and help developers work more efficien